                "text": "Ask whether they have another approach in mind.",
                "start_ms": 6080,
                "end_ms": 9480
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Offer only what you can do or confirm.",
                "start_ms": 9780,
                "end_ms": 13180
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Say, “I can ask about another schedule.",
                "start_ms": 13480,
                "end_ms": 16800
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Would you like that?”",
                "start_ms": 17100,
                "end_ms": 18500
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Confirm who will act and when you will update each other.",
                "start_ms": 18800,
                "end_ms": 22960
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Using the action card, offer Ben two realistic follow-up options. Ask which he prefers.",
                "start_ms": 23260,
                "end_ms": 30540
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/01-difficult-situations/agree-the-next-step/action.fil.b485aef922c6.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "b485aef922c6cbdb4b06baf933ab763263e2d757f30659f50a2b33f49b31d19d",
            "sha256": "bddb2f31ec5d1a7bf6837fc747fe285a42c1b734af67a34766fb2a701dcd8d20",
            "duration_seconds": 36.754,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Gawin at sabihin",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2120
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Linawin kung anong resulta ang nais ng kausap.",
                "start_ms": 2420,
                "end_ms": 6380
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Itanong kung may naiisip siyang ibang paraan.",
                "start_ms": 6680,
                "end_ms": 10320
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Mag-alok lamang ng kayang gawin o kumpirmahin.",
                "start_ms": 10620,
                "end_ms": 14740
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Sabihin: “Maaari kong itanong ang ibang iskedyul.",
                "start_ms": 15040,
                "end_ms": 19280
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Gusto po ba ninyo iyon?”",
                "start_ms": 19580,
                "end_ms": 21460
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Kumpirmahin kung sino ang kikilos at kailan magbabalitaan.",
                "start_ms": 21760,
                "end_ms": 26840
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Gamit ang action card, mag-alok ng dalawang makatotohanang paraan ng pag-follow-up kay Ben. Ipasabi kung alin ang nais niya.",
                "start_ms": 27140,
                "end_ms": 36700
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "check-start": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/01-difficult-situations/agree-the-next-step/check-start.en.c1bc41096581.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "c1bc41096581b5dc9a07204afe714042c11eafad924890354d89d07ec8362fca",
            "sha256": "3bc8cf5fd69f9d9f2d244774f78919179ac7b542d2aea89b34b91a3043ee06ca",
            "duration_seconds": 14.289,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Choose the first response",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2160
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Choose an answer first.",
                "start_ms": 2460,
                "end_ms": 4580
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Then read why each choice helps or does not help.",
                "start_ms": 4880,
                "end_ms": 9200
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "This is a concrete action without promising an appointment.",
                "start_ms": 9500,
                "end_ms": 14220
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/01-difficult-situations/agree-the-next-step/check-start.fil.23cff5dd950f.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "23cff5dd950f368e16f2db4f72c040f6086c87bdfb452ba4fa01cf78153d33f2",
            "sha256": "c687430965f07055b0958e39acd2e51eb553dffc1b2161c9cbfd9f26a074fc4c",
            "duration_seconds": 15.438,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Piliin ang unang tugon",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2360
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Piliin muna ang sagot.",
                "start_ms": 2660,
                "end_ms": 4660
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Pagkatapos, basahin ang paliwanag para sa bawat pagpipilian.",
                "start_ms": 4960,
                "end_ms": 9720
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ito ay tiyak na gawaing kayang gawin nang hindi nangangako ng appointment.",
                "start_ms": 10020,
                "end_ms": 15380
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "check-transfer": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/01-difficult-situations/agree-the-next-step/check-transfer.en.214334dc46e6.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "214334dc46e6b3e61cd17d59f23298a3e652786d8617054d998f0f573a219c0b",
            "sha256": "38b847e5440b38dce49860082741765fd2725b71346c1ffa3014078b5f4eb88f",
            "duration_seconds": 13.218,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Apply it to the situation",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2280
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Return to the story.",
                "start_ms": 2580,
                "end_ms": 4540
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Choose the appropriate next step.",
                "start_ms": 4840,
                "end_ms": 7720
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "This has an action, owner and time to confirm with Ben.",
                "start_ms": 8020,
                "end_ms": 13140
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/01-difficult-situations/agree-the-next-step/check-transfer.fil.84a31a7c3b6e.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "84a31a7c3b6e9a927ab0c6b927ca70a7af10ec935128cdc0f1e40a2fb63fb50d",
            "sha256": "e3032fa0ffb9bb31181fb99479be2a0fc1a43b0df3dcbfa615e65273eb1859d1",
            "duration_seconds": 15.177,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Subukan sa sitwasyon",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2120
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Balikan ang nangyari sa kuwento.",
                "start_ms": 2420,
                "end_ms": 5060
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Piliin ang angkop na susunod na hakbang.",
                "start_ms": 5360,
                "end_ms": 9040
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "May hakbang, responsable at oras na puwedeng kumpirmahin kay Ben.",
                "start_ms": 9340,
                "end_ms": 15100
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "example": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/01-difficult-situations/agree-the-next-step/example.en.dafe24309432.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "dafe243094320026e05ff0180ec43ff03b9993faa767636baac8e55dae2e55ed",
            "sha256": "7f5f3ed5b09fb526025a357384d5a54740c3bdc3044b5f0a1ba45708107d1a93",
            "duration_seconds": 33.097,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Worked example",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 1800
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ben: “Could it be in the afternoon?”",
                "start_ms": 2100,
                "end_ms": 4980
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Salma: “I will ask the health center.",
                "start_ms": 5280,
                "end_ms": 8200
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "I can call you tomorrow at two if that works.”",
                "start_ms": 8500,
                "end_ms": 11580
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Ben: “Yes.”",
                "start_ms": 11880,
                "end_ms": 13680
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Salma: “The appointment is not confirmed yet; tomorrow’s call is an update.”",
                "start_ms": 13980,
                "end_ms": 19700
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "The agreement and uncertainty are both clear.",
                "start_ms": 20000,
                "end_ms": 23240
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Records the chosen action, responsible person and time; confirms Ben’s choice without presenting an update as an appointment.",
                "start_ms": 23540,
                "end_ms": 33020
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/01-difficult-situations/agree-the-next-step/example.fil.f3c630d0d1cc.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "f3c630d0d1cce3890ad4b73147b9f760eea7f68516243a37536a40d9c14d170f",
            "sha256": "12c17fa9d5b88ff91dde4994a8b9d2b91606187a85cd77ab3c2cde57fefb7f2b",
            "duration_seconds": 39.497,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Halimbawa ng usapan",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2200
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ben: “Puwede kaya sa hapon?”",
                "start_ms": 2500,
                "end_ms": 4860
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Salma: “Itatanong ko po sa health center.",
                "start_ms": 5160,
                "end_ms": 8640
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Tatawagan ko kayo bukas ng alas-dos kung iyon ay ayos.”",
                "start_ms": 8940,
                "end_ms": 14100
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Ben: “Oo.”",
                "start_ms": 14400,
                "end_ms": 16320
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Salma: “Wala pa pong kumpirmadong appointment; update muna bukas.”",
                "start_ms": 16620,
                "end_ms": 22180
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Malinaw kung ano ang napagkasunduan at kung ano ang hindi pa tiyak.",
                "start_ms": 22480,
                "end_ms": 27800
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Itinatala ang piniling hakbang, taong kikilos at oras; kinukumpirma ang pagpili ni Ben at hindi tinatawag na appointment ang update.",
                "start_ms": 28100,
                "end_ms": 39420
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "next-step": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/01-difficult-situations/agree-the-next-step/next-step.en.4ba8089cbf4e.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "4ba8089cbf4ed07356ef96222298961d3ddfedf563e299c6b73290652b9fd649",
            "sha256": "c4c2c8ca512ef04898410f3f1b417d074890074506d286747a885f8a31704383",
            "duration_seconds": 26.958,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "On Monday, try this",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2360
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Salma writes that she will ask the health center and call Ben tomorrow at two.",
                "start_ms": 2660,
                "end_ms": 8420
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Ben repeats the agreement.",
                "start_ms": 8720,
                "end_ms": 11240
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "On Monday, use the blank action card in practice with a colleague.",
                "start_ms": 11540,
                "end_ms": 16460
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Word: follow-up — returning to an agreement to find out the result.",
                "start_ms": 16760,
                "end_ms": 22760
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Choose one action and follow up on the result.",
                "start_ms": 23060,
                "end_ms": 26900
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/01-difficult-situations/agree-the-next-step/next-step.fil.a19c2467f811.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "a19c2467f8113d7e35d48100ce5030ddd6fe2deb956ec46bd80160bf677e7047",
            "sha256": "eef80a0a0e7f8d7d2ffaa42d46f5b2244ef2ffdf58e5f186cd0d903ba62e0965",
            "duration_seconds": 31.634,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Sa Lunes, gawin ito",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2480
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Isinulat ni Salma: siya ang magtatanong sa health center at tatawag kay Ben bukas ng alas-dos.",
                "start_ms": 2780,
                "end_ms": 10140
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Inulit ni Ben ang napagkasunduan.",
                "start_ms": 10440,
                "end_ms": 13360
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Sa Lunes, gamitin ang blangkong action card sa isang pagsasanay kasama ang katrabaho.",
                "start_ms": 13660,
                "end_ms": 19980
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Salita: follow-up — pagbabalik sa napag-usapan upang alamin ang resulta.",
                "start_ms": 20280,
                "end_ms": 27080
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Pumili ng isang hakbang at balikan ang naging resulta.",
                "start_ms": 27380,
                "end_ms": 31580
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "scene": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/01-difficult-situations/agree-the-next-step/scene.en.262102fd1bc3.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "262102fd1bc373e650b5b916d5d46274c3e65915058c7896cf328399f2e3887f",
            "sha256": "d60cd44ca3659e51e46c0d5e03763f3f5366c361831b1bbff87bcbfd4f1b526a",
            "duration_seconds": 23.406,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "The situation",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 1720
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "BHW Salma visits Ben in Marawi.",
                "start_ms": 2020,
                "end_ms": 5980
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "He cannot go to the health center in the morning because of work.",
                "start_ms": 6280,
                "end_ms": 10760
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "“I cannot lose a whole day,” he says.",
                "start_ms": 11060,
                "end_ms": 14620
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Salma does not yet know whether staff offer another schedule.",
                "start_ms": 14920,
                "end_ms": 19440
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Find out the concern before choosing a response.",
                "start_ms": 19740,
                "end_ms": 23340
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/01-difficult-situations/agree-the-next-step/scene.fil.99a8afa3e8d3.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "99a8afa3e8d37f2cc921c3b2b4719a66bc1f953b2308999bda406824ba8152b5",
            "sha256": "d92192c70717b9c3453118aac637ea5ae073870e15cb6f3f792293d5c459ce2a",
            "duration_seconds": 25.365,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ang sitwasyon",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2360
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Binisita ni BHW Salma si Ben sa Marawi.",
                "start_ms": 2660,
                "end_ms": 7460
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Hindi siya makapunta sa health center sa umaga dahil sa trabaho.",
                "start_ms": 7760,
                "end_ms": 12480
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "“Hindi ko kayang mawala buong araw,” sabi niya.",
                "start_ms": 12780,
                "end_ms": 16500
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Hindi pa alam ni Salma kung may ibang iskedyul ang staff.",
                "start_ms": 16800,
                "end_ms": 20960
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Alamin ang alalahanin bago pumili ng tugon.",
                "start_ms": 21260,
                "end_ms": 25300
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "scope": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/01-difficult-situations/agree-the-next-step/scope.en.f58080bd5629.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "f58080bd562943a77092215b49520df479d50708fb7e85d441c47529a1612d8b",
            "sha256": "be7fe0f7a256f61c7f3a234cd7809f1221954d954b7e643e5430e3918364bf8f",
            "duration_seconds": 29.153,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Scope and support",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2360
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "The BHW helps coordinate; do not guarantee a schedule or force agreement.",
                "start_ms": 2660,
                "end_ms": 9540
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "If no suitable option is available, ask the midwife or supervisor.",
                "start_ms": 9840,
                "end_ms": 15200
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "If there is immediate danger, prioritize emergency services; routine follow-up must not replace urgent help.",
                "start_ms": 15500,
                "end_ms": 23780
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Seek the appropriate support when a situation exceeds your role.",
                "start_ms": 24080,
                "end_ms": 29080
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/01-difficult-situations/agree-the-next-step/scope.fil.892f27bb6e83.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "892f27bb6e83a940152c226950af390f9c9d0d45bbee82abf9886beefac01855",
            "sha256": "6e31625f5d2a18d573063a2d2f36abc09b763c3c91a2a4bba01eedfb07456d7f",
            "duration_seconds": 33.384,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Saklaw at paghingi ng tulong",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2720
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Tungkulin ng BHW na tumulong sa pakikipag-ugnayan, hindi maggarantiya ng iskedyul o pilitin ang pagsang-ayon.",
                "start_ms": 3020,
                "end_ms": 11780
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Kapag walang angkop na pagpipilian, humingi ng gabay sa midwife o supervisor.",
                "start_ms": 12080,
                "end_ms": 18240
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Kung may agarang panganib, unahin ang emergency service; huwag gamitin ang ordinaryong follow-up bilang kapalit ng agarang tulong.",
                "start_ms": 18540,
                "end_ms": 27900
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Humingi ng tulong sa tamang tao kapag lampas sa saklaw.",
                "start_ms": 28200,
                "end_ms": 33320
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "akapulko": {
