              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Hear the concern and check the clarity of your explanation while staying within the BHW role.",
                "start_ms": 11460,
                "end_ms": 18780
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/check.fil.c165e162ab54.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "c165e162ab54ee3da2e4b813b878f30bdccbfdcac1d5d9647f565812462498de",
            "sha256": "6b3f70e80dc2028fd969d968b4aa59a81ed6c6d4bf02dfe1e9b3a4b51b040a5c",
            "duration_seconds": 22.883,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Piliin ang susunod na hakbang",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2880
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Piliin ang sagot at ipaliwanag kung bakit bago tingnan ang feedback.",
                "start_ms": 3180,
                "end_ms": 8420
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Pagkatapos, ihambing sa sarili mong ginawa sa pagsasanay.",
                "start_ms": 8720,
                "end_ms": 13520
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Pakinggan ang concern at suriin ang linaw ng sariling paliwanag, habang nananatili sa saklaw ng BHW.",
                "start_ms": 13820,
                "end_ms": 22820
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "distress": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/distress.en.303e4c2052ec.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "303e4c2052ecee09bbe21cd7290f73e7811e842680a83a01624bdfe82bc65340",
            "sha256": "33decf957af7d130623ce483a0efe043a41740dada8daa27e30f049de4d9d92a",
            "duration_seconds": 44.278,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "When someone feels overwhelmed",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2720
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ben, 37, says he has felt low for several weeks.",
                "start_ms": 3020,
                "end_ms": 7700
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "A possible opening is, “Thank you for telling me.",
                "start_ms": 8000,
                "end_ms": 11880
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "What feels hardest right now?”",
                "start_ms": 12180,
                "end_ms": 14580
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Listen privately and help him reach a health professional; avoid saying “just think happy thoughts” or assigning a diagnosis.",
                "start_ms": 14880,
                "end_ms": 24600
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "If there is immediate danger to safety, follow the local emergency referral protocol at once.",
                "start_ms": 24900,
                "end_ms": 31940
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Do not promise to conceal danger from people who need to help.",
                "start_ms": 32240,
                "end_ms": 36560
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Listening offers support; diagnosis and clinical care belong with a qualified health professional.",
                "start_ms": 36860,
                "end_ms": 44220
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/distress.fil.ead03843859b.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "ead03843859b8fbb6836d4ef005c7af6ce9d1b7a0313eaa3f5a77719e9e90926",
            "sha256": "325c0e940b094315594cebee76ca805dbc4041a7bac46cc5e3266233048db545",
            "duration_seconds": 50.991,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Kapag mabigat ang nararamdaman",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2560
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Si Ben, 37 anyos, ay nagsasabing ilang linggo na siyang malungkot.",
                "start_ms": 2860,
                "end_ms": 8820
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "“Salamat sa pagsabi.",
                "start_ms": 9120,
                "end_ms": 10920
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Ano ang pinakamabigat para sa iyo ngayon?”",
                "start_ms": 11220,
                "end_ms": 14780
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "ang maaaring simula.",
                "start_ms": 15080,
                "end_ms": 17160
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Makinig sa pribadong lugar at tumulong makaugnay sa health professional; huwag sabihing “isipin mo lang ang masasaya” o magbigay ng diagnosis.",
                "start_ms": 17460,
                "end_ms": 28340
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Kung may agarang panganib sa kaligtasan, sundin kaagad ang lokal na emergency referral protocol.",
                "start_ms": 28640,
                "end_ms": 35960
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "Huwag mangakong ililihim ang panganib sa mga taong kailangang tumulong.",
                "start_ms": 36260,
                "end_ms": 42060
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ang pakikinig ay suporta; ang diagnosis at pangangalagang klinikal ay para sa kwalipikadong health professional.",
                "start_ms": 42360,
                "end_ms": 50920
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "family-planning": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/family-planning.en.6316d05fd10e.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "6316d05fd10e956333a9e1743ac8bdac31e73efba77e02e2cf363c67b8afb5cc",
            "sha256": "5ee60929982ac2db85225afc434c460e5ee52ede1853a5083bd06a230a8288cf",
            "duration_seconds": 38.113,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "A family-planning question",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2280
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Jo, 24, is worried about something she heard about family planning.",
                "start_ms": 2580,
                "end_ms": 7740
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Ask what specifically concerns her and listen without mocking the belief.",
                "start_ms": 8040,
                "end_ms": 13600
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "A BHW can explain general information from approved materials, while choosing an appropriate method requires discussion with Jo and a midwife or qualified provider.",
                "start_ms": 13900,
                "end_ms": 26140
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Identify where she can get private counseling; do not decide for her.",
                "start_ms": 26440,
                "end_ms": 31440
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Family-planning communication supports the person’s choice and appropriate counseling.",
                "start_ms": 31740,
                "end_ms": 38060
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/family-planning.fil.0ad47f94e318.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "0ad47f94e318de05ef270be2a98772c08f7a403bb85efaf996f880f54a062f1c",
            "sha256": "3a71aad4aba9cf563789704bc766117e9097aa9789bf469e16bcb64bba3ef5f3",
            "duration_seconds": 48.64,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "May tanong tungkol sa family planning",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2880
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Si Jo, 24 anyos, ay takot sa kuwentong narinig tungkol sa family planning.",
                "start_ms": 3180,
                "end_ms": 9940
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Tanungin kung ano ang partikular na ikinababahala niya at makinig nang hindi pinagtatawanan ang paniniwala.",
                "start_ms": 10240,
                "end_ms": 18000
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Maaaring ipaliwanag ng BHW ang pangkalahatang impormasyon mula sa aprubadong materyal, ngunit ang pagpili ng angkop na paraan ay kailangang talakayin kay Jo at sa midwife o kwalipikadong provider.",
                "start_ms": 18300,
                "end_ms": 34220
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Tiyakin kung saan siya makakakuha ng pribadong counseling; huwag pumili para sa kanya.",
                "start_ms": 34520,
                "end_ms": 40880
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ang pakikipag-usap tungkol sa family planning ay nagbibigay ng puwang sa pagpili at tamang counseling.",
                "start_ms": 41180,
                "end_ms": 48580
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "practice": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/practice.en.cedb52ab8871.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "cedb52ab88710212fb480224912a41a925bb02c97c1a44da227300278ca2fcbb",
            "sha256": "867262ff1be50d7ef0bd2eff247bbdac196322fe6c3f734f232de43f2f90c7ae",
            "duration_seconds": 41.561,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Try it, then repeat",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2600
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Choose Jo, Ben or Ramon.",
                "start_ms": 2900,
                "end_ms": 6260
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "In triads, play BHW, resident and observer.",
                "start_ms": 6560,
                "end_ms": 11800
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Acknowledge the concern, give one safe next step and invite an explanation in the resident’s own words.",
                "start_ms": 12100,
                "end_ms": 20660
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "The observer identifies one phrase to change; repeat.",
                "start_ms": 20960,
                "end_ms": 25720
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Alone, write both sides.",
                "start_ms": 26020,
                "end_ms": 28660
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "At the next visit, use teach-back with one approved message.",
                "start_ms": 28960,
                "end_ms": 34200
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Hear the concern and check the clarity of your explanation while staying within the BHW role.",
                "start_ms": 34500,
                "end_ms": 41500
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/practice.fil.a3480f6e0452.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "a3480f6e04522e4bf480b2bcd707861829cab63ce6064017c84a5af22b8c33e4",
            "sha256": "419b860e1947bf844637026034ad5bcd1b0d9fccb12f112efad19fa53893c3b6",
            "duration_seconds": 49.633,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Subukan, saka ulitin",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 3160
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Pumili ng Jo, Ben o Ramon na sitwasyon.",
                "start_ms": 3460,
                "end_ms": 7780
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Sa tatluhan, gumanap na BHW, residente at tagamasid.",
                "start_ms": 8080,
                "end_ms": 14840
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Kilalanin ang concern, sabihin ang isang ligtas na susunod na hakbang, at ipasabi ito sa sariling salita.",
                "start_ms": 15140,
                "end_ms": 23580
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Magbigay ang tagamasid ng isang linyang babaguhin; ulitin.",
                "start_ms": 23880,
                "end_ms": 28800
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Kung mag-isa, i-record sa papel ang dalawang panig.",
                "start_ms": 29100,
                "end_ms": 33700
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Sa susunod na pagbisita, gamitin ang teach-back sa isang aprubadong mensahe.",
                "start_ms": 34000,
                "end_ms": 39720
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Pakinggan ang concern at suriin ang linaw ng sariling paliwanag, habang nananatili sa saklaw ng BHW.",
                "start_ms": 40020,
                "end_ms": 49580
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "smoking": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/smoking.en.b1fe9b935295.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "b1fe9b935295b1467df5c4e5254a70b1299cae7341389ed3460e9b987d0d8e01",
            "sha256": "442f86cbf6541c1337c65aa893a2f412f156bf2cbc6b643a4db822f062009ad2",
            "duration_seconds": 38.687,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Discuss smoking without blame",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2440
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ramon, 45, feels attacked when called “undisciplined.”",
                "start_ms": 2740,
                "end_ms": 7980
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "First ask permission to discuss smoking.",
                "start_ms": 8280,
                "end_ms": 11480
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Explore what he would like to change and what barriers he anticipates.",
                "start_ms": 11780,
                "end_ms": 16860
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Summarize his response and offer a connection to health-center support.",
                "start_ms": 17160,
                "end_ms": 22080
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "One agreed step is more useful than a long lecture he has stopped hearing.",
                "start_ms": 22380,
                "end_ms": 28140
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Medication and suitable treatment should be discussed with the provider.",
                "start_ms": 28440,
                "end_ms": 33400
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Planning improves when the person’s own goal and barriers are heard.",
                "start_ms": 33700,
                "end_ms": 38620
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/smoking.fil.fc493c01a1bd.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "fc493c01a1bded2a437aee19067e03ae9fc5807760d6b26b7a1eced27cafdea2",
            "sha256": "8a9294bc20a986dbeea17058da81be23fa567e6e57375e25c2cbda3168d86af2",
            "duration_seconds": 47.726,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Pag-usapan ang paninigarilyo nang walang paninisi",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 3840
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Si Ramon, 45 anyos, ay napipikon kapag pinagsasabihang “walang disiplina.”",
                "start_ms": 4140,
                "end_ms": 11980
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Humingi muna ng pahintulot na pag-usapan ang paninigarilyo.",
                "start_ms": 12280,
                "end_ms": 16760
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Itanong kung ano ang gusto niyang mabago at kung anong hadlang ang nakikita niya.",
                "start_ms": 17060,
                "end_ms": 22540
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Ibuod ang sagot at mag-alok na ikonekta siya sa health-center support.",
                "start_ms": 22840,
                "end_ms": 27880
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Isang napagkasunduang hakbang ang mas kapaki-pakinabang kaysa mahabang sermon na hindi niya pinakinggan.",
                "start_ms": 28180,
                "end_ms": 36620
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Ang gamot at angkop na paggamot ay talakayin sa provider.",
                "start_ms": 36920,
                "end_ms": 41440
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Mas madaling magplano kapag narinig ang layunin at hadlang ng mismong tao.",
                "start_ms": 41740,
                "end_ms": 47660
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "teach-back": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/teach-back.en.b0249869511b.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "b0249869511b1a42926072767ee52ef625e7a2cbbdc6d7bea0cca53be496466d",
            "sha256": "5010abb1588d4da47554c856c79a25b739f15a72a4f86d705b52ddbfb0f2924f",
            "duration_seconds": 50.469,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "One message, then hear it back",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2960
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "BHW Gibs has heard Liza, 29, explain her difficulty attending the health center.",
                "start_ms": 3260,
                "end_ms": 10180
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "They agree to contact the midwife about scheduling.",
                "start_ms": 10480,
                "end_ms": 14160
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Gibs explains the agreed next step in plain language.",
                "start_ms": 14460,
                "end_ms": 18820
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "“To check that I explained it clearly, how would you describe the plan when you get home?”",
                "start_ms": 19120,
                "end_ms": 24640
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "If Liza’s response differs, Gibs explains it another way and checks again.",
                "start_ms": 24940,
                "end_ms": 30700
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Teach-back checks the clarity of the explanation, not the person’s intelligence.",
                "start_ms": 31000,
                "end_ms": 36680
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "Use a suitable picture if helpful; keep advice within training and the health team’s instructions.",
                "start_ms": 36980,
                "end_ms": 44180
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Check a clear message through the person’s own explanation, not a nod alone.",
                "start_ms": 44480,
                "end_ms": 50400
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/teach-back.fil.9d64b6344c06.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "9d64b6344c068984370020c0c8fbeeeca07f02192ac2b8918c2a75b56c4c7646",
            "sha256": "c0eba863ee6ce9cf7d72fc2f32180ece137ef2bc604d55655f795b9e29bd2766",
            "duration_seconds": 61.701,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Isang mensahe, saka pakinggan ang balik",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 3640
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Si BHW Gibs ay nakipag-usap kay Liza, 29, tungkol sa hadlang sa pagpunta sa health center.",
                "start_ms": 3940,
                "end_ms": 11940
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Magkasundo silang makikipag-ugnayan sa midwife tungkol sa iskedyul.",
                "start_ms": 12240,
                "end_ms": 17560
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Ipinaliwanag ni Gibs ang napagkasunduang susunod na hakbang sa payak na salita.",
                "start_ms": 17860,
                "end_ms": 23900
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "“Para malaman kong malinaw ang paliwanag ko, paano mo ikukuwento ang plano pag-uwi?”",
                "start_ms": 24200,
                "end_ms": 30560
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Kapag iba ang sagot ni Liza, uulitin ni Gibs sa ibang paraan at muling magtatanong.",
                "start_ms": 30860,
                "end_ms": 37220
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Ang teach-back ay pagsusuri sa linaw ng paliwanag, hindi pagsusulit sa talino ng kausap.",
                "start_ms": 37520,
                "end_ms": 44120
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "Gumamit ng angkop na larawan kung makakatulong; huwag magbigay ng payong lampas sa pagsasanay at tagubilin ng health team.",
                "start_ms": 44420,
                "end_ms": 53380
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ang malinaw na mensahe ay nasusuri sa sariling paliwanag ng kausap, hindi sa pagtango lamang.",
                "start_ms": 53680,
                "end_ms": 61640
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "communication-handoff": {
      "module": "06-komunikasyon",
      "sections": {
        "audience": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/audience.en.3834ec14d40b.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "3834ec14d40ba969ff7397e80fad6d9a126b4b15972f78553d6d5a708839c9d7",
            "sha256": "63317d31ba187fdeb7b1d06e4358036b20f3218c186dc72e6420b6e99e59b249",
            "duration_seconds": 83.278,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "The right recipient and enough detail",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2920
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Before sending, verify who is authorized to receive an individual report and what they need for their role.",
                "start_ms": 3220,
                "end_ms": 10260
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "In this example, the midwife is the designated recipient.",
                "start_ms": 10560,
                "end_ms": 15040
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Every meeting participant is not automatically authorized to receive a private case.",
                "start_ms": 15340,
                "end_ms": 20740
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Gibs asks: “Are you the authorized recipient for this report?",
                "start_ms": 21040,
                "end_ms": 25320
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Which approved method should we use?”",
                "start_ms": 25620,
                "end_ms": 28140
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Verify the actual recipient; do not rely only on an account name.",
                "start_ms": 28440,
                "end_ms": 33800
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "Follow the verified local procedure for a spoken, paper or electronic handoff.",
                "start_ms": 34100,
                "end_ms": 39700
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 7,
                "text": "A personal phone is not automatically approved.",
                "start_ms": 40000,
                "end_ms": 43320
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 8,
                "text": "Keep names and personal forms out of public group chats.",
                "start_ms": 43620,
                "end_ms": 47660
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 9,
                "text": "Explain the purpose, recipient and next step to Liza in plain language under local policy.",
                "start_ms": 47960,
                "end_ms": 54000
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 10,
                "text": "Give the midwife only relevant details.",
                "start_ms": 54300,
                "end_ms": 57540
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 11,
                "text": "At a meeting, use sufficient aggregated information that cannot identify a household.",
                "start_ms": 57840,
                "end_ms": 63920
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 12,
                "text": "Do not promise absolute secrecy in every situation.",
                "start_ms": 64220,
                "end_ms": 68620
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 13,
                "text": "If urgent assistance is needed, do not delay help to finish a routine report; follow the verified local process.",
                "start_ms": 68920,
                "end_ms": 77000
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Verify the authorized recipient and locally approved method; share only what is needed.",
                "start_ms": 77300,
                "end_ms": 83220
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/audience.fil.11b0fa4f1192.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "11b0fa4f11927ea7c512d4f32759483b2a320d428199b827dbf616b5699d12f9",
            "sha256": "034bd35168dc104517f20b7af1dd97eb250d327352a43b21a37c5ed700b4a2e6",
            "duration_seconds": 93.048,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Tamang tatanggap, sapat na detalye",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 3240
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Bago magpadala, tiyakin kung sino ang awtorisadong tumanggap ng indibidwal na ulat at ano ang kailangan niya para sa kanyang tungkulin.",
                "start_ms": 3540,
                "end_ms": 12260
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Sa halimbawa, ang midwife ang itinalagang tatanggap.",
                "start_ms": 12560,
                "end_ms": 16160
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Hindi nangangahulugang maaaring tumanggap ng pribadong kaso ang bawat kasama sa pulong.",
                "start_ms": 16460,
                "end_ms": 22060
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Sinabi ni Gibs: “Kayo po ba ang awtorisadong tatanggap nito?",
                "start_ms": 22360,
                "end_ms": 26640
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Aling aprubadong paraan ang gagamitin natin?”",
                "start_ms": 26940,
                "end_ms": 30020
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Tiyakin ang aktuwal na tatanggap; huwag umasa sa pangalan lang sa isang account.",
                "start_ms": 30320,
                "end_ms": 35400
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "Sundin ang natiyak na lokal na paraan para sa pasalita, papel o elektronikong ulat.",
                "start_ms": 35700,
                "end_ms": 41940
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 7,
                "text": "Hindi awtomatikong aprubado ang personal na telepono.",
                "start_ms": 42240,
                "end_ms": 46160
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 8,
                "text": "Huwag ilagay ang pangalan o personal na form sa pampublikong group chat.",
                "start_ms": 46460,
                "end_ms": 51540
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 9,
                "text": "Kay Liza, ipaliwanag sa payak na wika ang layunin, tatanggap at susunod na hakbang ayon sa lokal na patakaran.",
                "start_ms": 51840,
                "end_ms": 60520
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 10,
                "text": "Sa midwife, ibigay lamang ang kaugnay na detalye.",
                "start_ms": 60820,
                "end_ms": 64620
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 11,
                "text": "Sa pulong, gumamit ng sapat na pinagsama-samang impormasyon na hindi makakakilala sa isang pamilya.",
                "start_ms": 64920,
                "end_ms": 72800
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 12,
                "text": "Walang pangakong lubos na lihim sa lahat ng pagkakataon.",
                "start_ms": 73100,
                "end_ms": 76820
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 13,
                "text": "Kung may agarang pangangailangan, huwag ipagpaliban ang tulong para tapusin ang karaniwang ulat; sundin ang natiyak na lokal na proseso.",
                "start_ms": 77120,
                "end_ms": 85760
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Tiyakin ang awtorisadong tatanggap at lokal na aprubadong paraan; ibahagi lamang ang kailangan.",
                "start_ms": 86060,
                "end_ms": 92980
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "check": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/check.en.3eaa90eeebbe.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "3eaa90eeebbe4838d955e9483542f4a560ae691b8a7770e265d217e1a47ef020",
            "sha256": "a543aec4db0cf595946115a25eb88b989bd0291191c5e36c9a91418bc36bfdc4",
            "duration_seconds": 41.953,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "What is enough for the meeting?",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 1880
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "The chair of a barangay planning meeting asks about missed visits.",
                "start_ms": 2180,
                "end_ms": 6980
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Gibs has a private record from the fictional exercise, but not everyone present is authorized to receive individual cases.",
                "start_ms": 7280,
                "end_ms": 14800
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "A schedule change has not been approved.",
                "start_ms": 15100,
                "end_ms": 17900
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Look at the situation before choosing.",
                "start_ms": 18200,
                "end_ms": 20600
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "What relevant information does the group need for planning?",
                "start_ms": 20900,
                "end_ms": 24300
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Choose an answer and explain why.",
                "start_ms": 24600,
                "end_ms": 27400
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "After selecting, read all three rationales and the ending, then compare them with your own report and confirmation.",
                "start_ms": 27700,
                "end_ms": 35460
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Share what the right recipient needs; verify receipt and follow up on the agreement.",
                "start_ms": 35760,
                "end_ms": 41880
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/check.fil.f461a939520c.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "f461a939520ced75d2825a2c1025e4bf1472aca04818126aca51bf1e26103ec7",
            "sha256": "a3d04790c96cac7e819a580cb637a5338ed7fcac8023113943f9e9d7a118e56f",
            "duration_seconds": 50.181,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ano ang sapat para sa pulong?",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2320
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Nagtanong ang chair ng barangay planning meeting tungkol sa mga hindi natuloy na pagpunta.",
                "start_ms": 2620,
                "end_ms": 7820
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "May pribadong tala si Gibs mula sa kathang-isip na pagsasanay, ngunit hindi lahat ng nasa pulong ay awtorisadong tumanggap ng indibidwal na kaso.",
                "start_ms": 8120,
                "end_ms": 17960
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Hindi pa aprubado ang pagbabago sa iskedyul.",
                "start_ms": 18260,
                "end_ms": 21260
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Tingnan ang larawan ng sitwasyon bago pumili.",
                "start_ms": 21560,
                "end_ms": 24520
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Ano ang kaugnay na impormasyong kailangan ng grupo para magplano?",
                "start_ms": 24820,
                "end_ms": 28900
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Piliin ang sagot at ipaliwanag kung bakit.",
                "start_ms": 29200,
                "end_ms": 32720
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "Pagkatapos pumili, basahin ang paliwanag sa lahat ng pagpipilian at ang wakas; ihambing sa sariling ulat at kumpirmasyon.",
                "start_ms": 33020,
                "end_ms": 42500
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ibahagi ang kailangan ng tamang tatanggap; tiyakin ang pagtanggap at sundan ang napagkasunduan.",
                "start_ms": 42800,
                "end_ms": 50120
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "confirm-next-step": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/confirm-next-step.en.36b3156f46c6.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "36b3156f46c62c7b2f31718772063dd4f505fbed2f5a76a31f5c8df231c75216",
            "sha256": "288623a6473ace62343280464ff8a64c6ec69ab66bdbda41f07e9e1fcbb6998a",
            "duration_seconds": 86.465,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Was it received, and what was agreed?",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 3160
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "A sent message does not prove that it was read, understood or agreed to.",
                "start_ms": 3460,
                "end_ms": 9340
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Ask the recipient and listen to clarification.",
                "start_ms": 9640,
                "end_ms": 13440
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "In this example, the midwife asks: “Is the last attendance date certain?”",
                "start_ms": 13740,
                "end_ms": 18940
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Gibs replies: “Not yet.",
                "start_ms": 19240,
                "end_ms": 21720
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "I will correct the report: Liza is the source of the barrier; the date still needs verification.”",
                "start_ms": 22020,
                "end_ms": 28620
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "The midwife says: “I received your report.",
                "start_ms": 28920,
                "end_ms": 31760
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "I will check scheduling options and talk with you tomorrow through our agreed private method.”",
                "start_ms": 32060,
                "end_ms": 37220
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 7,
                "text": "Gibs repeats: “You will check the schedule.",
                "start_ms": 37520,
                "end_ms": 40640
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 8,
                "text": "Tomorrow I will confirm your response with you, then explain the verified next step to Liza.",
                "start_ms": 40940,
                "end_ms": 46940
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 9,
                "text": "Is that correct?”",
                "start_ms": 47240,
                "end_ms": 48400
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 10,
                "text": "The midwife agrees.",
                "start_ms": 48700,
                "end_ms": 50700
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 11,
                "text": "This is the agreement in the fictional exercise, not a universal local deadline.",
                "start_ms": 51000,
                "end_ms": 56400
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 12,
                "text": "Record acknowledgement, who will act, what they will do and when or how to confirm again.",
                "start_ms": 56700,
                "end_ms": 63580
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 13,
                "text": "Do not tell Liza that an appointment or childcare is arranged when it is not.",
                "start_ms": 63880,
                "end_ms": 69480
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 14,
                "text": "If the recipient cannot be reached, follow only the verified local backup process; do not invent a substitute recipient or an emergency rule.",
                "start_ms": 69780,
                "end_ms": 80140
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Confirm receipt and the agreement: who, what, and when or how to follow up.",
                "start_ms": 80440,
                "end_ms": 86400
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/confirm-next-step.fil.ea4d10cda9e3.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "ea4d10cda9e3d3c9a3a98f7b12a41efe4c2924200498cf9468dbb6d196794f2c",
            "sha256": "6763f0d7d126f8924fbba54cd4ab646ee46f2d389a27814e1a3225c3d6097ab6",
            "duration_seconds": 99.265,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Natanggap ba, at ano ang napagkasunduan?",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 3240
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ang naipadalang mensahe ay hindi patunay na nabasa, naunawaan o napagkasunduan ang hiling.",
                "start_ms": 3540,
                "end_ms": 10940
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Tanungin ang tatanggap at pakinggan ang paglilinaw.",
                "start_ms": 11240,
                "end_ms": 14840
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Sa halimbawa, nagtanong ang midwife: “Tiyak ba ang huling petsa?”",
                "start_ms": 15140,
                "end_ms": 20380
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Sumagot si Gibs: “Hindi pa po.",
                "start_ms": 20680,
                "end_ms": 23600
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Itatama ko ang ulat: ayon kay Liza ang hadlang; ang petsa ay kailangan pang beripikahin.”",
                "start_ms": 23900,
                "end_ms": 31100
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Sinabi ng midwife: “Natanggap ko ang ulat.",
                "start_ms": 31400,
                "end_ms": 34600
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "Titingnan ko ang mga pagpipilian sa iskedyul at kakausapin kita bukas sa napagkasunduan nating pribadong paraan.”",
                "start_ms": 34900,
                "end_ms": 43020
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 7,
                "text": "Inulit ni Gibs: “Kayo po ang titingin sa iskedyul.",
                "start_ms": 43320,
                "end_ms": 47320
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 8,
                "text": "Bukas ko kukumpirmahin sa inyo ang sagot; pagkatapos ay ipapaliwanag ko kay Liza ang natiyak na hakbang.",
                "start_ms": 47620,
                "end_ms": 54780
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 9,
                "text": "Tama po ba?”",
                "start_ms": 55080,
                "end_ms": 56360
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 10,
                "text": "Sumang-ayon ang midwife.",
                "start_ms": 56660,
                "end_ms": 58820
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 11,
                "text": "Ito ang napagkasunduan sa kathang-isip na pagsasanay, hindi pangkalahatang deadline sa lahat ng lugar.",
                "start_ms": 59120,
                "end_ms": 65360
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 12,
                "text": "Itala ang pagtanggap, sino ang gagawa, ano ang gagawin at kailan o paano muling kukumpirmahin.",
                "start_ms": 65660,
                "end_ms": 74860
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 13,
                "text": "Huwag sabihin kay Liza na may appointment o childcare na kung wala pa.",
                "start_ms": 75160,
                "end_ms": 80440
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 14,
                "text": "Kung hindi makontak ang tatanggap, sundin lamang ang natiyak na lokal na backup process; huwag gumawa ng sariling kapalit na tatanggap o emergency rule.",
                "start_ms": 80740,
                "end_ms": 90900
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Kumpirmahin ang pagtanggap at ang napagkasunduan: sino, ano, at kailan o paano mag-follow-up.",
                "start_ms": 91200,
                "end_ms": 99200
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "handoff": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/handoff.en.1105573ee9e5.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "1105573ee9e526ca97f94ad1eff87249b65d8fac388cd5e42a9dd57550450389",
            "sha256": "e2b04a9f837684577465cbed5fc2a96c5d696deff9715f61de69007c7229fb50",
            "duration_seconds": 75.938,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "A short report with honest sources",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2880
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Gibs is the fictional male BHW; Liza, 29, is the resident.",
                "start_ms": 3180,
                "end_ms": 9220
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Her earlier attributed record says attending the health center is difficult because she has no one to watch her child.",
                "start_ms": 9520,
                "end_ms": 16640
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Her last attendance date remains unverified.",
                "start_ms": 16940,
                "end_ms": 19740
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "This is neither a diagnosis nor evidence that she refuses to attend.",
                "start_ms": 20040,
                "end_ms": 24800
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "In a private conversation with the authorized midwife, Gibs says: “Liza reports difficulty finding childcare.",
                "start_ms": 25100,
                "end_ms": 32260
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Her last attendance date is not yet verified.",
                "start_ms": 32560,
                "end_ms": 35680
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "She requests a conversation about scheduling.",
                "start_ms": 35980,
                "end_ms": 39140
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 7,
                "text": "Could you check a possible way for her to talk with you?”",
                "start_ms": 39440,
                "end_ms": 42720
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 8,
                "text": "Use the locally approved form if available: date, relevant concern, source, uncertainty, action taken and requested action.",
                "start_ms": 43020,
                "end_ms": 53940
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 9,
                "text": "Record the request separately from what was actually agreed.",
                "start_ms": 54240,
                "end_ms": 58520
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 10,
                "text": "Asking for help does not approve a visit, appointment or childcare.",
                "start_ms": 58820,
                "end_ms": 63620
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 11,
                "text": "This dialogue is an authored teaching example, not a DOH quotation.",
                "start_ms": 63920,
                "end_ms": 68840
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Separate the concern, source and missing detail; a request is not yet an agreement.",
                "start_ms": 69140,
                "end_ms": 75860
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/handoff.fil.9eb9a5961c9f.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "9eb9a5961c9f78ea3b5f0d1def63c68120a250792fa5b9621aeadef0fb874bfe",
            "sha256": "771c71fe88e37a222c31bb7e64ca8c0e35b0155c5463112eca8f4e4576392eee",
            "duration_seconds": 85.682,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Maikling ulat, tapat na pinagmulan",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 3040
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Si Gibs ang kathang-isip na lalaking BHW; si Liza, 29, ang residente.",
                "start_ms": 3340,
                "end_ms": 10940
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Sa naunang tala, sinabi ni Liza na mahirap pumunta sa health center dahil walang magbabantay sa anak.",
                "start_ms": 11240,
                "end_ms": 17960
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Hindi pa natiyak ang petsa ng huling pagpunta.",
                "start_ms": 18260,
                "end_ms": 21540
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Hindi ito diagnosis o patunay na ayaw niyang pumunta.",
                "start_ms": 21840,
                "end_ms": 26200
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Sa pribadong usapan sa awtorisadong midwife, sinabi ni Gibs: “Ayon kay Liza, hirap siyang makahanap ng magbabantay sa anak.",
                "start_ms": 26500,
                "end_ms": 35580
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Hindi pa natiyak ang huling pagpunta niya.",
                "start_ms": 35880,
                "end_ms": 38720
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "Humihingi siya ng pakikipag-usap tungkol sa iskedyul.",
                "start_ms": 39020,
                "end_ms": 42540
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 7,
                "text": "Maaari po ba ninyong tingnan ang posibleng paraan ng pakikipag-usap?”",
                "start_ms": 42840,
                "end_ms": 47600
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 8,
                "text": "Gamitin ang lokal na aprubadong form kung mayroon: petsa, kaugnay na concern, pinagmulan, hindi pa tiyak, ginawa at hinihinging aksyon.",
                "start_ms": 47900,
                "end_ms": 60140
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 9,
                "text": "Itala nang magkahiwalay ang hiling at ang talagang napagkasunduan.",
                "start_ms": 60440,
                "end_ms": 65440
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 10,
                "text": "Ang paghingi ng tulong ay hindi pa pag-apruba ng pagbisita, appointment o childcare.",
                "start_ms": 65740,
                "end_ms": 72020
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 11,
                "text": "Ang usapang ito ay ginawang halimbawa para sa aralin, hindi sipi mula sa DOH.",
                "start_ms": 72320,
                "end_ms": 78000
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ihiwalay ang concern, pinagmulan at kulang na detalye; ang hinihingi ay hindi pa napagkasunduan.",
                "start_ms": 78300,
                "end_ms": 85620
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "meeting": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/meeting.en.ccd59541d1e9.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "ccd59541d1e98777498dce74bd81df72875d68c51cbcbf8f953d278af29b51f0",
            "sha256": "d88f59cf1d1b8a509da8262dd2377197a0eee611a665084d3b8e4f0304cdc2f9",
            "duration_seconds": 79.595,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "A pattern for the meeting, a case for the right person",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 3720
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "In this practice exercise, three fictional households report childcare barriers.",
                "start_ms": 4020,
                "end_ms": 10140
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "The barangay planning meeting aims to discuss scheduling, not expose their private stories.",
                "start_ms": 10440,
                "end_ms": 16000
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Names, form photographs, exact addresses and details that point to a household are unnecessary.",
                "start_ms": 16300,
                "end_ms": 23020
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Combined details can identify someone even without a name.",
                "start_ms": 23320,
                "end_ms": 27440
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Gibs gives a brief report: “In three fictional reports, childcare was mentioned as a barrier.",
                "start_ms": 27740,
                "end_ms": 34220
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Not all attendance dates have been verified.",
                "start_ms": 34520,
                "end_ms": 37520
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "Could we discuss how to explain scheduling options?”",
                "start_ms": 37820,
                "end_ms": 41260
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 7,
                "text": "This is a coordination question, not a statement that a change is approved.",
                "start_ms": 41560,
                "end_ms": 46680
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 8,
                "text": "The count belongs only to this example; it is not barangay data.",
                "start_ms": 46980,
                "end_ms": 51540
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 9,
                "text": "Keep individual follow-up separate from the meeting.",
                "start_ms": 51840,
                "end_ms": 55360
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 10,
                "text": "In real work, use only authorized information for the approved purpose under local procedure.",
                "start_ms": 55660,
                "end_ms": 61740
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 11,
                "text": "If removing identifying details is insufficient, do not share the case with the group; ask the designated health team member for the appropriate method.",
                "start_ms": 62040,
                "end_ms": 71560
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "At a meeting, give a sufficient pattern and a clear question; private cases go to the authorized recipient.",
                "start_ms": 71860,
                "end_ms": 79540
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/meeting.fil.e76bbd131450.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "e76bbd13145068ce63dc0508f6d3f9c8ebd9f972457c9058a85001816e61ad8b",
            "sha256": "e44f2dc09e50d09072b1258fa670bcf54fbb0651028d2887005e8b2c70606fe7",
            "duration_seconds": 89.496,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Pattern sa pulong, kaso sa tamang tao",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 3120
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Sa pagsasanay, tatlong kathang-isip na pamilya ang nagsabing hadlang ang magbabantay sa anak.",
                "start_ms": 3420,
                "end_ms": 10580
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Ang layunin ng barangay planning meeting ay pag-usapan ang iskedyul, hindi ilantad ang kanilang personal na kuwento.",
                "start_ms": 10880,
                "end_ms": 17720
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Walang kailangang pangalan, larawan ng form, eksaktong tirahan o detalyeng madaling magturo sa isang pamilya.",
                "start_ms": 18020,
                "end_ms": 26180
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Kahit walang pangalan, maaaring makilala ang tao mula sa pinagsamang detalye.",
                "start_ms": 26480,
                "end_ms": 32160
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Maikling ulat ni Gibs: “Sa tatlong kathang-isip na ulat, nabanggit ang hadlang sa pagbabantay ng anak.",
                "start_ms": 32460,
                "end_ms": 40260
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Hindi pa natiyak ang lahat ng petsa ng pagpunta.",
                "start_ms": 40560,
                "end_ms": 43840
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "Maaari bang pag-usapan kung paano ipapaliwanag ang mga pagpipilian sa iskedyul?”",
                "start_ms": 44140,
                "end_ms": 50060
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 7,
                "text": "Tanong ito para sa koordinasyon, hindi pahayag na aprubado na ang pagbabago.",
                "start_ms": 50360,
                "end_ms": 55720
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 8,
                "text": "Ang bilang ay mula lamang sa halimbawang ito, hindi datos ng barangay.",
                "start_ms": 56020,
                "end_ms": 60380
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 9,
                "text": "Ihiwalay ang indibidwal na follow-up sa pulong.",
                "start_ms": 60680,
                "end_ms": 64200
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 10,
                "text": "Sa tunay na gawain, gamitin lamang ang awtorisadong impormasyon para sa aprubadong layunin at lokal na proseso.",
                "start_ms": 64500,
                "end_ms": 72100
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 11,
                "text": "Kung hindi sapat ang pagtatanggal ng pagkakakilanlan, huwag ibahagi ang kaso sa grupo; itanong ang tamang paraan sa itinalagang health team member.",
                "start_ms": 72400,
                "end_ms": 81640
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Sa pulong, sapat na pattern at malinaw na tanong; ang pribadong kaso ay sa awtorisadong tatanggap.",
                "start_ms": 81940,
                "end_ms": 89420
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "practice": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/practice.en.5ad96ade2c2c.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "5ad96ade2c2c14f7418cfa1af175c5aa92199a6713fef236063bf0a3abbee235",
            "sha256": "5de4ae679dae24311cfbc3a55b3d7ee69bfcb97f63f3acb293a95b7e22024650",
            "duration_seconds": 91.794,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Report, clarify, confirm",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 3080
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "In a triad, use fictional role cards.",
                "start_ms": 3380,
                "end_ms": 6580
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "First, play Gibs and give the brief report: concern, source and uncertainty, request and secure method.",
                "start_ms": 6880,
                "end_ms": 15360
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Second, play the authorized midwife: ask one clarification, acknowledge receipt and agree on an action within the role.",
                "start_ms": 15660,
                "end_ms": 24140
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Third, observe with the checklist.",
                "start_ms": 24440,
                "end_ms": 27160
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Rotate roles over three rounds so everyone practises giving the report.",
                "start_ms": 27460,
                "end_ms": 32780
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Replace “The family is difficult” with Liza’s honestly attributed concern and the verified or unverified details.",
                "start_ms": 33080,
                "end_ms": 41760
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "After clarification, repeat who will do what and when or how to follow up.",
                "start_ms": 42060,
                "end_ms": 47940
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 7,
                "text": "Include no diagnosis, promised service or real resident record.",
                "start_ms": 48240,
                "end_ms": 53120
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 8,
                "text": "Give specific feedback, then retry the missing part.",
                "start_ms": 53420,
                "end_ms": 57620
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 9,
                "text": "Peer feedback is not a facilitator grade.",
                "start_ms": 57920,
                "end_ms": 61600
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 10,
                "text": "Alone or without internet, write or say the report using paper cards.",
                "start_ms": 61900,
                "end_ms": 67220
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 11,
                "text": "Read the midwife’s clarification and prepare the reply and confirmation.",
                "start_ms": 67520,
                "end_ms": 72360
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 12,
                "text": "Reading support or the preferred language may be used.",
                "start_ms": 72660,
                "end_ms": 76660
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 13,
                "text": "Keep the same standard; arrange later direct facilitator observation before claiming that the performance was observed.",
                "start_ms": 76960,
                "end_ms": 84680
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Practise reporting, answering clarification and confirming; retry the missing part.",
                "start_ms": 84980,
                "end_ms": 91740
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/practice.fil.47588b675285.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "47588b675285644d1aaa168a1c618b456d4596934a4efa832b1f36ff993d8f76",
            "sha256": "e24d52f67141a3dd9b6bc0da98392fb07a5e71848dac43ade823037ce458f89e",
            "duration_seconds": 105.169,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ulat, paglilinaw, kumpirmasyon",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 3320
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Sa grupo ng tatlo, gumamit ng kathang-isip na role cards.",
                "start_ms": 3620,
                "end_ms": 8060
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Una, gumanap na Gibs at ibigay ang maikling ulat: concern, pinagmulan at hindi pa tiyak, hiling at ligtas na paraan.",
                "start_ms": 8360,
                "end_ms": 18440
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Ikalawa, gumanap na awtorisadong midwife: humingi ng isang paglilinaw, kilalanin ang pagtanggap at makipagkasundo sa kayang gawin.",
                "start_ms": 18740,
                "end_ms": 29660
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Ikatlo, magmasid gamit ang checklist.",
                "start_ms": 29960,
                "end_ms": 33480
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Iikot ang mga tungkulin sa tatlong round upang lahat ay makapag-ulat.",
                "start_ms": 33780,
                "end_ms": 38980
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Palitan ang “Mahirap kausap ang pamilya” ng tapat na concern ni Liza at kung alin ang natiyak o hindi pa natiyak.",
                "start_ms": 39280,
                "end_ms": 48560
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "Pagkatapos ng paglilinaw, ulitin kung sino ang gagawa ng ano at kailan o paano susundan.",
                "start_ms": 48860,
                "end_ms": 55860
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 7,
                "text": "Walang diagnosis, pangakong serbisyo o tunay na resident record.",
                "start_ms": 56160,
                "end_ms": 61560
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 8,
                "text": "Magbigay ng tiyak na puna, saka ulitin ang bahaging kulang.",
                "start_ms": 61860,
                "end_ms": 65980
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 9,
                "text": "Ang puna ng kapareha ay hindi marka ng facilitator.",
                "start_ms": 66280,
                "end_ms": 70400
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 10,
                "text": "Kung mag-isa o walang internet, isulat o sabihin ang ulat gamit ang papel na cards.",
                "start_ms": 70700,
                "end_ms": 77180
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 11,
                "text": "Basahin ang paglilinaw ng midwife at buuin ang sagot at kumpirmasyon.",
                "start_ms": 77480,
                "end_ms": 82600
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 12,
                "text": "Maaaring may katuwang sa pagbasa o sariling wika.",
                "start_ms": 82900,
                "end_ms": 86220
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 13,
                "text": "Pareho ang pamantayan; ang direktang obserbasyon ng facilitator ay kailangang maisagawa sa kalaunan bago sabihing naobserbahan ang kakayahan.",
                "start_ms": 86520,
                "end_ms": 97440
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Magsanay sa pag-uulat, pagsagot sa paglilinaw at pagkumpirma; ulitin ang bahaging kulang.",
                "start_ms": 97740,
                "end_ms": 105100
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "communication-listen": {
      "module": "06-komunikasyon",
      "sections": {
        "check": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/check.en.dcdaa412d29b.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "dcdaa412d29b3eb79cc71ba434fd0c72f581997b4f3e1e7fd39f750f795d4d71",
            "sha256": "6df064c60cb7e3b76421dbbd0b3bd48fe1c9267d38216e5727cf43244886e5f3",
            "duration_seconds": 27.533,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Choose the next step",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 1560
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Return to the scene: the neighbor answers for Liza.",
                "start_ms": 1860,
                "end_ms": 5620
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Gibs holds a closed clipboard.",
                "start_ms": 5920,
                "end_ms": 8360
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "He has not yet checked where, in which language and with whom Liza feels comfortable talking.",
                "start_ms": 8660,
                "end_ms": 14900
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Choose the first step and explain your reason before viewing feedback.",
                "start_ms": 15200,
                "end_ms": 19880
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Then compare your decision with your practice attempt.",
                "start_ms": 20180,
                "end_ms": 23340
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Give Liza a choice and a voice, then check understanding.",
                "start_ms": 23640,
                "end_ms": 27480
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/check.fil.c3b213b32b6f.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "c3b213b32b6fe1f89781617fede646c260f4ad6b95f301516356fa13929ef7f4",
            "sha256": "346aefebef1e3eec9db0bb267d8d17327bf1942bfd492896e36c4f1e0090a89b",
            "duration_seconds": 33.228,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Piliin ang susunod na hakbang",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2200
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Bumalik sa tagpo: ang kapitbahay ang sumasagot para kay Liza.",
                "start_ms": 2500,
                "end_ms": 7460
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Hawak ni Gibs ang nakasarang clipboard.",
                "start_ms": 7760,
                "end_ms": 10480
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Hindi pa niya alam kung saan, sa anong wika at kanino kasama komportable si Liza.",
                "start_ms": 10780,
                "end_ms": 17460
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Piliin ang unang hakbang at ipaliwanag ang dahilan bago tingnan ang feedback.",
                "start_ms": 17760,
                "end_ms": 23080
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Pagkatapos, ihambing ang pasya sa ginawa mo sa pagsasanay.",
                "start_ms": 23380,
                "end_ms": 27900
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Bigyan ng pagpili at boses si Liza, saka tiyakin ang pagkaintindi.",
                "start_ms": 28200,
                "end_ms": 33160
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "listen": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/listen.en.d6c6e47f2ab2.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "d6c6e47f2ab2faf7c9b3f8ceee1c5a500c4516eed7e9d420078866a1864ddc7e",
            "sha256": "ad6fb29571fd5b498a4654f24bf22c9e75a49103004a2ed775a8a89116b10f8d",
            "duration_seconds": 43.494,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Listen before giving advice",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2920
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Gibs sits at Liza’s level and puts his phone away.",
                "start_ms": 3220,
                "end_ms": 6700
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "“What would you like to tell me about getting to the health center?”",
                "start_ms": 7000,
                "end_ms": 10240
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "he asks.",
                "start_ms": 10540,
                "end_ms": 11780
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "He allows time and does not interrupt.",
                "start_ms": 12080,
                "end_ms": 15160
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Liza says getting there is difficult when nobody can look after her child.",
                "start_ms": 15460,
                "end_ms": 19820
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "“It sounds difficult to manage caregiving and getting there,” Gibs replies.",
                "start_ms": 20120,
                "end_ms": 25840
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "He does not call Liza lazy or promise to fix everything.",
                "start_ms": 26140,
                "end_ms": 29940
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 7,
                "text": "He uses a calm voice and allows pauses.",
                "start_ms": 30240,
                "end_ms": 33280
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 8,
                "text": "Do not force eye contact; comfortable listening is not measured by staring.",
                "start_ms": 33580,
                "end_ms": 39100
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Allow time for the account and acknowledge difficulty without blame.",
                "start_ms": 39400,
                "end_ms": 43440
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/listen.fil.6d66945bc07f.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "6d66945bc07f01127fb74a27979b7745ccef3e6e77fc2d2b9d924dbcc76135be",
            "sha256": "7eb9a5a5454ca0c57b3c1fe474fb65a25c637f98bd2b525550299ad757a8ec7e",
            "duration_seconds": 47.935,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Makinig bago magpayo",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2080
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Umupo si Gibs nang kapantay ni Liza at itinabi ang telepono.",
                "start_ms": 2380,
                "end_ms": 6300
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "“Ano po ang gusto ninyong ikuwento tungkol sa pagpunta sa health center?”",
                "start_ms": 6600,
                "end_ms": 10760
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "tanong niya.",
                "start_ms": 11060,
                "end_ms": 12220
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Nagbigay siya ng oras at hindi sumabat.",
                "start_ms": 12520,
                "end_ms": 15480
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Sinabi ni Liza na mahirap pumunta kapag walang magbabantay sa anak.",
                "start_ms": 15780,
                "end_ms": 19820
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "“Mukhang mahirap pagsabayin ang pag-aalaga at pagpunta roon,” tugon ni Gibs.",
                "start_ms": 20120,
                "end_ms": 25760
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "Hindi niya tinawag na tamad si Liza o nangakong maaayos ang lahat.",
                "start_ms": 26060,
                "end_ms": 30660
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 7,
                "text": "Gumamit siya ng mahinahong boses at sapat na paghinto.",
                "start_ms": 30960,
                "end_ms": 35360
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 8,
                "text": "Huwag pilitin ang eye contact; ang komportableng pakikinig ay hindi sinusukat sa pagtitig.",
                "start_ms": 35660,
                "end_ms": 42060
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Magbigay ng oras sa kuwento at kilalanin ang hirap nang walang paratang.",
                "start_ms": 42360,
                "end_ms": 47880
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "liza": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/liza.en.f880278eea9b.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "f880278eea9b8a270f76a30fee49857200c5b29833ba74e61c15049969bc7810",
            "sha256": "07b7963bbb89ba72078653788cb2d90165c03f682fb532425a9cb493b1e8f929",
            "duration_seconds": 34.873,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Why is Liza quiet?",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2360
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Gibs, a male BHW, visits Liza, 29, for a household profile.",
                "start_ms": 2660,
                "end_ms": 9220
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "A neighbor sits beside Liza and answers for her.",
                "start_ms": 9520,
                "end_ms": 13720
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Liza gives short replies and looks toward the door.",
                "start_ms": 14020,
                "end_ms": 17500
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "These cues do not tell Gibs for certain how she feels.",
                "start_ms": 17800,
                "end_ms": 21840
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "He pauses the questions.",
                "start_ms": 22140,
                "end_ms": 24220
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Before continuing, what should he check about Liza’s comfort and choices?",
                "start_ms": 24520,
                "end_ms": 29280
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Pause and ask what the person prefers; do not guess the reason for silence.",
                "start_ms": 29580,
                "end_ms": 34820
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/liza.fil.947df9854c6d.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "947df9854c6def3fd636436b493c24d001f8fc2b88abc1989bdd1637d1007c46",
            "sha256": "5062e66e7d4b44cee172dc7f1f741716802f014c53d0a0228da465c99ec4328e",
            "duration_seconds": 36.833,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Bakit tahimik si Liza?",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 1920
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Si Gibs, isang lalaking BHW, ay bumisita kay Liza, 29 anyos, para sa household profile.",
                "start_ms": 2220,
                "end_ms": 10060
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Katabi ni Liza ang kapitbahay na sumasagot para sa kanya.",
                "start_ms": 10360,
                "end_ms": 13720
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Maikli ang sagot ni Liza at tumitingin siya sa pinto.",
                "start_ms": 14020,
                "end_ms": 17700
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Hindi nito tiyak na sinasabi kung ano ang nararamdaman niya.",
                "start_ms": 18000,
                "end_ms": 21800
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Huminto muna si Gibs sa pagtatanong.",
                "start_ms": 22100,
                "end_ms": 24380
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Bago magpatuloy, ano ang dapat niyang alamin tungkol sa ginhawa at pagpili ni Liza?",
                "start_ms": 24680,
                "end_ms": 31360
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Huminto at itanong ang gusto ng kausap; huwag hulaan ang dahilan ng katahimikan.",
                "start_ms": 31660,
                "end_ms": 36780
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "permission": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/permission.en.4041e78d3059.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "4041e78d30591af91e441c7d740385141af0c3175b0f2e4d5220e799b1bbc2aa",
            "sha256": "32fedbb5914a2be2a68b76f45c264eea18a52a89d7a284bf194771166d44ab3a",
            "duration_seconds": 49.162,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ask permission and offer choices",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2600
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Gibs explains: “This is for an authorized household profile and health-service planning.",
                "start_ms": 2900,
                "end_ms": 8900
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Only relevant information will be used by the authorized health team under local policy.",
                "start_ms": 9200,
                "end_ms": 14320
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "May we talk?”",
                "start_ms": 14620,
                "end_ms": 16060
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "He asks about Liza’s preferred language, place and whether she wants a support person present.",
                "start_ms": 16360,
                "end_ms": 22400
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "“Here in the quieter part, in Filipino, just us for now,” Liza replies.",
                "start_ms": 22700,
                "end_ms": 28180
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "She may pause, leave a question unanswered for now or choose another time.",
                "start_ms": 28480,
                "end_ms": 33360
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "Gibs does not promise absolute secrecy.",
                "start_ms": 33660,
                "end_ms": 36900
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 7,
                "text": "If immediate help is needed, do not delay it to complete a routine interview; follow the local process.",
                "start_ms": 37200,
                "end_ms": 44040
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "The person chooses a comfortable place, language and support person.",
                "start_ms": 44340,
                "end_ms": 49100
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/permission.fil.e556f22af84c.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "e556f22af84c1c88af981481b3bcd4b293ea55a8ed57a70c3c81f8e42fa2a40f",
            "sha256": "60dce0934aad4d82fff1d38b0d031fdcd5327c869e668093215401d85b8df266",
            "duration_seconds": 56.033,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Humingi ng pahintulot at mag-alok ng pagpili",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 4080
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ipinaliwanag ni Gibs: “Para po ito sa awtorisadong household profile at pagpaplano ng serbisyong pangkalusugan.",
                "start_ms": 4380,
                "end_ms": 11860
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Kaugnay na impormasyon lamang ang gagamitin ng awtorisadong health team ayon sa lokal na patakaran.",
                "start_ms": 12160,
                "end_ms": 17880
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Maaari po ba tayong mag-usap?”",
                "start_ms": 18180,
                "end_ms": 20180
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Tinanong niya ang gustong wika, lugar at kung nais ni Liza ng kasamang susuporta sa kanya.",
                "start_ms": 20480,
                "end_ms": 27160
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "“Dito po sa mas tahimik na bahagi, sa Filipino, tayo muna,” sagot ni Liza.",
                "start_ms": 27460,
                "end_ms": 32460
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Maaari siyang magpahinga, hindi muna sumagot o pumili ng ibang oras.",
                "start_ms": 32760,
                "end_ms": 38360
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "Hindi pangako ng ganap na lihim ang paliwanag ni Gibs.",
                "start_ms": 38660,
                "end_ms": 42500
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 7,
                "text": "Kung kailangan ng agarang tulong, huwag itong ipagpaliban para makumpleto ang karaniwang interview; sundin ang lokal na proseso.",
                "start_ms": 42800,
                "end_ms": 50280
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ang kausap ang pumipili ng komportableng lugar, wika at kasama.",
                "start_ms": 50580,
                "end_ms": 55980
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "practice": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/practice.en.12b535e84c65.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "12b535e84c65c2cbc3ddb4dfa73d14f1f590a9bc3287e59699a4a1b4a4cc5496",
            "sha256": "6901b00a0e3e63817e098a22b8e5d97ca5bc7fe0056d29e830531b6e0669640e",
            "duration_seconds": 48.797,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Try it, then repeat",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2120
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Use the fictional role cards: Gibs, Liza and observer.",
                "start_ms": 2420,
                "end_ms": 7460
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Rehearse permission, choice of place and language, listening without interruption, and a summary with an accuracy check.",
                "start_ms": 7760,
                "end_ms": 17160
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Liza chooses whether she wants a support person.",
                "start_ms": 17460,
                "end_ms": 20660
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "The observer records the exact helpful phrase and any rushed step.",
                "start_ms": 20960,
                "end_ms": 26200
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Repeat that part before rotating roles.",
                "start_ms": 26500,
                "end_ms": 29540
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Everyone practices as the BHW.",
                "start_ms": 29840,
                "end_ms": 32640
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "Alone, say both roles aloud and check the listening aid.",
                "start_ms": 32940,
                "end_ms": 36940
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 7,
                "text": "At the next authorized visit, rehearse the same opening.",
                "start_ms": 37240,
                "end_ms": 41000
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 8,
                "text": "Do not upload a resident’s private account.",
                "start_ms": 41300,
                "end_ms": 44660
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Repeat the step needing work; peer feedback is practice.",
                "start_ms": 44960,
                "end_ms": 48720
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/practice.fil.a42caab66ef8.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "a42caab66ef8227b2df736db57564850a2ae5124b75f767e4445eae376fa14c6",
            "sha256": "5455dffc6f9c0ea21c3b51cc85ebbd5291f586eba64fabedf481597fe08743c3",
            "duration_seconds": 52.637,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Subukan, saka ulitin",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2520
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Gamitin ang kathang-isip na role cards: Gibs, Liza at tagamasid.",
                "start_ms": 2820,
                "end_ms": 8260
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Magsanay ng pahintulot, pagpili ng lugar at wika, pakikinig nang hindi sumasabat, at buod na may pagtiyak.",
                "start_ms": 8560,
                "end_ms": 16920
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Si Liza ang pipili kung may kasamang susuporta.",
                "start_ms": 17220,
                "end_ms": 20380
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Itala ng tagamasid ang eksaktong linyang nakatulong at ang hakbang na minadali.",
                "start_ms": 20680,
                "end_ms": 25960
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Ulitin ang bahaging iyon bago magpalit ng papel.",
                "start_ms": 26260,
                "end_ms": 29420
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Lahat ay susubok bilang BHW.",
                "start_ms": 29720,
                "end_ms": 33160
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "Kung mag-isa, sabihin nang malakas ang dalawang papel at itsek ang listening aid.",
                "start_ms": 33460,
                "end_ms": 38660
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 7,
                "text": "Sa susunod na awtorisadong pagbisita, sanayin ang parehong pambungad.",
                "start_ms": 38960,
                "end_ms": 43640
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 8,
                "text": "Huwag mag-upload ng pribadong kuwento ng residente.",
                "start_ms": 43940,
                "end_ms": 47020
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ulitin ang hindi pa malinaw na hakbang; feedback ng kapareha ay pagsasanay.",
                "start_ms": 47320,
                "end_ms": 52560
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "profile": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/profile.en.4fa60ff0f040.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "4fa60ff0f040bff559d28c774570dde26bcd5f4ef5cd7d867b780e6b7154178d",
            "sha256": "e45a11235ba24d664a4944e133956d9efee37f243ae09a04dbcec2c5154a6589",
            "duration_seconds": 49.972,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Summarize and check accuracy",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2600
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "“Have I understood correctly: getting there is difficult when nobody can look after your child?”",
                "start_ms": 2900,
                "end_ms": 9180
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Gibs asks.",
                "start_ms": 9480,
                "end_ms": 11000
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "“Yes, when my sister is away,” Liza clarifies.",
                "start_ms": 11300,
                "end_ms": 15460
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Gibs offers a more accurate summary: “When your sister is away, it is difficult to find childcare.",
                "start_ms": 15760,
                "end_ms": 22520
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Is that right?”",
                "start_ms": 22820,
                "end_ms": 24140
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Liza confirms it.",
                "start_ms": 24440,
                "end_ms": 26400
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "This is a fictional accuracy check, not an actual record.",
                "start_ms": 26700,
                "end_ms": 30980
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 7,
                "text": "In an authorized profile, collect only relevant information, do not guess missing answers and respect a wish not to answer yet.",
                "start_ms": 31280,
                "end_ms": 41000
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 8,
                "text": "No childcare arrangement or appointment has been promised.",
                "start_ms": 41300,
                "end_ms": 45500
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ask whether the summary is accurate and let the person correct it.",
                "start_ms": 45800,
                "end_ms": 49920
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/profile.fil.4ea13b5f19d0.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "4ea13b5f19d0b05282f420e6467142e777be6c9ff9398729a1d7900d6f0417f2",
            "sha256": "c6eea6b674c3b580fe319ae71509fa18dc318485cba896e69bf480cf8c532037",
            "duration_seconds": 50.233,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ibuod at tiyaking tama",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2360
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "“Tama po ba ang pagkaintindi ko: mahirap pumunta kapag walang magbabantay sa anak ninyo?”",
                "start_ms": 2660,
                "end_ms": 9100
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "tanong ni Gibs.",
                "start_ms": 9400,
                "end_ms": 11000
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "“Opo, kapag wala ang kapatid ko,” paglilinaw ni Liza.",
                "start_ms": 11300,
                "end_ms": 15740
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Ibinalik ni Gibs ang mas tumpak na buod: “Kapag wala ang kapatid ninyo, mahirap makahanap ng magbabantay.",
                "start_ms": 16040,
                "end_ms": 24280
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Tama po ba?”",
                "start_ms": 24580,
                "end_ms": 25780
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Kinumpirma ito ni Liza.",
                "start_ms": 26080,
                "end_ms": 28040
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "Kathang-isip na halimbawa ito ng pagtitiyak, hindi aktuwal na rekord.",
                "start_ms": 28340,
                "end_ms": 32900
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 7,
                "text": "Sa awtorisadong profile, kunin lamang ang kaugnay na impormasyon, huwag hulaan ang patlang at igalang ang ayaw munang sagutin.",
                "start_ms": 33200,
                "end_ms": 41920
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 8,
                "text": "Walang ipinangakong childcare o appointment.",
                "start_ms": 42220,
                "end_ms": 45540
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Tanungin kung tama ang buod at hayaan ang kausap na magwasto.",
                "start_ms": 45840,
                "end_ms": 50160
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "communication-record": {
      "module": "06-komunikasyon",
      "sections": {
        "check": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-record/check.en.2e5217dea0f9.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "2e5217dea0f9e4c099484159e51d223605050f499bbc52a84cbeb37cd6b4eb41",
            "sha256": "970eeba4294e2492068cf81cc040ff76a1b597b0f02e02b9a09fdbdf4db14308",
            "duration_seconds": 17.293,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Choose the next step",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2000
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Choose an answer and explain why before viewing the feedback.",
                "start_ms": 2300,
                "end_ms": 6780
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Then compare it with your own practice attempt.",
                "start_ms": 7080,
                "end_ms": 10600
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Clear sources and explicit gaps prevent a guess becoming an official record.",
                "start_ms": 10900,
                "end_ms": 17220
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-record/check.fil.37d60632cbde.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "37d60632cbde57f1a93aaa44b3c99b4a1f80a6a87f2a7d259bef862cf79f2d5f",
            "sha256": "da80ca02c98d69d74a845ae91f3ab4936a660f6e187b921fd0d60425c370bf80",
            "duration_seconds": 21.525,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Piliin ang susunod na hakbang",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 3120
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Piliin ang sagot at ipaliwanag kung bakit bago tingnan ang feedback.",
                "start_ms": 3420,
                "end_ms": 8620
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Pagkatapos, ihambing sa sarili mong ginawa sa pagsasanay.",
                "start_ms": 8920,
                "end_ms": 13480
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Malinaw na pinagmulan at tapat na pagmarka sa kulang ang pumipigil sa hula na maging opisyal na tala.",
                "start_ms": 13780,
                "end_ms": 21460
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "conflicting-accounts": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-record/conflicting-accounts.en.d0ca72e8d0a2.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "d0ca72e8d0a20adaecc3dfd9ca5adcbf88b1ebaaa63c41dfd7d2e4bb428f92a6",
            "sha256": "85787805b374c6ff2ce8e7a23c541b5a2a185438dcbdc81918fd841b91b323c4",
            "duration_seconds": 34.873,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "When accounts differ",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 1960
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Liza says the appointment was canceled; a neighbor says she was not interested.",
                "start_ms": 2260,
                "end_ms": 8260
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Do not choose a story because one voice is louder.",
                "start_ms": 8560,
                "end_ms": 12920
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Ask Liza, check the authorized record and identify the source of each detail.",
                "start_ms": 13220,
                "end_ms": 19460
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "If uncertainty remains, tell the health team.",
                "start_ms": 19760,
                "end_ms": 23360
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Respecting a person and being careful with evidence can happen together.",
                "start_ms": 23660,
                "end_ms": 29100
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "When accounts differ, clarify and verify before deciding.",
                "start_ms": 29400,
                "end_ms": 34800
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-record/conflicting-accounts.fil.d377496d80c4.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "d377496d80c4e8c7fdae9637a4e0afedb318156c8a0f36017c2bf4cb3fda3459",
            "sha256": "a3e9c5036553934a1bf7109fa9efc4bf448d6bcf97df912188a735d921766163",
            "duration_seconds": 41.273,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Kapag may magkaibang kuwento",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2800
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Sabi ni Liza, kinansela ang schedule; sabi ng kapitbahay, hindi siya interesado.",
                "start_ms": 3100,
                "end_ms": 10580
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Huwag pumili ng kuwento dahil mas malakas ang boses.",
                "start_ms": 10880,
                "end_ms": 15000
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Tanungin si Liza, suriin ang awtorisadong tala at itala ang pinagmulan ng bawat detalye.",
                "start_ms": 15300,
                "end_ms": 23660
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Kung hindi pa malinaw, sabihin iyon sa health team.",
                "start_ms": 23960,
                "end_ms": 28040
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Ang tiwala sa kausap at pagiging maingat sa ebidensya ay maaaring sabay na gawin.",
                "start_ms": 28340,
                "end_ms": 34620
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Kapag magkaiba ang kuwento, maglinaw at magberipika bago magpasya.",
                "start_ms": 34920,
                "end_ms": 41200
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "practice": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-record/practice.en.137d49670c1a.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "137d49670c1a44e357f26ca8a2bdf65052f27f9083c9e0296340c5cb65c5540d",
            "sha256": "e888f29933b9ec48b41a75e4462591afaff436a05dd0ae442edbd00d324f41dc",
            "duration_seconds": 37.695,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Try it, then repeat",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2560
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Draw three boxes: “Reported,” “Observed,” and “Unconfirmed.”",
                "start_ms": 2860,
                "end_ms": 9180
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Sort Liza’s details.",
                "start_ms": 9480,
                "end_ms": 11760
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Add: “Verify the date against the authorized record with the midwife.”",
                "start_ms": 12060,
                "end_ms": 18020
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Ask a partner to check for guesses or diagnoses.",
                "start_ms": 18320,
                "end_ms": 22480
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Alone, underline each detail’s source.",
                "start_ms": 22780,
                "end_ms": 26620
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "In your next record, mark what remains unconfirmed.",
                "start_ms": 26920,
                "end_ms": 31040
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Clear sources and explicit gaps prevent a guess becoming an official record.",
                "start_ms": 31340,
                "end_ms": 37620
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-record/practice.fil.7e71c8321ea6.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "7e71c8321ea60888b40122d73270c08ea2029306d9390c7950646761dd5ad6e0",
            "sha256": "60a1771fabe65c195cdb2cab9e92c0a8aba67ed78f7d265a61ecef9c07c11c86",
            "duration_seconds": 44.617,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Subukan, saka ulitin",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2880
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Gumawa ng tatlong kahon: “Sinabi,” “Nakita,” at “Hindi pa tiyak.”",
                "start_ms": 3180,
                "end_ms": 9660
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Ilagay ang detalye ni Liza sa tamang kahon.",
                "start_ms": 9960,
                "end_ms": 13840
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Idagdag: “Beripikahin ang petsa sa awtorisadong tala kasama ang midwife.”",
                "start_ms": 14140,
                "end_ms": 20780
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Ipasuri sa kapareha kung may hula o diagnosis.",
                "start_ms": 21080,
                "end_ms": 25920
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Kung mag-isa, salungguhitan ang pinagmulan ng bawat detalye.",
                "start_ms": 26220,
                "end_ms": 31500
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Sa susunod na pagtala, markahan ang hindi pa natiyak.",
                "start_ms": 31800,
                "end_ms": 36480
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Malinaw na pinagmulan at tapat na pagmarka sa kulang ang pumipigil sa hula na maging opisyal na tala.",
                "start_ms": 36780,
                "end_ms": 44540
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "sources": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-record/sources.en.fa812da9b7ef.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "fa812da9b7ef762cd81e14761382d7683a8f442b527c75ea88fbdebaa6847674",
            "sha256": "14756778b2b532fe302096323ba60e9b689cc49bb7d871f668d9641cd447900c",
            "duration_seconds": 58.854,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Reported, observed, and unconfirmed",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 4880
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "BHW Gibs is asking Liza, 29, about a missed health-center visit.",
                "start_ms": 5180,
                "end_ms": 11700
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Gibs has not yet checked the authorized attendance record.",
                "start_ms": 12000,
                "end_ms": 16560
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Liza says no one can stay with her two children.",
                "start_ms": 16860,
                "end_ms": 20380
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Gibs notices the appointment card is unavailable, but that does not prove there was no appointment.",
                "start_ms": 20680,
                "end_ms": 27600
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "In the notes, separate “Liza reports” from direct observations.",
                "start_ms": 27900,
                "end_ms": 33420
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Clarify an uncertain date; mark information “not yet confirmed” when a record still needs checking.",
                "start_ms": 33720,
                "end_ms": 40920
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "Assessing information means checking its source and relevance, without assigning a diagnosis or judging the person.",
                "start_ms": 41220,
                "end_ms": 49740
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "When assessing information, distinguish reports, observations and details still requiring verification.",
                "start_ms": 50040,
                "end_ms": 58800
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-record/sources.fil.ba6a0324f348.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "ba6a0324f348f02c4109826f8af5517f02f8ea0e26507fbc287d51fa1b945dc5",
            "sha256": "2ea923ef0c9e026fe2dbc91324fb70a61d1141ec4a8660865e4c6aa7427aa5e9",
            "duration_seconds": 63.634,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Sinabi, nakita, at hindi pa tiyak",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 4800
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Si Liza, 29, ay kinakausap ni BHW Gibs tungkol sa hindi pagpunta sa health center.",
                "start_ms": 5100,
                "end_ms": 13140
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Hindi pa nakita ni Gibs ang awtorisadong attendance record.",
                "start_ms": 13440,
                "end_ms": 18160
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Sinabi ni Liza na walang maiiwan sa dalawang anak.",
                "start_ms": 18460,
                "end_ms": 22900
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Nakita ni Gibs na wala ang appointment card, ngunit hindi ito patunay na walang appointment.",
                "start_ms": 23200,
                "end_ms": 29960
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Sa tala, ihiwalay ang “ayon kay Liza” sa sariling obserbasyon.",
                "start_ms": 30260,
                "end_ms": 36580
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Itanong ang petsang hindi malinaw; markahang “hindi pa nakumpirma” kung kailangan pang tingnan ang rekord.",
                "start_ms": 36880,
                "end_ms": 45240
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "Ang pagsusuri ng impormasyon ay pagtiyak sa pinagmulan at kaugnayan nito, hindi paglalagay ng diagnosis o husga sa tao.",
                "start_ms": 45540,
                "end_ms": 55260
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Sa pagsusuri ng impormasyon, ihiwalay ang sinabi, nakita at kailangan pang beripikahin.",
                "start_ms": 55560,
                "end_ms": 63560
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "community-action-followup": {
      "module": "chapter2/06-community-mobilization",
      "sections": {
        "action": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/community-action-followup/action.en.14d03f21570d.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "14d03f21570dc07f723c8fe6c06b8f792bca9b336a76db89ff7217da825fb618",
            "sha256": "ee12cedc18221f3d17e7bff279f71309067b5ef1f925fc43b8d0f3010545e72b",
            "duration_seconds": 35.788,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "What to do and say",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2040
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Record the action, owner, resources and date.",
                "start_ms": 2340,
                "end_ms": 7620
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Confirm resources instead of assuming they exist.",
                "start_ms": 7920,
                "end_ms": 12160
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Agree on follow-up and a simple result measure.",
                "start_ms": 12460,
                "end_ms": 16780
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Ask residents whether the method helped.",
                "start_ms": 17080,
                "end_ms": 20200
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "When a commitment is missed, discuss the barrier respectfully and adjust the plan together.",
                "start_ms": 20500,
                "end_ms": 26940
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Complete the group’s action plan. Add a timely-update measure and a response to an unfinished commitment.",
                "start_ms": 27240,
                "end_ms": 35720
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/community-action-followup/action.fil.134b82131cfb.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "134b82131cfb88edae80b7ea0cc4f6715b4d0293b162307581e5531febdd9a03",
            "sha256": "5a9adb442f2e6308c0eee69a399491c4a851079f835e998e0861e9259944871a",
            "duration_seconds": 39.941,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Gawin at sabihin",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2040
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Itala ang gagawin, responsable, kailangan at petsa.",
                "start_ms": 2340,
                "end_ms": 8860
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Kumpirmahin muna ang resources; huwag ipalagay na mayroon.",
                "start_ms": 9160,
                "end_ms": 14040
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Magkasundo sa follow-up at simpleng panukat ng resulta.",
                "start_ms": 14340,
                "end_ms": 18980
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Tanungin ang residente kung nakatulong ang paraan.",
                "start_ms": 19280,
                "end_ms": 22960
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Kung may hindi nagawa, alamin ang hadlang nang magalang at baguhin ang plano kasama nila.",
                "start_ms": 23260,
                "end_ms": 29660
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Punan ang action plan ng grupo. Magdagdag ng panukat sa napapanahong balita at tugon kapag may hindi nakatapos.",
                "start_ms": 29960,
                "end_ms": 39880
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "check-start": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/community-action-followup/check-start.en.d6f85dc0d652.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "d6f85dc0d652a068678129a382bcb6d430da9d8810b510b7de58624169692683",
            "sha256": "a089b84751ff994c86e433e85d9fdf3fce5b701cd7a678fdb99d9af751708f9f",
            "duration_seconds": 12.696,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Choose the first response",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2360
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Choose an answer first.",
                "start_ms": 2660,
                "end_ms": 4780
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Then read the explanation for each option.",
                "start_ms": 5080,
                "end_ms": 8640
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "This makes the agreement specific and reviewable.",
                "start_ms": 8940,
                "end_ms": 12620
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/community-action-followup/check-start.fil.7946e964d3dd.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "7946e964d3ddc4cb8440ff2a5ab3921a0e909b73a738415521a200249ea6efeb",
            "sha256": "2dba9fc302e85c1907259ddc4521d5a68b433e5c64413ca484c244c3e167e09e",
            "duration_seconds": 15.438,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Piliin ang unang tugon",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2640
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Piliin muna ang sagot.",
                "start_ms": 2940,
                "end_ms": 5100
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Pagkatapos, basahin ang paliwanag sa bawat pagpipilian.",
                "start_ms": 5400,
                "end_ms": 10360
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ginagawang malinaw at masusuri ang napagkasunduan.",
                "start_ms": 10660,
                "end_ms": 15380
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "check-transfer": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/community-action-followup/check-transfer.en.ddab6f72b552.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "ddab6f72b552d16977f62d9d28fe0cc010b1b06b2a2cbf1322f021bc2628446b",
            "sha256": "a8596173985ef8ef1dfdb1005f9cdc4b11cbbbe520c19238dfa941a2a8d5a10b",
            "duration_seconds": 13.113,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Apply it to the situation",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2360
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Return to the story.",
                "start_ms": 2660,
                "end_ms": 4500
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Choose an appropriate next step.",
                "start_ms": 4800,
                "end_ms": 7840
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "This maintains accountability while addressing the actual problem.",
                "start_ms": 8140,
                "end_ms": 13060
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/community-action-followup/check-transfer.fil.240ba152b34d.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "240ba152b34d991ff3db6c8b00e9169167811eff4528d9a1297dcc8079221c80",
            "sha256": "b0969601fab5c063a55aab37b69211ac4f52b74eada0cd1a6434d198b375645a",
            "duration_seconds": 14.315,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Subukan sa sitwasyon",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2400
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Balikan ang kuwento.",
                "start_ms": 2700,
                "end_ms": 4420
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Piliin ang angkop na susunod na hakbang.",
                "start_ms": 4720,
                "end_ms": 8320
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Pinananatili ang pananagutan habang inaayos ang aktuwal na problema.",
                "start_ms": 8620,
                "end_ms": 14260
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "example": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/community-action-followup/example.en.fb2b623edb5d.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "fb2b623edb5d35079bd8972603326fea1920247b0a7ffca6e5dca106b10dd1d5",
            "sha256": "85d8d931771d3942d67e6ab8ef0dc0b732a04b0af2e4d31d2c5e88eaed6fce85",
            "duration_seconds": 36.833,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Worked example",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 1640
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Plan: Ina confirms the time with the BHS.",
                "start_ms": 1940,
                "end_ms": 6300
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Volunteers deliver invitations before the agreed day.",
                "start_ms": 6600,
                "end_ms": 10800
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "At follow-up, they ask whether residents received and understood the update before the visit.",
                "start_ms": 11100,
                "end_ms": 18140
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Short of paper?",
                "start_ms": 18440,
                "end_ms": 20040
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Confirm another method first.",
                "start_ms": 20340,
                "end_ms": 23060
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "A member who could not finish is not shamed.",
                "start_ms": 23360,
                "end_ms": 27040
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Includes an action, owner, resource confirmation, date, measure and respectful community follow-up.",
                "start_ms": 27340,
                "end_ms": 36780
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/community-action-followup/example.fil.555120c42445.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "555120c42445b46af04df71198c96aafaa616825959e09f4a8b1cdd95d73701c",
            "sha256": "6a03b0988ba5e66244fb1aba1149b963b1ee5d03011eea6714bf42c507a4642d",
            "duration_seconds": 40.124,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Halimbawang sagot",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 1680
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Plano: kukumpirmahin ni Ina ang oras sa BHS.",
                "start_ms": 1980,
                "end_ms": 6980
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Ihahatid ng boluntaryong grupo ang paanyaya bago ang napiling araw.",
                "start_ms": 7280,
                "end_ms": 12640
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Sa follow-up, itatanong kung natanggap at naunawaan ang balita bago ang pagbisita.",
                "start_ms": 12940,
                "end_ms": 19660
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Kulang ang papel?",
                "start_ms": 19960,
                "end_ms": 21600
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Kumpirmahin muna ang ibang paraan.",
                "start_ms": 21900,
                "end_ms": 24860
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Hindi ipapahiya ang kasaping hindi nakatapos.",
                "start_ms": 25160,
                "end_ms": 29280
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "May gawain, responsable, kumpirmasyon ng resources, petsa, panukat at magalang na follow-up kasama ang komunidad.",
                "start_ms": 29580,
                "end_ms": 40060
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "next-step": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/community-action-followup/next-step.en.ce1d2ede6d77.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "ce1d2ede6d77fb55d308d481e8ae82ecb339722a736483689878423507b0c048",
            "sha256": "a9cad4a98bf08ab17a394825fd327adc37c08155ee82b784b6b89a520493f43e",
            "duration_seconds": 31.713,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "On Monday, try this",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2400
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "The group has actions, owners, dates and a measure.",
                "start_ms": 2700,
                "end_ms": 8060
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "On Monday, ask a colleague to review the fictional action plan.",
                "start_ms": 8360,
                "end_ms": 13200
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Word: accountability — fulfilling and respectfully following up agreed responsibilities.",
                "start_ms": 13500,
                "end_ms": 21380
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "If results fall short, plan again with affected people.",
                "start_ms": 21680,
                "end_ms": 26600
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "On Monday, ask a colleague to review the fictional action plan.",
                "start_ms": 26900,
                "end_ms": 31660
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/community-action-followup/next-step.fil.9a4c42bed3ea.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "9a4c42bed3ea149dc890949f41d4c4087193e6644a741775ca84680cd2265602",
            "sha256": "d5862828a67cb8687fe2d5f0e14dba72576340355860dc92fbef2bab26521347",
            "duration_seconds": 35.892,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Sa Lunes, gawin ito",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2240
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "May gagawin, responsable, petsa at panukat na ang grupo.",
                "start_ms": 2540,
                "end_ms": 9700
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Sa Lunes, ipasuri sa katrabaho ang action plan para sa kathang-isip na kaso.",
                "start_ms": 10000,
                "end_ms": 16120
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Salita: pananagutan — pagtupad at magalang na pagbalik sa napagkasunduang tungkulin.",
                "start_ms": 16420,
                "end_ms": 24620
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Kapag kulang ang resulta, magplano muli kasama ang apektado.",
                "start_ms": 24920,
                "end_ms": 30000
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Sa Lunes, ipasuri sa katrabaho ang kathang-isip na action plan.",
                "start_ms": 30300,
                "end_ms": 35820
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "scene": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/community-action-followup/scene.en.e8d71284ec3c.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "e8d71284ec3c76552c8a1bc6b8783a66317120ba37ef7dd353210610200411c0",
            "sha256": "f106c4c3845d3533cdc511f867ee2035d59622379949c06242519293c435d308",
            "duration_seconds": 25.652,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "The situation",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 1920
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "The group agrees on personal invitations for people without phones.",
                "start_ms": 2220,
                "end_ms": 7060
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Someone calls the effort successful because many attended the meeting.",
                "start_ms": 7360,
                "end_ms": 11920
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "It is not yet known whether updates reached people in time.",
                "start_ms": 12220,
                "end_ms": 16420
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "The group needs clear actions and a way to review results.",
                "start_ms": 16720,
                "end_ms": 21560
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "An action plan and result measure are needed.",
                "start_ms": 21860,
                "end_ms": 25580
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/community-action-followup/scene.fil.88193ee23810.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "88193ee23810b748750d72f409dc012c83967709c9cd78bfd0f40b8db4e0234d",
            "sha256": "07778dfb573cd3720023d683f3f4b3dc164210cc405963bd6a6c8f923e3f6d07",
            "duration_seconds": 30.328,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ang sitwasyon",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 4400
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Napagkasunduan ng grupo ang personal na paanyaya para sa walang cellphone.",
                "start_ms": 4700,
                "end_ms": 9900
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "May gustong magsabing matagumpay na dahil marami ang dumalo sa pulong.",
                "start_ms": 10200,
                "end_ms": 16120
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Hindi pa alam kung nakarating sa oras ang balita.",
                "start_ms": 16420,
                "end_ms": 20340
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Kailangan ng grupo ng malinaw na gagawin at paraan ng pagsusuri.",
                "start_ms": 20640,
                "end_ms": 26160
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Kailangan ng plano at panukat ng resulta.",
                "start_ms": 26460,
                "end_ms": 30260
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "scope": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/community-action-followup/scope.en.f232cc69516b.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "f232cc69516b15ec3bfc9786e9f5eda6984c3f9483ac7aaf3c7d3999cab09ec1",
            "sha256": "30f60ffd83417dc998def585b171bea31b0fa7e0701076eed393ad598ce93491",
            "duration_seconds": 30.485,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Scope and support",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2240
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Do not promise unconfirmed funds, transport or services.",
                "start_ms": 2540,
                "end_ms": 7540
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Use combined counts and avoid publishing personal reasons for nonattendance.",
                "start_ms": 7840,
                "end_ms": 13720
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Measures should support improvement, not punishment.",
                "start_ms": 14020,
                "end_ms": 18060
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Ask the organizer to confirm required permissions and reporting arrangements.",
                "start_ms": 18360,
                "end_ms": 24040
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Promise nothing unconfirmed; measures support improvement, not punishment.",
                "start_ms": 24340,
                "end_ms": 30420
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/community-action-followup/scope.fil.20e5a9582bba.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "20e5a9582bba0fea8de3f90662cb8dd887e09d91fcbbbc12e147a7fef908e89d",
            "sha256": "748861bc4e29553da80dc5115997a8cbeda1354d200a0823e526180d1f8d245a",
            "duration_seconds": 35.553,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Saklaw at paghingi ng tulong",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2880
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Huwag mangako ng pondo, sasakyan o serbisyo na hindi pa kumpirmado.",
                "start_ms": 3180,
                "end_ms": 9420
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Gumamit ng pinagsamang bilang at iwasang ilathala ang personal na dahilan ng hindi pagdalo.",
                "start_ms": 9720,
                "end_ms": 16240
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Ang panukat ay dapat makatulong sa pagpapabuti, hindi sa pagparusa.",
                "start_ms": 16540,
                "end_ms": 21900
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Ipasuri sa organizer ang kailangang pahintulot at paraan ng pag-uulat.",
                "start_ms": 22200,
                "end_ms": 27560
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Walang pangakong hindi kumpirmado; panukat para sa pagpapabuti, hindi parusa.",
                "start_ms": 27860,
                "end_ms": 35500
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "community-issue": {
      "module": "chapter2/06-community-mobilization",
      "sections": {
        "action": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/community-issue/action.en.c718341bb258.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "c718341bb2588fecb1ef19f070bf9e3a51e622b1599e3634994a78e66a1b7620",
            "sha256": "a6ee279eb05a15ea7665859c012d860b737574c09f116f0edb8e2349b7ab0a24",
            "duration_seconds": 37.433,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "What to do and say",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2240
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Hear affected people before choosing a solution.",
                "start_ms": 2540,
                "end_ms": 6380
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Separate reports from assumptions.",
                "start_ms": 6680,
                "end_ms": 9960
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Ask whose voice is missing.",
                "start_ms": 10260,
                "end_ms": 13020
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Together, state what is happening, who is affected and what evidence exists.",
                "start_ms": 13320,
                "end_ms": 19800
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Mark what remains unknown.",
                "start_ms": 20100,
                "end_ms": 22660
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Community members share decisions rather than simply receiving instructions.",
                "start_ms": 22960,
                "end_ms": 28840
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Make an issue card: reported concern, affected people, missing voices and the next question.",
                "start_ms": 29140,
                "end_ms": 37380
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/community-issue/action.fil.81b040edcd29.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "81b040edcd29e689bb372cb4f6f0db2f232890f6789962e8f251860c6eab9845",
            "sha256": "7bc8c916d7f7e550fe82e94d7b235649df5acacd645ffd2d644ab414929dd9ba",
            "duration_seconds": 42.658,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Gawin at sabihin",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2200
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Pakinggan ang mga apektado bago pumili ng solusyon.",
                "start_ms": 2500,
                "end_ms": 6780
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Ihiwalay ang iniulat sa hula.",
                "start_ms": 7080,
                "end_ms": 10440
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Itanong kung sino pa ang hindi naririnig.",
                "start_ms": 10740,
                "end_ms": 14100
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Bumuo kasama nila ng maikling pahayag: ano ang nangyayari, kanino at anong ebidensiya ang mayroon.",
                "start_ms": 14400,
                "end_ms": 22680
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Markahan ang hindi pa alam.",
                "start_ms": 22980,
                "end_ms": 25580
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Ang komunidad ay kasamang nagpapasya, hindi tagatanggap lamang ng utos.",
                "start_ms": 25880,
                "end_ms": 31640
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Gumawa ng issue card: ano ang naiulat, sino ang apektado, sino ang hindi pa naririnig at ano ang itatanong.",
                "start_ms": 31940,
                "end_ms": 42580
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "check-start": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/community-issue/check-start.en.4cbedb2f14e5.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "4cbedb2f14e5c3b96a3b92915fd0a6cd1453026a438b72a51f694f362571d41f",
            "sha256": "d3b7d6d900450cd3d6d38b2a72361069b1b728bba977cebbcb59d2f45a48f692",
            "duration_seconds": 15.856,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Choose the first response",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2400
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Choose an answer first.",
                "start_ms": 2700,
                "end_ms": 5180
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Then read the explanation for each option.",
                "start_ms": 5480,
                "end_ms": 9240
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "This is the specific report; its extent and causes still need clarification.",
                "start_ms": 9540,
                "end_ms": 15780
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/community-issue/check-start.fil.2d9481ebffdd.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "2d9481ebffdd66d0348ca7fefcea4a6d671bd2801bc4487e8170b4c9191fab81",
            "sha256": "c8190289c26d17c8edb04a6b2c9ae60e847e7c18f6fd3ae26d3f384743fe54f4",
            "duration_seconds": 16.118,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Piliin ang unang tugon",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2280
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Piliin muna ang sagot.",
                "start_ms": 2580,
                "end_ms": 4420
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Pagkatapos, basahin ang paliwanag sa bawat pagpipilian.",
                "start_ms": 4720,
                "end_ms": 9400
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ito ang tiyak na naiulat; kailangan pang linawin ang lawak at dahilan.",
                "start_ms": 9700,
                "end_ms": 16060
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "check-transfer": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/community-issue/check-transfer.en.7c6bc1ac3227.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "7c6bc1ac3227a0296d93beb48f76743b6dd6082813043990a84f45ceddbe4ba2",
            "sha256": "1c9af80b43cd60a6cca9835bc524f64f498f97b43a09de9a9fc2136064547817",
            "duration_seconds": 11.964,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Apply it to the situation",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2480
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Return to the story.",
                "start_ms": 2780,
                "end_ms": 4540
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Choose an appropriate next step.",
                "start_ms": 4840,
                "end_ms": 7480
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Affected people help identify a workable solution.",
                "start_ms": 7780,
                "end_ms": 11900
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/community-issue/check-transfer.fil.3b5c403142ff.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "3b5c403142ff988bc858f00350c5d7e674ec798ee57bb901b03afe5bec7b6088",
            "sha256": "781e030c6e2bcd6912a42e84cfd9b6946b5425398873351e7812e584883f881b",
            "duration_seconds": 17.136,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Subukan sa sitwasyon",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 5240
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Balikan ang kuwento.",
                "start_ms": 5540,
                "end_ms": 7660
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Piliin ang angkop na susunod na hakbang.",
                "start_ms": 7960,
                "end_ms": 11320
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Kasama ang apektado sa pagtukoy ng magagamit na solusyon.",
                "start_ms": 11620,
                "end_ms": 17060
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "example": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/community-issue/example.en.25cfde4e38c8.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "25cfde4e38c84224cb0fd4bc19d6f60d5c38ed7c120e854912a6e62e93999a98",
            "sha256": "d93e68197f9b0f4c2fdbd8b3f124a24865a2ac0e41da20960402cc56635f523a",
            "duration_seconds": 30.929,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Worked example",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 1800
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "The group writes: “Three residents report learning the new time late.",
                "start_ms": 2100,
                "end_ms": 7300
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "We do not yet know how people without phones receive updates.”",
                "start_ms": 7600,
                "end_ms": 12040
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "They will ask affected residents which channels they can use.",
                "start_ms": 12340,
                "end_ms": 16700
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "They do not label people who missed the visit as lazy.",
                "start_ms": 17000,
                "end_ms": 21680
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Includes a specific report, affected group, missing perspective and question without labels or personal details.",
                "start_ms": 21980,
                "end_ms": 30860
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/community-issue/example.fil.5f881c026acb.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "5f881c026acb8a55f05602aeac64d633e525d5d193332630fc7987fc56bac567",
            "sha256": "7d7e115abb584ea2b0ddc87cf592336a2e7e1ae31273dc9c9e8741eab1044c57",
            "duration_seconds": 32.993,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Halimbawang sagot",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 1840
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Isinulat ng grupo: “Tatlong residente ang nag-ulat na huli nilang nalaman ang bagong oras.",
                "start_ms": 2140,
                "end_ms": 9740
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Hindi pa natin alam kung paano naaabot ang walang cellphone.”",
                "start_ms": 10040,
                "end_ms": 14720
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Itatanong nila sa mga apektado kung aling paraan ang magagamit.",
                "start_ms": 15020,
                "end_ms": 19380
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Hindi nila tinawag na tamad ang mga hindi nakarating.",
                "start_ms": 19680,
                "end_ms": 23400
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "May tiyak na ulat, apektadong grupo, nawawalang pananaw at tanong; walang bansag o personal na detalye.",
                "start_ms": 23700,
                "end_ms": 32940
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "next-step": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/community-issue/next-step.en.52dcde32ce71.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "52dcde32ce71466840d8d92557c686de113d052a5492679b00e2e0433c200f2a",
            "sha256": "27cffb11dc739c92ee5a86b2757e6dcf43f8a1148f70a79e8b08f3d71b8c6f89",
            "duration_seconds": 26.07,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "On Monday, try this",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2360
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "The group decides first to clarify who is missing updates.",
                "start_ms": 2660,
                "end_ms": 7380
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "On Monday, use the blank issue card with a colleague and a fictional case.",
                "start_ms": 7680,
                "end_ms": 13000
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Word: evidence — a specific report or observation, not an assumption about someone’s character.",
                "start_ms": 13300,
                "end_ms": 21060
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "On Monday, practise with the blank issue card and a colleague.",
                "start_ms": 21360,
                "end_ms": 26000
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/community-issue/next-step.fil.a5ed2db84966.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "a5ed2db84966fdac67e55e6549aa7627c333b8559ff1100547469cba47157d8b",
            "sha256": "19e0430ee6e71dbbda635df0f9f9a8ed89c314f7eac674df66e3bfe27ad77d68",
            "duration_seconds": 31.896,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Sa Lunes, gawin ito",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2280
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Napili ng grupo na linawin muna kung sino ang hindi naaabot ng balita.",
                "start_ms": 2580,
                "end_ms": 9100
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Sa Lunes, gamitin ang blangkong issue card sa kathang-isip na kaso kasama ang katrabaho.",
                "start_ms": 9400,
                "end_ms": 16280
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Salita: ebidensiya — tiyak na iniulat o naobserbahan, hindi hula sa ugali ng tao.",
                "start_ms": 16580,
                "end_ms": 25340
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Sa Lunes, magsanay gamit ang blangkong issue card kasama ang katrabaho.",
                "start_ms": 25640,
                "end_ms": 31840
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "scene": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/community-issue/scene.en.91447cf94962.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "91447cf94962c8a20ceaaf029e11fb71c6e99370a396bbf7ac7a9a481fef0db2",
            "sha256": "80ec4cef8527f9749537be4d009e0c3fb228c626a53f94bb777f3182c41ad33d",
            "duration_seconds": 26.096,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "The situation",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 1640
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "In fictional Purok Maligaya, three residents say they learned about a BHS schedule change too late.",
                "start_ms": 1940,
                "end_ms": 9740
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "A leader says, “They just refuse to follow.”",
                "start_ms": 10040,
                "end_ms": 13280
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "BHW Ina has not heard from people without phones or those working during the day.",
                "start_ms": 13580,
                "end_ms": 20940
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "What is the actual issue?",
                "start_ms": 21240,
                "end_ms": 23600
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Whose voice is missing?",
                "start_ms": 23900,
                "end_ms": 26020
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/community-issue/scene.fil.c7441d9df74e.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "c7441d9df74ef575a7d4a90b304dc200387f089fab2c96140843ab7cfd631bd6",
            "sha256": "f27a18a137de87ecc66abdaa04310d1a72eecd7d4eecee250934afebb0e15900",
            "duration_seconds": 27.246,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ang sitwasyon",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 1560
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Sa kathang-isip na Purok Maligaya, tatlong residente ang nagsabing huli nilang nalaman ang pagbabago ng oras sa BHS.",
                "start_ms": 1860,
                "end_ms": 10220
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Sabi ng isang lider, “Ayaw lang nilang sumunod.”",
                "start_ms": 10520,
                "end_ms": 14360
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Hindi pa naririnig ni BHW Ina ang mga walang cellphone at nagtatrabaho sa araw.",
                "start_ms": 14660,
                "end_ms": 21780
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Ano ang tunay na isyu?",
                "start_ms": 22080,
                "end_ms": 24280
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Sino pa ang hindi naririnig?",
                "start_ms": 24580,
                "end_ms": 27180
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "scope": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/community-issue/scope.en.eac8885d49b3.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "eac8885d49b3e1494064fd7edf2294f29cb1b3d7084821a06e4ee73123b125a1",
            "sha256": "65e681ab3a12daf65c0b6610565086a084c5a5e81086ca094551d0114bda0bb6",
            "duration_seconds": 31.843,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Scope and support",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2160
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Community mobilization involves identifying needs, acting and reviewing results together.",
                "start_ms": 2460,
                "end_ms": 9900
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "People do not need to disclose personal circumstances publicly.",
                "start_ms": 10200,
                "end_ms": 15160
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Use combined, non-identifying information.",
                "start_ms": 15460,
                "end_ms": 19180
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "For sensitive concerns, ask whether a small, private conversation is more appropriate.",
                "start_ms": 19480,
                "end_ms": 25920
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Decide with the community; no one has to share personal circumstances publicly.",
                "start_ms": 26220,
                "end_ms": 31780
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/community-issue/scope.fil.237a852028ea.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "237a852028ea6191433f1f30dcd18ad81d7d9cab56afbd043273a369f3ca5159",
            "sha256": "31aab0ff92a283e94c341075a3bc3579d64842e699fe79e2aa20dcfc0eb0b335",
            "duration_seconds": 37.12,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Saklaw at paghingi ng tulong",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 3080
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ang community mobilization ay sama-samang pagtukoy, pagkilos at pagsusuri sa lokal na pangangailangan.",
                "start_ms": 3380,
                "end_ms": 11900
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Hindi kailangan ang pampublikong pagsasalaysay ng personal na kalagayan.",
                "start_ms": 12200,
                "end_ms": 17960
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Gumamit ng pinagsama at hindi makikilalang impormasyon.",
                "start_ms": 18260,
                "end_ms": 23340
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Kung sensitibo ang isyu, itanong kung ang maliit at pribadong usapan ang mas angkop.",
                "start_ms": 23640,
                "end_ms": 30360
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Kasama ang komunidad sa pagpapasya; walang sapilitang pampublikong personal na kuwento.",
                "start_ms": 30660,
                "end_ms": 37060
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
