                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Mang Ernesto asks again: “If I am already included in PhilHealth, is my consultation free at any facility?”",
                "start_ms": 1900,
                "end_ms": 9820
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Which response from Vlanche is most accurate and helpful?",
                "start_ms": 10120,
                "end_ms": 13840
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Explain what is known and name what still needs checking.",
                "start_ms": 14140,
                "end_ms": 18020
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-coverage/check.fil.c0db74b47455.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "c0db74b47455568918e5e5ecc9828b5192fccb417077939ef561fa8f8b15f12b",
            "sha256": "967378e640789cf3cc1bd7c016aa715bfbc04bc24e49236962251671d22ec773",
            "duration_seconds": 21.002,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Sagutin ang residente",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2000
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Muling nagtanong si Mang Ernesto: “Kung kasama na ako sa PhilHealth, libre na ba ang konsulta ko sa kahit aling pasilidad?”",
                "start_ms": 2300,
                "end_ms": 10940
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Aling sagot ni Vlanche ang pinakatumpak at pinakamakatutulong?",
                "start_ms": 11240,
                "end_ms": 15840
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ibigay ang alam na, at tukuyin ang dapat pang tiyakin.",
                "start_ms": 16140,
                "end_ms": 20940
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "included": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-coverage/included.en.e1daed577c97.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "e1daed577c9700a6d76425c382ffd897bfb9dd36ecca69bcae3542d3618dbc34",
            "sha256": "ddd2561b59f288790896d68addfe3ddb29575c94357c8a232ea2ac82c531b6f6",
            "duration_seconds": 36.78,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "What does automatic inclusion mean?",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 3160
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Under the UHC Act, every Filipino citizen is automatically included in PhilHealth's National Health Insurance Program.",
                "start_ms": 3460,
                "end_ms": 11420
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "This describes who is included in the program.",
                "start_ms": 11720,
                "end_ms": 14920
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Automatic inclusion alone does not answer whether a particular service is covered at a particular facility.",
                "start_ms": 15220,
                "end_ms": 21940
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Vlanche says, “You are included in PhilHealth under UHC.",
                "start_ms": 22240,
                "end_ms": 26800
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Let us still check the rules for the consultation you are asking about.”",
                "start_ms": 27100,
                "end_ms": 31500
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Every Filipino citizen is automatically included in the NHIP.",
                "start_ms": 31800,
                "end_ms": 36720
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-coverage/included.fil.ed850f4428f0.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "ed850f4428f02a449a5dfd1b0c08a69516d34016b1bc5cbb374d6ddd03d94401",
            "sha256": "f494e9fb89e77e6a5c0aabe0c2687d38430959cad3748cc01f448eb742495f6b",
            "duration_seconds": 41.613,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ano ang ibig sabihin ng awtomatikong kasama?",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 3440
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Sa ilalim ng UHC Act, awtomatikong kasama ang bawat Pilipinong mamamayan sa National Health Insurance Program ng PhilHealth.",
                "start_ms": 3740,
                "end_ms": 13260
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Saklaw ito ng programa para sa mga tao.",
                "start_ms": 13560,
                "end_ms": 16360
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Hindi kailangang ipalagay na ang awtomatikong pagsama ay sagot na rin sa tanong kung aling partikular na serbisyo ang sakop sa isang pasilidad.",
                "start_ms": 16660,
                "end_ms": 25340
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Sinabi ni Vlanche: “Kasama po kayo sa PhilHealth sa ilalim ng UHC.",
                "start_ms": 25640,
                "end_ms": 31080
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Tingnan pa natin ang tuntunin para sa konsulta na itinatanong ninyo.”",
                "start_ms": 31380,
                "end_ms": 36060
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Awtomatikong kasama sa NHIP ang bawat Pilipinong mamamayan.",
                "start_ms": 36360,
                "end_ms": 41560
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "section-1": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-coverage/section-1.en.f66338ac00e5.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "f66338ac00e5363cf7e8d435ae3fd1c3a4792ec9cab23652b8fba7b8d36da74b",
            "sha256": "e9a81a812ae56f33013a8982fdece8e1ef2397f0280a4c1bab9da0f049bfc468",
            "duration_seconds": 39.706,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Mang Ernesto's question",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2520
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "“Are consultations at the health center free now?”",
                "start_ms": 2820,
                "end_ms": 6540
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Mang Ernesto asks BHW Vlanche while they wait at the barangay health station.",
                "start_ms": 6840,
                "end_ms": 13000
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "He heard this on the radio, but he does not know whether a consultation is covered at the facility he plans to visit.",
                "start_ms": 13300,
                "end_ms": 20500
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Vlanche listens.",
                "start_ms": 20800,
                "end_ms": 22600
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "“I can explain what UHC says.",
                "start_ms": 22900,
                "end_ms": 25460
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Then we can check which benefit and process apply to you.”",
                "start_ms": 25760,
                "end_ms": 29360
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "She does not promise a price or a free service yet.",
                "start_ms": 29660,
                "end_ms": 34140
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Listen to the question before explaining or promising anything.",
                "start_ms": 34440,
                "end_ms": 39640
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-coverage/section-1.fil.c146d0f99fcf.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "c146d0f99fcf80612cfe1f1b5b264892cb46def987b38f344ea3af3b47747e6a",
            "sha256": "0b273715b96072055ec2ecf9fc513b56dabb4caf210bc378e41bd9cda8cdddf2",
            "duration_seconds": 41.064,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ang tanong ni Mang Ernesto",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2200
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "“Totoo bang libre na ang konsulta sa health center?”",
                "start_ms": 2500,
                "end_ms": 5860
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "tanong ni Mang Ernesto kay BHW Vlanche habang naghihintay sila sa barangay health station.",
                "start_ms": 6160,
                "end_ms": 12320
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Narinig niya ito sa radyo, ngunit hindi niya alam kung sakop ang konsulta sa pasilidad na pupuntahan niya.",
                "start_ms": 12620,
                "end_ms": 19340
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Nakinig si Vlanche.",
                "start_ms": 19640,
                "end_ms": 21040
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "“Ipapaliwanag ko po ang sinasabi ng UHC.",
                "start_ms": 21340,
                "end_ms": 25420
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Pagkatapos, aalamin natin kung anong benepisyo at proseso ang naaangkop sa inyo.”",
                "start_ms": 25720,
                "end_ms": 31640
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "Hindi muna siya nangako ng halagang babayaran o serbisyong libre.",
                "start_ms": 31940,
                "end_ms": 36740
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Makinig muna sa tanong bago magpaliwanag o mangako.",
                "start_ms": 37040,
                "end_ms": 41000
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "section-2": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-coverage/section-2.en.04d30c4418d0.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "04d30c4418d0a19118617faf020937b4935a50ad325725074da8d58c3f474104",
            "sha256": "2383e736e044408c9fe6b543c31159b54e344de085bbce69fd5205e03cc075f6",
            "duration_seconds": 45.061,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "What is UHC trying to achieve?",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2600
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Republic Act 11223, the Universal Health Care (UHC) Act of 2019, aims to improve access to affordable, quality health services for every Filipino and protect people from financial hardship when they need care.",
                "start_ms": 2900,
                "end_ms": 19580
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "This is the law's direction for the health system; it does not say that the same services are already available everywhere today.",
                "start_ms": 19880,
                "end_ms": 28400
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Vlanche explains to Mang Ernesto: “UHC aims to make appropriate care easier to reach without the cost becoming a heavy burden.”",
                "start_ms": 28700,
                "end_ms": 38220
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "UHC aims to improve access to quality care and protect people from financial hardship.",
                "start_ms": 38520,
                "end_ms": 45000
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-coverage/section-2.fil.5a384cfdffd8.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "5a384cfdffd89a7e3b077dc114bfab085adc586d8e20b9e214b8e2ca8ec4a4fd",
            "sha256": "bd41b7d09a9751a52e24fecde592a8b471cfea42b20d0374c66d4e28a14a7f76",
            "duration_seconds": 52.219,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ano ang layunin ng UHC?",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 3080
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ang Republic Act 11223, o Universal Health Care (UHC) Act of 2019, ay naglalayong mapalapit ang dekalidad at abot-kayang serbisyong pangkalusugan sa bawat Pilipino at maprotektahan sila laban sa mabigat na gastusin kapag nangangailangan ng pangangalaga.",
                "start_ms": 3380,
                "end_ms": 25100
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Layunin ito ng batas para sa sistema ng kalusugan; hindi nito sinasabi na pare-pareho na ang serbisyo sa lahat ng lugar ngayon.",
                "start_ms": 25400,
                "end_ms": 33480
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Ipinaliwanag ni Vlanche kay Mang Ernesto: “Gusto ng UHC na mas madali kayong makalapit sa angkop na pangangalaga nang hindi mabigatan sa gastos.”",
                "start_ms": 33780,
                "end_ms": 44420
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Layunin ng UHC ang mas madaling paglapit sa dekalidad na serbisyo at proteksiyon sa gastusin.",
                "start_ms": 44720,
                "end_ms": 52160
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "verify": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-coverage/verify.en.97779af974f6.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "97779af974f6f1a578a92b709dce9168135d61764d2cb354f9d5fc1bc0ccb97e",
            "sha256": "c0e1ff8bb94416785ea6fd6587f7efae94b5ccfa3f96b27a5c45840a3ee61914",
            "duration_seconds": 48.118,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "What will Vlanche do next?",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2480
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Vlanche checks with PhilHealth, the RHU, or the health team which current benefit Mang Ernesto may use, which provider or facility is recognized, and what steps that benefit requires.",
                "start_ms": 2780,
                "end_ms": 16340
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "If choosing or registering with a primary care clinic is part of those steps, she explains the local process after confirming it.",
                "start_ms": 16640,
                "end_ms": 25280
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "This is separate from automatic inclusion in the National Health Insurance Program.",
                "start_ms": 25580,
                "end_ms": 30420
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "She could say: “You are included in PhilHealth.",
                "start_ms": 30720,
                "end_ms": 34360
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "To find out whether this consultation is covered here, let us check the benefit, provider, and next step.”",
                "start_ms": 34660,
                "end_ms": 42060
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Check the benefit, provider, and required steps for the particular consultation.",
                "start_ms": 42360,
                "end_ms": 48040
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-coverage/verify.fil.5877b1da215e.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "5877b1da215e6d2924fb9ad9fbc37d737fd0ed7d95f2fe674ea654541f643ba8",
            "sha256": "06347eef2c88b8975d260ca4b779ca2c2f78cd72f1b1da3f62027f9b0b2bf831",
            "duration_seconds": 53.499,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ano ang susunod na gagawin ni Vlanche?",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2760
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Titingnan ni Vlanche sa PhilHealth, RHU, o sa health team ang kasalukuyang benepisyong maaaring gamitin ni Mang Ernesto, ang kinikilalang provider o pasilidad, at ang kailangang hakbang para sa benepisyong iyon.",
                "start_ms": 3060,
                "end_ms": 18100
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Kung may pagpili o pagpaparehistro sa primary care clinic, ipaliliwanag niya ang lokal na paraan matapos itong makumpirma.",
                "start_ms": 18400,
                "end_ms": 27480
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Iba iyon sa awtomatikong pagsama sa National Health Insurance Program.",
                "start_ms": 27780,
                "end_ms": 32980
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Maaari niyang sabihin: “Kasama po kayo sa PhilHealth.",
                "start_ms": 33280,
                "end_ms": 37520
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Para malaman natin kung sakop ang konsultang ito rito, tiyakin natin ang benepisyo, ang provider, at ang dapat gawin.”",
                "start_ms": 37820,
                "end_ms": 46140
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Tiyakin ang benepisyo, provider, at kailangang hakbang para sa partikular na konsulta.",
                "start_ms": 46440,
                "end_ms": 53440
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "uhc-improvement": {
      "module": "02-uhc-act",
      "sections": {
        "improvement-check": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-improvement/improvement-check.en.05b62ca458cd.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "05b62ca458cd3544af964e2f682cd10b54bd2c75f4705ae957fa0341ca93f552",
            "sha256": "64b83dc6b7a247e4cbbe7fd7f94054916b52ca4c39443fa6c9833ba80df0a574",
            "duration_seconds": 39.576,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Choose a workable plan",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2120
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "You have an idea to make information clearer during visits.",
                "start_ms": 2420,
                "end_ms": 6380
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Before starting, you need a confirmed contact and message, the right agreement, and feasible time and materials.",
                "start_ms": 6680,
                "end_ms": 14200
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Afterwards, you need to check whether people understood it and what still needs adjustment.",
                "start_ms": 14500,
                "end_ms": 19820
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Choose the plan with a small first step and a clear review with the health team.",
                "start_ms": 20120,
                "end_ms": 25280
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "In your barangay, what is one real gap, whom should you discuss it with, and what would you clarify first?",
                "start_ms": 25580,
                "end_ms": 33180
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Observed → Confirmed and discussed → Small plan → Tried and reviewed.",
                "start_ms": 33480,
                "end_ms": 39520
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-improvement/improvement-check.fil.bc27f8772a9a.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "bc27f8772a9a4326cbfc75f30f30c71e368ca0a9fb12a7176caf6b496325f768",
            "sha256": "1365115f24bcfd08014bd16980190eb8764cd673204db6200f541f1f58653b29",
            "duration_seconds": 50.416,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Piliin ang maisasagawang plano",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 3080
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "May mungkahi kang gawing mas malinaw ang impormasyon sa mga pagbisita.",
                "start_ms": 3380,
                "end_ms": 8540
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Bago magsimula, kailangan ng kumpirmadong contact at mensahe, tamang pahintulot, at kayang oras at gamit.",
                "start_ms": 8840,
                "end_ms": 17640
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Pagkatapos, kailangan mong malaman kung naunawaan ito at kung ano pa ang dapat ayusin.",
                "start_ms": 17940,
                "end_ms": 24340
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Piliin ang plano na may maliit na unang hakbang at malinaw na pagbabalik sa health team.",
                "start_ms": 24640,
                "end_ms": 30920
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Sa iyong barangay, ano ang isang totoong puwang, sino ang dapat mong kausapin, at ano ang una mong ipapalinaw?",
                "start_ms": 31220,
                "end_ms": 40980
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Napansin → Tiniyak at napag-usapan → Maliit na plano → Sinubukan at binalikan.",
                "start_ms": 41280,
                "end_ms": 50360
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "improvement-confirm": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-improvement/improvement-confirm.en.18f1ce3d44db.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "18f1ce3d44dbced1bd9b15a5ec80888b772898590ca6d1452762af3da9366d1b",
            "sha256": "ffec9d5d4ba32c3ac5a201c79b74eaaaa1693b2a435d973b9e2ed467ccb7087d",
            "duration_seconds": 40.882,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Confirm the facts and listen",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2920
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Vlanche asks the midwife: “Who is the current contact for this kind of question?",
                "start_ms": 3220,
                "end_ms": 9460
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Do we already have a message?”",
                "start_ms": 9760,
                "end_ms": 11760
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "There may be a new schedule or local policy she does not yet know about.",
                "start_ms": 12060,
                "end_ms": 17140
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "She listens to the explanation and her fellow BHW’s suggestion.",
                "start_ms": 17440,
                "end_ms": 22520
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "If the contact or message is unconfirmed, she holds it back and asks the responsible person to clarify it.",
                "start_ms": 22820,
                "end_ms": 30140
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "A BHW does not change services or policy on their own.",
                "start_ms": 30440,
                "end_ms": 35080
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Confirm current information and permission with the right person before acting.",
                "start_ms": 35380,
                "end_ms": 40820
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-improvement/improvement-confirm.fil.f1175f6f98d1.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "f1175f6f98d1d20110d065feb25ea92ec0f1192e50ab590d4071e988b6c5ee38",
            "sha256": "a869b4313871557ba125b0c0debbc43e897797e6841d5a03d12c4134cab53e52",
            "duration_seconds": 43.755,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Tiyakin ang datos at makinig",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 3080
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Tinanong ni Vlanche ang midwife: “Sino ang kasalukuyang contact para sa ganitong tanong?",
                "start_ms": 3380,
                "end_ms": 8700
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "May mensahe na ba tayong ginagamit?”",
                "start_ms": 9000,
                "end_ms": 11240
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Maaaring may bagong iskedyul o lokal na patakaran na hindi pa niya alam.",
                "start_ms": 11540,
                "end_ms": 16700
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Pinakinggan niya ang paliwanag at mungkahi ng kapwa BHW.",
                "start_ms": 17000,
                "end_ms": 21800
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Kung hindi pa kumpirmado ang contact o mensahe, hindi muna niya ito ipapakalat.",
                "start_ms": 22100,
                "end_ms": 27620
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Ipapalinaw muna sa taong may pananagutan.",
                "start_ms": 27920,
                "end_ms": 31120
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "Hindi binabago ng BHW ang serbisyo o patakaran sa sariling pasya.",
                "start_ms": 31420,
                "end_ms": 36980
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Tiyakin ang kasalukuyang impormasyon at pahintulot sa tamang tao bago kumilos.",
                "start_ms": 37280,
                "end_ms": 43680
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "improvement-feedback": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-improvement/improvement-feedback.en.e8d6a3868e2d.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "e8d6a3868e2d377fdbb9be580a518c16f900a4d73f92f13f9b4517d4c08bc520",
            "sha256": "e01d9dc8010c7f0de549f160731b4cefa86a3ac05cfb71c907a3a0683a0cc0b8",
            "duration_seconds": 39.837,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Try it and review what happened",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2800
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "During the agreed trial, Vlanche asks after explaining: “Who would you approach with this kind of question?”",
                "start_ms": 3100,
                "end_ms": 10700
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "She notes how many people can name the correct contact and what questions remain, without personal details.",
                "start_ms": 11000,
                "end_ms": 17560
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "On Friday, she and the midwife review the notes and feedback.",
                "start_ms": 17860,
                "end_ms": 21620
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "If the message is unclear, they revise it before trying again.",
                "start_ms": 21920,
                "end_ms": 26320
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "A few answers are a small indicator; they do not prove that the whole system or everyone’s health has improved.",
                "start_ms": 26620,
                "end_ms": 33780
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Review a small indicator and feedback; adjust the plan based on what happened.",
                "start_ms": 34080,
                "end_ms": 39760
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-improvement/improvement-feedback.fil.d5c5bb310af9.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "d5c5bb310af92b20930e1f4393e5ee526a217ea3b9e828a7595a288351003fb3",
            "sha256": "423e260af46871fd18287bb24e7d2e3432d2bf75ab07e082548fbc5264dbdf78",
            "duration_seconds": 45.14,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Subukan at balikan ang nangyari",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2680
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Sa napagkasunduang pagsubok, tinanong ni Vlanche pagkatapos ng paliwanag: “Sino po ang lalapitan ninyo para sa ganitong tanong?”",
                "start_ms": 2980,
                "end_ms": 12060
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Itinala niya kung ilang nakausap ang nakapagsabi ng tamang contact at kung anong tanong ang nanatili, nang walang personal na detalye.",
                "start_ms": 12360,
                "end_ms": 21200
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Sa Biyernes, tiningnan nila ng midwife ang tala at feedback.",
                "start_ms": 21500,
                "end_ms": 25900
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Kung hindi malinaw ang mensahe, aayusin nila ito bago muling subukan.",
                "start_ms": 26200,
                "end_ms": 31080
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Ang ilang sagot ay palatandaan lamang; hindi patunay na gumanda na ang buong sistema o kalusugan ng lahat.",
                "start_ms": 31380,
                "end_ms": 38740
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Tingnan ang maliit na palatandaan at feedback; baguhin ang plano ayon sa nakita.",
                "start_ms": 39040,
                "end_ms": 45080
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "improvement-plan": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-improvement/improvement-plan.en.7dbd3cefd3c4.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "7dbd3cefd3c46490c7652bd83e4ad61fba774cb91a854a5317127dbb253f08d8",
            "sha256": "f11c80462e1657c1d1097c1e6b8f78bae3b6aff6a2b05f920e9bc2e9296f5aed",
            "duration_seconds": 41.456,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Make the plan concrete",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2240
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "In this example, they agree on a plan after the midwife confirms the contact and message.",
                "start_ms": 2540,
                "end_ms": 7820
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Vlanche will explain it during her scheduled visits next week.",
                "start_ms": 8120,
                "end_ms": 11680
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "She will use a small guide checked by the midwife; the plan needs no new campaign or unagreed service.",
                "start_ms": 11980,
                "end_ms": 18740
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "On Friday, they will review questions that remain unclear.",
                "start_ms": 19040,
                "end_ms": 22880
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Write down the action, the responsible person and required agreement, the time and materials available, and when to review the result.",
                "start_ms": 23180,
                "end_ms": 32660
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "One action, clear responsibility and agreement, feasible time and materials, and a review date.",
                "start_ms": 32960,
                "end_ms": 41400
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-improvement/improvement-plan.fil.067c36c1f3fc.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "067c36c1f3fc7f7a424c933c9ef6381f5af0a6f60798aab31fa18103ca1dd441",
            "sha256": "dd1fd29658cef3cfb1412a7a8f4d0e0f67724a3464da9c0ee833b1f2a9838fd8",
            "duration_seconds": 50.338,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Gawing konkretong plano",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2320
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Sa halimbawang ito, napagkasunduan nila ang plano matapos kumpirmahin ng midwife ang contact at mensahe.",
                "start_ms": 2620,
                "end_ms": 10740
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Si Vlanche ang magsasabi nito sa kanyang nakatakdang pagbisita sa susunod na linggo.",
                "start_ms": 11040,
                "end_ms": 16280
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Gagamit siya ng maliit na gabay na sinuri ng midwife; hindi kailangan ng bagong kampanya o dagdag na serbisyong hindi napagkasunduan.",
                "start_ms": 16580,
                "end_ms": 24860
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Sa Biyernes, babalikan nila ang mga tanong na hindi pa malinaw.",
                "start_ms": 25160,
                "end_ms": 29480
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Isulat: ano ang gagawin, sino ang responsable at kailangang pumayag, anong oras at materyales ang kaya, at kailan susuriin ang resulta.",
                "start_ms": 29780,
                "end_ms": 40980
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Isang gawain, malinaw na pananagutan at pahintulot, kayang oras at gamit, at takdang pagbabalik.",
                "start_ms": 41280,
                "end_ms": 50280
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "section-6": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-improvement/section-6.en.b8beb8d68254.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "b8beb8d68254083659e1653d4aa9c21cab72c429f05025f848e90b542de4ee60",
            "sha256": "435816ea59a5597b3a5e1739f250d64bd8683f9332f151b7df8116a28ffd3169",
            "duration_seconds": 40.124,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Propose it, and talk it through first",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 3280
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "On two visits, BHW Vlanche hears residents give different answers about whom to approach with a health station question.",
                "start_ms": 3580,
                "end_ms": 13260
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "“Who should I ask?”",
                "start_ms": 13560,
                "end_ms": 15320
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "says Mang Ernesto.",
                "start_ms": 15620,
                "end_ms": 17260
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Vlanche notes the question without names or personal details.",
                "start_ms": 17560,
                "end_ms": 22200
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "This does not establish that the whole system is wrong.",
                "start_ms": 22500,
                "end_ms": 26140
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "It identifies something to clarify with a fellow BHW and the midwife before proposing a change.",
                "start_ms": 26440,
                "end_ms": 33600
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Describe what you saw or heard; do not blame people or treat an assumption as fact.",
                "start_ms": 33900,
                "end_ms": 40060
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-improvement/section-6.fil.48c0d9010792.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "48c0d90107927ceb7b3e2bf2893203b393697a888c1ede53860bf35c80b99f7e",
            "sha256": "000d9f07ceed3bb373c59a5e08ff6f3bfe92a82138073d487c5ae84846602042",
            "duration_seconds": 43.128,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Magmungkahi at pag-usapan muna",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2720
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Sa dalawang pagbisita, magkaiba ang narinig ni BHW Vlanche sa mga residente tungkol sa kung sino ang lalapitan para sa tanong sa health station.",
                "start_ms": 3020,
                "end_ms": 13780
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "“Sino po ba ang dapat kong tanungin?”",
                "start_ms": 14080,
                "end_ms": 16600
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "sabi ni Mang Ernesto.",
                "start_ms": 16900,
                "end_ms": 18900
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Itinala ni Vlanche ang tanong nang walang pangalan o personal na detalye.",
                "start_ms": 19200,
                "end_ms": 24520
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Hindi pa nito pinatutunayang mali ang buong sistema.",
                "start_ms": 24820,
                "end_ms": 28220
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "May puwang na dapat linawin kasama ang kapwa BHW at midwife bago magmungkahi ng pagbabago.",
                "start_ms": 28520,
                "end_ms": 36480
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ilarawan ang nakita o narinig; huwag sisihin ang tao o gawing tiyak ang hinala.",
                "start_ms": 36780,
                "end_ms": 43060
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "section-7": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-improvement/section-7.en.837f838f84a9.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "837f838f84a9b1707a81b5f43bcddf3b6b4989c30a1b6f55f7c1dfb695e84b2c",
            "sha256": "aa1cccf4a1147acab82695fe8824590f4b0061597b3f8d4075a133e7f705928f",
            "duration_seconds": 37.172,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "The first small step",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 1840
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Vlanche proposes: “On my visits next week, could we use one short message about whom to ask?”",
                "start_ms": 2140,
                "end_ms": 8460
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "The starting point is small: one message during scheduled visits, rather than a whole campaign.",
                "start_ms": 8760,
                "end_ms": 15840
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "It is still a proposal.",
                "start_ms": 16140,
                "end_ms": 17860
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Before using it, she needs to confirm the information, discuss it with the midwife, and check that the task fits her role and time.",
                "start_ms": 18160,
                "end_ms": 27080
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "The proposal may change after that discussion.",
                "start_ms": 27380,
                "end_ms": 30460
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Choose a small first step to discuss, rather than a change to impose alone.",
                "start_ms": 30760,
                "end_ms": 37120
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-improvement/section-7.fil.1223acb9c451.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "1223acb9c451b4ec8cff1e98cfb02b7e4902ace9d9fda28a23d485db6196a3bc",
            "sha256": "4e1ddfdd0ac86a370d7e0597086f5832ec92b60dfccccfaba87b62c7dcc2ea63",
            "duration_seconds": 46.576,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ang unang maliit na hakbang",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2360
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Mungkahi ni Vlanche: “Sa mga pagbisita ko sa susunod na linggo, maaari kaya tayong gumamit ng isang maikling mensahe tungkol sa kung sino ang tatanungin?”",
                "start_ms": 2660,
                "end_ms": 14540
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Maliit ang simula: isang mensahe sa mga nakatakdang pagbisita, hindi isang buong kampanya.",
                "start_ms": 14840,
                "end_ms": 21960
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Panukala pa lamang ito.",
                "start_ms": 22260,
                "end_ms": 24500
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Bago gamitin, kailangan niyang tiyakin ang impormasyon, kausapin ang midwife, at alamin kung pasok ang gawain sa kanyang papel at oras.",
                "start_ms": 24800,
                "end_ms": 34600
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Maaaring baguhin ang mungkahi pagkatapos ng usapan.",
                "start_ms": 34900,
                "end_ms": 39020
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Pumili ng maliit na unang hakbang na pag-uusapan, hindi ng pagbabagong ipapatupad nang mag-isa.",
                "start_ms": 39320,
                "end_ms": 46520
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "uhc-local-system": {
      "module": "02-uhc-act",
      "sections": {
        "local-system-board": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-local-system/local-system-board.en.a84149054e3f.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "a84149054e3f927443a211b892224b49f92236cfdd1a76aeb429172205537231",
            "sha256": "c2a3dbbb3f81f5e7cb9278db94a572146ea19c6e16673f225a07ff447999d171",
            "duration_seconds": 61.414,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Health board and health team: distinct roles",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 4120
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Under the UHC Act, Provincial and City Health Boards oversee and coordinate integration of health services into province-wide and city-wide health systems.",
                "start_ms": 4420,
                "end_ms": 16340
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "They also have duties for the Special Health Fund and supervision of facilities and health personnel within the law’s scope.",
                "start_ms": 16640,
                "end_ms": 24440
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "The Local Government Code also establishes local health boards in provinces, cities and municipalities, with budget-proposal and advisory functions for the sanggunian.",
                "start_ms": 24740,
                "end_ms": 35300
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Do not treat all boards as one body or assume every place follows the same process.",
                "start_ms": 35600,
                "end_ms": 42600
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "A BHW does not automatically sit on or lead a board.",
                "start_ms": 42900,
                "end_ms": 47940
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Vlanche asks the midwife or designated health-team contact who should receive her observation and how to share it locally.",
                "start_ms": 48240,
                "end_ms": 56360
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Understand the board’s role; confirm the local coordination process.",
                "start_ms": 56660,
                "end_ms": 61340
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-local-system/local-system-board.fil.e46ae9f828c0.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "e46ae9f828c0bd7ac17501e1e04045a415f43c3245d6639810e0bf27fce8cd25",
            "sha256": "47aca58aea30eb9566a71b807e31825e113c515076f9d635d54104fe5f36ba38",
            "duration_seconds": 66.873,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Health board at health team: magkaibang papel",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 3920
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Sa UHC Act, pinangangasiwaan at pinag-uugnay ng Provincial at City Health Boards ang pagsasama ng mga serbisyong pangkalusugan sa province-wide at city-wide health systems.",
                "start_ms": 4220,
                "end_ms": 17540
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "May tungkulin din sila sa Special Health Fund at pangangasiwa sa mga pasilidad at health personnel sa saklaw ng batas.",
                "start_ms": 17840,
                "end_ms": 25640
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "May local health boards din sa probinsya, lungsod at munisipyo sa ilalim ng Local Government Code, na may mga tungkulin sa mungkahing budget at payo sa sanggunian.",
                "start_ms": 25940,
                "end_ms": 38500
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Hindi dapat pag-isahin ang lahat ng board o ipalagay na iisa ang lokal na proseso.",
                "start_ms": 38800,
                "end_ms": 45240
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Hindi awtomatikong kasapi o namumuno sa board ang BHW.",
                "start_ms": 45540,
                "end_ms": 50540
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Tatanungin ni Vlanche ang midwife o ang itinalagang health-team contact kung kanino at paano dapat ipaabot ang obserbasyon.",
                "start_ms": 50840,
                "end_ms": 60120
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Unawain ang papel ng board; kumpirmahin ang lokal na paraan ng pakikipag-ugnayan.",
                "start_ms": 60420,
                "end_ms": 66820
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "local-system-check": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-local-system/local-system-check.en.c63caedebd45.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "c63caedebd4519d18111befc19185cc10713aa1525ecacc736008fe6b77082ce",
            "sha256": "7e5f9a20e14fc35ae23d3ed5fe1be8c0bbfa8469e762ae22304be24fcfbd9c0c",
            "duration_seconds": 49.894,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Your turn: what will you share?",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2440
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Residents repeatedly ask about conflicting information they have heard about a health activity.",
                "start_ms": 2740,
                "end_ms": 9260
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "You have not yet confirmed the current details.",
                "start_ms": 9560,
                "end_ms": 12960
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "As a BHW, what is the best first response?",
                "start_ms": 13260,
                "end_ms": 17780
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Choose the summary and step that show a factual observation, care with personal details, and appropriate coordination.",
                "start_ms": 18080,
                "end_ms": 26240
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "After answering, try saying your own summary and one specific question for the health team.",
                "start_ms": 26540,
                "end_ms": 33140
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "The online answer checks understanding; practical skill will be observed separately during practice.",
                "start_ms": 33440,
                "end_ms": 40040
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "The BHW contributes observation, accurate messaging, a locally confirmed contact, and follow-up.",
                "start_ms": 40340,
                "end_ms": 49820
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-local-system/local-system-check.fil.b403066f01e2.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "b403066f01e25ccf3f95f158d27b889386c5c21fe5f41ff387f7b4f9f9965105",
            "sha256": "8736dcfbf15f538e125a9c60bed923f8be039e950a6157a2fe0e2bd37d795c0f",
            "duration_seconds": 55.484,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ikaw naman: ano ang ipaaabot mo?",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 3240
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "May mga residenteng paulit-ulit na nagtatanong tungkol sa magkaibang impormasyong narinig nila sa isang health activity.",
                "start_ms": 3540,
                "end_ms": 11860
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Hindi mo pa nakukumpirma ang kasalukuyang detalye.",
                "start_ms": 12160,
                "end_ms": 15800
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Bilang BHW, ano ang pinakamainam na unang tugon?",
                "start_ms": 16100,
                "end_ms": 21780
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Piliin ang buod at hakbang na nagpapakita ng malinaw na obserbasyon, pag-iingat sa personal na detalye, at tamang pakikipag-ugnayan.",
                "start_ms": 22080,
                "end_ms": 33400
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Pagkatapos sumagot, subukang sabihin ang sarili mong buod at isang tiyak na tanong sa health team.",
                "start_ms": 33700,
                "end_ms": 39940
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Ang online na sagot ay pagsuri ng pagkaunawa; hiwalay na oobserbahan sa practice ang aktuwal na kasanayan.",
                "start_ms": 40240,
                "end_ms": 47640
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Obserbasyon, tumpak na mensahe, lokal na contact, at follow-up ang ambag ng BHW.",
                "start_ms": 47940,
                "end_ms": 55420
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "local-system-feedback": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-local-system/local-system-feedback.en.968e0b6c54aa.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "968e0b6c54aaa4984e38abb0dce35a9339794a83327e1d4403fda926b0bb79b4",
            "sha256": "6c9ea1a37a423162f44bbb2480606a8a58be79c2befd9f44906682cecadba008",
            "duration_seconds": 59.115,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Skills, suggestions and follow-up",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 3560
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "In this example, Vlanche rehearses her summary with the midwife.",
                "start_ms": 3860,
                "end_ms": 9340
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "The midwife helps her make the question clearer and remove assumptions.",
                "start_ms": 9640,
                "end_ms": 14560
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Vlanche suggests a clearer explanation using information the health team can confirm.",
                "start_ms": 14860,
                "end_ms": 21420
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "She asks: “Who can decide on this suggestion, and when and how can I learn the response?”",
                "start_ms": 21720,
                "end_ms": 28320
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "They discuss a locally agreed next step.",
                "start_ms": 28620,
                "end_ms": 32060
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "She does not promise that the suggestion is approved or has reached a board.",
                "start_ms": 32360,
                "end_ms": 37600
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "She will follow up with the agreed contact and share only the confirmed response with residents.",
                "start_ms": 37900,
                "end_ms": 43740
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 7,
                "text": "This practices identifying an opportunity, discussing an idea with others, and following an agreed change.",
                "start_ms": 44040,
                "end_ms": 52360
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Practice with the team, identify who can decide, and follow up on the agreed step.",
                "start_ms": 52660,
                "end_ms": 59060
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-local-system/local-system-feedback.fil.e43899ef0044.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "e43899ef0044e0b93d75528cf0e03a98f7dfdffa081ab037f531bd5f5b766ed5",
            "sha256": "aba72dce8d2c04ba101aed6e7b0071d3e9bbf9eae5c3c7f6c4be414de13e67eb",
            "duration_seconds": 65.933,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Kasanayan, mungkahi at follow-up",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 4200
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Sa halimbawang ito, nagpraktis si Vlanche ng kanyang buod kasama ang midwife.",
                "start_ms": 4500,
                "end_ms": 10660
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Tinulungan siyang gawing mas malinaw ang tanong at alisin ang hinala.",
                "start_ms": 10960,
                "end_ms": 15360
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Iminungkahi niya ang isang mas madaling maintindihang paliwanag gamit ang impormasyong makukumpirma ng health team.",
                "start_ms": 15660,
                "end_ms": 22940
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Tinanong niya: “Sino po ang maaaring magpasya sa mungkahi, at kailan at paano ko malalaman ang tugon?”",
                "start_ms": 23240,
                "end_ms": 32200
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Napag-usapan nila ang lokal na susunod na hakbang.",
                "start_ms": 32500,
                "end_ms": 36020
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Hindi niya ipinangakong aprubado na ang mungkahi o na umabot na ito sa board.",
                "start_ms": 36320,
                "end_ms": 41360
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "Babalikan niya ang napagkasunduang contact at ipaaabot lamang sa mga residente ang nakumpirmang tugon.",
                "start_ms": 41660,
                "end_ms": 48340
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 7,
                "text": "Ito ang pagsasanay sa pagtukoy ng pagkakataon, pagtalakay ng ideya sa iba, at pagsunod sa napagkasunduang pagbabago.",
                "start_ms": 48640,
                "end_ms": 58360
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Magpraktis kasama ang team, alamin kung sino ang may pasya, at sundan ang napagkasunduang hakbang.",
                "start_ms": 58660,
                "end_ms": 65860
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "local-system-observation": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-local-system/local-system-observation.en.e2c1d3f988b3.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "e2c1d3f988b315637fcc1cf95ca0295b39124dd0a52d37f7710719209cc45c72",
            "sha256": "2e2006dada2601d378ca99a4c6876d5b825466f9589cffbaa29e23e89b1c0bb9",
            "duration_seconds": 55.38,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "A clear, careful observation",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 3160
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Vlanche prepares a short summary: “In conversations this week, residents have asked where to get current information about the health activity.",
                "start_ms": 3460,
                "end_ms": 13140
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "They have heard different information.",
                "start_ms": 13440,
                "end_ms": 16200
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "I have not yet confirmed the correct details.”",
                "start_ms": 16500,
                "end_ms": 19580
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "She separates what she actually heard from guesses about the cause.",
                "start_ms": 19880,
                "end_ms": 25240
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "This summary does not need names, diagnoses or other details that identify residents.",
                "start_ms": 25540,
                "end_ms": 32060
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "She does not put a private conversation in a public post.",
                "start_ms": 32360,
                "end_ms": 36560
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "Her question to the appropriate health-team contact is specific: “Who can confirm the information, and how can I share the suggestion to make the message clearer?”",
                "start_ms": 36860,
                "end_ms": 47740
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Share a sufficient factual observation, protect personal details, and ask a specific question.",
                "start_ms": 48040,
                "end_ms": 55320
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-local-system/local-system-observation.fil.2ff9c160f94b.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "2ff9c160f94bf971aad8d9689dda780592f35694adcb6abc40d3d10853703f77",
            "sha256": "2ac6f58f92a400bdf3f54231c7e552e0068a2167afb3d367f5adddc6fddadd3e",
            "duration_seconds": 61.466,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Obserbasyon na malinaw at may pag-iingat",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 3040
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Inihanda ni Vlanche ang isang maikling buod: “Sa mga usapan nitong linggo, may mga residenteng nagtatanong kung saan makukuha ang kasalukuyang impormasyon sa health activity.",
                "start_ms": 3340,
                "end_ms": 15460
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Magkaiba ang impormasyong narinig nila.",
                "start_ms": 15760,
                "end_ms": 18480
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Hindi ko pa nakukumpirma ang tamang detalye.”",
                "start_ms": 18780,
                "end_ms": 22100
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Inihiwalay niya ang aktuwal na narinig sa hinala tungkol sa dahilan.",
                "start_ms": 22400,
                "end_ms": 27160
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Para sa buod na ito, hindi kailangan ang pangalan, diagnosis o ibang detalye na makakakilala sa residente.",
                "start_ms": 27460,
                "end_ms": 37020
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Hindi niya ilalagay ang personal na usapan sa pampublikong post.",
                "start_ms": 37320,
                "end_ms": 41760
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "Tiyak ang tanong niya sa angkop na health-team contact: “Sino po ang makapagkukumpirma ng impormasyon, at paano ko maipapasa ang mungkahing gawing mas malinaw ang mensahe?”",
                "start_ms": 42060,
                "end_ms": 54380
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ibahagi ang sapat na obserbasyon, protektahan ang personal na detalye, at magtanong nang tiyak.",
                "start_ms": 54680,
                "end_ms": 61400
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "local-system-promotion": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-local-system/local-system-promotion.en.69f73450044c.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "69f73450044ca5de657612a30af02312d50dff0444c96691850f3a89410d6a86",
            "sha256": "71762d7b02623424d63cd31bca9b45d9b1555d0847b33af50bcce799ac76dbad",
            "duration_seconds": 60.447,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Health promotion that responds to the question",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 3240
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Recall Module 1: as a barangay-level Health Education and Promotion Officer, or HEPO, a BHW helps share accurate health information and encourage community participation.",
                "start_ms": 3540,
                "end_ms": 17220
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Intensified health promotion is one of the changes described in the manual.",
                "start_ms": 17520,
                "end_ms": 21920
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Instead of repeating an unconfirmed announcement, Vlanche asks the health team for current material and confirmation.",
                "start_ms": 22220,
                "end_ms": 31980
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "She uses a simple explanation suited to the residents’ questions and the language they understand.",
                "start_ms": 32280,
                "end_ms": 38800
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "She can say: “Let us first confirm the current information with the health team.”",
                "start_ms": 39100,
                "end_ms": 44620
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Once it is confirmed, she explains it, invites questions, and asks the resident to describe their understanding in their own words.",
                "start_ms": 44920,
                "end_ms": 54920
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Listen to the need, check the message, and check understanding.",
                "start_ms": 55220,
                "end_ms": 60380
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-local-system/local-system-promotion.fil.ac39546694ba.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "ac39546694ba70f5093d3713b8e63284f54ca70001b60df2004b524fbe1b38ab",
            "sha256": "6074aac64484df252214206192000c1d62bef693cc68cd1a6b233284655b6282",
            "duration_seconds": 65.097,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Health promotion na tumutugon sa tanong",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 3080
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Balikan ang Modyul 1: bilang barangay-level Health Education and Promotion Officer o HEPO, tumutulong ang BHW na maghatid ng tamang impormasyong pangkalusugan at hikayatin ang pakikilahok ng komunidad.",
                "start_ms": 3380,
                "end_ms": 19100
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Mas pinaigting na health promotion ang isa sa mga pagbabagong binanggit sa manwal.",
                "start_ms": 19400,
                "end_ms": 24840
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Sa halip na ulitin ang hindi pa tiyak na anunsiyo, hihingi si Vlanche ng kasalukuyang materyal at kumpirmasyon sa health team.",
                "start_ms": 25140,
                "end_ms": 33540
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Gagamit siya ng payak na paliwanag na angkop sa mga tanong at wikang naiintindihan ng residente.",
                "start_ms": 33840,
                "end_ms": 40400
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Maaari niyang sabihin: “Tiyakin muna natin sa health team ang kasalukuyang impormasyon.”",
                "start_ms": 40700,
                "end_ms": 47380
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Kapag nakumpirma na, ipaliliwanag niya ito, mag-aanyaya ng tanong, at hihilingin sa residente na sabihin sa sariling salita ang naunawaan.",
                "start_ms": 47680,
                "end_ms": 58240
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Makinig sa pangangailangan, tiyakin ang mensahe, at suriin kung naunawaan.",
                "start_ms": 58540,
                "end_ms": 65020
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "section-5": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-local-system/section-5.en.b5b0fa8343c4.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "b5b0fa8343c4b3dd7d52b75efbd8a9be8c0b26853db1e52d9179d5c201f97190",
            "sha256": "2f4333d1bf40abfd1b54bcedf6518d390476f68ba7a915046828b79a0bc85666",
            "duration_seconds": 59.141,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "A recurring question in the barangay",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2360
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "In this fictional situation, Mang Ernesto asks BHW Vlanche: “Where can we get accurate information about the barangay health activity?”",
                "start_ms": 2660,
                "end_ms": 12260
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Other residents are also confused by the different information they have heard.",
                "start_ms": 12560,
                "end_ms": 17680
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Vlanche listens.",
                "start_ms": 17980,
                "end_ms": 20260
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "She does not immediately blame anyone or announce a new policy.",
                "start_ms": 20560,
                "end_ms": 25680
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "She notices the recurring question and asks herself: “What have I actually observed, and who in the health team can confirm the information?”",
                "start_ms": 25980,
                "end_ms": 35460
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "The manual describes provincial and city health boards as partners in the local system, alongside stronger BHW skills and intensified health promotion.",
                "start_ms": 35760,
                "end_ms": 48120
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "Vlanche will identify her own contribution and its boundaries.",
                "start_ms": 48420,
                "end_ms": 53300
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Listen, identify the question, and find out who can confirm the information.",
                "start_ms": 53600,
                "end_ms": 59080
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-local-system/section-5.fil.4578531666d0.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "4578531666d0957d98e4ca5a94c456d16c316612f1518f20335f7129626a3f4d",
            "sha256": "ef5328807ded3158791961cb533e137fc782b8d3bc8fd9971016192d8e98a6eb",
            "duration_seconds": 60.5,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Paulit-ulit na tanong sa barangay",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2680
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Sa kathang-isip na sitwasyong ito, nagtanong si Mang Ernesto kay BHW Vlanche: “Saan po malalaman ang tamang impormasyon tungkol sa health activity sa barangay?”",
                "start_ms": 2980,
                "end_ms": 15020
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "May iba ring residenteng nalilito sa magkaibang impormasyong narinig nila.",
                "start_ms": 15320,
                "end_ms": 20200
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Nakinig si Vlanche.",
                "start_ms": 20500,
                "end_ms": 22500
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Hindi niya agad sinabi na mali ang isang tao o nagtakda ng bagong patakaran.",
                "start_ms": 22800,
                "end_ms": 27720
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Napansin niya ang paulit-ulit na tanong at naisip: “Ano ang malinaw kong naobserbahan, at sino sa health team ang makapagkukumpirma?”",
                "start_ms": 28020,
                "end_ms": 37300
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Ipinapakita ng manwal na kaagapay sa lokal na sistema ang provincial at city health boards, kasabay ng mas mataas na kasanayan ng BHW at mas pinaigting na health promotion.",
                "start_ms": 37600,
                "end_ms": 50000
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 6,
                "text": "Aalamin ni Vlanche ang sarili niyang ambag at hangganan.",
                "start_ms": 50300,
                "end_ms": 54100
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Makinig, tukuyin ang tanong, at alamin kung sino ang makapagkukumpirma.",
                "start_ms": 54400,
                "end_ms": 60440
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "uhc-primary-care": {
      "module": "02-uhc-act",
      "sections": {
        "bridge": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-primary-care/bridge.en.c1484fb7aee8.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "c1484fb7aee800e32f301351041a51e7e0ab719ef87048a93321f06f6cfa2b65",
            "sha256": "3ae42a3104d1b4d6d0682b48a1aff02a95ece9add44537288bf7a4022b47ba85",
            "duration_seconds": 49.58,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Four changes, one journey",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2800
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Last time, Mang Ernesto and BHW Vlanche learned that every Filipino citizen is automatically included in the National Health Insurance Program.",
                "start_ms": 3100,
                "end_ms": 13020
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "That is the first box in the UHC guide’s selected four-change chain: **PhilHealth inclusion, outpatient consultation, choosing a primary care provider, and a better referral system**.",
                "start_ms": 13320,
                "end_ms": 27120
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "The BHW Reference Manual lists more changes; this story follows these four.",
                "start_ms": 27420,
                "end_ms": 33260
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Now Mang Ernesto asks, ‘Where do I start, and what if I need another service?’",
                "start_ms": 33560,
                "end_ms": 39800
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Vlanche will not guess the answer for their barangay.",
                "start_ms": 40100,
                "end_ms": 43500
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Automatic PhilHealth inclusion is the starting point; three more changes shape the next step.",
                "start_ms": 43800,
                "end_ms": 49520
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-primary-care/bridge.fil.1064a5089723.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "1064a5089723cdc9115a95f6dc8095add56ade588c0a9ee1bac3d8e3964dcb94",
            "sha256": "36dd97c640bcd24fddf973c736e9b0a6c81cdf9e379dafc1d5f415f86415c326",
            "duration_seconds": 57.025,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Apat na pagbabago, isang paglalakbay",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 4000
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Noong huli, nalaman nina Mang Ernesto at BHW Vlanche na awtomatikong kasama ang bawat Pilipinong mamamayan sa National Health Insurance Program.",
                "start_ms": 4300,
                "end_ms": 15460
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Iyon ang unang kahon sa apat na pagbabagong pinili ng gabay sa UHC: **PhilHealth inclusion, outpatient consultation, pagpili ng primary care provider, at mas maayos na referral**.",
                "start_ms": 15760,
                "end_ms": 29120
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Marami pang pagbabagong nakalista sa BHW Reference Manual; itong apat ang sinusundan natin sa kuwento.",
                "start_ms": 29420,
                "end_ms": 36780
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Ngayon, ang tanong ni Mang Ernesto ay: ‘Saan ako magsisimula, at paano kung kailangan ko ng ibang serbisyo?’",
                "start_ms": 37080,
                "end_ms": 45800
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Hindi huhulaan ni Vlanche ang sagot para sa kanilang barangay.",
                "start_ms": 46100,
                "end_ms": 50020
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ang awtomatikong pagsama sa PhilHealth ang panimulang punto; tatlo pang hakbang ang kailangang unawain.",
                "start_ms": 50320,
                "end_ms": 56960
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "check": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-primary-care/check.en.4299fa387e60.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "4299fa387e60796f7508d83701c63a49bef0f98e56dd1480e58536aed8a662e6",
            "sha256": "a9c45f2179dbb96b134b3c8a6641804474ab2b521fc0a775db52e5e72c9fd09e",
            "duration_seconds": 21.629,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Choose the appropriate next step",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2320
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Mang Ernesto is unsure whether he has selected a primary care clinic.",
                "start_ms": 2620,
                "end_ms": 7900
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "He also asks where to go if a clinician recommends a referral.",
                "start_ms": 8200,
                "end_ms": 12640
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "What should Vlanche do now?",
                "start_ms": 12940,
                "end_ms": 15100
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Confirm the chosen clinic and local process; leave the referral decision to the clinician.",
                "start_ms": 15400,
                "end_ms": 21560
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-primary-care/check.fil.c3ca0436d4f9.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "c3ca0436d4f93c66161a293138bccb20f9d50303eaffb2cdab8959bf5a8c388d",
            "sha256": "68120273cdda3d3ab4c41fb7129dbc13259f4b87f1f68e762714af50589a52b0",
            "duration_seconds": 24.268,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Piliin ang angkop na susunod na hakbang",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2960
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Hindi pa alam ni Mang Ernesto kung may napili na siyang primary care clinic.",
                "start_ms": 3260,
                "end_ms": 7700
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Nagtanong din siya kung saan siya pupunta kung magrekomenda ng referral ang clinician.",
                "start_ms": 8000,
                "end_ms": 14280
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Ano ang dapat gawin ni Vlanche ngayon?",
                "start_ms": 14580,
                "end_ms": 17260
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Tiyakin ang napiling clinic at lokal na proseso; ipaubaya sa clinician ang referral decision.",
                "start_ms": 17560,
                "end_ms": 24200
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "local": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-primary-care/local.en.d898c9c492ae.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "d898c9c492ae014e794659c5ccff2bfc9024cab6c2295e4f53aa522917ae777c",
            "sha256": "4143ed478cdf79028824f52b7e021f87993ff606895077963204b96fae7fc4aa",
            "duration_seconds": 48.875,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Vlanche’s next step",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 1680
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Vlanche tells Mang Ernesto, ‘Let us first find out whether you have chosen a primary care clinic.",
                "start_ms": 1980,
                "end_ms": 9540
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "We will also ask the health team which outpatient benefit and steps apply to your consultation.",
                "start_ms": 9840,
                "end_ms": 15440
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "If a clinician says a referral is needed, we will get the local process and contact.’",
                "start_ms": 15740,
                "end_ms": 21100
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "On a small note, she writes the three things to confirm: **clinic and selection; benefit and how to use it; referral contact and instructions if needed**.",
                "start_ms": 21400,
                "end_ms": 32760
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "She does not promise that every service is already available in the barangay.",
                "start_ms": 33060,
                "end_ms": 38100
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "She takes unanswered questions to the midwife or RHU.",
                "start_ms": 38400,
                "end_ms": 42800
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ask, confirm local details, and help the resident take the next step.",
                "start_ms": 43100,
                "end_ms": 48820
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-primary-care/local.fil.7b5da29c63e6.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "7b5da29c63e627400a276a1272338f98576afc6779f732db1c67c0d33aff106c",
            "sha256": "b507e815fcf08605b22028041b25a53e191c26d616fea2df40e6f796073c4886",
            "duration_seconds": 54.674,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ang susunod na hakbang ni Vlanche",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2600
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Sinabi ni Vlanche kay Mang Ernesto: ‘Alamin muna natin kung may napili na kayong primary care clinic.",
                "start_ms": 2900,
                "end_ms": 10060
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Itatanong din natin sa health team kung anong outpatient benefit at hakbang ang naaangkop sa inyong konsultasyon.",
                "start_ms": 10360,
                "end_ms": 17720
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Kung sabihin ng clinician na kailangan ng referral, hihingin natin ang lokal na proseso at contact.’",
                "start_ms": 18020,
                "end_ms": 24540
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Sa isang maliit na tala, isinulat niya ang tatlong kailangang kumpirmahin: **clinic at pagpili; benepisyo at paraan ng paggamit; referral contact at tagubilin kung kailangan**.",
                "start_ms": 24840,
                "end_ms": 38000
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Hindi niya ipinangakong mayroon nang lahat ng serbisyo sa barangay.",
                "start_ms": 38300,
                "end_ms": 42300
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Ang mga hindi pa nasasagot ay dadalhin niya sa midwife o RHU.",
                "start_ms": 42600,
                "end_ms": 47320
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Magtanong, kumpirmahin ang lokal na detalye, at tulungan ang residente sa susunod na hakbang.",
                "start_ms": 47620,
                "end_ms": 54620
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "outpatient": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-primary-care/outpatient.en.f7da61ec8347.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "f7da61ec83477a1b6e98e5df56d4149d4985f675b8af52a0fae039cc2dcbb13c",
            "sha256": "8d22742155084d3e97f5544a08afef568fdfebe579f308a990dae800cc319d03",
            "duration_seconds": 45.793,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "What is an outpatient benefit?",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2600
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Outpatient care does not require hospital admission; a primary care consultation is one example.",
                "start_ms": 2900,
                "end_ms": 9420
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "PhilHealth’s current YAKAP primary care package covers specified services under its rules.",
                "start_ms": 9720,
                "end_ms": 16160
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "That does not mean every test, medicine, or consultation is available at any facility.",
                "start_ms": 16460,
                "end_ms": 23420
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Vlanche asks which service Mang Ernesto is seeking, then checks with PhilHealth or the health team whether it is covered, at which accredited clinic, and what steps apply.",
                "start_ms": 23720,
                "end_ms": 34840
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "A health professional decides the appropriate clinical care.",
                "start_ms": 35140,
                "end_ms": 39340
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Outpatient care is a benefit with rules; check the specific service and facility.",
                "start_ms": 39640,
                "end_ms": 45720
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-primary-care/outpatient.fil.c2514a8c4d9d.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "c2514a8c4d9d34b12c8b6f517a7f8c801529183b609ff4df0249f58442abfcfa",
            "sha256": "f3f0b3bc42ab18f496fb103239f497da8ed47856553391e5ae5b490d1a14fefb",
            "duration_seconds": 53.995,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ano ang outpatient benefit?",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2640
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ang outpatient ay pangangalagang hindi nangangailangan ng pagpapaospital, gaya ng konsultasyon sa primary care.",
                "start_ms": 2940,
                "end_ms": 10580
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Saklaw ng kasalukuyang PhilHealth YAKAP primary care package ang mga partikular na serbisyo sa ilalim ng mga tuntunin nito.",
                "start_ms": 10880,
                "end_ms": 19160
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Hindi ibig sabihin nito na makukuha ang bawat pagsusuri, gamot, o konsulta sa kahit anong pasilidad.",
                "start_ms": 19460,
                "end_ms": 27260
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Tatanungin ni Vlanche kung anong serbisyo ang kailangan ni Mang Ernesto at titiyakin sa PhilHealth o health team kung sakop ito, sa aling accredited clinic, at ano ang kailangang proseso.",
                "start_ms": 27560,
                "end_ms": 40680
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Ang health professional ang magtatakda ng angkop na klinikal na pangangalaga.",
                "start_ms": 40980,
                "end_ms": 45940
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Benepisyo ang outpatient care na may tuntunin; tiyakin ang partikular na serbisyo at pasilidad.",
                "start_ms": 46240,
                "end_ms": 53920
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "provider": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-primary-care/provider.en.cb8a9b338179.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "cb8a9b338179b40e37e4ec2bb1e018cc6376591cf4f778406a337e08e2b6d4e7",
            "sha256": "dffe208e062adb7536bfb8f1232109882d8129e4270cf5dba86bdf0943a18a68",
            "duration_seconds": 53.447,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Which primary care clinic was chosen?",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2720
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Under the UHC Act, every Filipino is to choose and register with a public or private primary care provider.",
                "start_ms": 3020,
                "end_ms": 11940
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "PhilHealth’s current rules provide a process for selecting an accredited YAKAP primary care clinic and completing a first patient encounter.",
                "start_ms": 12240,
                "end_ms": 20600
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Automatic PhilHealth inclusion does not mean a clinic has already been selected.",
                "start_ms": 20900,
                "end_ms": 26660
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Vlanche asks whether Mang Ernesto has chosen one; if he is unsure, she helps him ask the RHU, PhilHealth, or health team about current choices and how to select.",
                "start_ms": 26960,
                "end_ms": 39200
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Mang Ernesto chooses.",
                "start_ms": 39500,
                "end_ms": 41580
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 5,
                "text": "Vlanche does not choose for him or name a clinic she has not confirmed.",
                "start_ms": 41880,
                "end_ms": 47040
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Check whether a clinic was selected and how to choose; respect the resident’s choice.",
                "start_ms": 47340,
                "end_ms": 53380
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-primary-care/provider.fil.2dd0a182beae.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "2dd0a182beae5c63d1d22983d7080bbe0663bb6aac49a74609f5b237f24dd6fa",
            "sha256": "d8c6fadb5060dcbe5331bd86d55f2e7b5fcd29fb7b0b1c30fd6288c73ddd8a95",
            "duration_seconds": 58.175,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Alin ang napiling primary care clinic?",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2760
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Sa ilalim ng UHC Act, dapat makapili at makapagparehistro ang bawat Pilipino sa pampubliko o pribadong primary care provider.",
                "start_ms": 3060,
                "end_ms": 13500
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Sa kasalukuyang patakaran ng PhilHealth, may proseso para sa pagpili ng accredited YAKAP primary care clinic at unang patient encounter.",
                "start_ms": 13800,
                "end_ms": 23040
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Hindi awtomatikong ibig sabihin ng PhilHealth inclusion na napili na ang clinic.",
                "start_ms": 23340,
                "end_ms": 29140
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Itatanong ni Vlanche kung may napili na si Mang Ernesto; kung hindi niya alam, tutulungan siyang itanong sa RHU, PhilHealth, o health team ang mga kasalukuyang pagpipilian at paraan ng pagpili.",
                "start_ms": 29440,
                "end_ms": 42480
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Si Mang Ernesto ang pipili; hindi pipili si Vlanche para sa kanya at hindi magpapangalan ng clinic na hindi pa natiyak.",
                "start_ms": 42780,
                "end_ms": 50940
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Tiyakin kung may napiling clinic at paano makapipili; igalang ang pagpili ng residente.",
                "start_ms": 51240,
                "end_ms": 58120
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "referral": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-primary-care/referral.en.807dd357cbe5.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "807dd357cbe50877e09d9275c4a073c8f7c4bbcb5935b662d113413686ba1439",
            "sha256": "479b47bd8fa596e452c972e159969dfaa50d2af58fa799e52e97b512a83b838b",
            "duration_seconds": 46.315,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Who decides on a referral?",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2120
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "UHC aims to connect services better, including reorganizing previously separate health programs and improving movement between levels of care.",
                "start_ms": 2420,
                "end_ms": 12340
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Local governments may have their own referral protocols.",
                "start_ms": 12640,
                "end_ms": 16360
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "A doctor, nurse, or midwife guides the patient and decides the clinical need and appropriate referral.",
                "start_ms": 16660,
                "end_ms": 23340
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Vlanche’s role is to ask them for the current local contact, communication method, and instructions for the resident.",
                "start_ms": 23640,
                "end_ms": 31640
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "She does not decide which condition needs hospital care or which facility will receive the patient.",
                "start_ms": 31940,
                "end_ms": 38180
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "A health professional makes clinical referral decisions; the BHW supports the local instructions.",
                "start_ms": 38480,
                "end_ms": 46240
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/02-uhc-act/uhc-primary-care/referral.fil.1d2b59c3eb31.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "1d2b59c3eb31904837bb2ece28921111a73e04e4f0a125a654a3815780025ae4",
            "sha256": "269de458838269acc758099fda4ee93be9effe245397d1a633bf9a8cfdd5dac1",
            "duration_seconds": 56.372,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Sino ang nagpapasya sa referral?",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2480
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Layunin ng UHC ang mas magkakaugnay na serbisyo, kabilang ang pag-aayos ng dating hiwa-hiwalay na mga programang pangkalusugan at mas maayos na paglipat sa ibang antas ng pangangalaga.",
                "start_ms": 2780,
                "end_ms": 15380
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Ngunit maaaring may sariling referral protocol ang lokal na pamahalaan.",
                "start_ms": 15680,
                "end_ms": 21240
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Ang doktor, nurse, o midwife ang gagabay sa pasyente at magpapasya sa klinikal na pangangailangan at angkop na pagre-refer.",
                "start_ms": 21540,
                "end_ms": 30660
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Ang tungkulin ni Vlanche ay alamin sa kanila ang kasalukuyang lokal na contact, paraan ng pakikipag-ugnayan, at tagubilin para sa residente.",
                "start_ms": 30960,
                "end_ms": 40040
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 4,
                "text": "Hindi siya magpapasya kung anong kondisyon ang dapat dalhin sa ospital o kung saang pasilidad ito tatanggapin.",
                "start_ms": 40340,
                "end_ms": 47420
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ang health professional ang nagpapasya sa klinikal na referral; ang BHW ay umaalalay ayon sa lokal na tagubilin.",
                "start_ms": 47720,
                "end_ms": 56320
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ulasimang-bato": {
      "module": "chapter2/05-medicinal-plants",
      "sections": {
        "action": {
          "en": {
