                  "end_ms": 5688
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "There is a separate qualification for BHW Eligibility under the Civil Service Commission.",
                  "start_ms": 5688,
                  "end_ms": 12288
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Four conditions are required: accredited by the local health board; completed a minimum of two (2) years of college; actively and voluntarily serving continuously for five (5) years or more; and having a satisfactory service record as an accredited BHW in the community.",
                  "start_ms": 12288,
                  "end_ms": 31392
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "This is not the same thing as general accreditation — it asks for more, and it is for BHWs who want official eligibility in the civil service.",
                  "start_ms": 31392,
                  "end_ms": 41808
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "BHWE needs four conditions — accreditation, two years of college, five years of continuous service, and a satisfactory record. Missing even one means it isn't met yet.",
                  "start_ms": 41808,
                  "end_ms": 55608
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-eligibility/section-4.fil.b745906b23da.mp3",
              "voice": "fil-PH-BlessicaNeural",
              "content_hash": "b745906b23dab5b6f01fd907ade98fac7123897eebdbbc51792c29794ac1a0b4",
              "sha256": "0d3b8d394629b3ba582ee979fa5ed9b61b2926cdf8aaac0bbe38ee7bd630aaa6",
              "duration_seconds": 55.632,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang BHW Eligibility (BHWE) sa Civil Service",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 5184
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "May hiwalay na kwalipikasyon para sa BHW Eligibility sa ilalim ng Civil Service Commission.",
                  "start_ms": 5184,
                  "end_ms": 11856
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Apat na kondisyon ang kailangan: akreditado ng local health board; nakatapos ng minimum na dalawang (2) taon sa kolehiyo; aktibo at boluntaryong naglilingkod nang tuloy-tuloy sa loob ng limang (5) taon o higit pa; at may satisfactory service bilang accredited BHW sa komunidad.",
                  "start_ms": 11856,
                  "end_ms": 30480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Hindi ito parehong bagay sa pangkalahatang akreditasyon — mas mataas ang hinihingi nito, at para ito sa mga BHW na nais magkaroon ng opisyal na eligibility sa serbisyo sibil.",
                  "start_ms": 30480,
                  "end_ms": 42024
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Apat na kondisyon ang kailangan sa BHWE — akreditasyon, dalawang taon sa kolehiyo, limang taon ng tuloy-tuloy na serbisyo, at satisfactory service. Kulang ang isa, hindi pa ito matutugunan.",
                  "start_ms": 42024,
                  "end_ms": 55632
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "module": "04-ra7883",
        "sections": {
          "bhwe-application-check": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-eligibility/bhwe-application-check.en.2256997127b1.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "2256997127b10697fd89c2ee9b77c12764ab2686f85425ddb1e7287f26d6de5f",
              "sha256": "b0da820707db768147f1211a753ab11fe10d6eca458b814676f637ac7e3f80e5",
              "duration_seconds": 40.542,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose a careful explanation",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Fictional Card A reports eight years of service but only three years under accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 2660,
                  "end_ms": 9060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Which explanation is best?",
                  "start_ms": 9360,
                  "end_ms": 11840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Connect the count to accredited status, check education and the other service conditions, and form a specific CSC question.",
                  "start_ms": 12140,
                  "end_ms": 21460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Demi should promise neither BHWE nor a job.",
                  "start_ms": 21760,
                  "end_ms": 26680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "After choosing, read the reasons for all three answers and explain to a partner what needs verification.",
                  "start_ms": 26980,
                  "end_ms": 34340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Explain conditions and evidence, then verify with CSC.",
                  "start_ms": 34640,
                  "end_ms": 40480
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-eligibility/bhwe-application-check.fil.6a7358ba3748.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "6a7358ba3748df6a80805160d6b67d650774347f824dbb27195844fa6352c69f",
              "sha256": "75762cb30c08452efe7d483b3b6ad3cd051134896da62092fff3198e936a309b",
              "duration_seconds": 44.513,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang maingat na paliwanag",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Sinabi sa kathang-isip na Card A na walong taon na ang serbisyo at tatlong taon pa lamang ang accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 3060,
                  "end_ms": 10820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Aling paliwanag ang pinakamainam?",
                  "start_ms": 11120,
                  "end_ms": 14400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Iugnay ang bilang sa accredited status, suriin ang edukasyon at iba pang service conditions, at bumuo ng tiyak na tanong sa CSC.",
                  "start_ms": 14700,
                  "end_ms": 23620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Hindi dapat mangako si Demi ng BHWE o trabaho.",
                  "start_ms": 23920,
                  "end_ms": 29160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Pagkatapos pumili, basahin ang dahilan para sa lahat ng tatlong sagot at ipaliwanag sa kapareha kung ano ang dapat tiyakin.",
                  "start_ms": 29460,
                  "end_ms": 38860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ipaliwanag ang kondisyon at ebidensiya, saka tiyakin sa CSC.",
                  "start_ms": 39160,
                  "end_ms": 44440
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "bhwe-question": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-eligibility/bhwe-question.en.ccebf4e77f16.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "ccebf4e77f166efaf3cfb5076c736dd3f5a1edfa0e893da32bfe8bd4d3ac028f",
              "sha256": "91535175a0afeb33348c14ded73dee1abdc2932607f9b18dbb5690a8436fed59",
              "duration_seconds": 39.262,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Demi's question",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Demi hears that accreditation or long BHW service automatically brings BHWE and a government job.",
                  "start_ms": 2620,
                  "end_ms": 12300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "She asks, ‘Are accreditation, civil service eligibility and appointment the same?’",
                  "start_ms": 12600,
                  "end_ms": 19440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "They are different.",
                  "start_ms": 19740,
                  "end_ms": 21420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "This is a fictional situation; Demi's education and qualifying service are not established.",
                  "start_ms": 21720,
                  "end_ms": 28360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "First understand the conditions and evidence before making a promise.",
                  "start_ms": 28660,
                  "end_ms": 33300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Accreditation, BHWE approval and appointment are different.",
                  "start_ms": 33600,
                  "end_ms": 39200
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-eligibility/bhwe-question.fil.c1bc7e73a262.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "c1bc7e73a262d8602cb13a2180121e781c487481af8f8f8322b7cea318196884",
              "sha256": "362fb276e59091c0d40c74289c4337025b3d44da287a64de088e2a0ead358487",
              "duration_seconds": 39.549,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tanong ni Demi",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "May narinig si Demi: kapag accredited o matagal nang BHW, may BHWE at trabaho na raw agad.",
                  "start_ms": 1820,
                  "end_ms": 11420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Nagtanong siya, ‘Pareho ba ang akreditasyon, civil service eligibility at appointment?’",
                  "start_ms": 11720,
                  "end_ms": 18520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Magkakaibang bagay ang mga ito.",
                  "start_ms": 18820,
                  "end_ms": 21340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Kathang-isip ang sitwasyon; hindi pa natin alam ang edukasyon o qualifying service ni Demi.",
                  "start_ms": 21640,
                  "end_ms": 28000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Unawain muna ang mga kondisyon at ebidensiya bago gumawa ng pangako.",
                  "start_ms": 28300,
                  "end_ms": 33620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Magkaiba ang akreditasyon, BHWE approval at appointment.",
                  "start_ms": 33920,
                  "end_ms": 39480
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "bhwe-verification": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-eligibility/bhwe-verification.en.f0d27a0c7131.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "f0d27a0c71310e3b559aa982948e186b573bd3a467ff3e71af798fcd017da30e",
              "sha256": "21c3ab0b13f10322b77483eddc693ccfa9ad98e97bc044c634fafce354400535",
              "duration_seconds": 55.536,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A specific question for CSC",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Using a blank planning sheet, Demi asks, ‘For this fictional record, which accredited-service period and education and service evidence should be verified, including the JO/COS arrangement?’",
                  "start_ms": 3580,
                  "end_ms": 19340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "The RHU and Local Health Board help identify records and contacts; they do not replace CSC approval.",
                  "start_ms": 19640,
                  "end_ms": 27680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ask the CSC Regional or Field Office with jurisdiction over the barangay of service.",
                  "start_ms": 27980,
                  "end_ms": 34140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "BHWE takes effect on approval by the responsible CSC Regional Office.",
                  "start_ms": 34440,
                  "end_ms": 41080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Confirm current documentary and form guidance there; this practice submits no actual application or private record.",
                  "start_ms": 41380,
                  "end_ms": 49340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Connect the question to records, conditions and the proper CSC office.",
                  "start_ms": 49640,
                  "end_ms": 55480
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-eligibility/bhwe-verification.fil.6672b25a27c6.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "6672b25a27c6a71903881c8fb6c14ff2a36a6f6ed2cc9db0ef818df0c0117ff5",
              "sha256": "896b97ab205fec27a3c86de9b02ab94f6c80e73fd08133f31460d82c98d8bfa0",
              "duration_seconds": 57.783,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Isang tiyak na tanong sa CSC",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Gumawa si Demi ng tanong gamit ang blankong planning sheet: ‘Para sa kathang-isip na record na ito, aling panahon ng accredited service at anong education at service evidence ang dapat tiyakin, kasama ang JO/COS arrangement?’",
                  "start_ms": 2940,
                  "end_ms": 21860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Tumutulong ang RHU at Local Health Board sa records at contact; hindi nila pinapalitan ang CSC approval.",
                  "start_ms": 22160,
                  "end_ms": 29240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Magtanong sa CSC Regional o Field Office na may sakop sa barangay ng serbisyo.",
                  "start_ms": 29540,
                  "end_ms": 35300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ang effectivity ng BHWE ay nakabatay sa approval ng kaukulang CSC Regional Office.",
                  "start_ms": 35600,
                  "end_ms": 42520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Tiyakin doon ang kasalukuyang documentary at form guidance; walang tunay na application o pribadong record na isusumite sa practice na ito.",
                  "start_ms": 42820,
                  "end_ms": 51820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Iugnay ang tanong sa record, kondisyon at tamang CSC office.",
                  "start_ms": 52120,
                  "end_ms": 57720
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "evidence-and-scope": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-eligibility/evidence-and-scope.en.eb3242833134.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "eb324283313454bcbc1fc7e378ca422c5ec8299b034fcc68554b8e2c33a53c7a",
              "sha256": "b2450bb259910d576c990deab3f5e79d3db0454751b3dc2e134183fd1f5e9d06",
              "duration_seconds": 74.58,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "One label is not enough",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The two college years must lead toward a degree.",
                  "start_ms": 3020,
                  "end_ms": 6940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Voluntary BHW service means no salary or compensation except honorarium throughout the five-year service period.",
                  "start_ms": 7240,
                  "end_ms": 17040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "CSC clarifies no government appointment or salary from government plantilla payroll; meal and transport allowances are excluded from salary/compensation.",
                  "start_ms": 17340,
                  "end_ms": 29420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "A Job Order or Contract of Service worker may still qualify; the label alone proves neither qualification nor disqualification.",
                  "start_ms": 29720,
                  "end_ms": 40000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Verify the actual arrangement and all conditions with CSC.",
                  "start_ms": 40300,
                  "end_ms": 44940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "BHWE is appropriate for first-level positions with exceptions: TESDA trade-test positions, positions requiring licenses, stenographer positions, and board-exam or special-law positions.",
                  "start_ms": 45240,
                  "end_ms": 60720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "It is not a professional license or an appointment guarantee; a position also has other qualification requirements.",
                  "start_ms": 61020,
                  "end_ms": 69740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Check evidence and scope; do not decide from a label alone.",
                  "start_ms": 70040,
                  "end_ms": 74520
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-eligibility/evidence-and-scope.fil.5f0b5df3be44.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "5f0b5df3be44b06b705fe4278f0a381dba61c3cfd1b9b932242daa4acda140c3",
              "sha256": "ba53fc181fa90e2d25aff354f106795119a0b69d8ffb2f8432b4809a6c48da63",
              "duration_seconds": 72.542,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Hindi sapat ang isang label",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Dapat tungo sa degree ang dalawang taon sa kolehiyo.",
                  "start_ms": 3020,
                  "end_ms": 6580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sa buong limang-taong service period, voluntary ang BHW service: walang salary/compensation maliban sa honorarium.",
                  "start_ms": 6880,
                  "end_ms": 15920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Nililinaw ng CSC ang kawalan ng government appointment at salary mula sa government plantilla payroll; hindi kabilang sa salary/compensation ang meal at transport allowances.",
                  "start_ms": 16220,
                  "end_ms": 28580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Maaaring maging kwalipikado pa rin ang nasa Job Order o Contract of Service; hindi sapat ang label para sabihing pasado o disqualified.",
                  "start_ms": 28880,
                  "end_ms": 37880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Tiyakin ang aktuwal na arrangement at lahat ng kondisyon sa CSC.",
                  "start_ms": 38180,
                  "end_ms": 43020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ang BHWE ay para sa naaangkop na first-level positions, may mga exception: TESDA trade-test positions, mga nangangailangan ng license, stenographer positions, at board-exam o special-law positions.",
                  "start_ms": 43320,
                  "end_ms": 59320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Hindi ito professional license o garantiya ng appointment; may iba pang qualification requirements ang posisyon.",
                  "start_ms": 59620,
                  "end_ms": 67300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Suriin ang ebidensiya at saklaw; huwag magpasya batay sa label lamang.",
                  "start_ms": 67600,
                  "end_ms": 72480
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-4": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-eligibility/section-4.en.6c14f7da5fe8.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "6c14f7da5fe8c2a190331d0fbfe4999fb44d629098e47fe1b0b0d145177d7a03",
              "sha256": "2f497b7f62a7ae214df88ae0dfcf669b0f11e504499b5b6eff64672fdfb8dc92",
              "duration_seconds": 69.538,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "BHWE conditions",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "RA 7883 section 6(d) provides the statutory basis for second-grade eligibility after five years of continuous service.",
                  "start_ms": 3260,
                  "end_ms": 15180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "CSC implementing conditions are more detailed.",
                  "start_ms": 15480,
                  "end_ms": 19320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Use these four teaching groups: Local Health Board accreditation; at least two years of college education leading to a degree; at least five years of continuous, active, full-time voluntary service as an accredited BHW; and a satisfactory service record.",
                  "start_ms": 19620,
                  "end_ms": 42260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Accreditation must precede the qualifying service.",
                  "start_ms": 42560,
                  "end_ms": 46320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Service before 20 February 1995 is not counted.",
                  "start_ms": 46620,
                  "end_ms": 51180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Accreditation alone is insufficient: applicable conditions must be met and supported by evidence, and CSC decides the application.",
                  "start_ms": 51480,
                  "end_ms": 60560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Verify accreditation, education, qualifying service and a satisfactory record.",
                  "start_ms": 60860,
                  "end_ms": 69460
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-eligibility/section-4.fil.2dcc5bce3636.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "2dcc5bce36365dfbeed5e231cae7d2825962983b9221a6f756e0222e27de4023",
              "sha256": "b80ff04f41f97891d7654c40527bc3895df4c054262d8cfc545a421a4aa9a65b",
              "duration_seconds": 72.96,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Mga kondisyon ng BHWE",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang seksiyon 6(d) ng RA 7883 ay nagbibigay ng batayan para sa second-grade eligibility matapos ang limang taong tuloy-tuloy na serbisyo.",
                  "start_ms": 3580,
                  "end_ms": 15420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "May mas detalyadong implementing conditions ang CSC.",
                  "start_ms": 15720,
                  "end_ms": 19840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Gamitin ang apat na pangkat na ito: akreditasyon ng Local Health Board; hindi bababa sa dalawang taon sa kolehiyo tungo sa isang degree; hindi bababa sa limang taong tuloy-tuloy, aktibo, full-time at boluntaryong serbisyo bilang accredited BHW; at satisfactory service record.",
                  "start_ms": 20140,
                  "end_ms": 42460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Dapat accredited na bago magsimula ang qualifying service.",
                  "start_ms": 42760,
                  "end_ms": 47160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Hindi binibilang ang serbisyo bago ang 20 Pebrero 1995.",
                  "start_ms": 47460,
                  "end_ms": 54060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Hindi sapat ang akreditasyon lamang; kailangang matugunan at mapatunayan ang naaangkop na kondisyon, at CSC ang nagpapasya sa application.",
                  "start_ms": 54360,
                  "end_ms": 64680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tiyakin ang akreditasyon, edukasyon, qualifying service at satisfactory record.",
                  "start_ms": 64980,
                  "end_ms": 72900
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "service-count": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-eligibility/service-count.en.77dec67ecd61.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "77dec67ecd61edbd8a16cade3933f8a415a624937349d8b99f4c9954b3e063b1",
              "sha256": "6c74d9f51ce93006c4de1d55a14f92aa3780df8b5771340b9928b29c91a98836",
              "duration_seconds": 56.111,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Which service can be counted?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "All service in these fictional cards is after 20 February 1995.",
                  "start_ms": 2420,
                  "end_ms": 8380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Card A has eight years of total service but only three under accredited status; the first five years before accreditation cannot be included.",
                  "start_ms": 8680,
                  "end_ms": 20160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Card B reports five years of continuous, active, full-time, voluntary and satisfactory service while already accredited, plus school evidence of two college years leading to a degree.",
                  "start_ms": 20460,
                  "end_ms": 35420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "B supports checking the conditions, but it is not CSC approval.",
                  "start_ms": 35720,
                  "end_ms": 40280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Unclear dates, an interruption or missing records require a CSC question, not an invented ruling.",
                  "start_ms": 40580,
                  "end_ms": 49020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Total service and qualifying accredited service are not always the same.",
                  "start_ms": 49320,
                  "end_ms": 56040
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-eligibility/service-count.fil.df122545f599.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "df122545f59941c30091b56fb953f99bacfdc4f9d8f19b75a1130fc6c8c50532",
              "sha256": "fb1e541b3bb46ca041b7a0c9ff48bb292c6cf747da47d5301afa1297d0fc0457",
              "duration_seconds": 60.212,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Aling serbisyo ang mabibilang?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Lahat ng serbisyo sa mga kathang-isip na card na ito ay matapos ang 20 Pebrero 1995.",
                  "start_ms": 2620,
                  "end_ms": 12460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sa Card A, walong taon ang kabuuang serbisyo ngunit tatlo lamang ang nasa accredited status; hindi maisasama ang unang limang taon bago ang akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 12760,
                  "end_ms": 24320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Sa Card B, may limang taong tuloy-tuloy, aktibo, full-time, boluntaryo at satisfactory na serbisyo habang accredited na, at school evidence para sa dalawang taon sa kolehiyo tungo sa degree.",
                  "start_ms": 24620,
                  "end_ms": 39860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "May batayan para suriin ang mga kondisyon sa B, ngunit hindi ito CSC approval.",
                  "start_ms": 40160,
                  "end_ms": 45760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Kung malabo ang petsa, may interruption o kulang ang record, magtanong sa CSC; huwag hulaan ang ruling.",
                  "start_ms": 46060,
                  "end_ms": 54180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Kabuuang serbisyo at qualifying accredited service ay hindi laging pareho.",
                  "start_ms": 54480,
                  "end_ms": 60160
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "bhw-accreditation": [
      {
        "module": "04-ra7883",
        "sections": {
          "section-5": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/section-5.en.be4c59ec599f.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "be4c59ec599f569ff3ec1ea374ddb71e563ed0a1d5cb99a93166f68b80a722fb",
              "sha256": "4042d6ef0808ca3ccb5444562eb04142aedccacc2d1d6d77df53e8b4c0f48bef",
              "duration_seconds": 73.326,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Who makes up the accreditation process",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The local health board does not simply grant accreditation on a whim — it carries a set of responsibilities under Section 5 of the RA 7883 IRR: safeguard the registration and accreditation process, evaluate applications, record decisions in a board resolution or meeting minutes, issue certificates of registration or accreditation, review and approve any benefit that would use local funds, recommend benefits and fund appropriation, provide an official copy of the BHW registry to the DOH, and monitor the service registered BHWs provide.",
                  "start_ms": 3460,
                  "end_ms": 46500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "The local health board may also create a BHW Registration and Accreditation Committee to evaluate applications, interview applicants, recommend action to the board, and keep the BHW registry updated.",
                  "start_ms": 46800,
                  "end_ms": 62560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Accreditation isn't decided by one person alone — it runs through a system, with assigned responsibility and a registry that's kept up to date.",
                  "start_ms": 62860,
                  "end_ms": 73260
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/section-5.fil.08886de82378.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "08886de82378477abf6592592ebc053ac98e9e88ef7b436aad32f7d851f0a870",
              "sha256": "4752451000df07ff28e301415c7b2f626d980ace74007cf1cd38cd8a1713c80d",
              "duration_seconds": 81.816,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Kung sino ang bumubuo sa proseso ng akreditasyon",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 4120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Hindi basta-basta pumapayag ang local health board sa akreditasyon — may hanay ng responsibilidad ito ayon sa Section 5 ng RA 7883 IRR: pangalagaan ang proseso ng rehistrasyon at akreditasyon, suriin ang mga aplikasyon, itala ang desisyon sa isang board resolution o minutes ng pulong, maglabas ng certificate of registration o accreditation, suriin at aprubahan ang bawat benepisyong gagamit ng pondong lokal, magrekomenda ng benepisyo at pondo, magbigay ng opisyal na kopya ng BHW registry sa DOH, at bantayan ang serbisyong ibinibigay ng mga rehistradong BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 4420,
                  "end_ms": 51780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Maaari ring lumikha ang local health board ng isang BHW Registration and Accreditation Committee na susuri ng mga aplikasyon, kakapanayamin ang mga aplikante, magrerekomenda sa local health board, at mag-uupdate ng BHW registry.",
                  "start_ms": 52080,
                  "end_ms": 71160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Hindi iisang tao lang ang nagpapasya sa akreditasyon — may sistema ito, may itinalagang responsibilidad, at may talaang pinapanatili.",
                  "start_ms": 71460,
                  "end_ms": 81740
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "module": "04-ra7883",
        "sections": {
          "accreditation-application-check": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-application-check.en.7629c6df5b3d.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "7629c6df5b3d90c04ff8a988c93cf7684e7d4aeae0869369fcb4de4d9ae0b474",
              "sha256": "5eed7464ff6cf87b968ed7b9154912e044a5bd2f176d510963ff76531b7a7cf2",
              "duration_seconds": 46.524,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose the supported explanation",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Return to Card B: there is a committee recommendation, but no verified official decision.",
                  "start_ms": 2940,
                  "end_ms": 9980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "What should Demi explain?",
                  "start_ms": 10280,
                  "end_ms": 12080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Distinguish the recommendation from the board’s decision, name the missing information, and choose a question about the process and official record.",
                  "start_ms": 12380,
                  "end_ms": 21540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "A training certificate, BHWE or job title does not replace accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 21840,
                  "end_ms": 29040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Choose an answer, then read the reasons for all options.",
                  "start_ms": 29340,
                  "end_ms": 33580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Completing the online lesson is separate from observed competency and does not grant accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 33880,
                  "end_ms": 40760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Explain the roles, identify the gap and verify the official decision.",
                  "start_ms": 41060,
                  "end_ms": 46460
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-application-check.fil.22c9b4f22e26.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "22c9b4f22e26669cd959e623b49d223b6952904936ae1bf00cb73579e618a00d",
              "sha256": "ac516d170002c9343f5398226217668a371ce0bfbc8fdaf7040ba7a5883768f4",
              "duration_seconds": 49.737,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang tamang paliwanag",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Balikan ang Card B: may rekomendasyon ng komite, ngunit wala pang natiyak na opisyal na pasya.",
                  "start_ms": 2540,
                  "end_ms": 8940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ano ang dapat ipaliwanag ni Demi?",
                  "start_ms": 9240,
                  "end_ms": 11560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ihiwalay ang rekomendasyon sa pasya ng board, sabihin ang kulang na impormasyon, at pumili ng tanong na magpapalinaw sa proseso at opisyal na tala.",
                  "start_ms": 11860,
                  "end_ms": 22420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Hindi ipinapalit ang training certificate, BHWE o job title sa akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 22720,
                  "end_ms": 30080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Piliin ang sagot, saka basahin ang dahilan para sa lahat ng pagpipilian.",
                  "start_ms": 30380,
                  "end_ms": 35580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ang pagkumpleto sa online lesson ay hiwalay sa obserbasyon ng kasanayan at hindi nagbibigay ng akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 35880,
                  "end_ms": 43320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ipaliwanag ang mga papel, tukuyin ang kulang at tiyakin ang opisyal na pasya.",
                  "start_ms": 43620,
                  "end_ms": 49660
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "accreditation-follow-up": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-follow-up.en.0448219b69d2.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "0448219b69d250eeef22bed8f8d12d821cdc2c7c9d7cc0843a5ea2e2ecb1cda7",
              "sha256": "9e07d0c448a47e0fa0130a1d877dc804bdbbf9d06badd6b87a9d8918af53551e",
              "duration_seconds": 52.767,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A question about the process",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Demi chooses Card B.",
                  "start_ms": 2460,
                  "end_ms": 4700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "On a blank planning sheet, she writes: ‘For this example with a committee recommendation, which office can confirm whether the local health board has made an official decision, where can it be verified, and what is the next step if none has been made?’",
                  "start_ms": 5000,
                  "end_ms": 19600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "The question names the process, known fact, missing information and proper contact.",
                  "start_ms": 19900,
                  "end_ms": 26620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ask the locally confirmed RHU, municipal or city health office, or board contact for current guidance.",
                  "start_ms": 26920,
                  "end_ms": 35200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "This practice submits no actual application or private documents.",
                  "start_ms": 35500,
                  "end_ms": 40140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Proof of registration, proof of accreditation and a training certificate should not be treated as interchangeable.",
                  "start_ms": 40440,
                  "end_ms": 47360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Connect the question to the process, known fact and official record.",
                  "start_ms": 47660,
                  "end_ms": 52700
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-follow-up.fil.3948a718eb8a.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "3948a718eb8a8d2e900a8c340a798a7f24798a040253ca6ab9b800050a4c9d06",
              "sha256": "1609881257b7e21061887a8d18ccd6a4579605b7642bb3eb96fe9a6b35cca59c",
              "duration_seconds": 59.638,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Isang tanong tungkol sa proseso",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pinili ni Demi ang Card B.",
                  "start_ms": 2580,
                  "end_ms": 5020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sa blankong planning sheet, isinulat niya: ‘Para sa halimbawang may rekomendasyon ng komite, aling tanggapan ang makapagsasabi kung may opisyal na pasya na ang local health board, saan ito matitiyak, at ano ang susunod na hakbang kung wala pa?’",
                  "start_ms": 5320,
                  "end_ms": 20800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Tiyak ang tanong: pangalan ng proseso, alam na detalye, kulang na impormasyon at tamang contact.",
                  "start_ms": 21100,
                  "end_ms": 30100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Makipag-ugnayan sa locally confirmed na RHU, municipal o city health office, o board contact para sa kasalukuyang gabay.",
                  "start_ms": 30400,
                  "end_ms": 39640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Walang tunay na aplikasyon o pribadong dokumentong isusumite sa pagsasanay.",
                  "start_ms": 39940,
                  "end_ms": 44900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ang katibayan ng rehistrasyon, katibayan ng akreditasyon at training certificate ay hindi dapat ipagpalit sa isa’t isa.",
                  "start_ms": 45200,
                  "end_ms": 53840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Iugnay ang tanong sa proseso, alam na detalye at opisyal na tala.",
                  "start_ms": 54140,
                  "end_ms": 59580
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "accreditation-question": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-question.en.13b00d2cd085.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "13b00d2cd0854c312904f1edeec366479cb4d04096bd511aacf08dabb18d02d7",
              "sha256": "0fcf29c8a70d8e5d93d919b64bbaaa0ae9e422f5318c590a4af9db1fe55b5d1a",
              "duration_seconds": 46.08,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Demi’s question",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Demi prepares a question about registration and accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 1780,
                  "end_ms": 6300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "‘Who reviews an application, and how can I verify the official decision?’",
                  "start_ms": 6600,
                  "end_ms": 11880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "This is a fictional situation; we have not established that Demi has an application, registration or accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 12180,
                  "end_ms": 19740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "RA 7883 places accreditation with the local health board under DOH guidelines.",
                  "start_ms": 20040,
                  "end_ms": 27440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Registration and accreditation are related but distinct steps.",
                  "start_ms": 27740,
                  "end_ms": 32380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Asking a question, attending training or holding a title does not prove that the process is complete.",
                  "start_ms": 32680,
                  "end_ms": 40280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Understand the roles and verify the decision; do not assume status.",
                  "start_ms": 40580,
                  "end_ms": 46020
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-question.fil.bfd4694d4783.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "bfd4694d47837234ae2f89bc555cafeb6f10ec301be91f5b322b034913d1a1a9",
              "sha256": "87f791d2602a71855a66acc4d0394cedfffde751459ab30e99728633b4ba1bab",
              "duration_seconds": 50.495,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tanong ni Demi",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Naghahanda si Demi ng tanong tungkol sa rehistrasyon at akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 1660,
                  "end_ms": 6700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "‘Sino ang tumitingin sa aplikasyon, at paano ko matitiyak ang opisyal na pasya?’",
                  "start_ms": 7000,
                  "end_ms": 12680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Kathang-isip ang sitwasyong ito; hindi pa natin alam kung may aplikasyon, rehistrasyon o akreditasyon si Demi.",
                  "start_ms": 12980,
                  "end_ms": 21460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Sa RA 7883, nakaugnay ang akreditasyon sa local health board, ayon sa gabay ng DOH.",
                  "start_ms": 21760,
                  "end_ms": 29920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Magkaugnay ngunit magkaibang hakbang ang rehistrasyon at akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 30220,
                  "end_ms": 35700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ang pagtatanong, pagdalo sa pagsasanay o pagkakaroon ng titulo ay hindi patunay na tapos na ang proseso.",
                  "start_ms": 36000,
                  "end_ms": 43960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Unawain ang tungkulin at tiyakin ang pasya; huwag ipagpalagay ang status.",
                  "start_ms": 44260,
                  "end_ms": 50420
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "fictional-process-cards": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/fictional-process-cards.en.840b9d7f8cf0.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "840b9d7f8cf067511fe1e997cda462ccab86cb575996e2cba56c784a3bb8c5d0",
              "sha256": "b783f96148cb4dbd6479d727c027e6931cbe54d0952b2bf3e3ff1b8ca35379d0",
              "duration_seconds": 51.461,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "What is known and missing?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Demi uses three fictional practice cards.",
                  "start_ms": 2500,
                  "end_ms": 5540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "A has only a training certificate; it does not prove accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 5840,
                  "end_ms": 11120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "B has a committee recommendation but no verified board decision.",
                  "start_ms": 11420,
                  "end_ms": 17540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "C mentions a board resolution, but its process, scope and verification contact remain unclear.",
                  "start_ms": 17840,
                  "end_ms": 26240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "None of the cards decides a person’s status.",
                  "start_ms": 26540,
                  "end_ms": 29660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Match each known fact to the missing information: what is the next step for A, is there an official decision for B, and which official record should be checked for C?",
                  "start_ms": 29960,
                  "end_ms": 40680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Do not invent a local form, fee, deadline or result.",
                  "start_ms": 40980,
                  "end_ms": 45820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Separate known facts from what needs verification; do not guess approval.",
                  "start_ms": 46120,
                  "end_ms": 51400
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/fictional-process-cards.fil.5c8de306e4f2.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "5c8de306e4f23eacbfd932997f52f638b70b1d2e565bcaeee2f880c6441ed5e2",
              "sha256": "3bd110ba0843960a78b8b77aed37c6ed7b59e71adae03f197fde5264071100fb",
              "duration_seconds": 59.429,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ano ang alam at kulang?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tatlong kathang-isip na practice card ang ginagamit ni Demi.",
                  "start_ms": 2940,
                  "end_ms": 7060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sa A, may training certificate lamang; hindi nito pinatutunayan ang akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 7360,
                  "end_ms": 14000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Sa B, may rekomendasyon ng komite ngunit walang natiyak na pasya ng board.",
                  "start_ms": 14300,
                  "end_ms": 20020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Sa C, may binanggit na board resolution ngunit hindi pa natiyak kung para sa anong proseso, sino ang saklaw at saan ito makukumpirma.",
                  "start_ms": 20320,
                  "end_ms": 29880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Walang card na nagpapasya sa status ng tao.",
                  "start_ms": 30180,
                  "end_ms": 34180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Itapat ang bawat alam na detalye sa kulang na impormasyon: anong susunod na hakbang sa A, may opisyal na pasya na ba sa B, at aling opisyal na tala ang dapat tiyakin sa C?",
                  "start_ms": 34480,
                  "end_ms": 47600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Huwag mag-imbento ng lokal na form, bayad, deadline o resulta.",
                  "start_ms": 47900,
                  "end_ms": 53620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ihiwalay ang alam na detalye sa kailangang tiyakin; walang hulang approval.",
                  "start_ms": 53920,
                  "end_ms": 59360
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "roles-and-records": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/roles-and-records.en.6dcdc61d3504.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "6dcdc61d3504d55a9fcdc2aea62a38cf1273b9cf1ad1c122ab83aa285f6688cd",
              "sha256": "1aadbdfe1d71a643143b3a69444bce14bbf8c7c1b5f4851ea82cb5b8ecd7a70a",
              "duration_seconds": 54.674,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Recommendation or decision?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Compare the two roles.",
                  "start_ms": 2940,
                  "end_ms": 4660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "A committee helps screen applications and recommend action; the board is responsible for acting and officially recording its decision.",
                  "start_ms": 4960,
                  "end_ms": 14200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "The circular encourages municipal and city health boards to create a committee.",
                  "start_ms": 14500,
                  "end_ms": 19740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "If none exists yet or creation is pending, the board remains responsible for facilitating registration and accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 20040,
                  "end_ms": 28280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Find out the actual local arrangement rather than assume every locality has the same committee and office.",
                  "start_ms": 28580,
                  "end_ms": 35260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "The RHU or municipal or city health office can help identify the proper contact.",
                  "start_ms": 35560,
                  "end_ms": 42080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Their assistance, an interview or a training certificate does not replace an official decision.",
                  "start_ms": 42380,
                  "end_ms": 49460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Verify who assists and where the board’s decision is recorded.",
                  "start_ms": 49760,
                  "end_ms": 54600
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/roles-and-records.fil.cb4e0c6b4df9.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "cb4e0c6b4df9f9cb454cac3f322527e2a9d7e7af38a74d5666a402bf27bbdef6",
              "sha256": "df8a500686ecc4a3ddcd06693a00f5623f10307c518c0e5acc809591f7993f6c",
              "duration_seconds": 57.913,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Rekomendasyon o pasya?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ihambing ang dalawang papel.",
                  "start_ms": 2500,
                  "end_ms": 4980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Tumutulong ang komite sa pagsusuri at rekomendasyon; pananagutan ng board ang pag-aksiyon at opisyal na pagtatala ng pasya.",
                  "start_ms": 5280,
                  "end_ms": 15200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Hinihikayat ng circular ang mga municipal at city health board na bumuo ng komite.",
                  "start_ms": 15500,
                  "end_ms": 21380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Kapag wala pa nito o habang binubuo ito, nananatili sa board ang tungkuling padaliin ang rehistrasyon at akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 21680,
                  "end_ms": 29800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Kaya dapat alamin ang aktuwal na lokal na ayos, sa halip na ipagpalagay na pare-pareho ang komite at opisina sa lahat ng lugar.",
                  "start_ms": 30100,
                  "end_ms": 39300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Makapagtuturo ng tamang contact ang RHU o municipal o city health office.",
                  "start_ms": 39600,
                  "end_ms": 45840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Hindi sila, isang panayam, o isang training certificate ang kapalit ng opisyal na pasya.",
                  "start_ms": 46140,
                  "end_ms": 52900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tiyakin kung sino ang tumutulong at saan nakatala ang pasya ng board.",
                  "start_ms": 53200,
                  "end_ms": 57840
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-5": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/section-5.en.04768183e365.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "04768183e3658a00d2c740c1cdc01cd1c2afe6adf078515ad73ceae3ac04ace9",
              "sha256": "70e81bc8f45cb275749d8826681f8f53c5f9fbebd27d24fc48b1d08e610db754",
              "duration_seconds": 72.856,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Responsibilities in the process",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The local health board has specific responsibilities.",
                  "start_ms": 2700,
                  "end_ms": 6780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "The joint DILG and DOH circular issued in 2023 lists its duties: safeguard registration and accreditation; evaluate and act on applications; record decisions in a board resolution or meeting minutes; issue certificates to qualified BHWs; review and approve benefits using local funds; recommend benefits and fund allocation; provide a copy of the BHW registry to DOH; and monitor services.",
                  "start_ms": 7080,
                  "end_ms": 38920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "An accreditation decision and review of a benefit using local funds are different decisions.",
                  "start_ms": 39220,
                  "end_ms": 45820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "The board may also create a BHW Registration and Accreditation Committee.",
                  "start_ms": 46120,
                  "end_ms": 51280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "The facilitator guide describes screening, interviews, recommendations to the board and registry preparation as supporting committee tasks.",
                  "start_ms": 51580,
                  "end_ms": 61700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "A recommendation alone is not the board’s official decision.",
                  "start_ms": 62000,
                  "end_ms": 66200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The board is responsible; the committee assists and decisions have official records.",
                  "start_ms": 66500,
                  "end_ms": 72780
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/section-5.fil.62489f505b2d.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "62489f505b2d46a2354b7f6afa361a7df73941e77dbf44542687210622967bbd",
              "sha256": "6c816b9dd1fd903fd02be6894fb3a41203218b378b851a5f8ecbc6125f3b561c",
              "duration_seconds": 77.009,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tungkulin sa proseso",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "May tiyak na pananagutan ang local health board.",
                  "start_ms": 2300,
                  "end_ms": 5740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Inililista ng magkasanib na circular ng DILG at DOH noong 2023 ang mga tungkulin nito: pangalagaan ang proseso ng rehistrasyon at akreditasyon; suriin at aksiyunan ang mga aplikasyon; itala ang pasya sa board resolution o minutes ng pulong; maglabas ng sertipiko sa mga kwalipikadong BHW; suriin at aprubahan ang mga benepisyong gagamit ng pondong lokal; magrekomenda ng benepisyo at paglalaan ng pondo; magbigay ng kopya ng BHW registry sa DOH; at subaybayan ang serbisyo.",
                  "start_ms": 6040,
                  "end_ms": 41240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Magkaiba ang pasya sa akreditasyon at pagsusuri ng benepisyong may lokal na pondo.",
                  "start_ms": 41540,
                  "end_ms": 47900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Maaari ring bumuo ang board ng BHW Registration and Accreditation Committee.",
                  "start_ms": 48200,
                  "end_ms": 54240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Inilalarawan ng facilitator guide ang pagsusuri, panayam, rekomendasyon sa board at pag-aayos ng registry bilang mga tungkuling pantulong ng komite.",
                  "start_ms": 54540,
                  "end_ms": 65740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Hindi katumbas ng opisyal na pasya ng board ang rekomendasyon lamang.",
                  "start_ms": 66040,
                  "end_ms": 70560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "May pananagutan ang board; pantulong ang komite at may opisyal na tala ang pasya.",
                  "start_ms": 70860,
                  "end_ms": 76940
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "module": "04-ra7883",
        "sections": {
          "accreditation-application-check": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-application-check.en.7629c6df5b3d.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "7629c6df5b3d90c04ff8a988c93cf7684e7d4aeae0869369fcb4de4d9ae0b474",
              "sha256": "5eed7464ff6cf87b968ed7b9154912e044a5bd2f176d510963ff76531b7a7cf2",
              "duration_seconds": 46.524,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose the supported explanation",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Return to Card B: there is a committee recommendation, but no verified official decision.",
                  "start_ms": 2940,
                  "end_ms": 9980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "What should Demi explain?",
                  "start_ms": 10280,
                  "end_ms": 12080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Distinguish the recommendation from the board’s decision, name the missing information, and choose a question about the process and official record.",
                  "start_ms": 12380,
                  "end_ms": 21540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "A training certificate, BHWE or job title does not replace accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 21840,
                  "end_ms": 29040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Choose an answer, then read the reasons for all options.",
                  "start_ms": 29340,
                  "end_ms": 33580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Completing the online lesson is separate from observed competency and does not grant accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 33880,
                  "end_ms": 40760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Explain the roles, identify the gap and verify the official decision.",
                  "start_ms": 41060,
                  "end_ms": 46460
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-application-check.fil.22c9b4f22e26.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "22c9b4f22e26669cd959e623b49d223b6952904936ae1bf00cb73579e618a00d",
              "sha256": "ac516d170002c9343f5398226217668a371ce0bfbc8fdaf7040ba7a5883768f4",
              "duration_seconds": 49.737,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang tamang paliwanag",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Balikan ang Card B: may rekomendasyon ng komite, ngunit wala pang natiyak na opisyal na pasya.",
                  "start_ms": 2540,
                  "end_ms": 8940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ano ang dapat ipaliwanag ni Demi?",
                  "start_ms": 9240,
                  "end_ms": 11560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ihiwalay ang rekomendasyon sa pasya ng board, sabihin ang kulang na impormasyon, at pumili ng tanong na magpapalinaw sa proseso at opisyal na tala.",
                  "start_ms": 11860,
                  "end_ms": 22420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Hindi ipinapalit ang training certificate, BHWE o job title sa akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 22720,
                  "end_ms": 30080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Piliin ang sagot, saka basahin ang dahilan para sa lahat ng pagpipilian.",
                  "start_ms": 30380,
                  "end_ms": 35580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ang pagkumpleto sa online lesson ay hiwalay sa obserbasyon ng kasanayan at hindi nagbibigay ng akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 35880,
                  "end_ms": 43320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ipaliwanag ang mga papel, tukuyin ang kulang at tiyakin ang opisyal na pasya.",
                  "start_ms": 43620,
                  "end_ms": 49660
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "accreditation-follow-up": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-follow-up.en.0448219b69d2.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "0448219b69d250eeef22bed8f8d12d821cdc2c7c9d7cc0843a5ea2e2ecb1cda7",
              "sha256": "9e07d0c448a47e0fa0130a1d877dc804bdbbf9d06badd6b87a9d8918af53551e",
              "duration_seconds": 52.767,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A question about the process",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Demi chooses Card B.",
                  "start_ms": 2460,
                  "end_ms": 4700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "On a blank planning sheet, she writes: ‘For this example with a committee recommendation, which office can confirm whether the local health board has made an official decision, where can it be verified, and what is the next step if none has been made?’",
                  "start_ms": 5000,
                  "end_ms": 19600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "The question names the process, known fact, missing information and proper contact.",
                  "start_ms": 19900,
                  "end_ms": 26620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ask the locally confirmed RHU, municipal or city health office, or board contact for current guidance.",
                  "start_ms": 26920,
                  "end_ms": 35200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "This practice submits no actual application or private documents.",
                  "start_ms": 35500,
                  "end_ms": 40140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Proof of registration, proof of accreditation and a training certificate should not be treated as interchangeable.",
                  "start_ms": 40440,
                  "end_ms": 47360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Connect the question to the process, known fact and official record.",
                  "start_ms": 47660,
                  "end_ms": 52700
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-follow-up.fil.3948a718eb8a.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "3948a718eb8a8d2e900a8c340a798a7f24798a040253ca6ab9b800050a4c9d06",
              "sha256": "1609881257b7e21061887a8d18ccd6a4579605b7642bb3eb96fe9a6b35cca59c",
              "duration_seconds": 59.638,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Isang tanong tungkol sa proseso",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pinili ni Demi ang Card B.",
                  "start_ms": 2580,
                  "end_ms": 5020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sa blankong planning sheet, isinulat niya: ‘Para sa halimbawang may rekomendasyon ng komite, aling tanggapan ang makapagsasabi kung may opisyal na pasya na ang local health board, saan ito matitiyak, at ano ang susunod na hakbang kung wala pa?’",
                  "start_ms": 5320,
                  "end_ms": 20800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Tiyak ang tanong: pangalan ng proseso, alam na detalye, kulang na impormasyon at tamang contact.",
                  "start_ms": 21100,
                  "end_ms": 30100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Makipag-ugnayan sa locally confirmed na RHU, municipal o city health office, o board contact para sa kasalukuyang gabay.",
                  "start_ms": 30400,
                  "end_ms": 39640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Walang tunay na aplikasyon o pribadong dokumentong isusumite sa pagsasanay.",
                  "start_ms": 39940,
                  "end_ms": 44900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ang katibayan ng rehistrasyon, katibayan ng akreditasyon at training certificate ay hindi dapat ipagpalit sa isa’t isa.",
                  "start_ms": 45200,
                  "end_ms": 53840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Iugnay ang tanong sa proseso, alam na detalye at opisyal na tala.",
                  "start_ms": 54140,
                  "end_ms": 59580
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "accreditation-question": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-question.en.13b00d2cd085.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "13b00d2cd0854c312904f1edeec366479cb4d04096bd511aacf08dabb18d02d7",
              "sha256": "0fcf29c8a70d8e5d93d919b64bbaaa0ae9e422f5318c590a4af9db1fe55b5d1a",
              "duration_seconds": 46.08,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Demi’s question",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Demi prepares a question about registration and accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 1780,
                  "end_ms": 6300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "‘Who reviews an application, and how can I verify the official decision?’",
                  "start_ms": 6600,
                  "end_ms": 11880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "This is a fictional situation; we have not established that Demi has an application, registration or accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 12180,
                  "end_ms": 19740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "RA 7883 places accreditation with the local health board under DOH guidelines.",
                  "start_ms": 20040,
                  "end_ms": 27440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Registration and accreditation are related but distinct steps.",
                  "start_ms": 27740,
                  "end_ms": 32380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Asking a question, attending training or holding a title does not prove that the process is complete.",
                  "start_ms": 32680,
                  "end_ms": 40280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Understand the roles and verify the decision; do not assume status.",
                  "start_ms": 40580,
                  "end_ms": 46020
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-question.fil.bfd4694d4783.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "bfd4694d47837234ae2f89bc555cafeb6f10ec301be91f5b322b034913d1a1a9",
              "sha256": "87f791d2602a71855a66acc4d0394cedfffde751459ab30e99728633b4ba1bab",
              "duration_seconds": 50.495,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tanong ni Demi",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Naghahanda si Demi ng tanong tungkol sa rehistrasyon at akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 1660,
                  "end_ms": 6700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "‘Sino ang tumitingin sa aplikasyon, at paano ko matitiyak ang opisyal na pasya?’",
                  "start_ms": 7000,
                  "end_ms": 12680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Kathang-isip ang sitwasyong ito; hindi pa natin alam kung may aplikasyon, rehistrasyon o akreditasyon si Demi.",
                  "start_ms": 12980,
                  "end_ms": 21460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Sa RA 7883, nakaugnay ang akreditasyon sa local health board, ayon sa gabay ng DOH.",
                  "start_ms": 21760,
                  "end_ms": 29920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Magkaugnay ngunit magkaibang hakbang ang rehistrasyon at akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 30220,
                  "end_ms": 35700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ang pagtatanong, pagdalo sa pagsasanay o pagkakaroon ng titulo ay hindi patunay na tapos na ang proseso.",
                  "start_ms": 36000,
                  "end_ms": 43960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Unawain ang tungkulin at tiyakin ang pasya; huwag ipagpalagay ang status.",
                  "start_ms": 44260,
                  "end_ms": 50420
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "fictional-process-cards": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/fictional-process-cards.en.840b9d7f8cf0.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "840b9d7f8cf067511fe1e997cda462ccab86cb575996e2cba56c784a3bb8c5d0",
              "sha256": "b783f96148cb4dbd6479d727c027e6931cbe54d0952b2bf3e3ff1b8ca35379d0",
              "duration_seconds": 51.461,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "What is known and missing?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Demi uses three fictional practice cards.",
                  "start_ms": 2500,
                  "end_ms": 5540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "A has only a training certificate; it does not prove accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 5840,
                  "end_ms": 11120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "B has a committee recommendation but no verified board decision.",
                  "start_ms": 11420,
                  "end_ms": 17540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "C mentions a board resolution, but its process, scope and verification contact remain unclear.",
                  "start_ms": 17840,
                  "end_ms": 26240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "None of the cards decides a person’s status.",
                  "start_ms": 26540,
                  "end_ms": 29660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Match each known fact to the missing information: what is the next step for A, is there an official decision for B, and which official record should be checked for C?",
                  "start_ms": 29960,
                  "end_ms": 40680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Do not invent a local form, fee, deadline or result.",
                  "start_ms": 40980,
                  "end_ms": 45820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Separate known facts from what needs verification; do not guess approval.",
                  "start_ms": 46120,
                  "end_ms": 51400
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/fictional-process-cards.fil.5c8de306e4f2.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "5c8de306e4f23eacbfd932997f52f638b70b1d2e565bcaeee2f880c6441ed5e2",
              "sha256": "3bd110ba0843960a78b8b77aed37c6ed7b59e71adae03f197fde5264071100fb",
              "duration_seconds": 59.429,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ano ang alam at kulang?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tatlong kathang-isip na practice card ang ginagamit ni Demi.",
                  "start_ms": 2940,
                  "end_ms": 7060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sa A, may training certificate lamang; hindi nito pinatutunayan ang akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 7360,
                  "end_ms": 14000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Sa B, may rekomendasyon ng komite ngunit walang natiyak na pasya ng board.",
                  "start_ms": 14300,
                  "end_ms": 20020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Sa C, may binanggit na board resolution ngunit hindi pa natiyak kung para sa anong proseso, sino ang saklaw at saan ito makukumpirma.",
                  "start_ms": 20320,
                  "end_ms": 29880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Walang card na nagpapasya sa status ng tao.",
                  "start_ms": 30180,
                  "end_ms": 34180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Itapat ang bawat alam na detalye sa kulang na impormasyon: anong susunod na hakbang sa A, may opisyal na pasya na ba sa B, at aling opisyal na tala ang dapat tiyakin sa C?",
                  "start_ms": 34480,
                  "end_ms": 47600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Huwag mag-imbento ng lokal na form, bayad, deadline o resulta.",
                  "start_ms": 47900,
                  "end_ms": 53620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ihiwalay ang alam na detalye sa kailangang tiyakin; walang hulang approval.",
                  "start_ms": 53920,
                  "end_ms": 59360
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "roles-and-records": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/roles-and-records.en.6dcdc61d3504.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "6dcdc61d3504d55a9fcdc2aea62a38cf1273b9cf1ad1c122ab83aa285f6688cd",
              "sha256": "1aadbdfe1d71a643143b3a69444bce14bbf8c7c1b5f4851ea82cb5b8ecd7a70a",
              "duration_seconds": 54.674,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Recommendation or decision?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Compare the two roles.",
                  "start_ms": 2940,
                  "end_ms": 4660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "A committee helps screen applications and recommend action; the board is responsible for acting and officially recording its decision.",
                  "start_ms": 4960,
                  "end_ms": 14200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "The circular encourages municipal and city health boards to create a committee.",
                  "start_ms": 14500,
                  "end_ms": 19740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "If none exists yet or creation is pending, the board remains responsible for facilitating registration and accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 20040,
                  "end_ms": 28280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Find out the actual local arrangement rather than assume every locality has the same committee and office.",
                  "start_ms": 28580,
                  "end_ms": 35260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "The RHU or municipal or city health office can help identify the proper contact.",
                  "start_ms": 35560,
                  "end_ms": 42080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Their assistance, an interview or a training certificate does not replace an official decision.",
                  "start_ms": 42380,
                  "end_ms": 49460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Verify who assists and where the board’s decision is recorded.",
                  "start_ms": 49760,
                  "end_ms": 54600
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/roles-and-records.fil.af8e730e444f.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "af8e730e444ff939602283728e95067cd97f81b9fe96abfeb6a05d854c9173d4",
              "sha256": "d59d505508779e733951882de1b6a25c277d5983b698ab531fea9231d563821a",
              "duration_seconds": 58.462,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Rekomendasyon o pasya?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ihambing ang dalawang papel.",
                  "start_ms": 2660,
                  "end_ms": 5140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Tumutulong ang komite sa pagsusuri at rekomendasyon; pananagutan ng board ang pag-aksiyon at opisyal na pagtatala ng pasya.",
                  "start_ms": 5440,
                  "end_ms": 14360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Hinihikayat ng circular ang mga municipal at city health board na bumuo ng komite.",
                  "start_ms": 14660,
                  "end_ms": 20980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Kapag wala pa nito o habang binubuo ito, nananatili sa board ang tungkuling padaliin ang rehistrasyon at akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 21280,
                  "end_ms": 30480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Kaya dapat alamin ang aktuwal na lokal na ayos, sa halip na ipagpalagay na pare-pareho ang komite at opisina sa lahat ng lugar.",
                  "start_ms": 30780,
                  "end_ms": 40180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Makapagtuturo ng tamang contact ang RHU o municipal o city health office.",
                  "start_ms": 40480,
                  "end_ms": 46000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Hindi kapalit ng opisyal na pasya ang kanilang tulong, isang panayam o isang training certificate.",
                  "start_ms": 46300,
                  "end_ms": 53220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tiyakin kung sino ang tumutulong at saan nakatala ang pasya ng board.",
                  "start_ms": 53520,
                  "end_ms": 58400
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-5": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/section-5.en.04768183e365.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "04768183e3658a00d2c740c1cdc01cd1c2afe6adf078515ad73ceae3ac04ace9",
              "sha256": "70e81bc8f45cb275749d8826681f8f53c5f9fbebd27d24fc48b1d08e610db754",
              "duration_seconds": 72.856,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Responsibilities in the process",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The local health board has specific responsibilities.",
                  "start_ms": 2700,
                  "end_ms": 6780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "The joint DILG and DOH circular issued in 2023 lists its duties: safeguard registration and accreditation; evaluate and act on applications; record decisions in a board resolution or meeting minutes; issue certificates to qualified BHWs; review and approve benefits using local funds; recommend benefits and fund allocation; provide a copy of the BHW registry to DOH; and monitor services.",
                  "start_ms": 7080,
                  "end_ms": 38920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "An accreditation decision and review of a benefit using local funds are different decisions.",
                  "start_ms": 39220,
                  "end_ms": 45820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "The board may also create a BHW Registration and Accreditation Committee.",
                  "start_ms": 46120,
                  "end_ms": 51280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "The facilitator guide describes screening, interviews, recommendations to the board and registry preparation as supporting committee tasks.",
                  "start_ms": 51580,
                  "end_ms": 61700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "A recommendation alone is not the board’s official decision.",
                  "start_ms": 62000,
                  "end_ms": 66200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The board is responsible; the committee assists and decisions have official records.",
                  "start_ms": 66500,
                  "end_ms": 72780
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/section-5.fil.62489f505b2d.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "62489f505b2d46a2354b7f6afa361a7df73941e77dbf44542687210622967bbd",
              "sha256": "6c816b9dd1fd903fd02be6894fb3a41203218b378b851a5f8ecbc6125f3b561c",
              "duration_seconds": 77.009,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tungkulin sa proseso",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "May tiyak na pananagutan ang local health board.",
                  "start_ms": 2300,
                  "end_ms": 5740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Inililista ng magkasanib na circular ng DILG at DOH noong 2023 ang mga tungkulin nito: pangalagaan ang proseso ng rehistrasyon at akreditasyon; suriin at aksiyunan ang mga aplikasyon; itala ang pasya sa board resolution o minutes ng pulong; maglabas ng sertipiko sa mga kwalipikadong BHW; suriin at aprubahan ang mga benepisyong gagamit ng pondong lokal; magrekomenda ng benepisyo at paglalaan ng pondo; magbigay ng kopya ng BHW registry sa DOH; at subaybayan ang serbisyo.",
                  "start_ms": 6040,
                  "end_ms": 41240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Magkaiba ang pasya sa akreditasyon at pagsusuri ng benepisyong may lokal na pondo.",
                  "start_ms": 41540,
                  "end_ms": 47900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Maaari ring bumuo ang board ng BHW Registration and Accreditation Committee.",
                  "start_ms": 48200,
                  "end_ms": 54240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Inilalarawan ng facilitator guide ang pagsusuri, panayam, rekomendasyon sa board at pag-aayos ng registry bilang mga tungkuling pantulong ng komite.",
                  "start_ms": 54540,
                  "end_ms": 65740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Hindi katumbas ng opisyal na pasya ng board ang rekomendasyon lamang.",
                  "start_ms": 66040,
                  "end_ms": 70560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "May pananagutan ang board; pantulong ang komite at may opisyal na tala ang pasya.",
                  "start_ms": 70860,
                  "end_ms": 76940
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "module": "04-ra7883",
        "sections": {
          "accreditation-application-check": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-application-check.en.7629c6df5b3d.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "7629c6df5b3d90c04ff8a988c93cf7684e7d4aeae0869369fcb4de4d9ae0b474",
              "sha256": "5eed7464ff6cf87b968ed7b9154912e044a5bd2f176d510963ff76531b7a7cf2",
              "duration_seconds": 46.524,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose the supported explanation",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Return to Card B: there is a committee recommendation, but no verified official decision.",
                  "start_ms": 2940,
                  "end_ms": 9980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "What should Demi explain?",
                  "start_ms": 10280,
                  "end_ms": 12080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Distinguish the recommendation from the board’s decision, name the missing information, and choose a question about the process and official record.",
                  "start_ms": 12380,
                  "end_ms": 21540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "A training certificate, BHWE or job title does not replace accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 21840,
                  "end_ms": 29040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Choose an answer, then read the reasons for all options.",
                  "start_ms": 29340,
                  "end_ms": 33580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Completing the online lesson is separate from observed competency and does not grant accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 33880,
                  "end_ms": 40760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Explain the roles, identify the gap and verify the official decision.",
                  "start_ms": 41060,
                  "end_ms": 46460
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-application-check.fil.13e8dc534e39.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "13e8dc534e39c53318ba144010282a0304a90e40d3378372f63fde96eb6d0405",
              "sha256": "3349ac10bc8f14714acb224350fd22145680df3960e1d8278819dbf42c667714",
              "duration_seconds": 51.566,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang tamang paliwanag",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Balikan ang Card B: may rekomendasyon ng komite, ngunit wala pang natiyak na opisyal na pasya.",
                  "start_ms": 2940,
                  "end_ms": 10620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ano ang dapat ipaliwanag ni Demi?",
                  "start_ms": 10920,
                  "end_ms": 13360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ihiwalay ang rekomendasyon sa pasya ng board, sabihin ang kulang na impormasyon, at pumili ng tanong na magpapalinaw sa proseso at opisyal na tala.",
                  "start_ms": 13660,
                  "end_ms": 24340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Hindi ipinapalit ang training certificate, BHWE o job title sa akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 24640,
                  "end_ms": 31680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Piliin ang sagot, saka basahin ang dahilan para sa lahat ng pagpipilian.",
                  "start_ms": 31980,
                  "end_ms": 37660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ang pagkumpleto sa online lesson ay hiwalay sa obserbasyon ng kasanayan at hindi nagbibigay ng akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 37960,
                  "end_ms": 45480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ipaliwanag ang mga papel, tukuyin ang kulang at tiyakin ang opisyal na pasya.",
                  "start_ms": 45780,
                  "end_ms": 51500
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "accreditation-follow-up": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-follow-up.en.0448219b69d2.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "0448219b69d250eeef22bed8f8d12d821cdc2c7c9d7cc0843a5ea2e2ecb1cda7",
              "sha256": "9e07d0c448a47e0fa0130a1d877dc804bdbbf9d06badd6b87a9d8918af53551e",
              "duration_seconds": 52.767,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A question about the process",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Demi chooses Card B.",
                  "start_ms": 2460,
                  "end_ms": 4700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "On a blank planning sheet, she writes: ‘For this example with a committee recommendation, which office can confirm whether the local health board has made an official decision, where can it be verified, and what is the next step if none has been made?’",
                  "start_ms": 5000,
                  "end_ms": 19600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "The question names the process, known fact, missing information and proper contact.",
                  "start_ms": 19900,
                  "end_ms": 26620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ask the locally confirmed RHU, municipal or city health office, or board contact for current guidance.",
                  "start_ms": 26920,
                  "end_ms": 35200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "This practice submits no actual application or private documents.",
                  "start_ms": 35500,
                  "end_ms": 40140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Proof of registration, proof of accreditation and a training certificate should not be treated as interchangeable.",
                  "start_ms": 40440,
                  "end_ms": 47360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Connect the question to the process, known fact and official record.",
                  "start_ms": 47660,
                  "end_ms": 52700
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-follow-up.fil.3948a718eb8a.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "3948a718eb8a8d2e900a8c340a798a7f24798a040253ca6ab9b800050a4c9d06",
              "sha256": "1609881257b7e21061887a8d18ccd6a4579605b7642bb3eb96fe9a6b35cca59c",
              "duration_seconds": 59.638,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Isang tanong tungkol sa proseso",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pinili ni Demi ang Card B.",
                  "start_ms": 2580,
                  "end_ms": 5020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sa blankong planning sheet, isinulat niya: ‘Para sa halimbawang may rekomendasyon ng komite, aling tanggapan ang makapagsasabi kung may opisyal na pasya na ang local health board, saan ito matitiyak, at ano ang susunod na hakbang kung wala pa?’",
                  "start_ms": 5320,
                  "end_ms": 20800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Tiyak ang tanong: pangalan ng proseso, alam na detalye, kulang na impormasyon at tamang contact.",
                  "start_ms": 21100,
                  "end_ms": 30100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Makipag-ugnayan sa locally confirmed na RHU, municipal o city health office, o board contact para sa kasalukuyang gabay.",
                  "start_ms": 30400,
                  "end_ms": 39640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Walang tunay na aplikasyon o pribadong dokumentong isusumite sa pagsasanay.",
                  "start_ms": 39940,
                  "end_ms": 44900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ang katibayan ng rehistrasyon, katibayan ng akreditasyon at training certificate ay hindi dapat ipagpalit sa isa’t isa.",
                  "start_ms": 45200,
                  "end_ms": 53840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Iugnay ang tanong sa proseso, alam na detalye at opisyal na tala.",
                  "start_ms": 54140,
                  "end_ms": 59580
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "accreditation-question": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-question.en.13b00d2cd085.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "13b00d2cd0854c312904f1edeec366479cb4d04096bd511aacf08dabb18d02d7",
              "sha256": "0fcf29c8a70d8e5d93d919b64bbaaa0ae9e422f5318c590a4af9db1fe55b5d1a",
              "duration_seconds": 46.08,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Demi’s question",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Demi prepares a question about registration and accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 1780,
                  "end_ms": 6300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "‘Who reviews an application, and how can I verify the official decision?’",
                  "start_ms": 6600,
                  "end_ms": 11880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "This is a fictional situation; we have not established that Demi has an application, registration or accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 12180,
                  "end_ms": 19740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "RA 7883 places accreditation with the local health board under DOH guidelines.",
                  "start_ms": 20040,
                  "end_ms": 27440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Registration and accreditation are related but distinct steps.",
                  "start_ms": 27740,
                  "end_ms": 32380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Asking a question, attending training or holding a title does not prove that the process is complete.",
                  "start_ms": 32680,
                  "end_ms": 40280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Understand the roles and verify the decision; do not assume status.",
                  "start_ms": 40580,
                  "end_ms": 46020
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-question.fil.bfd4694d4783.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "bfd4694d47837234ae2f89bc555cafeb6f10ec301be91f5b322b034913d1a1a9",
              "sha256": "87f791d2602a71855a66acc4d0394cedfffde751459ab30e99728633b4ba1bab",
              "duration_seconds": 50.495,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tanong ni Demi",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Naghahanda si Demi ng tanong tungkol sa rehistrasyon at akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 1660,
                  "end_ms": 6700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "‘Sino ang tumitingin sa aplikasyon, at paano ko matitiyak ang opisyal na pasya?’",
                  "start_ms": 7000,
                  "end_ms": 12680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Kathang-isip ang sitwasyong ito; hindi pa natin alam kung may aplikasyon, rehistrasyon o akreditasyon si Demi.",
                  "start_ms": 12980,
                  "end_ms": 21460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Sa RA 7883, nakaugnay ang akreditasyon sa local health board, ayon sa gabay ng DOH.",
                  "start_ms": 21760,
                  "end_ms": 29920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Magkaugnay ngunit magkaibang hakbang ang rehistrasyon at akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 30220,
                  "end_ms": 35700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ang pagtatanong, pagdalo sa pagsasanay o pagkakaroon ng titulo ay hindi patunay na tapos na ang proseso.",
                  "start_ms": 36000,
                  "end_ms": 43960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Unawain ang tungkulin at tiyakin ang pasya; huwag ipagpalagay ang status.",
                  "start_ms": 44260,
                  "end_ms": 50420
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "fictional-process-cards": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/fictional-process-cards.en.840b9d7f8cf0.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "840b9d7f8cf067511fe1e997cda462ccab86cb575996e2cba56c784a3bb8c5d0",
              "sha256": "b783f96148cb4dbd6479d727c027e6931cbe54d0952b2bf3e3ff1b8ca35379d0",
              "duration_seconds": 51.461,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "What is known and missing?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Demi uses three fictional practice cards.",
                  "start_ms": 2500,
                  "end_ms": 5540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "A has only a training certificate; it does not prove accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 5840,
                  "end_ms": 11120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "B has a committee recommendation but no verified board decision.",
                  "start_ms": 11420,
                  "end_ms": 17540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "C mentions a board resolution, but its process, scope and verification contact remain unclear.",
                  "start_ms": 17840,
                  "end_ms": 26240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "None of the cards decides a person’s status.",
                  "start_ms": 26540,
                  "end_ms": 29660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Match each known fact to the missing information: what is the next step for A, is there an official decision for B, and which official record should be checked for C?",
                  "start_ms": 29960,
                  "end_ms": 40680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Do not invent a local form, fee, deadline or result.",
                  "start_ms": 40980,
                  "end_ms": 45820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Separate known facts from what needs verification; do not guess approval.",
                  "start_ms": 46120,
                  "end_ms": 51400
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/fictional-process-cards.fil.5c8de306e4f2.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "5c8de306e4f23eacbfd932997f52f638b70b1d2e565bcaeee2f880c6441ed5e2",
              "sha256": "3bd110ba0843960a78b8b77aed37c6ed7b59e71adae03f197fde5264071100fb",
              "duration_seconds": 59.429,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ano ang alam at kulang?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tatlong kathang-isip na practice card ang ginagamit ni Demi.",
                  "start_ms": 2940,
                  "end_ms": 7060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sa A, may training certificate lamang; hindi nito pinatutunayan ang akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 7360,
                  "end_ms": 14000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Sa B, may rekomendasyon ng komite ngunit walang natiyak na pasya ng board.",
                  "start_ms": 14300,
                  "end_ms": 20020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Sa C, may binanggit na board resolution ngunit hindi pa natiyak kung para sa anong proseso, sino ang saklaw at saan ito makukumpirma.",
                  "start_ms": 20320,
                  "end_ms": 29880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Walang card na nagpapasya sa status ng tao.",
                  "start_ms": 30180,
                  "end_ms": 34180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Itapat ang bawat alam na detalye sa kulang na impormasyon: anong susunod na hakbang sa A, may opisyal na pasya na ba sa B, at aling opisyal na tala ang dapat tiyakin sa C?",
                  "start_ms": 34480,
                  "end_ms": 47600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Huwag mag-imbento ng lokal na form, bayad, deadline o resulta.",
                  "start_ms": 47900,
                  "end_ms": 53620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ihiwalay ang alam na detalye sa kailangang tiyakin; walang hulang approval.",
                  "start_ms": 53920,
                  "end_ms": 59360
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "roles-and-records": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/roles-and-records.en.6dcdc61d3504.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "6dcdc61d3504d55a9fcdc2aea62a38cf1273b9cf1ad1c122ab83aa285f6688cd",
              "sha256": "1aadbdfe1d71a643143b3a69444bce14bbf8c7c1b5f4851ea82cb5b8ecd7a70a",
              "duration_seconds": 54.674,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Recommendation or decision?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Compare the two roles.",
                  "start_ms": 2940,
                  "end_ms": 4660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "A committee helps screen applications and recommend action; the board is responsible for acting and officially recording its decision.",
                  "start_ms": 4960,
                  "end_ms": 14200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "The circular encourages municipal and city health boards to create a committee.",
                  "start_ms": 14500,
                  "end_ms": 19740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "If none exists yet or creation is pending, the board remains responsible for facilitating registration and accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 20040,
                  "end_ms": 28280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Find out the actual local arrangement rather than assume every locality has the same committee and office.",
                  "start_ms": 28580,
                  "end_ms": 35260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "The RHU or municipal or city health office can help identify the proper contact.",
                  "start_ms": 35560,
                  "end_ms": 42080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Their assistance, an interview or a training certificate does not replace an official decision.",
                  "start_ms": 42380,
                  "end_ms": 49460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Verify who assists and where the board’s decision is recorded.",
                  "start_ms": 49760,
                  "end_ms": 54600
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/roles-and-records.fil.af8e730e444f.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "af8e730e444ff939602283728e95067cd97f81b9fe96abfeb6a05d854c9173d4",
              "sha256": "d59d505508779e733951882de1b6a25c277d5983b698ab531fea9231d563821a",
              "duration_seconds": 58.462,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Rekomendasyon o pasya?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ihambing ang dalawang papel.",
                  "start_ms": 2660,
                  "end_ms": 5140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Tumutulong ang komite sa pagsusuri at rekomendasyon; pananagutan ng board ang pag-aksiyon at opisyal na pagtatala ng pasya.",
                  "start_ms": 5440,
                  "end_ms": 14360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Hinihikayat ng circular ang mga municipal at city health board na bumuo ng komite.",
                  "start_ms": 14660,
                  "end_ms": 20980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Kapag wala pa nito o habang binubuo ito, nananatili sa board ang tungkuling padaliin ang rehistrasyon at akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 21280,
                  "end_ms": 30480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Kaya dapat alamin ang aktuwal na lokal na ayos, sa halip na ipagpalagay na pare-pareho ang komite at opisina sa lahat ng lugar.",
                  "start_ms": 30780,
                  "end_ms": 40180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Makapagtuturo ng tamang contact ang RHU o municipal o city health office.",
                  "start_ms": 40480,
                  "end_ms": 46000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Hindi kapalit ng opisyal na pasya ang kanilang tulong, isang panayam o isang training certificate.",
                  "start_ms": 46300,
                  "end_ms": 53220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tiyakin kung sino ang tumutulong at saan nakatala ang pasya ng board.",
                  "start_ms": 53520,
                  "end_ms": 58400
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-5": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/section-5.en.04768183e365.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "04768183e3658a00d2c740c1cdc01cd1c2afe6adf078515ad73ceae3ac04ace9",
              "sha256": "70e81bc8f45cb275749d8826681f8f53c5f9fbebd27d24fc48b1d08e610db754",
              "duration_seconds": 72.856,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Responsibilities in the process",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The local health board has specific responsibilities.",
                  "start_ms": 2700,
                  "end_ms": 6780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "The joint DILG and DOH circular issued in 2023 lists its duties: safeguard registration and accreditation; evaluate and act on applications; record decisions in a board resolution or meeting minutes; issue certificates to qualified BHWs; review and approve benefits using local funds; recommend benefits and fund allocation; provide a copy of the BHW registry to DOH; and monitor services.",
                  "start_ms": 7080,
                  "end_ms": 38920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "An accreditation decision and review of a benefit using local funds are different decisions.",
                  "start_ms": 39220,
                  "end_ms": 45820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "The board may also create a BHW Registration and Accreditation Committee.",
                  "start_ms": 46120,
                  "end_ms": 51280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "The facilitator guide describes screening, interviews, recommendations to the board and registry preparation as supporting committee tasks.",
                  "start_ms": 51580,
                  "end_ms": 61700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "A recommendation alone is not the board’s official decision.",
                  "start_ms": 62000,
                  "end_ms": 66200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The board is responsible; the committee assists and decisions have official records.",
                  "start_ms": 66500,
                  "end_ms": 72780
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/section-5.fil.a0cdaaff0484.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "a0cdaaff04846502c1e8abbe6c3df43fd0f93415fba5d352c3dc8437987531c1",
              "sha256": "b713462498e648c4ec57c1a9a1adb660d63829cba7c9086d23a3da0aef6150f6",
              "duration_seconds": 80.327,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tungkulin sa proseso",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "May tiyak na pananagutan ang local health board.",
                  "start_ms": 2260,
                  "end_ms": 5660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Inililista ng magkasanib na circular ng DILG at DOH noong 2023 ang mga tungkulin nito: pangalagaan ang proseso ng rehistrasyon at akreditasyon; suriin at aksiyunan ang mga aplikasyon; itala ang pasya sa board resolution o minutes ng pulong; maglabas ng sertipiko sa mga kwalipikadong BHW; suriin at aprubahan ang mga benepisyong gagamit ng pondong lokal; magrekomenda ng benepisyo at paglalaan ng pondo; magbigay ng kopya ng BHW registry sa DOH; at subaybayan ang serbisyo.",
                  "start_ms": 5960,
                  "end_ms": 45200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Magkaiba ang pasya sa akreditasyon at pagsusuri ng benepisyong may lokal na pondo.",
                  "start_ms": 45500,
                  "end_ms": 50980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Maaari ring bumuo ang board ng BHW Registration and Accreditation Committee.",
                  "start_ms": 51280,
                  "end_ms": 57480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Inilalarawan ng facilitator guide ang pagsusuri, panayam, rekomendasyon sa board at pag-aayos ng registry bilang mga tungkuling pantulong ng komite.",
                  "start_ms": 57780,
                  "end_ms": 68780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Hindi katumbas ng opisyal na pasya ng board ang rekomendasyon lamang.",
                  "start_ms": 69080,
                  "end_ms": 73960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "May pananagutan ang board; pantulong ang komite at may opisyal na tala ang pasya.",
                  "start_ms": 74260,
                  "end_ms": 80260
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "module": "04-ra7883",
        "sections": {
          "accreditation-application-check": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-application-check.en.7629c6df5b3d.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "7629c6df5b3d90c04ff8a988c93cf7684e7d4aeae0869369fcb4de4d9ae0b474",
              "sha256": "5eed7464ff6cf87b968ed7b9154912e044a5bd2f176d510963ff76531b7a7cf2",
              "duration_seconds": 46.524,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose the supported explanation",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Return to Card B: there is a committee recommendation, but no verified official decision.",
                  "start_ms": 2940,
                  "end_ms": 9980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "What should Demi explain?",
                  "start_ms": 10280,
                  "end_ms": 12080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Distinguish the recommendation from the board’s decision, name the missing information, and choose a question about the process and official record.",
                  "start_ms": 12380,
                  "end_ms": 21540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "A training certificate, BHWE or job title does not replace accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 21840,
                  "end_ms": 29040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Choose an answer, then read the reasons for all options.",
                  "start_ms": 29340,
                  "end_ms": 33580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Completing the online lesson is separate from observed competency and does not grant accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 33880,
                  "end_ms": 40760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Explain the roles, identify the gap and verify the official decision.",
                  "start_ms": 41060,
                  "end_ms": 46460
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-application-check.fil.7d7d05c82fc5.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "7d7d05c82fc5d9852db396f4b7eb0a4eb0fabef91e653375a75f9061116488ea",
              "sha256": "b108dcaca5e85f486cab8294e644675c5612ddd21a76aacda3a4c09bde913765",
              "duration_seconds": 51.775,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang tamang paliwanag",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Balikan ang Card B: may rekomendasyon ng komite, ngunit wala pang natiyak na opisyal na pasya.",
                  "start_ms": 2580,
                  "end_ms": 9780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ano ang dapat ipaliwanag ni Demi?",
                  "start_ms": 10080,
                  "end_ms": 13000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ihiwalay ang rekomendasyon sa pasya ng board, sabihin ang kulang na impormasyon, at pumili ng tanong na magpapalinaw sa proseso at opisyal na tala.",
                  "start_ms": 13300,
                  "end_ms": 23980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Hindi ipinapalit ang training certificate, Barangay Health Worker Eligibility o job title sa akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 24280,
                  "end_ms": 31480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Piliin ang sagot, saka basahin ang dahilan para sa lahat ng pagpipilian.",
                  "start_ms": 31780,
                  "end_ms": 36740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ang pagkumpleto sa online lesson ay hiwalay sa obserbasyon ng kasanayan at hindi nagbibigay ng akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 37040,
                  "end_ms": 44600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ipaliwanag ang mga papel, tukuyin ang kulang at tiyakin ang opisyal na pasya.",
                  "start_ms": 44900,
                  "end_ms": 51700
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "accreditation-follow-up": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-follow-up.en.0448219b69d2.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "0448219b69d250eeef22bed8f8d12d821cdc2c7c9d7cc0843a5ea2e2ecb1cda7",
              "sha256": "9e07d0c448a47e0fa0130a1d877dc804bdbbf9d06badd6b87a9d8918af53551e",
              "duration_seconds": 52.767,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A question about the process",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Demi chooses Card B.",
                  "start_ms": 2460,
                  "end_ms": 4700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "On a blank planning sheet, she writes: ‘For this example with a committee recommendation, which office can confirm whether the local health board has made an official decision, where can it be verified, and what is the next step if none has been made?’",
                  "start_ms": 5000,
                  "end_ms": 19600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "The question names the process, known fact, missing information and proper contact.",
                  "start_ms": 19900,
                  "end_ms": 26620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ask the locally confirmed RHU, municipal or city health office, or board contact for current guidance.",
                  "start_ms": 26920,
                  "end_ms": 35200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "This practice submits no actual application or private documents.",
                  "start_ms": 35500,
                  "end_ms": 40140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Proof of registration, proof of accreditation and a training certificate should not be treated as interchangeable.",
                  "start_ms": 40440,
                  "end_ms": 47360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Connect the question to the process, known fact and official record.",
                  "start_ms": 47660,
                  "end_ms": 52700
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-follow-up.fil.3948a718eb8a.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "3948a718eb8a8d2e900a8c340a798a7f24798a040253ca6ab9b800050a4c9d06",
              "sha256": "1609881257b7e21061887a8d18ccd6a4579605b7642bb3eb96fe9a6b35cca59c",
              "duration_seconds": 59.638,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Isang tanong tungkol sa proseso",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pinili ni Demi ang Card B.",
                  "start_ms": 2580,
                  "end_ms": 5020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sa blankong planning sheet, isinulat niya: ‘Para sa halimbawang may rekomendasyon ng komite, aling tanggapan ang makapagsasabi kung may opisyal na pasya na ang local health board, saan ito matitiyak, at ano ang susunod na hakbang kung wala pa?’",
                  "start_ms": 5320,
                  "end_ms": 20800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Tiyak ang tanong: pangalan ng proseso, alam na detalye, kulang na impormasyon at tamang contact.",
                  "start_ms": 21100,
                  "end_ms": 30100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Makipag-ugnayan sa locally confirmed na RHU, municipal o city health office, o board contact para sa kasalukuyang gabay.",
                  "start_ms": 30400,
                  "end_ms": 39640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Walang tunay na aplikasyon o pribadong dokumentong isusumite sa pagsasanay.",
                  "start_ms": 39940,
                  "end_ms": 44900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ang katibayan ng rehistrasyon, katibayan ng akreditasyon at training certificate ay hindi dapat ipagpalit sa isa’t isa.",
                  "start_ms": 45200,
                  "end_ms": 53840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Iugnay ang tanong sa proseso, alam na detalye at opisyal na tala.",
                  "start_ms": 54140,
                  "end_ms": 59580
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "accreditation-question": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-question.en.13b00d2cd085.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "13b00d2cd0854c312904f1edeec366479cb4d04096bd511aacf08dabb18d02d7",
              "sha256": "0fcf29c8a70d8e5d93d919b64bbaaa0ae9e422f5318c590a4af9db1fe55b5d1a",
              "duration_seconds": 46.08,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Demi’s question",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Demi prepares a question about registration and accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 1780,
                  "end_ms": 6300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "‘Who reviews an application, and how can I verify the official decision?’",
                  "start_ms": 6600,
                  "end_ms": 11880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "This is a fictional situation; we have not established that Demi has an application, registration or accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 12180,
                  "end_ms": 19740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "RA 7883 places accreditation with the local health board under DOH guidelines.",
                  "start_ms": 20040,
                  "end_ms": 27440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Registration and accreditation are related but distinct steps.",
                  "start_ms": 27740,
                  "end_ms": 32380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Asking a question, attending training or holding a title does not prove that the process is complete.",
                  "start_ms": 32680,
                  "end_ms": 40280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Understand the roles and verify the decision; do not assume status.",
                  "start_ms": 40580,
                  "end_ms": 46020
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-question.fil.bfd4694d4783.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "bfd4694d47837234ae2f89bc555cafeb6f10ec301be91f5b322b034913d1a1a9",
              "sha256": "87f791d2602a71855a66acc4d0394cedfffde751459ab30e99728633b4ba1bab",
              "duration_seconds": 50.495,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tanong ni Demi",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Naghahanda si Demi ng tanong tungkol sa rehistrasyon at akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 1660,
                  "end_ms": 6700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "‘Sino ang tumitingin sa aplikasyon, at paano ko matitiyak ang opisyal na pasya?’",
                  "start_ms": 7000,
                  "end_ms": 12680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Kathang-isip ang sitwasyong ito; hindi pa natin alam kung may aplikasyon, rehistrasyon o akreditasyon si Demi.",
                  "start_ms": 12980,
                  "end_ms": 21460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Sa RA 7883, nakaugnay ang akreditasyon sa local health board, ayon sa gabay ng DOH.",
                  "start_ms": 21760,
                  "end_ms": 29920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Magkaugnay ngunit magkaibang hakbang ang rehistrasyon at akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 30220,
                  "end_ms": 35700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ang pagtatanong, pagdalo sa pagsasanay o pagkakaroon ng titulo ay hindi patunay na tapos na ang proseso.",
                  "start_ms": 36000,
                  "end_ms": 43960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Unawain ang tungkulin at tiyakin ang pasya; huwag ipagpalagay ang status.",
                  "start_ms": 44260,
                  "end_ms": 50420
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "fictional-process-cards": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/fictional-process-cards.en.840b9d7f8cf0.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "840b9d7f8cf067511fe1e997cda462ccab86cb575996e2cba56c784a3bb8c5d0",
              "sha256": "b783f96148cb4dbd6479d727c027e6931cbe54d0952b2bf3e3ff1b8ca35379d0",
              "duration_seconds": 51.461,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "What is known and missing?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Demi uses three fictional practice cards.",
                  "start_ms": 2500,
                  "end_ms": 5540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "A has only a training certificate; it does not prove accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 5840,
                  "end_ms": 11120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "B has a committee recommendation but no verified board decision.",
                  "start_ms": 11420,
                  "end_ms": 17540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "C mentions a board resolution, but its process, scope and verification contact remain unclear.",
                  "start_ms": 17840,
                  "end_ms": 26240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "None of the cards decides a person’s status.",
                  "start_ms": 26540,
                  "end_ms": 29660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Match each known fact to the missing information: what is the next step for A, is there an official decision for B, and which official record should be checked for C?",
                  "start_ms": 29960,
                  "end_ms": 40680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Do not invent a local form, fee, deadline or result.",
                  "start_ms": 40980,
                  "end_ms": 45820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Separate known facts from what needs verification; do not guess approval.",
                  "start_ms": 46120,
                  "end_ms": 51400
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/fictional-process-cards.fil.5c8de306e4f2.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "5c8de306e4f23eacbfd932997f52f638b70b1d2e565bcaeee2f880c6441ed5e2",
              "sha256": "3bd110ba0843960a78b8b77aed37c6ed7b59e71adae03f197fde5264071100fb",
              "duration_seconds": 59.429,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ano ang alam at kulang?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tatlong kathang-isip na practice card ang ginagamit ni Demi.",
                  "start_ms": 2940,
                  "end_ms": 7060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sa A, may training certificate lamang; hindi nito pinatutunayan ang akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 7360,
                  "end_ms": 14000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Sa B, may rekomendasyon ng komite ngunit walang natiyak na pasya ng board.",
                  "start_ms": 14300,
                  "end_ms": 20020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Sa C, may binanggit na board resolution ngunit hindi pa natiyak kung para sa anong proseso, sino ang saklaw at saan ito makukumpirma.",
                  "start_ms": 20320,
                  "end_ms": 29880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Walang card na nagpapasya sa status ng tao.",
                  "start_ms": 30180,
                  "end_ms": 34180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Itapat ang bawat alam na detalye sa kulang na impormasyon: anong susunod na hakbang sa A, may opisyal na pasya na ba sa B, at aling opisyal na tala ang dapat tiyakin sa C?",
                  "start_ms": 34480,
                  "end_ms": 47600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Huwag mag-imbento ng lokal na form, bayad, deadline o resulta.",
                  "start_ms": 47900,
                  "end_ms": 53620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ihiwalay ang alam na detalye sa kailangang tiyakin; walang hulang approval.",
                  "start_ms": 53920,
                  "end_ms": 59360
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "roles-and-records": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/roles-and-records.en.6dcdc61d3504.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "6dcdc61d3504d55a9fcdc2aea62a38cf1273b9cf1ad1c122ab83aa285f6688cd",
              "sha256": "1aadbdfe1d71a643143b3a69444bce14bbf8c7c1b5f4851ea82cb5b8ecd7a70a",
              "duration_seconds": 54.674,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Recommendation or decision?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Compare the two roles.",
                  "start_ms": 2940,
                  "end_ms": 4660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "A committee helps screen applications and recommend action; the board is responsible for acting and officially recording its decision.",
                  "start_ms": 4960,
                  "end_ms": 14200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "The circular encourages municipal and city health boards to create a committee.",
                  "start_ms": 14500,
                  "end_ms": 19740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "If none exists yet or creation is pending, the board remains responsible for facilitating registration and accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 20040,
                  "end_ms": 28280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Find out the actual local arrangement rather than assume every locality has the same committee and office.",
                  "start_ms": 28580,
                  "end_ms": 35260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "The RHU or municipal or city health office can help identify the proper contact.",
                  "start_ms": 35560,
                  "end_ms": 42080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Their assistance, an interview or a training certificate does not replace an official decision.",
                  "start_ms": 42380,
                  "end_ms": 49460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Verify who assists and where the board’s decision is recorded.",
                  "start_ms": 49760,
                  "end_ms": 54600
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/roles-and-records.fil.af8e730e444f.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "af8e730e444ff939602283728e95067cd97f81b9fe96abfeb6a05d854c9173d4",
              "sha256": "d59d505508779e733951882de1b6a25c277d5983b698ab531fea9231d563821a",
              "duration_seconds": 58.462,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Rekomendasyon o pasya?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ihambing ang dalawang papel.",
                  "start_ms": 2660,
                  "end_ms": 5140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Tumutulong ang komite sa pagsusuri at rekomendasyon; pananagutan ng board ang pag-aksiyon at opisyal na pagtatala ng pasya.",
                  "start_ms": 5440,
                  "end_ms": 14360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Hinihikayat ng circular ang mga municipal at city health board na bumuo ng komite.",
                  "start_ms": 14660,
                  "end_ms": 20980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Kapag wala pa nito o habang binubuo ito, nananatili sa board ang tungkuling padaliin ang rehistrasyon at akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 21280,
                  "end_ms": 30480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Kaya dapat alamin ang aktuwal na lokal na ayos, sa halip na ipagpalagay na pare-pareho ang komite at opisina sa lahat ng lugar.",
                  "start_ms": 30780,
                  "end_ms": 40180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Makapagtuturo ng tamang contact ang RHU o municipal o city health office.",
                  "start_ms": 40480,
                  "end_ms": 46000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Hindi kapalit ng opisyal na pasya ang kanilang tulong, isang panayam o isang training certificate.",
                  "start_ms": 46300,
                  "end_ms": 53220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tiyakin kung sino ang tumutulong at saan nakatala ang pasya ng board.",
                  "start_ms": 53520,
                  "end_ms": 58400
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-5": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/section-5.en.04768183e365.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "04768183e3658a00d2c740c1cdc01cd1c2afe6adf078515ad73ceae3ac04ace9",
              "sha256": "70e81bc8f45cb275749d8826681f8f53c5f9fbebd27d24fc48b1d08e610db754",
              "duration_seconds": 72.856,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Responsibilities in the process",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The local health board has specific responsibilities.",
                  "start_ms": 2700,
                  "end_ms": 6780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "The joint DILG and DOH circular issued in 2023 lists its duties: safeguard registration and accreditation; evaluate and act on applications; record decisions in a board resolution or meeting minutes; issue certificates to qualified BHWs; review and approve benefits using local funds; recommend benefits and fund allocation; provide a copy of the BHW registry to DOH; and monitor services.",
                  "start_ms": 7080,
                  "end_ms": 38920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "An accreditation decision and review of a benefit using local funds are different decisions.",
                  "start_ms": 39220,
                  "end_ms": 45820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "The board may also create a BHW Registration and Accreditation Committee.",
                  "start_ms": 46120,
                  "end_ms": 51280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "The facilitator guide describes screening, interviews, recommendations to the board and registry preparation as supporting committee tasks.",
                  "start_ms": 51580,
                  "end_ms": 61700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "A recommendation alone is not the board’s official decision.",
                  "start_ms": 62000,
                  "end_ms": 66200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The board is responsible; the committee assists and decisions have official records.",
                  "start_ms": 66500,
                  "end_ms": 72780
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/section-5.fil.beec6121c750.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "beec6121c75093ef5fabd8264ccc349080bf807905b16e9d4377b60c4d42a1e2",
              "sha256": "8508ea5bd82d30e50591b38e1214df1e75362acfd7721ba89726508988aacfa8",
              "duration_seconds": 77.897,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tungkulin sa proseso",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "May tiyak na pananagutan ang local health board.",
                  "start_ms": 2540,
                  "end_ms": 5820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Inililista ng magkasanib na circular ng DILG at DOH noong 2023 ang mga tungkulin nito: pangalagaan ang proseso ng rehistrasyon at akreditasyon; suriin at aksiyunan ang mga aplikasyon; itala ang pasya sa board resolution o minutes ng pulong; maglabas ng sertipiko sa mga kwalipikadong BHW; suriin at aprubahan ang mga benepisyong gagamit ng pondong lokal; magrekomenda ng benepisyo at paglalaan ng pondo; magbigay ng kopya ng BHW registry sa DOH; at magsagawa ng monitoring sa serbisyo.",
                  "start_ms": 6120,
                  "end_ms": 42240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Magkahiwalay ang pasya sa akreditasyon at ang pagsusuri ng benepisyong may lokal na pondo.",
                  "start_ms": 42540,
                  "end_ms": 48660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Maaari ring bumuo ang board ng BHW Registration and Accreditation Committee.",
                  "start_ms": 48960,
                  "end_ms": 55160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Inilalarawan ng facilitator guide ang pagsusuri, panayam, rekomendasyon sa board at pag-aayos ng registry bilang mga tungkuling pantulong ng komite.",
                  "start_ms": 55460,
                  "end_ms": 66380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Hindi katumbas ng opisyal na pasya ng board ang rekomendasyon lamang.",
                  "start_ms": 66680,
                  "end_ms": 71320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "May pananagutan ang board; pantulong ang komite at may opisyal na tala ang pasya.",
                  "start_ms": 71620,
                  "end_ms": 77820
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "module": "04-ra7883",
        "sections": {
          "accreditation-application-check": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-application-check.en.7629c6df5b3d.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "7629c6df5b3d90c04ff8a988c93cf7684e7d4aeae0869369fcb4de4d9ae0b474",
              "sha256": "5eed7464ff6cf87b968ed7b9154912e044a5bd2f176d510963ff76531b7a7cf2",
              "duration_seconds": 46.524,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose the supported explanation",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Return to Card B: there is a committee recommendation, but no verified official decision.",
                  "start_ms": 2940,
                  "end_ms": 9980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "What should Demi explain?",
                  "start_ms": 10280,
                  "end_ms": 12080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Distinguish the recommendation from the board’s decision, name the missing information, and choose a question about the process and official record.",
                  "start_ms": 12380,
                  "end_ms": 21540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "A training certificate, BHWE or job title does not replace accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 21840,
                  "end_ms": 29040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Choose an answer, then read the reasons for all options.",
                  "start_ms": 29340,
                  "end_ms": 33580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Completing the online lesson is separate from observed competency and does not grant accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 33880,
                  "end_ms": 40760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Explain the roles, identify the gap and verify the official decision.",
                  "start_ms": 41060,
                  "end_ms": 46460
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-application-check.fil.7d7d05c82fc5.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "7d7d05c82fc5d9852db396f4b7eb0a4eb0fabef91e653375a75f9061116488ea",
              "sha256": "b108dcaca5e85f486cab8294e644675c5612ddd21a76aacda3a4c09bde913765",
              "duration_seconds": 51.775,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang tamang paliwanag",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Balikan ang Card B: may rekomendasyon ng komite, ngunit wala pang natiyak na opisyal na pasya.",
                  "start_ms": 2580,
                  "end_ms": 9780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ano ang dapat ipaliwanag ni Demi?",
                  "start_ms": 10080,
                  "end_ms": 13000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ihiwalay ang rekomendasyon sa pasya ng board, sabihin ang kulang na impormasyon, at pumili ng tanong na magpapalinaw sa proseso at opisyal na tala.",
                  "start_ms": 13300,
                  "end_ms": 23980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Hindi ipinapalit ang training certificate, Barangay Health Worker Eligibility o job title sa akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 24280,
                  "end_ms": 31480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Piliin ang sagot, saka basahin ang dahilan para sa lahat ng pagpipilian.",
                  "start_ms": 31780,
                  "end_ms": 36740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ang pagkumpleto sa online lesson ay hiwalay sa obserbasyon ng kasanayan at hindi nagbibigay ng akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 37040,
                  "end_ms": 44600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ipaliwanag ang mga papel, tukuyin ang kulang at tiyakin ang opisyal na pasya.",
                  "start_ms": 44900,
                  "end_ms": 51700
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "accreditation-follow-up": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-follow-up.en.0448219b69d2.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "0448219b69d250eeef22bed8f8d12d821cdc2c7c9d7cc0843a5ea2e2ecb1cda7",
              "sha256": "9e07d0c448a47e0fa0130a1d877dc804bdbbf9d06badd6b87a9d8918af53551e",
              "duration_seconds": 52.767,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A question about the process",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Demi chooses Card B.",
                  "start_ms": 2460,
                  "end_ms": 4700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "On a blank planning sheet, she writes: ‘For this example with a committee recommendation, which office can confirm whether the local health board has made an official decision, where can it be verified, and what is the next step if none has been made?’",
                  "start_ms": 5000,
                  "end_ms": 19600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "The question names the process, known fact, missing information and proper contact.",
                  "start_ms": 19900,
                  "end_ms": 26620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ask the locally confirmed RHU, municipal or city health office, or board contact for current guidance.",
                  "start_ms": 26920,
                  "end_ms": 35200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "This practice submits no actual application or private documents.",
                  "start_ms": 35500,
                  "end_ms": 40140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Proof of registration, proof of accreditation and a training certificate should not be treated as interchangeable.",
                  "start_ms": 40440,
                  "end_ms": 47360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Connect the question to the process, known fact and official record.",
                  "start_ms": 47660,
                  "end_ms": 52700
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-follow-up.fil.3948a718eb8a.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "3948a718eb8a8d2e900a8c340a798a7f24798a040253ca6ab9b800050a4c9d06",
              "sha256": "1609881257b7e21061887a8d18ccd6a4579605b7642bb3eb96fe9a6b35cca59c",
              "duration_seconds": 59.638,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Isang tanong tungkol sa proseso",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pinili ni Demi ang Card B.",
                  "start_ms": 2580,
                  "end_ms": 5020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sa blankong planning sheet, isinulat niya: ‘Para sa halimbawang may rekomendasyon ng komite, aling tanggapan ang makapagsasabi kung may opisyal na pasya na ang local health board, saan ito matitiyak, at ano ang susunod na hakbang kung wala pa?’",
                  "start_ms": 5320,
                  "end_ms": 20800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Tiyak ang tanong: pangalan ng proseso, alam na detalye, kulang na impormasyon at tamang contact.",
                  "start_ms": 21100,
                  "end_ms": 30100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Makipag-ugnayan sa locally confirmed na RHU, municipal o city health office, o board contact para sa kasalukuyang gabay.",
                  "start_ms": 30400,
                  "end_ms": 39640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Walang tunay na aplikasyon o pribadong dokumentong isusumite sa pagsasanay.",
                  "start_ms": 39940,
                  "end_ms": 44900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ang katibayan ng rehistrasyon, katibayan ng akreditasyon at training certificate ay hindi dapat ipagpalit sa isa’t isa.",
                  "start_ms": 45200,
                  "end_ms": 53840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Iugnay ang tanong sa proseso, alam na detalye at opisyal na tala.",
                  "start_ms": 54140,
                  "end_ms": 59580
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "accreditation-question": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-question.en.13b00d2cd085.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "13b00d2cd0854c312904f1edeec366479cb4d04096bd511aacf08dabb18d02d7",
              "sha256": "0fcf29c8a70d8e5d93d919b64bbaaa0ae9e422f5318c590a4af9db1fe55b5d1a",
              "duration_seconds": 46.08,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Demi’s question",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Demi prepares a question about registration and accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 1780,
                  "end_ms": 6300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "‘Who reviews an application, and how can I verify the official decision?’",
                  "start_ms": 6600,
                  "end_ms": 11880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "This is a fictional situation; we have not established that Demi has an application, registration or accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 12180,
                  "end_ms": 19740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "RA 7883 places accreditation with the local health board under DOH guidelines.",
                  "start_ms": 20040,
                  "end_ms": 27440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Registration and accreditation are related but distinct steps.",
                  "start_ms": 27740,
                  "end_ms": 32380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Asking a question, attending training or holding a title does not prove that the process is complete.",
                  "start_ms": 32680,
                  "end_ms": 40280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Understand the roles and verify the decision; do not assume status.",
                  "start_ms": 40580,
                  "end_ms": 46020
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/accreditation-question.fil.04c3c989905d.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "04c3c989905dd997c81f42736d3b352b152dd189f92b4306cbb70e2a9b04076c",
              "sha256": "1eb95e3d4eb198337210f99d886ce6b9b50083f2ce649841cb68934ac69fa3dc",
              "duration_seconds": 49.398,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tanong ni Demi",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Naghahanda si Demi ng tanong tungkol sa rehistrasyon at akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 1860,
                  "end_ms": 7060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "‘Sino ang tumitingin sa aplikasyon, at saan ko makikita ang opisyal na tala ng pasya?’",
                  "start_ms": 7360,
                  "end_ms": 13680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Kathang-isip ang sitwasyong ito; hindi pa natin alam kung may aplikasyon, rehistrasyon o akreditasyon si Demi.",
                  "start_ms": 13980,
                  "end_ms": 21060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Sa RA 7883, nakaugnay ang akreditasyon sa local health board, ayon sa gabay ng DOH.",
                  "start_ms": 21360,
                  "end_ms": 29280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Magkaugnay ngunit magkaibang hakbang ang rehistrasyon at akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 29580,
                  "end_ms": 34740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ang pagtatanong, pagdalo sa pagsasanay o pagkakaroon ng titulo ay hindi patunay na tapos na ang proseso.",
                  "start_ms": 35040,
                  "end_ms": 43760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Unawain ang tungkulin at tiyakin ang pasya; huwag ipagpalagay ang status.",
                  "start_ms": 44060,
                  "end_ms": 49340
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "fictional-process-cards": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/fictional-process-cards.en.840b9d7f8cf0.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "840b9d7f8cf067511fe1e997cda462ccab86cb575996e2cba56c784a3bb8c5d0",
              "sha256": "b783f96148cb4dbd6479d727c027e6931cbe54d0952b2bf3e3ff1b8ca35379d0",
              "duration_seconds": 51.461,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "What is known and missing?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Demi uses three fictional practice cards.",
                  "start_ms": 2500,
                  "end_ms": 5540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "A has only a training certificate; it does not prove accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 5840,
                  "end_ms": 11120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "B has a committee recommendation but no verified board decision.",
                  "start_ms": 11420,
                  "end_ms": 17540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "C mentions a board resolution, but its process, scope and verification contact remain unclear.",
                  "start_ms": 17840,
                  "end_ms": 26240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "None of the cards decides a person’s status.",
                  "start_ms": 26540,
                  "end_ms": 29660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Match each known fact to the missing information: what is the next step for A, is there an official decision for B, and which official record should be checked for C?",
                  "start_ms": 29960,
                  "end_ms": 40680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Do not invent a local form, fee, deadline or result.",
                  "start_ms": 40980,
                  "end_ms": 45820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Separate known facts from what needs verification; do not guess approval.",
                  "start_ms": 46120,
                  "end_ms": 51400
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/fictional-process-cards.fil.5c8de306e4f2.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "5c8de306e4f23eacbfd932997f52f638b70b1d2e565bcaeee2f880c6441ed5e2",
              "sha256": "3bd110ba0843960a78b8b77aed37c6ed7b59e71adae03f197fde5264071100fb",
              "duration_seconds": 59.429,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ano ang alam at kulang?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tatlong kathang-isip na practice card ang ginagamit ni Demi.",
                  "start_ms": 2940,
                  "end_ms": 7060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sa A, may training certificate lamang; hindi nito pinatutunayan ang akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 7360,
                  "end_ms": 14000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Sa B, may rekomendasyon ng komite ngunit walang natiyak na pasya ng board.",
                  "start_ms": 14300,
                  "end_ms": 20020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Sa C, may binanggit na board resolution ngunit hindi pa natiyak kung para sa anong proseso, sino ang saklaw at saan ito makukumpirma.",
                  "start_ms": 20320,
                  "end_ms": 29880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Walang card na nagpapasya sa status ng tao.",
                  "start_ms": 30180,
                  "end_ms": 34180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Itapat ang bawat alam na detalye sa kulang na impormasyon: anong susunod na hakbang sa A, may opisyal na pasya na ba sa B, at aling opisyal na tala ang dapat tiyakin sa C?",
                  "start_ms": 34480,
                  "end_ms": 47600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Huwag mag-imbento ng lokal na form, bayad, deadline o resulta.",
                  "start_ms": 47900,
                  "end_ms": 53620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ihiwalay ang alam na detalye sa kailangang tiyakin; walang hulang approval.",
                  "start_ms": 53920,
                  "end_ms": 59360
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "roles-and-records": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/roles-and-records.en.6dcdc61d3504.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "6dcdc61d3504d55a9fcdc2aea62a38cf1273b9cf1ad1c122ab83aa285f6688cd",
              "sha256": "1aadbdfe1d71a643143b3a69444bce14bbf8c7c1b5f4851ea82cb5b8ecd7a70a",
              "duration_seconds": 54.674,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Recommendation or decision?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Compare the two roles.",
                  "start_ms": 2940,
                  "end_ms": 4660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "A committee helps screen applications and recommend action; the board is responsible for acting and officially recording its decision.",
                  "start_ms": 4960,
                  "end_ms": 14200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "The circular encourages municipal and city health boards to create a committee.",
                  "start_ms": 14500,
                  "end_ms": 19740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "If none exists yet or creation is pending, the board remains responsible for facilitating registration and accreditation.",
                  "start_ms": 20040,
                  "end_ms": 28280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Find out the actual local arrangement rather than assume every locality has the same committee and office.",
                  "start_ms": 28580,
                  "end_ms": 35260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "The RHU or municipal or city health office can help identify the proper contact.",
                  "start_ms": 35560,
                  "end_ms": 42080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Their assistance, an interview or a training certificate does not replace an official decision.",
                  "start_ms": 42380,
                  "end_ms": 49460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Verify who assists and where the board’s decision is recorded.",
                  "start_ms": 49760,
                  "end_ms": 54600
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/roles-and-records.fil.af8e730e444f.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "af8e730e444ff939602283728e95067cd97f81b9fe96abfeb6a05d854c9173d4",
              "sha256": "d59d505508779e733951882de1b6a25c277d5983b698ab531fea9231d563821a",
              "duration_seconds": 58.462,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Rekomendasyon o pasya?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ihambing ang dalawang papel.",
                  "start_ms": 2660,
                  "end_ms": 5140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Tumutulong ang komite sa pagsusuri at rekomendasyon; pananagutan ng board ang pag-aksiyon at opisyal na pagtatala ng pasya.",
                  "start_ms": 5440,
                  "end_ms": 14360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Hinihikayat ng circular ang mga municipal at city health board na bumuo ng komite.",
                  "start_ms": 14660,
                  "end_ms": 20980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Kapag wala pa nito o habang binubuo ito, nananatili sa board ang tungkuling padaliin ang rehistrasyon at akreditasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 21280,
                  "end_ms": 30480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Kaya dapat alamin ang aktuwal na lokal na ayos, sa halip na ipagpalagay na pare-pareho ang komite at opisina sa lahat ng lugar.",
                  "start_ms": 30780,
                  "end_ms": 40180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Makapagtuturo ng tamang contact ang RHU o municipal o city health office.",
                  "start_ms": 40480,
                  "end_ms": 46000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Hindi kapalit ng opisyal na pasya ang kanilang tulong, isang panayam o isang training certificate.",
                  "start_ms": 46300,
                  "end_ms": 53220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tiyakin kung sino ang tumutulong at saan nakatala ang pasya ng board.",
                  "start_ms": 53520,
                  "end_ms": 58400
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-5": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/section-5.en.04768183e365.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "04768183e3658a00d2c740c1cdc01cd1c2afe6adf078515ad73ceae3ac04ace9",
              "sha256": "70e81bc8f45cb275749d8826681f8f53c5f9fbebd27d24fc48b1d08e610db754",
              "duration_seconds": 72.856,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Responsibilities in the process",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The local health board has specific responsibilities.",
                  "start_ms": 2700,
                  "end_ms": 6780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "The joint DILG and DOH circular issued in 2023 lists its duties: safeguard registration and accreditation; evaluate and act on applications; record decisions in a board resolution or meeting minutes; issue certificates to qualified BHWs; review and approve benefits using local funds; recommend benefits and fund allocation; provide a copy of the BHW registry to DOH; and monitor services.",
                  "start_ms": 7080,
                  "end_ms": 38920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "An accreditation decision and review of a benefit using local funds are different decisions.",
                  "start_ms": 39220,
                  "end_ms": 45820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "The board may also create a BHW Registration and Accreditation Committee.",
                  "start_ms": 46120,
                  "end_ms": 51280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "The facilitator guide describes screening, interviews, recommendations to the board and registry preparation as supporting committee tasks.",
                  "start_ms": 51580,
                  "end_ms": 61700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "A recommendation alone is not the board’s official decision.",
                  "start_ms": 62000,
                  "end_ms": 66200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The board is responsible; the committee assists and decisions have official records.",
                  "start_ms": 66500,
                  "end_ms": 72780
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-accreditation/section-5.fil.beec6121c750.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "beec6121c75093ef5fabd8264ccc349080bf807905b16e9d4377b60c4d42a1e2",
              "sha256": "8508ea5bd82d30e50591b38e1214df1e75362acfd7721ba89726508988aacfa8",
              "duration_seconds": 77.897,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tungkulin sa proseso",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "May tiyak na pananagutan ang local health board.",
                  "start_ms": 2540,
                  "end_ms": 5820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Inililista ng magkasanib na circular ng DILG at DOH noong 2023 ang mga tungkulin nito: pangalagaan ang proseso ng rehistrasyon at akreditasyon; suriin at aksiyunan ang mga aplikasyon; itala ang pasya sa board resolution o minutes ng pulong; maglabas ng sertipiko sa mga kwalipikadong BHW; suriin at aprubahan ang mga benepisyong gagamit ng pondong lokal; magrekomenda ng benepisyo at paglalaan ng pondo; magbigay ng kopya ng BHW registry sa DOH; at magsagawa ng monitoring sa serbisyo.",
                  "start_ms": 6120,
                  "end_ms": 42240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Magkahiwalay ang pasya sa akreditasyon at ang pagsusuri ng benepisyong may lokal na pondo.",
                  "start_ms": 42540,
                  "end_ms": 48660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Maaari ring bumuo ang board ng BHW Registration and Accreditation Committee.",
                  "start_ms": 48960,
                  "end_ms": 55160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Inilalarawan ng facilitator guide ang pagsusuri, panayam, rekomendasyon sa board at pag-aayos ng registry bilang mga tungkuling pantulong ng komite.",
                  "start_ms": 55460,
                  "end_ms": 66380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Hindi katumbas ng opisyal na pasya ng board ang rekomendasyon lamang.",
                  "start_ms": 66680,
                  "end_ms": 71320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "May pananagutan ang board; pantulong ang komite at may opisyal na tala ang pasya.",
                  "start_ms": 71620,
                  "end_ms": 77820
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "bhw-follow-up": [
      {
        "module": "04-ra7883",
        "sections": {
          "section-6": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-follow-up/section-6.en.e5a75df83aad.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "e5a75df83aada2f3cd39806e736ca74605c2831408bd9d33595b2fff38f26f03",
              "sha256": "2aba5121834adc590635b233ed3a0f4bf8d7168344745a65ab5fbda75b73a7a6",
              "duration_seconds": 43.442,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "When the process is slow",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "You now know the whole process — but what do you do if months pass with no word?",
                  "start_ms": 2740,
                  "end_ms": 8980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "The best move: calm yourself first before frustration takes over, then follow up with a specific question — not \"when will this be done?\"",
                  "start_ms": 9280,
                  "end_ms": 20440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "but \"what's the status of my application, and is there anything else I need to submit?\"",
                  "start_ms": 20740,
                  "end_ms": 27220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "A clear, calm question is more likely to get answered than a complaint with no specific ask.",
                  "start_ms": 27520,
                  "end_ms": 35200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Following up calmly and with a specific question works better than a complaint with no specific ask.",
                  "start_ms": 35500,
                  "end_ms": 43380
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-follow-up/section-6.fil.cb0586faccf0.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "cb0586faccf0408db0c98d916a26c05fa5c92b9b47e650efad1060c935f876cc",
              "sha256": "81255b6d9f0b9f8e18d387b0b2f4ef5eb18a7667515f5099749ffecdc61ceff7",
              "duration_seconds": 47.804,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Kapag mabagal ang proseso",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Alam mo na ngayon ang buong proseso — pero ano ang gagawin mo kung inabot ito ng ilang buwan nang walang balita?",
                  "start_ms": 2660,
                  "end_ms": 10740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ang pinakamahusay na hakbang: pakalmahin muna ang sarili bago sumulpot sa galit, saka mag-follow-up nang may tiyak na tanong — hindi \"kailan pa ba ito matatapos?\"",
                  "start_ms": 11040,
                  "end_ms": 23800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "kundi \"ano pong status ng aking aplikasyon, at may kailangan pa po ba akong ibigay?\"",
                  "start_ms": 24100,
                  "end_ms": 30900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ang malinaw at kalmadong tanong ay mas malamang na masagot kaysa sa reklamong walang tiyak na hinihingi.",
                  "start_ms": 31200,
                  "end_ms": 38640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang pag-follow-up nang kalmado at may tiyak na tanong ay mas epektibo kaysa sa reklamong walang tiyak na hinihingi.",
                  "start_ms": 38940,
                  "end_ms": 47740
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-7": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-follow-up/section-7.en.35e054814efd.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "35e054814efd1b3d8b77a6bdbdd2f8bad61c8384eba853fb4d6d69e42b069cb5",
              "sha256": "e56ca1e16b8372b8ce1cb1b945ae52bd8275dbf3e9f70d70215817d65104efcd",
              "duration_seconds": 48.771,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Wrong versus right: following up on a benefit",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "**Wrong**: Josie waited six months for her accreditation but never asked, because \"maybe I'll look impatient.\"",
                  "start_ms": 4060,
                  "end_ms": 13220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "She eventually found out one of her documents had gone missing at the office — a six-month delay that could have been avoided with an earlier follow-up.",
                  "start_ms": 13520,
                  "end_ms": 23920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "**Right**: Josie followed up every two months, with a specific question about her application's status, and reminded them calmly whenever needed.",
                  "start_ms": 24220,
                  "end_ms": 34180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "When the missing document was discovered, it was resubmitted right away.",
                  "start_ms": 34480,
                  "end_ms": 39240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Staying silent in the face of a delay isn't politeness — it often just lets a problem drag on that could have been fixed much sooner.",
                  "start_ms": 39540,
                  "end_ms": 48700
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/04-ra7883/bhw-follow-up/section-7.fil.21df6ae4e4cc.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "21df6ae4e4cc4a2eb5256feefc378accaed2f1c7d849f7288546676ebbb9a223",
              "sha256": "dfe5c7fe77e7bd95283da7b2dda890f952023f1fb23712944f54062c5d25e390",
              "duration_seconds": 54.674,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Mali kumpara sa tama: humingi ng nararapat",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 4720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "**Mali**: Anim na buwan nang naghihintay si Josie sa kanyang akreditasyon, pero hindi siya nagtanong kahit kailan dahil \"baka mukhang naiinip ako.\"",
                  "start_ms": 5020,
                  "end_ms": 15460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sa kalaunan, nalaman niyang nawala pala ang isa sa kanyang mga dokumento sa opisina — anim na buwang pagkaantala na naiwasan sana kung nag-follow-up siya nang maaga.",
                  "start_ms": 15760,
                  "end_ms": 27840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "**Tama**: Nag-follow-up si Josie tuwing dalawang buwan, may tiyak na tanong tungkol sa status ng aplikasyon, at kalmadong nagpaalala tuwing kailangan.",
                  "start_ms": 28140,
                  "end_ms": 38300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Nang matuklasan ang nawawalang dokumento, agad itong naibigay muli.",
                  "start_ms": 38600,
                  "end_ms": 43800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang katahimikan sa harap ng pagkaantala ay hindi pagiging magalang — madalas itong nagpapahaba lang ng problemang kaya sanang naayos nang maaga.",
                  "start_ms": 44100,
                  "end_ms": 54620
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "bhw-relationships": [
      {
        "module": "05-bhw-at-barangay",
        "sections": {
          "section-1": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-1.en.8f76e75c5526.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "8f76e75c552642fef5907fefe6b7de1e94256ac08ca42861db22d37d189b2b4b",
              "sha256": "b857cad2c9d0cb94ddc984c5d9f8fc3871d60d00112c3bea4ac25f5279f92239",
              "duration_seconds": 43.494,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The question at Aling Nena's house",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Aling Nena, 34 years old and a mother of three, came to BHW Marites' house because her eldest child had had a persistent cough.",
                  "start_ms": 3260,
                  "end_ms": 14700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "It had been going on for three weeks, and Aling Nena was starting to worry.",
                  "start_ms": 15000,
                  "end_ms": 20400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "As she listened, BHW Marites realized this wasn't just a question about a cough.",
                  "start_ms": 20700,
                  "end_ms": 27660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "She needed to work out who she should actually talk to about it — and it turned out more than one person was involved.",
                  "start_ms": 27960,
                  "end_ms": 36440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A simple household question usually passes through more than one relationship before it's resolved.",
                  "start_ms": 36740,
                  "end_ms": 43420
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-1.fil.87b918c20bde.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "87b918c20bde09202fc87f1d1c7ab57e693d3005ff91979d56f11c45fe3f1cc9",
              "sha256": "334243c586ba1f13ce0659f3c9b7bc345d90598194e7e333e7800e6081e8cea6",
              "duration_seconds": 45.166,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang tanong sa bahay ni Aling Nena",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Si Aling Nena, 34 anyos, ina ng tatlong anak, ay pumunta sa bahay ni BHW Marites dahil sa palagiang ubo ng kanyang panganay na anak.",
                  "start_ms": 3020,
                  "end_ms": 15140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Tatlong linggo na itong nangyayari, at natatakot na si Aling Nena.",
                  "start_ms": 15440,
                  "end_ms": 20720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Habang nakikinig, naisip ni BHW Marites: hindi lang ito tanong tungkol sa ubo.",
                  "start_ms": 21020,
                  "end_ms": 28980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Kailangan niyang malaman kung sino ang dapat niyang kausapin tungkol dito — at hindi lang isang tao pala ang kasangkot.",
                  "start_ms": 29280,
                  "end_ms": 37200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang isang simpleng katanungan sa bahay-bahay ay kadalasang dumadaan sa mahigit isang ugnayan bago matapos.",
                  "start_ms": 37500,
                  "end_ms": 45100
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-2": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-2.en.2444cd2924cc.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "2444cd2924ccbb41903e11c7276033a43ec23ae668be4a1eb1fe62b675513872",
              "sha256": "3bc7c626b852501b8574866452d0495e5bb17e394eedf8828a7f0ad318121ca3",
              "duration_seconds": 64.784,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Four relationships of a BHW",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A BHW's work does not revolve around just one person.",
                  "start_ms": 3500,
                  "end_ms": 8500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Four relationships shape the day-to-day work: The **community** — families like Aling Nena's, where the first step of care happens.",
                  "start_ms": 8800,
                  "end_ms": 18400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "The **midwife or Rural Health Unit (RHU)** — the technical support the BHW turns to for referrals or clinical questions.",
                  "start_ms": 18700,
                  "end_ms": 28700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "The **barangay officials** — the partner for support and facilities like the barangay health station.",
                  "start_ms": 29000,
                  "end_ms": 35480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "(Accreditation itself comes from the local health board of the city or municipality, as Module 4 explains.)",
                  "start_ms": 35780,
                  "end_ms": 43460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "And **fellow BHWs** — the peers who share experience and correct practice.",
                  "start_ms": 43760,
                  "end_ms": 50120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "These are four distinct relationships, but they are always present together in an ordinary BHW day.",
                  "start_ms": 50420,
                  "end_ms": 58780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Four relationships run through the BHW — the role never works alone.",
                  "start_ms": 59080,
                  "end_ms": 64720
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-2.fil.0284d2bda6cb.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "0284d2bda6cba4729fb6320afa7b3d45877c4ef312ae3a67a78070cfe561e5b5",
              "sha256": "c8fc0297b140b61e60b1b2a4b3f02fe88aaf8372948b99f9cb71b7208ad60723",
              "duration_seconds": 74.031,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Apat na ugnayan ng isang BHW",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 4040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang gawain ng BHW ay hindi umiikot sa iisang tao lamang.",
                  "start_ms": 4340,
                  "end_ms": 10020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Apat na ugnayan ang humuhubog sa araw-araw na trabaho: Ang **komunidad** — ang mga pamilyang tulad ni Aling Nena, kung saan naganap ang unang hakbang ng pangangalaga.",
                  "start_ms": 10320,
                  "end_ms": 23480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ang **midwife o Rural Health Unit (RHU)** — ang teknikal na susuportang kaakibat kapag may kailangang i-refer o may klinikal na tanong.",
                  "start_ms": 23780,
                  "end_ms": 34740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ang **barangay officials** — ang kasosyo sa suporta at mga pasilidad tulad ng barangay health station.",
                  "start_ms": 35040,
                  "end_ms": 42960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "(Ang akreditasyon mismo ay galing sa local health board ng lungsod o munisipyo, gaya ng ipinaliwanag sa Modyul 4.)",
                  "start_ms": 43260,
                  "end_ms": 51700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "At ang **kapwa BHW** — ang kasamahang pinagbabahaginan ng karanasan at tamang kaalaman.",
                  "start_ms": 52000,
                  "end_ms": 59720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Apat itong magkaibang ugnayan, ngunit palaging magkasama sa isang karaniwang araw ng BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 60020,
                  "end_ms": 67780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Apat na ugnayan ang dumadaan sa BHW — hindi ito nagtatrabaho nang mag-isa.",
                  "start_ms": 68080,
                  "end_ms": 73960
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-3": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-3.en.657efab88f02.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "657efab88f0270b703eab71902196f84ce786eaf187679adf0c47bad3dc42c82",
              "sha256": "fe37d39340836d11bf9033f4945d776b4800235d0aebd3a853b686751d0674a1",
              "duration_seconds": 48.3,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Who is the right person to approach?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Back to BHW Marites.",
                  "start_ms": 3020,
                  "end_ms": 5940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "She now knows the four relationships — the next step is choosing which one actually fits Aling Nena's situation.",
                  "start_ms": 6240,
                  "end_ms": 14680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Not every situation calls for the same person.",
                  "start_ms": 14980,
                  "end_ms": 18420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "The right first question is: \"What kind of support does this need — clinical, administrative, or the experience of a fellow BHW?\"",
                  "start_ms": 18720,
                  "end_ms": 28440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "In Aling Nena's case, a three-week cough is a clinical concern — so the midwife or RHU is the right first stop, not the barangay captain.",
                  "start_ms": 28740,
                  "end_ms": 39820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Before acting, first work out what kind of support is needed — that is how you know who to actually approach.",
                  "start_ms": 40120,
                  "end_ms": 48240
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-3.fil.16edc4d672a5.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "16edc4d672a52449959a7eae4e8464d644b1512205b8d80f544a798744157f38",
              "sha256": "87f73ee73e9b4f7135642cb815fd505482142f8323116bec857e620de5e781a6",
              "duration_seconds": 50.495,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Sino ang lalapitan?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Bumalik tayo kay BHW Marites.",
                  "start_ms": 2180,
                  "end_ms": 5220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Alam na niya ang apat na ugnayan — ngayon kailangan niyang piliin kung alin dito ang bagay sa sitwasyon ni Aling Nena.",
                  "start_ms": 5520,
                  "end_ms": 13520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Hindi lahat ng sitwasyon ay kailangan ng parehong tao.",
                  "start_ms": 13820,
                  "end_ms": 17900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ang tamang unang tanong ay: \"Anong uri ng suporta ang kailangan dito — klinikal ba, administratibo, o karanasan ng kapwa BHW?\"",
                  "start_ms": 18200,
                  "end_ms": 29560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Sa kaso ni Aling Nena, ang tatlong-linggong ubo ay klinikal na alalahanin — kaya't ang midwife o RHU ang unang dapat lapitan, hindi ang barangay captain.",
                  "start_ms": 29860,
                  "end_ms": 41860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Bago kumilos, tukuyin muna kung anong uri ng suporta ang kailangan — doon mo malalaman kung sino talaga ang lalapitan.",
                  "start_ms": 42160,
                  "end_ms": 50440
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "module": "05-bhw-at-barangay",
        "sections": {
          "community-listening": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/community-listening.en.14432502d1fa.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "14432502d1fa56b0b054df4e2b32bd2506cb18b2ef1e7f1176797ffdc7b231ff",
              "sha256": "48b83816bf28ffe0bc68d881af3e7e5a515871474683978a739f064540ac9eb8",
              "duration_seconds": 46.994,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Listen before assuming",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Malou repeats what she heard: “You want to confirm the venue and speak with a health professional.",
                  "start_ms": 2620,
                  "end_ms": 8740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Have I understood correctly?”",
                  "start_ms": 9040,
                  "end_ms": 11120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Nena can correct that summary and explain what matters to her.",
                  "start_ms": 11420,
                  "end_ms": 15580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Known: Nena has two questions.",
                  "start_ms": 15880,
                  "end_ms": 18680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Unknown: the confirmed venue, the locally designated professional contact, and Nena's preferred way to ask.",
                  "start_ms": 18980,
                  "end_ms": 26100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Malou does not assume that Nena needs transport or has a particular illness.",
                  "start_ms": 26400,
                  "end_ms": 32320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "She asks, “What information would help you, and how would you prefer to receive it?”",
                  "start_ms": 32620,
                  "end_ms": 37900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Use fictional details only during practice.",
                  "start_ms": 38200,
                  "end_ms": 41960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Repeat, clarify and invite the resident to correct your understanding.",
                  "start_ms": 42260,
                  "end_ms": 46940
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/community-listening.fil.cb01c2554014.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "cb01c25540148604f10c724f9d6956d777e5af1431a7cde653d2e3bebc35997d",
              "sha256": "31623ba536262837b5be6a16755924f7ad87c5678d3ee0843f5f4015604cc62e",
              "duration_seconds": 55.876,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Makinig bago magpalagay",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Inulit ni Malou ang narinig: “Gusto ninyong tiyakin ang lugar at makausap ang health professional.",
                  "start_ms": 3180,
                  "end_ms": 9180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Tama po ba ang pagkaunawa ko?”",
                  "start_ms": 9480,
                  "end_ms": 11840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Maaaring itama ni Nena ang buod at sabihin kung ano ang mahalaga sa kaniya.",
                  "start_ms": 12140,
                  "end_ms": 17340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Alam: may dalawang tanong si Nena.",
                  "start_ms": 17640,
                  "end_ms": 20320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Hindi pa alam: ang tiyak na lugar, ang lokal na itinalagang propesyonal na contact at ang paraang nais ni Nena sa pagtatanong.",
                  "start_ms": 20620,
                  "end_ms": 31020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Hindi ipinapalagay ni Malou na kailangan ni Nena ng transportasyon o may partikular siyang sakit.",
                  "start_ms": 31320,
                  "end_ms": 38360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Nagtanong siya: “Anong impormasyon ang makatutulong, at paano ninyo ito gustong matanggap?”",
                  "start_ms": 38660,
                  "end_ms": 45140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Kathang-isip na detalye lamang ang gamitin sa pagsasanay.",
                  "start_ms": 45440,
                  "end_ms": 49320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ulitin, linawin at hayaang itama ng residente ang iyong pagkaunawa.",
                  "start_ms": 49620,
                  "end_ms": 55820
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "relationships-application-check": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/relationships-application-check.en.e4c0d280b174.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "e4c0d280b1743f49c5224a3762affee7d59b0d2eb6579ec03cdcb27269e644cc",
              "sha256": "2d473649b4f4117c20e57cf31cf910cced08ceae0f13d67b20f504a6061149eb",
              "duration_seconds": 60.212,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Explain and apply the relationships",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Try the application check below.",
                  "start_ms": 3140,
                  "end_ms": 5620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "In Nena's fictional situation, explain what each relationship can contribute and what it cannot decide.",
                  "start_ms": 5920,
                  "end_ms": 13760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Give a reason for the contact you choose and one question you would use to verify that person's role.",
                  "start_ms": 14060,
                  "end_ms": 21140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "For equivalent written or paired practice, make four cards: resident's concern and choice; professional question; administrative support request; peer task.",
                  "start_ms": 21440,
                  "end_ms": 33920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Match each to an appropriate locally confirmed role, then explain the limits.",
                  "start_ms": 34220,
                  "end_ms": 40260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Your partner can ask, “What do you still need to clarify?”",
                  "start_ms": 40560,
                  "end_ms": 44280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Use invented details, receive feedback and try again.",
                  "start_ms": 44580,
                  "end_ms": 49100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Judge the explanation, not the person's accent or personality.",
                  "start_ms": 49400,
                  "end_ms": 53880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Explain the choice, verify the role and respect the resident’s preferences.",
                  "start_ms": 54180,
                  "end_ms": 60140
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/relationships-application-check.fil.48a85170d003.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "48a85170d003b7a7100cc26a8689ed11cf60d1c8d1de939314fe3d33fd7e2db6",
              "sha256": "a54c45052435385185dadd1d4672d634762277cdbdb30ac09539468667f70a17",
              "duration_seconds": 66.09,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ipaliwanag at gamitin ang mga ugnayan",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Subukan ang tanong sa ibaba.",
                  "start_ms": 4060,
                  "end_ms": 6220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sa kathang-isip na sitwasyon ni Nena, ipaliwanag ang maitutulong ng bawat ugnayan at ang hindi nito maaaring pagpasyahan.",
                  "start_ms": 6520,
                  "end_ms": 14800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Magbigay ng dahilan sa piniling contact at isang tanong upang tiyakin ang papel niya.",
                  "start_ms": 15100,
                  "end_ms": 20900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Para sa katumbas na pasulat o magkapares na pagsasanay, gumawa ng apat na card: alalahanin at pagpili ng residente; propesyonal na tanong; hiling na suportang administratibo; gawain ng kapwa BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 21200,
                  "end_ms": 38360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Itugma sa angkop na papel na tiniyak sa lokalidad, saka ipaliwanag ang hangganan.",
                  "start_ms": 38660,
                  "end_ms": 44260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Maaaring itanong ng kapareha: “Ano pa ang kailangan mong linawin?”",
                  "start_ms": 44560,
                  "end_ms": 49320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Gumamit ng kathang-isip na detalye, tumanggap ng puna at umulit.",
                  "start_ms": 49620,
                  "end_ms": 54900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Paliwanag ang suriin, hindi punto ng pagsasalita o personalidad.",
                  "start_ms": 55200,
                  "end_ms": 59800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ipaliwanag ang pagpili, tiyakin ang papel at igalang ang nais ng residente.",
                  "start_ms": 60100,
                  "end_ms": 66020
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-1": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-1.en.5570ac2a6af2.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "5570ac2a6af2264152202d3fc5d977a82e19ab3f981d2cb9f45d821d98eee7da",
              "sha256": "c4007ae906fbd2f52f7c2e09b885490263ea9cc9df8b6cf00b7adfc9a15d0bb9",
              "duration_seconds": 45.558,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Malou listens in the courtyard",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "In this fictional learning situation, BHW Malou meets Aling Nena in a shaded barangay courtyard.",
                  "start_ms": 2660,
                  "end_ms": 9660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Nena asks about a planned community health activity: “Where will it be held?",
                  "start_ms": 9960,
                  "end_ms": 15160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "I also want to ask a health professional whether it is suitable for me.”",
                  "start_ms": 15460,
                  "end_ms": 19780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Malou listens and asks which question Nena wants help with first.",
                  "start_ms": 20080,
                  "end_ms": 25000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "The venue question and the personal health question need different kinds of support.",
                  "start_ms": 25300,
                  "end_ms": 30220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Nena's preferences matter; Malou does not decide what she needs without asking.",
                  "start_ms": 30520,
                  "end_ms": 36000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Read or Slides can be completed without the optional story.",
                  "start_ms": 36300,
                  "end_ms": 40300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Listen to the resident and separate the questions before choosing support.",
                  "start_ms": 40600,
                  "end_ms": 45480
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-1.fil.87f852942a14.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "87f852942a14a7f06536424c07cb2269429937b44b7e30fd0c31d0cb805e0d44",
              "sha256": "6986f05b26d180931c1fe43be1a2343efa9de7f3807a709a2d6c3a2813d15214",
              "duration_seconds": 52.637,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Nakikinig si Malou sa bakuran",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Sa kathang-isip na sitwasyong ito, nakatagpo ni BHW Malou si Aling Nena sa malilim na bakuran ng barangay.",
                  "start_ms": 2900,
                  "end_ms": 12020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Nagtanong si Nena tungkol sa nakaplanong gawaing pangkalusugan: “Saan po ito gaganapin?",
                  "start_ms": 12320,
                  "end_ms": 18840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Gusto ko ring itanong sa health professional kung angkop ito para sa akin.”",
                  "start_ms": 19140,
                  "end_ms": 23300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Nakinig si Malou at nagtanong kung alin ang gustong unahing linawin ni Nena.",
                  "start_ms": 23600,
                  "end_ms": 28880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Magkaibang suporta ang kailangan sa tanong tungkol sa lugar at sa personal na kalusugan.",
                  "start_ms": 29180,
                  "end_ms": 35100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Mahalaga ang pagpili ni Nena; hindi hinuhulaan ni Malou ang kaniyang pangangailangan.",
                  "start_ms": 35400,
                  "end_ms": 41400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Maaaring tapusin ang Read o Slides nang hindi pinapanood ang opsyonal na kuwento.",
                  "start_ms": 41700,
                  "end_ms": 47220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Makinig sa residente at ihiwalay ang mga tanong bago pumili ng suporta.",
                  "start_ms": 47520,
                  "end_ms": 52560
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-2": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-2.en.2444cd2924cc.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "2444cd2924ccbb41903e11c7276033a43ec23ae668be4a1eb1fe62b675513872",
              "sha256": "3bc7c626b852501b8574866452d0495e5bb17e394eedf8828a7f0ad318121ca3",
              "duration_seconds": 64.784,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Four relationships of a BHW",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A BHW's work does not revolve around just one person.",
                  "start_ms": 3500,
                  "end_ms": 8500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Four relationships shape the day-to-day work: The **community** — families like Aling Nena's, where the first step of care happens.",
                  "start_ms": 8800,
                  "end_ms": 18400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "The **midwife or Rural Health Unit (RHU)** — the technical support the BHW turns to for referrals or clinical questions.",
                  "start_ms": 18700,
                  "end_ms": 28700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "The **barangay officials** — the partner for support and facilities like the barangay health station.",
                  "start_ms": 29000,
                  "end_ms": 35480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "(Accreditation itself comes from the local health board of the city or municipality, as Module 4 explains.)",
                  "start_ms": 35780,
                  "end_ms": 43460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "And **fellow BHWs** — the peers who share experience and correct practice.",
                  "start_ms": 43760,
                  "end_ms": 50120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "These are four distinct relationships, but they are always present together in an ordinary BHW day.",
                  "start_ms": 50420,
                  "end_ms": 58780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Four relationships run through the BHW — the role never works alone.",
                  "start_ms": 59080,
                  "end_ms": 64720
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-2.fil.1e2a31cc2ce6.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "1e2a31cc2ce6e24331ada007ca3d380dcb3ad2a1d223389b8d629cda68bc4f30",
              "sha256": "c49fbc25deebe148081cc65396e1adbb1f0300e9d044d8e00e632d83a3a2d6e4",
              "duration_seconds": 86.596,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Apat na ugnayan, magkakaibang layunin",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ginagamit sa araling ito ang apat na ugnayan bilang ginawang balangkas sa pagtuturo, hindi opisyal na apat na antas ng pamamahala.",
                  "start_ms": 3740,
                  "end_ms": 13380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Komunidad: ibinabahagi ng mga residente at pamilya ang kanilang alalahanin, impormasyon at pagpili.",
                  "start_ms": 13680,
                  "end_ms": 21960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Makinig at maglinaw kasama nila; hindi lamang sila tagatanggap ng tulong.",
                  "start_ms": 22260,
                  "end_ms": 27740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Itinalagang midwife o health professional ng Rural Health Unit: humingi ng awtorisadong propesyonal na gabay sa tanong pangkalusugan, ayon sa lokal na kaayusang tiniyak.",
                  "start_ms": 28040,
                  "end_ms": 40560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Hindi kapalit ng propesyonal na pagtatasa ang BHW o kapwa BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 40860,
                  "end_ms": 47100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Barangay officials: itanong sa responsableng lokal na contact ang suportang administratibo, pasilidad o kaayusan ng aktibidad.",
                  "start_ms": 47400,
                  "end_ms": 57160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Nakasalalay ang suporta sa lokal na papel at magagamit na kagamitan; walang garantiya.",
                  "start_ms": 57460,
                  "end_ms": 64140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Kapwa BHW: magbahagi ng karanasan sa karaniwang gawain, mag-ugnay ng napagkasunduang mga tungkulin at tumulong tukuyin ang dapat linawin.",
                  "start_ms": 64440,
                  "end_ms": 75720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Hindi nagiging klinikal na awtoridad ang payo ng kapwa BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 76020,
                  "end_ms": 81100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "May layunin at hangganan ang bawat ugnayan; tiyakin ang lokal na papel.",
                  "start_ms": 81400,
                  "end_ms": 86520
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-3": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-3.en.8f3a2920f542.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "8f3a2920f54239314a5bce8c824b648f065d3f7420d177a7c35d740aeacbc041",
              "sha256": "e985831e79cb6b99a651a15f2445792f04a880490a0343af75f367b435ce66eb",
              "duration_seconds": 56.607,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose a contact for the concern",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "For Nena's personal health question, Malou helps clarify the locally designated midwife or authorized health professional and how to contact them.",
                  "start_ms": 2700,
                  "end_ms": 12620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "She explains: “This question needs professional guidance; I should not answer it through a guess.”",
                  "start_ms": 12920,
                  "end_ms": 19120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "The exact local arrangement must be confirmed.",
                  "start_ms": 19420,
                  "end_ms": 22660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "For the venue, Malou checks the activity's verified information and asks the responsible local coordinator if anything remains unclear.",
                  "start_ms": 22960,
                  "end_ms": 31920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Ask a contact, “Is this within your role?",
                  "start_ms": 32220,
                  "end_ms": 35580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "If not, who is responsible?”",
                  "start_ms": 35880,
                  "end_ms": 38520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Position or familiarity alone does not establish the right role.",
                  "start_ms": 38820,
                  "end_ms": 44180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "This is an organizational example, not medical triage or a universal referral sequence.",
                  "start_ms": 44480,
                  "end_ms": 51080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose by the concern and confirmed role, rather than rank alone.",
                  "start_ms": 51380,
                  "end_ms": 56540
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-3.fil.3078161687b0.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "3078161687b044af4c0ea068a1c7ffbfdfe8474b651b0924dcde2d9c2ea9f225",
              "sha256": "80045305b471c0c209230b1838ee7cf5bba20a59d6d21505eec655074392afcc",
              "duration_seconds": 62.616,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang contact ayon sa alalahanin",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Para sa personal na tanong pangkalusugan ni Nena, tumutulong si Malou na linawin ang lokal na itinalagang midwife o awtorisadong health professional at ang paraan ng pakikipag-ugnayan.",
                  "start_ms": 3420,
                  "end_ms": 15940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ipinaliwanag niya: “Kailangan dito ng propesyonal na gabay; hindi ako dapat sumagot sa pamamagitan ng hula.”",
                  "start_ms": 16240,
                  "end_ms": 23680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Dapat tiyakin ang mismong lokal na kaayusan.",
                  "start_ms": 23980,
                  "end_ms": 26940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Para sa lugar, sinusuri ni Malou ang natiyak na impormasyon ng aktibidad at nagtatanong sa responsableng lokal na coordinator kung may malabo pa.",
                  "start_ms": 27240,
                  "end_ms": 37120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Itanong sa contact: “Saklaw po ba ito ng inyong papel?",
                  "start_ms": 37420,
                  "end_ms": 41740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Kung hindi, sino po ang responsable?”",
                  "start_ms": 42040,
                  "end_ms": 44840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Hindi sapat ang posisyon o pagiging kakilala.",
                  "start_ms": 45140,
                  "end_ms": 48420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Halimbawang pang-organisasyon ito, hindi medikal na triage o iisang proseso ng referral para sa lahat.",
                  "start_ms": 48720,
                  "end_ms": 56360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pumili ayon sa alalahanin at natiyak na papel, hindi sa posisyon lamang.",
                  "start_ms": 56660,
                  "end_ms": 62540
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "shared-support": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/shared-support.en.8b6326bb9fa2.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "8b6326bb9fa2a9b24d9667ad020871edaff4f7f8ab6df8da349a7e1c2ad90c7a",
              "sha256": "076e2c31eb05af626dc6827afc7e40bb6ac358269edbb75a3d5208200c986256",
              "duration_seconds": 58.201,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Coordinate support without replacing roles",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Malou keeps the questions separate while coordinating support.",
                  "start_ms": 3700,
                  "end_ms": 7780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "With Nena's agreement, she helps identify a suitable channel for the professional question.",
                  "start_ms": 8080,
                  "end_ms": 13800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Separately, the responsible barangay contact may clarify the venue or a request for practical support.",
                  "start_ms": 14100,
                  "end_ms": 20860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "A fellow BHW can help Malou organize an agreed routine task and check what remains unclear.",
                  "start_ms": 21160,
                  "end_ms": 28520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Nena contributes her preferences throughout.",
                  "start_ms": 28820,
                  "end_ms": 32300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Malou confirms what was actually agreed and what is still unknown.",
                  "start_ms": 32600,
                  "end_ms": 38040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "An official or peer cannot replace the health professional's assessment.",
                  "start_ms": 38340,
                  "end_ms": 43820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "No relationship guarantees transport, supplies, a response time or a successful outcome.",
                  "start_ms": 44120,
                  "end_ms": 52240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Coordinate distinct roles without promising resources or replacing assessment.",
                  "start_ms": 52540,
                  "end_ms": 58140
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/shared-support.fil.284ae77c1442.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "284ae77c14429e93d0c82a158018930b6664aa0614ca9e0f17e00900e2e4b43f",
              "sha256": "6d1ecb602731ab410550f9fa304373a59f00dfb00c05713492f29c00e57e4ae8",
              "duration_seconds": 60.291,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Mag-ugnay ng suporta nang may malinaw na papel",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pinaghihiwalay ni Malou ang mga tanong habang pinag-uugnay ang suporta.",
                  "start_ms": 4100,
                  "end_ms": 8620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sa pagsang-ayon ni Nena, tumutulong siyang tukuyin ang angkop na paraan para sa propesyonal na tanong.",
                  "start_ms": 8920,
                  "end_ms": 15800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Hiwalay dito, maaaring linawin ng responsableng barangay contact ang lugar o hiling na praktikal na suporta.",
                  "start_ms": 16100,
                  "end_ms": 23860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Maaaring tulungan ng kapwa BHW si Malou na ayusin ang napagkasunduang karaniwang gawain at alamin ang malabo pa.",
                  "start_ms": 24160,
                  "end_ms": 32320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Patuloy na ibinabahagi ni Nena ang kaniyang pagpili.",
                  "start_ms": 32620,
                  "end_ms": 35860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Tinitiyak ni Malou ang talagang napagkasunduan at ang hindi pa alam.",
                  "start_ms": 36160,
                  "end_ms": 41080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Hindi kapalit ng health professional ang opisyal o kapwa BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 41380,
                  "end_ms": 47020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Walang garantiya ng transportasyon, kagamitan, oras ng sagot o matagumpay na resulta.",
                  "start_ms": 47320,
                  "end_ms": 54120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pag-ugnayin ang magkakaibang papel nang walang pangako o kapalit na pagtatasa.",
                  "start_ms": 54420,
                  "end_ms": 60220
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "module": "05-bhw-at-barangay",
        "sections": {
          "community-listening": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/community-listening.en.14432502d1fa.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "14432502d1fa56b0b054df4e2b32bd2506cb18b2ef1e7f1176797ffdc7b231ff",
              "sha256": "48b83816bf28ffe0bc68d881af3e7e5a515871474683978a739f064540ac9eb8",
              "duration_seconds": 46.994,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Listen before assuming",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Malou repeats what she heard: “You want to confirm the venue and speak with a health professional.",
                  "start_ms": 2620,
                  "end_ms": 8740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Have I understood correctly?”",
                  "start_ms": 9040,
                  "end_ms": 11120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Nena can correct that summary and explain what matters to her.",
                  "start_ms": 11420,
                  "end_ms": 15580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Known: Nena has two questions.",
                  "start_ms": 15880,
                  "end_ms": 18680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Unknown: the confirmed venue, the locally designated professional contact, and Nena's preferred way to ask.",
                  "start_ms": 18980,
                  "end_ms": 26100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Malou does not assume that Nena needs transport or has a particular illness.",
                  "start_ms": 26400,
                  "end_ms": 32320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "She asks, “What information would help you, and how would you prefer to receive it?”",
                  "start_ms": 32620,
                  "end_ms": 37900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Use fictional details only during practice.",
                  "start_ms": 38200,
                  "end_ms": 41960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Repeat, clarify and invite the resident to correct your understanding.",
                  "start_ms": 42260,
                  "end_ms": 46940
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/community-listening.fil.cb01c2554014.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "cb01c25540148604f10c724f9d6956d777e5af1431a7cde653d2e3bebc35997d",
              "sha256": "31623ba536262837b5be6a16755924f7ad87c5678d3ee0843f5f4015604cc62e",
              "duration_seconds": 55.876,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Makinig bago magpalagay",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Inulit ni Malou ang narinig: “Gusto ninyong tiyakin ang lugar at makausap ang health professional.",
                  "start_ms": 3180,
                  "end_ms": 9180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Tama po ba ang pagkaunawa ko?”",
                  "start_ms": 9480,
                  "end_ms": 11840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Maaaring itama ni Nena ang buod at sabihin kung ano ang mahalaga sa kaniya.",
                  "start_ms": 12140,
                  "end_ms": 17340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Alam: may dalawang tanong si Nena.",
                  "start_ms": 17640,
                  "end_ms": 20320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Hindi pa alam: ang tiyak na lugar, ang lokal na itinalagang propesyonal na contact at ang paraang nais ni Nena sa pagtatanong.",
                  "start_ms": 20620,
                  "end_ms": 31020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Hindi ipinapalagay ni Malou na kailangan ni Nena ng transportasyon o may partikular siyang sakit.",
                  "start_ms": 31320,
                  "end_ms": 38360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Nagtanong siya: “Anong impormasyon ang makatutulong, at paano ninyo ito gustong matanggap?”",
                  "start_ms": 38660,
                  "end_ms": 45140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Kathang-isip na detalye lamang ang gamitin sa pagsasanay.",
                  "start_ms": 45440,
                  "end_ms": 49320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ulitin, linawin at hayaang itama ng residente ang iyong pagkaunawa.",
                  "start_ms": 49620,
                  "end_ms": 55820
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "relationships-application-check": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/relationships-application-check.en.e4c0d280b174.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "e4c0d280b1743f49c5224a3762affee7d59b0d2eb6579ec03cdcb27269e644cc",
              "sha256": "2d473649b4f4117c20e57cf31cf910cced08ceae0f13d67b20f504a6061149eb",
              "duration_seconds": 60.212,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Explain and apply the relationships",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Try the application check below.",
                  "start_ms": 3140,
                  "end_ms": 5620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "In Nena's fictional situation, explain what each relationship can contribute and what it cannot decide.",
                  "start_ms": 5920,
                  "end_ms": 13760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Give a reason for the contact you choose and one question you would use to verify that person's role.",
                  "start_ms": 14060,
                  "end_ms": 21140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "For equivalent written or paired practice, make four cards: resident's concern and choice; professional question; administrative support request; peer task.",
                  "start_ms": 21440,
                  "end_ms": 33920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Match each to an appropriate locally confirmed role, then explain the limits.",
                  "start_ms": 34220,
                  "end_ms": 40260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Your partner can ask, “What do you still need to clarify?”",
                  "start_ms": 40560,
                  "end_ms": 44280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Use invented details, receive feedback and try again.",
                  "start_ms": 44580,
                  "end_ms": 49100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Judge the explanation, not the person's accent or personality.",
                  "start_ms": 49400,
                  "end_ms": 53880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Explain the choice, verify the role and respect the resident’s preferences.",
                  "start_ms": 54180,
                  "end_ms": 60140
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/relationships-application-check.fil.48a85170d003.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "48a85170d003b7a7100cc26a8689ed11cf60d1c8d1de939314fe3d33fd7e2db6",
              "sha256": "a54c45052435385185dadd1d4672d634762277cdbdb30ac09539468667f70a17",
              "duration_seconds": 66.09,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ipaliwanag at gamitin ang mga ugnayan",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Subukan ang tanong sa ibaba.",
                  "start_ms": 4060,
                  "end_ms": 6220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sa kathang-isip na sitwasyon ni Nena, ipaliwanag ang maitutulong ng bawat ugnayan at ang hindi nito maaaring pagpasyahan.",
                  "start_ms": 6520,
                  "end_ms": 14800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Magbigay ng dahilan sa piniling contact at isang tanong upang tiyakin ang papel niya.",
                  "start_ms": 15100,
                  "end_ms": 20900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Para sa katumbas na pasulat o magkapares na pagsasanay, gumawa ng apat na card: alalahanin at pagpili ng residente; propesyonal na tanong; hiling na suportang administratibo; gawain ng kapwa BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 21200,
                  "end_ms": 38360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Itugma sa angkop na papel na tiniyak sa lokalidad, saka ipaliwanag ang hangganan.",
                  "start_ms": 38660,
                  "end_ms": 44260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Maaaring itanong ng kapareha: “Ano pa ang kailangan mong linawin?”",
                  "start_ms": 44560,
                  "end_ms": 49320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Gumamit ng kathang-isip na detalye, tumanggap ng puna at umulit.",
                  "start_ms": 49620,
                  "end_ms": 54900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Paliwanag ang suriin, hindi punto ng pagsasalita o personalidad.",
                  "start_ms": 55200,
                  "end_ms": 59800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ipaliwanag ang pagpili, tiyakin ang papel at igalang ang nais ng residente.",
                  "start_ms": 60100,
                  "end_ms": 66020
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-1": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-1.en.5570ac2a6af2.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "5570ac2a6af2264152202d3fc5d977a82e19ab3f981d2cb9f45d821d98eee7da",
              "sha256": "c4007ae906fbd2f52f7c2e09b885490263ea9cc9df8b6cf00b7adfc9a15d0bb9",
              "duration_seconds": 45.558,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Malou listens in the courtyard",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "In this fictional learning situation, BHW Malou meets Aling Nena in a shaded barangay courtyard.",
                  "start_ms": 2660,
                  "end_ms": 9660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Nena asks about a planned community health activity: “Where will it be held?",
                  "start_ms": 9960,
                  "end_ms": 15160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "I also want to ask a health professional whether it is suitable for me.”",
                  "start_ms": 15460,
                  "end_ms": 19780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Malou listens and asks which question Nena wants help with first.",
                  "start_ms": 20080,
                  "end_ms": 25000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "The venue question and the personal health question need different kinds of support.",
                  "start_ms": 25300,
                  "end_ms": 30220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Nena's preferences matter; Malou does not decide what she needs without asking.",
                  "start_ms": 30520,
                  "end_ms": 36000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Read or Slides can be completed without the optional story.",
                  "start_ms": 36300,
                  "end_ms": 40300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Listen to the resident and separate the questions before choosing support.",
                  "start_ms": 40600,
                  "end_ms": 45480
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-1.fil.87f852942a14.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "87f852942a14a7f06536424c07cb2269429937b44b7e30fd0c31d0cb805e0d44",
              "sha256": "6986f05b26d180931c1fe43be1a2343efa9de7f3807a709a2d6c3a2813d15214",
              "duration_seconds": 52.637,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Nakikinig si Malou sa bakuran",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Sa kathang-isip na sitwasyong ito, nakatagpo ni BHW Malou si Aling Nena sa malilim na bakuran ng barangay.",
                  "start_ms": 2900,
                  "end_ms": 12020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Nagtanong si Nena tungkol sa nakaplanong gawaing pangkalusugan: “Saan po ito gaganapin?",
                  "start_ms": 12320,
                  "end_ms": 18840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Gusto ko ring itanong sa health professional kung angkop ito para sa akin.”",
                  "start_ms": 19140,
                  "end_ms": 23300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Nakinig si Malou at nagtanong kung alin ang gustong unahing linawin ni Nena.",
                  "start_ms": 23600,
                  "end_ms": 28880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Magkaibang suporta ang kailangan sa tanong tungkol sa lugar at sa personal na kalusugan.",
                  "start_ms": 29180,
                  "end_ms": 35100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Mahalaga ang pagpili ni Nena; hindi hinuhulaan ni Malou ang kaniyang pangangailangan.",
                  "start_ms": 35400,
                  "end_ms": 41400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Maaaring tapusin ang Read o Slides nang hindi pinapanood ang opsyonal na kuwento.",
                  "start_ms": 41700,
                  "end_ms": 47220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Makinig sa residente at ihiwalay ang mga tanong bago pumili ng suporta.",
                  "start_ms": 47520,
                  "end_ms": 52560
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-2": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-2.en.56ee444fbab3.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "56ee444fbab33dfd5b5c2f38c3761cc43c7857ba262cea9d5bb0892f40f39b9b",
              "sha256": "10060417c252aa0be30144cf868cf10f025df570aad5253e28f88e1e35ce2a33",
              "duration_seconds": 76.669,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Four relationships, different purposes",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "This lesson uses four relationships as an authored teaching organizer, not an official four-category chain of command.",
                  "start_ms": 3620,
                  "end_ms": 11700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Community: residents and families contribute their concerns, information and choices.",
                  "start_ms": 12000,
                  "end_ms": 18720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Listen and clarify with them rather than treating them as passive recipients.",
                  "start_ms": 19020,
                  "end_ms": 24380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Designated midwife or Rural Health Unit health professional: seek authorized professional guidance for health questions, following locally confirmed arrangements.",
                  "start_ms": 24680,
                  "end_ms": 36240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "A BHW or peer does not replace professional assessment.",
                  "start_ms": 36540,
                  "end_ms": 41340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Barangay officials: ask the responsible local contact about administrative support, facilities or activity arrangements.",
                  "start_ms": 41640,
                  "end_ms": 51400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Support depends on local roles and available resources; it is not guaranteed.",
                  "start_ms": 51700,
                  "end_ms": 57700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Fellow BHWs: share routine work experience, coordinate agreed tasks and help identify questions to clarify.",
                  "start_ms": 58000,
                  "end_ms": 66720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Peer advice does not become clinical authority.",
                  "start_ms": 67020,
                  "end_ms": 70700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Each relationship has a purpose and a limit; verify the local roles.",
                  "start_ms": 71000,
                  "end_ms": 76600
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-2.fil.1e2a31cc2ce6.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "1e2a31cc2ce6e24331ada007ca3d380dcb3ad2a1d223389b8d629cda68bc4f30",
              "sha256": "c49fbc25deebe148081cc65396e1adbb1f0300e9d044d8e00e632d83a3a2d6e4",
              "duration_seconds": 86.596,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Apat na ugnayan, magkakaibang layunin",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ginagamit sa araling ito ang apat na ugnayan bilang ginawang balangkas sa pagtuturo, hindi opisyal na apat na antas ng pamamahala.",
                  "start_ms": 3740,
                  "end_ms": 13380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Komunidad: ibinabahagi ng mga residente at pamilya ang kanilang alalahanin, impormasyon at pagpili.",
                  "start_ms": 13680,
                  "end_ms": 21960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Makinig at maglinaw kasama nila; hindi lamang sila tagatanggap ng tulong.",
                  "start_ms": 22260,
                  "end_ms": 27740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Itinalagang midwife o health professional ng Rural Health Unit: humingi ng awtorisadong propesyonal na gabay sa tanong pangkalusugan, ayon sa lokal na kaayusang tiniyak.",
                  "start_ms": 28040,
                  "end_ms": 40560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Hindi kapalit ng propesyonal na pagtatasa ang BHW o kapwa BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 40860,
                  "end_ms": 47100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Barangay officials: itanong sa responsableng lokal na contact ang suportang administratibo, pasilidad o kaayusan ng aktibidad.",
                  "start_ms": 47400,
                  "end_ms": 57160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Nakasalalay ang suporta sa lokal na papel at magagamit na kagamitan; walang garantiya.",
                  "start_ms": 57460,
                  "end_ms": 64140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Kapwa BHW: magbahagi ng karanasan sa karaniwang gawain, mag-ugnay ng napagkasunduang mga tungkulin at tumulong tukuyin ang dapat linawin.",
                  "start_ms": 64440,
                  "end_ms": 75720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Hindi nagiging klinikal na awtoridad ang payo ng kapwa BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 76020,
                  "end_ms": 81100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "May layunin at hangganan ang bawat ugnayan; tiyakin ang lokal na papel.",
                  "start_ms": 81400,
                  "end_ms": 86520
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-3": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-3.en.8f3a2920f542.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "8f3a2920f54239314a5bce8c824b648f065d3f7420d177a7c35d740aeacbc041",
              "sha256": "e985831e79cb6b99a651a15f2445792f04a880490a0343af75f367b435ce66eb",
              "duration_seconds": 56.607,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose a contact for the concern",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "For Nena's personal health question, Malou helps clarify the locally designated midwife or authorized health professional and how to contact them.",
                  "start_ms": 2700,
                  "end_ms": 12620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "She explains: “This question needs professional guidance; I should not answer it through a guess.”",
                  "start_ms": 12920,
                  "end_ms": 19120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "The exact local arrangement must be confirmed.",
                  "start_ms": 19420,
                  "end_ms": 22660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "For the venue, Malou checks the activity's verified information and asks the responsible local coordinator if anything remains unclear.",
                  "start_ms": 22960,
                  "end_ms": 31920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Ask a contact, “Is this within your role?",
                  "start_ms": 32220,
                  "end_ms": 35580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "If not, who is responsible?”",
                  "start_ms": 35880,
                  "end_ms": 38520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Position or familiarity alone does not establish the right role.",
                  "start_ms": 38820,
                  "end_ms": 44180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "This is an organizational example, not medical triage or a universal referral sequence.",
                  "start_ms": 44480,
                  "end_ms": 51080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose by the concern and confirmed role, rather than rank alone.",
                  "start_ms": 51380,
                  "end_ms": 56540
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-3.fil.3078161687b0.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "3078161687b044af4c0ea068a1c7ffbfdfe8474b651b0924dcde2d9c2ea9f225",
              "sha256": "80045305b471c0c209230b1838ee7cf5bba20a59d6d21505eec655074392afcc",
              "duration_seconds": 62.616,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang contact ayon sa alalahanin",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Para sa personal na tanong pangkalusugan ni Nena, tumutulong si Malou na linawin ang lokal na itinalagang midwife o awtorisadong health professional at ang paraan ng pakikipag-ugnayan.",
                  "start_ms": 3420,
                  "end_ms": 15940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ipinaliwanag niya: “Kailangan dito ng propesyonal na gabay; hindi ako dapat sumagot sa pamamagitan ng hula.”",
                  "start_ms": 16240,
                  "end_ms": 23680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Dapat tiyakin ang mismong lokal na kaayusan.",
                  "start_ms": 23980,
                  "end_ms": 26940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Para sa lugar, sinusuri ni Malou ang natiyak na impormasyon ng aktibidad at nagtatanong sa responsableng lokal na coordinator kung may malabo pa.",
                  "start_ms": 27240,
                  "end_ms": 37120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Itanong sa contact: “Saklaw po ba ito ng inyong papel?",
                  "start_ms": 37420,
                  "end_ms": 41740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Kung hindi, sino po ang responsable?”",
                  "start_ms": 42040,
                  "end_ms": 44840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Hindi sapat ang posisyon o pagiging kakilala.",
                  "start_ms": 45140,
                  "end_ms": 48420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Halimbawang pang-organisasyon ito, hindi medikal na triage o iisang proseso ng referral para sa lahat.",
                  "start_ms": 48720,
                  "end_ms": 56360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pumili ayon sa alalahanin at natiyak na papel, hindi sa posisyon lamang.",
                  "start_ms": 56660,
                  "end_ms": 62540
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "shared-support": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/shared-support.en.8b6326bb9fa2.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "8b6326bb9fa2a9b24d9667ad020871edaff4f7f8ab6df8da349a7e1c2ad90c7a",
              "sha256": "076e2c31eb05af626dc6827afc7e40bb6ac358269edbb75a3d5208200c986256",
              "duration_seconds": 58.201,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Coordinate support without replacing roles",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Malou keeps the questions separate while coordinating support.",
                  "start_ms": 3700,
                  "end_ms": 7780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "With Nena's agreement, she helps identify a suitable channel for the professional question.",
                  "start_ms": 8080,
                  "end_ms": 13800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Separately, the responsible barangay contact may clarify the venue or a request for practical support.",
                  "start_ms": 14100,
                  "end_ms": 20860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "A fellow BHW can help Malou organize an agreed routine task and check what remains unclear.",
                  "start_ms": 21160,
                  "end_ms": 28520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Nena contributes her preferences throughout.",
                  "start_ms": 28820,
                  "end_ms": 32300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Malou confirms what was actually agreed and what is still unknown.",
                  "start_ms": 32600,
                  "end_ms": 38040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "An official or peer cannot replace the health professional's assessment.",
                  "start_ms": 38340,
                  "end_ms": 43820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "No relationship guarantees transport, supplies, a response time or a successful outcome.",
                  "start_ms": 44120,
                  "end_ms": 52240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Coordinate distinct roles without promising resources or replacing assessment.",
                  "start_ms": 52540,
                  "end_ms": 58140
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/shared-support.fil.284ae77c1442.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "284ae77c14429e93d0c82a158018930b6664aa0614ca9e0f17e00900e2e4b43f",
              "sha256": "6d1ecb602731ab410550f9fa304373a59f00dfb00c05713492f29c00e57e4ae8",
              "duration_seconds": 60.291,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Mag-ugnay ng suporta nang may malinaw na papel",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pinaghihiwalay ni Malou ang mga tanong habang pinag-uugnay ang suporta.",
                  "start_ms": 4100,
                  "end_ms": 8620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sa pagsang-ayon ni Nena, tumutulong siyang tukuyin ang angkop na paraan para sa propesyonal na tanong.",
                  "start_ms": 8920,
                  "end_ms": 15800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Hiwalay dito, maaaring linawin ng responsableng barangay contact ang lugar o hiling na praktikal na suporta.",
                  "start_ms": 16100,
                  "end_ms": 23860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Maaaring tulungan ng kapwa BHW si Malou na ayusin ang napagkasunduang karaniwang gawain at alamin ang malabo pa.",
                  "start_ms": 24160,
                  "end_ms": 32320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Patuloy na ibinabahagi ni Nena ang kaniyang pagpili.",
                  "start_ms": 32620,
                  "end_ms": 35860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Tinitiyak ni Malou ang talagang napagkasunduan at ang hindi pa alam.",
                  "start_ms": 36160,
                  "end_ms": 41080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Hindi kapalit ng health professional ang opisyal o kapwa BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 41380,
                  "end_ms": 47020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Walang garantiya ng transportasyon, kagamitan, oras ng sagot o matagumpay na resulta.",
                  "start_ms": 47320,
                  "end_ms": 54120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pag-ugnayin ang magkakaibang papel nang walang pangako o kapalit na pagtatasa.",
                  "start_ms": 54420,
                  "end_ms": 60220
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "module": "05-bhw-at-barangay",
        "sections": {
          "community-listening": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/community-listening.en.53770bf83fd6.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "53770bf83fd65cda404e7937a501a6b66cf45f4d2fe7f42e2809fcc6090df293",
              "sha256": "fa593f89129150be66ad4a65d4f600c9ef5f0678ba9a8fdcea04c772b3fd42a5",
              "duration_seconds": 48.405,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Listen before assuming",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Malou repeats what she heard: “You want to confirm the venue and speak with a health professional.",
                  "start_ms": 3020,
                  "end_ms": 9140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Have I understood correctly?”",
                  "start_ms": 9440,
                  "end_ms": 11560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Nena can correct that summary and explain what matters to her.",
                  "start_ms": 11860,
                  "end_ms": 15700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Malou knows that Nena has two questions.",
                  "start_ms": 16000,
                  "end_ms": 19480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "She still needs to confirm the venue, the locally designated professional contact, and Nena's preferred way to ask.",
                  "start_ms": 19780,
                  "end_ms": 27300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Malou does not assume that Nena needs transport or has a particular illness.",
                  "start_ms": 27600,
                  "end_ms": 33040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "She asks, “What information would help you, and how would you prefer to receive it?”",
                  "start_ms": 33340,
                  "end_ms": 39140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Use fictional details only during practice.",
                  "start_ms": 39440,
                  "end_ms": 42920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Repeat, clarify and invite the resident to correct your understanding.",
                  "start_ms": 43220,
                  "end_ms": 48340
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/community-listening.fil.cb01c2554014.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "cb01c25540148604f10c724f9d6956d777e5af1431a7cde653d2e3bebc35997d",
              "sha256": "31623ba536262837b5be6a16755924f7ad87c5678d3ee0843f5f4015604cc62e",
              "duration_seconds": 55.876,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Makinig bago magpalagay",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Inulit ni Malou ang narinig: “Gusto ninyong tiyakin ang lugar at makausap ang health professional.",
                  "start_ms": 3180,
                  "end_ms": 9180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Tama po ba ang pagkaunawa ko?”",
                  "start_ms": 9480,
                  "end_ms": 11840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Maaaring itama ni Nena ang buod at sabihin kung ano ang mahalaga sa kaniya.",
                  "start_ms": 12140,
                  "end_ms": 17340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Alam: may dalawang tanong si Nena.",
                  "start_ms": 17640,
                  "end_ms": 20320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Hindi pa alam: ang tiyak na lugar, ang lokal na itinalagang propesyonal na contact at ang paraang nais ni Nena sa pagtatanong.",
                  "start_ms": 20620,
                  "end_ms": 31020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Hindi ipinapalagay ni Malou na kailangan ni Nena ng transportasyon o may partikular siyang sakit.",
                  "start_ms": 31320,
                  "end_ms": 38360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Nagtanong siya: “Anong impormasyon ang makatutulong, at paano ninyo ito gustong matanggap?”",
                  "start_ms": 38660,
                  "end_ms": 45140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Kathang-isip na detalye lamang ang gamitin sa pagsasanay.",
                  "start_ms": 45440,
                  "end_ms": 49320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ulitin, linawin at hayaang itama ng residente ang iyong pagkaunawa.",
                  "start_ms": 49620,
                  "end_ms": 55820
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "relationships-application-check": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/relationships-application-check.en.e4c0d280b174.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "e4c0d280b1743f49c5224a3762affee7d59b0d2eb6579ec03cdcb27269e644cc",
              "sha256": "2d473649b4f4117c20e57cf31cf910cced08ceae0f13d67b20f504a6061149eb",
              "duration_seconds": 60.212,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Explain and apply the relationships",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Try the application check below.",
                  "start_ms": 3140,
                  "end_ms": 5620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "In Nena's fictional situation, explain what each relationship can contribute and what it cannot decide.",
                  "start_ms": 5920,
                  "end_ms": 13760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Give a reason for the contact you choose and one question you would use to verify that person's role.",
                  "start_ms": 14060,
                  "end_ms": 21140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "For equivalent written or paired practice, make four cards: resident's concern and choice; professional question; administrative support request; peer task.",
                  "start_ms": 21440,
                  "end_ms": 33920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Match each to an appropriate locally confirmed role, then explain the limits.",
                  "start_ms": 34220,
                  "end_ms": 40260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Your partner can ask, “What do you still need to clarify?”",
                  "start_ms": 40560,
                  "end_ms": 44280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Use invented details, receive feedback and try again.",
                  "start_ms": 44580,
                  "end_ms": 49100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Judge the explanation, not the person's accent or personality.",
                  "start_ms": 49400,
                  "end_ms": 53880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Explain the choice, verify the role and respect the resident’s preferences.",
                  "start_ms": 54180,
                  "end_ms": 60140
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/relationships-application-check.fil.48a85170d003.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "48a85170d003b7a7100cc26a8689ed11cf60d1c8d1de939314fe3d33fd7e2db6",
              "sha256": "a54c45052435385185dadd1d4672d634762277cdbdb30ac09539468667f70a17",
              "duration_seconds": 66.09,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ipaliwanag at gamitin ang mga ugnayan",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Subukan ang tanong sa ibaba.",
                  "start_ms": 4060,
                  "end_ms": 6220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sa kathang-isip na sitwasyon ni Nena, ipaliwanag ang maitutulong ng bawat ugnayan at ang hindi nito maaaring pagpasyahan.",
                  "start_ms": 6520,
                  "end_ms": 14800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Magbigay ng dahilan sa piniling contact at isang tanong upang tiyakin ang papel niya.",
                  "start_ms": 15100,
                  "end_ms": 20900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Para sa katumbas na pasulat o magkapares na pagsasanay, gumawa ng apat na card: alalahanin at pagpili ng residente; propesyonal na tanong; hiling na suportang administratibo; gawain ng kapwa BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 21200,
                  "end_ms": 38360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Itugma sa angkop na papel na tiniyak sa lokalidad, saka ipaliwanag ang hangganan.",
                  "start_ms": 38660,
                  "end_ms": 44260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Maaaring itanong ng kapareha: “Ano pa ang kailangan mong linawin?”",
                  "start_ms": 44560,
                  "end_ms": 49320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Gumamit ng kathang-isip na detalye, tumanggap ng puna at umulit.",
                  "start_ms": 49620,
                  "end_ms": 54900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Paliwanag ang suriin, hindi punto ng pagsasalita o personalidad.",
                  "start_ms": 55200,
                  "end_ms": 59800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ipaliwanag ang pagpili, tiyakin ang papel at igalang ang nais ng residente.",
                  "start_ms": 60100,
                  "end_ms": 66020
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-1": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-1.en.422ed4b48951.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "422ed4b48951648a2fdf81ec149d90bb1728d39e1a4eb2817a42fab67600615b",
              "sha256": "4656a5c8fd162da5875b63d8da0f722a14ccb70431c51cc9e63f06acbe640075",
              "duration_seconds": 50.756,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Malou listens in the courtyard",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "In this fictional learning situation, BHW Malou meets Aling Nena in a shaded barangay courtyard.",
                  "start_ms": 2820,
                  "end_ms": 10380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Nena asks about a planned community health activity: “Where will it be held?",
                  "start_ms": 10680,
                  "end_ms": 16240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "I also want to ask a health professional whether it is suitable for me.”",
                  "start_ms": 16540,
                  "end_ms": 20940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Malou listens and asks which question Nena wants help with first.",
                  "start_ms": 21240,
                  "end_ms": 26480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "The venue question and the personal health question need different kinds of support.",
                  "start_ms": 26780,
                  "end_ms": 32340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Nena's preferences matter; Malou does not decide what she needs without asking.",
                  "start_ms": 32640,
                  "end_ms": 38640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Learners can finish this lesson in either reading or slide mode without watching the optional story.",
                  "start_ms": 38940,
                  "end_ms": 45380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Listen to the resident and separate the questions before choosing support.",
                  "start_ms": 45680,
                  "end_ms": 50680
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-1.fil.d655fff59fab.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "d655fff59fab6cc759c98c8201583d9aea8db250eb35fa5969d88b04117eb26d",
              "sha256": "01ff80eb6071215c0eeaac5d7d680f8c68af844ca661859e1d7ec9ae5bebef45",
              "duration_seconds": 52.036,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Nakikinig si Malou sa bakuran",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Sa kathang-isip na sitwasyong ito, nakatagpo ni BHW Malou si Aling Nena sa malilim na bakuran ng barangay.",
                  "start_ms": 2620,
                  "end_ms": 10380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Nagtanong si Nena tungkol sa nakaplanong gawaing pangkalusugan: “Saan po ito gaganapin?",
                  "start_ms": 10680,
                  "end_ms": 16880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Gusto ko ring itanong sa health professional kung angkop ito para sa akin.”",
                  "start_ms": 17180,
                  "end_ms": 21380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Nakinig si Malou at nagtanong kung alin ang gustong unahing linawin ni Nena.",
                  "start_ms": 21680,
                  "end_ms": 26880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Magkaibang suporta ang kailangan sa tanong tungkol sa lugar at sa personal na kalusugan.",
                  "start_ms": 27180,
                  "end_ms": 33420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Mahalaga ang pagpili ni Nena; hindi hinuhulaan ni Malou ang kaniyang pangangailangan.",
                  "start_ms": 33720,
                  "end_ms": 39240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Maaaring tapusin ang bahaging Basahin o Slides nang hindi pinapanood ang opsyonal na kuwento.",
                  "start_ms": 39540,
                  "end_ms": 46060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Makinig sa residente at ihiwalay ang mga tanong bago pumili ng suporta.",
                  "start_ms": 46360,
                  "end_ms": 51960
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-2": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-2.en.56ee444fbab3.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "56ee444fbab33dfd5b5c2f38c3761cc43c7857ba262cea9d5bb0892f40f39b9b",
              "sha256": "10060417c252aa0be30144cf868cf10f025df570aad5253e28f88e1e35ce2a33",
              "duration_seconds": 76.669,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Four relationships, different purposes",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "This lesson uses four relationships as an authored teaching organizer, not an official four-category chain of command.",
                  "start_ms": 3620,
                  "end_ms": 11700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Community: residents and families contribute their concerns, information and choices.",
                  "start_ms": 12000,
                  "end_ms": 18720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Listen and clarify with them rather than treating them as passive recipients.",
                  "start_ms": 19020,
                  "end_ms": 24380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Designated midwife or Rural Health Unit health professional: seek authorized professional guidance for health questions, following locally confirmed arrangements.",
                  "start_ms": 24680,
                  "end_ms": 36240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "A BHW or peer does not replace professional assessment.",
                  "start_ms": 36540,
                  "end_ms": 41340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Barangay officials: ask the responsible local contact about administrative support, facilities or activity arrangements.",
                  "start_ms": 41640,
                  "end_ms": 51400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Support depends on local roles and available resources; it is not guaranteed.",
                  "start_ms": 51700,
                  "end_ms": 57700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Fellow BHWs: share routine work experience, coordinate agreed tasks and help identify questions to clarify.",
                  "start_ms": 58000,
                  "end_ms": 66720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Peer advice does not become clinical authority.",
                  "start_ms": 67020,
                  "end_ms": 70700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Each relationship has a purpose and a limit; verify the local roles.",
                  "start_ms": 71000,
                  "end_ms": 76600
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-2.fil.1e2a31cc2ce6.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "1e2a31cc2ce6e24331ada007ca3d380dcb3ad2a1d223389b8d629cda68bc4f30",
              "sha256": "c49fbc25deebe148081cc65396e1adbb1f0300e9d044d8e00e632d83a3a2d6e4",
              "duration_seconds": 86.596,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Apat na ugnayan, magkakaibang layunin",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ginagamit sa araling ito ang apat na ugnayan bilang ginawang balangkas sa pagtuturo, hindi opisyal na apat na antas ng pamamahala.",
                  "start_ms": 3740,
                  "end_ms": 13380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Komunidad: ibinabahagi ng mga residente at pamilya ang kanilang alalahanin, impormasyon at pagpili.",
                  "start_ms": 13680,
                  "end_ms": 21960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Makinig at maglinaw kasama nila; hindi lamang sila tagatanggap ng tulong.",
                  "start_ms": 22260,
                  "end_ms": 27740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Itinalagang midwife o health professional ng Rural Health Unit: humingi ng awtorisadong propesyonal na gabay sa tanong pangkalusugan, ayon sa lokal na kaayusang tiniyak.",
                  "start_ms": 28040,
                  "end_ms": 40560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Hindi kapalit ng propesyonal na pagtatasa ang BHW o kapwa BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 40860,
                  "end_ms": 47100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Barangay officials: itanong sa responsableng lokal na contact ang suportang administratibo, pasilidad o kaayusan ng aktibidad.",
                  "start_ms": 47400,
                  "end_ms": 57160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Nakasalalay ang suporta sa lokal na papel at magagamit na kagamitan; walang garantiya.",
                  "start_ms": 57460,
                  "end_ms": 64140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Kapwa BHW: magbahagi ng karanasan sa karaniwang gawain, mag-ugnay ng napagkasunduang mga tungkulin at tumulong tukuyin ang dapat linawin.",
                  "start_ms": 64440,
                  "end_ms": 75720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Hindi nagiging klinikal na awtoridad ang payo ng kapwa BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 76020,
                  "end_ms": 81100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "May layunin at hangganan ang bawat ugnayan; tiyakin ang lokal na papel.",
                  "start_ms": 81400,
                  "end_ms": 86520
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-3": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-3.en.8f3a2920f542.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "8f3a2920f54239314a5bce8c824b648f065d3f7420d177a7c35d740aeacbc041",
              "sha256": "e985831e79cb6b99a651a15f2445792f04a880490a0343af75f367b435ce66eb",
              "duration_seconds": 56.607,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose a contact for the concern",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "For Nena's personal health question, Malou helps clarify the locally designated midwife or authorized health professional and how to contact them.",
                  "start_ms": 2700,
                  "end_ms": 12620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "She explains: “This question needs professional guidance; I should not answer it through a guess.”",
                  "start_ms": 12920,
                  "end_ms": 19120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "The exact local arrangement must be confirmed.",
                  "start_ms": 19420,
                  "end_ms": 22660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "For the venue, Malou checks the activity's verified information and asks the responsible local coordinator if anything remains unclear.",
                  "start_ms": 22960,
                  "end_ms": 31920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Ask a contact, “Is this within your role?",
                  "start_ms": 32220,
                  "end_ms": 35580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "If not, who is responsible?”",
                  "start_ms": 35880,
                  "end_ms": 38520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Position or familiarity alone does not establish the right role.",
                  "start_ms": 38820,
                  "end_ms": 44180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "This is an organizational example, not medical triage or a universal referral sequence.",
                  "start_ms": 44480,
                  "end_ms": 51080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose by the concern and confirmed role, rather than rank alone.",
                  "start_ms": 51380,
                  "end_ms": 56540
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-3.fil.3078161687b0.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "3078161687b044af4c0ea068a1c7ffbfdfe8474b651b0924dcde2d9c2ea9f225",
              "sha256": "80045305b471c0c209230b1838ee7cf5bba20a59d6d21505eec655074392afcc",
              "duration_seconds": 62.616,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang contact ayon sa alalahanin",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Para sa personal na tanong pangkalusugan ni Nena, tumutulong si Malou na linawin ang lokal na itinalagang midwife o awtorisadong health professional at ang paraan ng pakikipag-ugnayan.",
                  "start_ms": 3420,
                  "end_ms": 15940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ipinaliwanag niya: “Kailangan dito ng propesyonal na gabay; hindi ako dapat sumagot sa pamamagitan ng hula.”",
                  "start_ms": 16240,
                  "end_ms": 23680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Dapat tiyakin ang mismong lokal na kaayusan.",
                  "start_ms": 23980,
                  "end_ms": 26940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Para sa lugar, sinusuri ni Malou ang natiyak na impormasyon ng aktibidad at nagtatanong sa responsableng lokal na coordinator kung may malabo pa.",
                  "start_ms": 27240,
                  "end_ms": 37120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Itanong sa contact: “Saklaw po ba ito ng inyong papel?",
                  "start_ms": 37420,
                  "end_ms": 41740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Kung hindi, sino po ang responsable?”",
                  "start_ms": 42040,
                  "end_ms": 44840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Hindi sapat ang posisyon o pagiging kakilala.",
                  "start_ms": 45140,
                  "end_ms": 48420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Halimbawang pang-organisasyon ito, hindi medikal na triage o iisang proseso ng referral para sa lahat.",
                  "start_ms": 48720,
                  "end_ms": 56360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pumili ayon sa alalahanin at natiyak na papel, hindi sa posisyon lamang.",
                  "start_ms": 56660,
                  "end_ms": 62540
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "shared-support": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/shared-support.en.8b6326bb9fa2.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "8b6326bb9fa2a9b24d9667ad020871edaff4f7f8ab6df8da349a7e1c2ad90c7a",
              "sha256": "076e2c31eb05af626dc6827afc7e40bb6ac358269edbb75a3d5208200c986256",
              "duration_seconds": 58.201,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Coordinate support without replacing roles",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Malou keeps the questions separate while coordinating support.",
                  "start_ms": 3700,
                  "end_ms": 7780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "With Nena's agreement, she helps identify a suitable channel for the professional question.",
                  "start_ms": 8080,
                  "end_ms": 13800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Separately, the responsible barangay contact may clarify the venue or a request for practical support.",
                  "start_ms": 14100,
                  "end_ms": 20860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "A fellow BHW can help Malou organize an agreed routine task and check what remains unclear.",
                  "start_ms": 21160,
                  "end_ms": 28520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Nena contributes her preferences throughout.",
                  "start_ms": 28820,
                  "end_ms": 32300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Malou confirms what was actually agreed and what is still unknown.",
                  "start_ms": 32600,
                  "end_ms": 38040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "An official or peer cannot replace the health professional's assessment.",
                  "start_ms": 38340,
                  "end_ms": 43820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "No relationship guarantees transport, supplies, a response time or a successful outcome.",
                  "start_ms": 44120,
                  "end_ms": 52240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Coordinate distinct roles without promising resources or replacing assessment.",
                  "start_ms": 52540,
                  "end_ms": 58140
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/shared-support.fil.284ae77c1442.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "284ae77c14429e93d0c82a158018930b6664aa0614ca9e0f17e00900e2e4b43f",
              "sha256": "6d1ecb602731ab410550f9fa304373a59f00dfb00c05713492f29c00e57e4ae8",
              "duration_seconds": 60.291,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Mag-ugnay ng suporta nang may malinaw na papel",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pinaghihiwalay ni Malou ang mga tanong habang pinag-uugnay ang suporta.",
                  "start_ms": 4100,
                  "end_ms": 8620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sa pagsang-ayon ni Nena, tumutulong siyang tukuyin ang angkop na paraan para sa propesyonal na tanong.",
                  "start_ms": 8920,
                  "end_ms": 15800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Hiwalay dito, maaaring linawin ng responsableng barangay contact ang lugar o hiling na praktikal na suporta.",
                  "start_ms": 16100,
                  "end_ms": 23860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Maaaring tulungan ng kapwa BHW si Malou na ayusin ang napagkasunduang karaniwang gawain at alamin ang malabo pa.",
                  "start_ms": 24160,
                  "end_ms": 32320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Patuloy na ibinabahagi ni Nena ang kaniyang pagpili.",
                  "start_ms": 32620,
                  "end_ms": 35860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Tinitiyak ni Malou ang talagang napagkasunduan at ang hindi pa alam.",
                  "start_ms": 36160,
                  "end_ms": 41080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Hindi kapalit ng health professional ang opisyal o kapwa BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 41380,
                  "end_ms": 47020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Walang garantiya ng transportasyon, kagamitan, oras ng sagot o matagumpay na resulta.",
                  "start_ms": 47320,
                  "end_ms": 54120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pag-ugnayin ang magkakaibang papel nang walang pangako o kapalit na pagtatasa.",
                  "start_ms": 54420,
                  "end_ms": 60220
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "bhw-barangay-partners": [
      {
        "module": "05-bhw-at-barangay",
        "sections": {
          "section-4": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-barangay-partners/section-4.en.1de0f7dd1f20.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "1de0f7dd1f208d2fb0ca3c60b7ba1f6a0cd629076a7772bbfa7e231b487a77d7",
              "sha256": "22701ff19cdd16f068851233f897e63089c47ad5c267085c280198d35ebcb3e6",
              "duration_seconds": 52.767,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Why each relationship matters",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "If BHW Marites always went to the midwife for everything, everything would slow down — the midwife's time would fill up with things that were never clinical to begin with.",
                  "start_ms": 3420,
                  "end_ms": 15500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "If she never built a relationship with barangay officials, she would struggle to get support when she needed transport or supplies.",
                  "start_ms": 15800,
                  "end_ms": 24560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "If she never connected with fellow BHWs, she would stay alone with experiences that should have been learned together.",
                  "start_ms": 24860,
                  "end_ms": 33620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Each relationship has its own purpose — and using the right one at the right moment is what makes barangay service fast and reliable.",
                  "start_ms": 33920,
                  "end_ms": 43760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Each relationship has its own purpose — using the right one at the right moment is what makes service fast and reliable.",
                  "start_ms": 44060,
                  "end_ms": 52700
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-barangay-partners/section-4.fil.3b984a08ed69.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "3b984a08ed69610fc6ffefa55094e2f19074954e4498457e5ecd3dde5843c99f",
              "sha256": "db74e177255a87e0089ad292e08fb5baeb8338f3080bec1e460ef29aa5dd0624",
              "duration_seconds": 62.25,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Bakit mahalaga ang bawat ugnayan",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Kung palagi na lamang lalapitan ni BHW Marites ang midwife para sa lahat ng bagay, mabagal ang lahat — mapupuno ang oras ng midwife sa mga bagay na hindi naman klinikal.",
                  "start_ms": 3500,
                  "end_ms": 16660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Kung hindi naman siya kikilala sa barangay officials, mahihirapan siyang humingi ng suporta kapag kailangan ng transportasyon o kagamitan.",
                  "start_ms": 16960,
                  "end_ms": 26160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Kung hindi siya nakikipag-ugnayan sa kapwa BHW, mananatili siyang mag-isa sa mga karanasang dapat sana ay napag-aaralan nang magkasama.",
                  "start_ms": 26460,
                  "end_ms": 37500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Bawat ugnayan ay may sariling layunin — at ang paggamit ng tamang ugnayan sa tamang pagkakataon ang gumagawa sa serbisyo ng barangay na mabilis at maaasahan.",
                  "start_ms": 37800,
                  "end_ms": 50760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang bawat ugnayan ay may sariling layunin — ang paggamit ng tama sa tamang pagkakataon ang gumagawa sa serbisyo na mabilis at maaasahan.",
                  "start_ms": 51060,
                  "end_ms": 62180
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-5": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-barangay-partners/section-5.en.b7422a2b25a5.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "b7422a2b25a5836e9d6e6dc8d580d9800b035d7a5536af523df167329c3470e4",
              "sha256": "b570e3d4a6e187c933718e0ccf70bdaf65dd5b9cb4825cc4153ad3cc7cdef9be",
              "duration_seconds": 64.392,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Additional contacts within the barangay",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Beyond the four relationships, there are two more contacts within the barangay itself that BHW Marites should know.",
                  "start_ms": 3540,
                  "end_ms": 12100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "The **punong barangay** is the BHW's partner in carrying out the barangay's mandate to provide basic health services, and oversees BHWs administratively — for the health work itself, the midwife remains the BHW's technical supervisor.",
                  "start_ms": 12400,
                  "end_ms": 31000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "They also decide how the barangay budget is used — including BHW honoraria.",
                  "start_ms": 31300,
                  "end_ms": 37740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "The **Kagawad sa Kalusugan** advocates health policies and resolutions in the barangay council, and is also a member of the barangay planning team for health.",
                  "start_ms": 38040,
                  "end_ms": 48520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "They push for budget for health-related activities, facilities, and materials.",
                  "start_ms": 48820,
                  "end_ms": 54700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The punong barangay holds the budget; the Kagawad sa Kalusugan advocates for policy. Different roles, both worth knowing.",
                  "start_ms": 55000,
                  "end_ms": 64320
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-barangay-partners/section-5.fil.cb6479a58004.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "cb6479a5800406a355a2f4f43ac2a87db1c20b6b2a963cc2fa4fe5de4f86e226",
              "sha256": "dd07c50f5b11b0c55001bec32aa45c092c93e451d237c84bbbf4a81497ec238d",
              "duration_seconds": 73.874,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Karagdagang kakilala sa barangay",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Bukod sa apat na ugnayan, may dalawa pang kakilala sa loob mismo ng barangay na dapat malaman ni BHW Marites.",
                  "start_ms": 2980,
                  "end_ms": 12140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ang **punong barangay** ay ka-partner ng mga BHW sa pagpapatupad ng mandato nitong magbigay ng basic health services, at administratibong nangangasiwa sa mga BHW — sa mismong gawaing pangkalusugan, ang midwife pa rin ang teknikal na supervisor ng BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 12440,
                  "end_ms": 31160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Siya rin ang nagdedesisyon kung paano gagamitin ang budget ng barangay — kasama ang pagbibigay ng honorarium para sa mga BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 31460,
                  "end_ms": 40380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ang **kagawad sa kalusugan** naman ang tagapagtaguyod sa konseho ng barangay ng mga polisiya at resolusyong pangkalusugan, at miyembro rin siya ng barangay planning team for health.",
                  "start_ms": 40680,
                  "end_ms": 52760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Siya ang nagsusulong ng budget para sa mga gawain, pasilidad, at materyales na may kinalaman sa kalusugan.",
                  "start_ms": 53060,
                  "end_ms": 62060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang punong barangay ang may hawak ng budget; ang kagawad sa kalusugan ang tagapagtaguyod ng polisiya. Magkaiba ang papel, pareho silang kailangang kakilala.",
                  "start_ms": 62360,
                  "end_ms": 73800
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "module": "05-bhw-at-barangay",
        "sections": {
          "barangay-partners-application-check": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-barangay-partners/barangay-partners-application-check.en.b5a63aa69f48.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "b5a63aa69f489bad530a261aacddb25f75945f15be749b78cd1b76db1e6a1964",
              "sha256": "e0b23c83deb9b8e7611ef195c0a4945165f676f25198fb3a15b76dfb9e2c2463",
              "duration_seconds": 39.732,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Explain your choice",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The space and ten chairs for Saturday are still unconfirmed.",
                  "start_ms": 2020,
                  "end_ms": 6460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "What is Malou’s appropriate next step?",
                  "start_ms": 6760,
                  "end_ms": 9600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Choose and explain your answer in the check.",
                  "start_ms": 9900,
                  "end_ms": 12380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Then form one question to confirm the local contact and approval.",
                  "start_ms": 12680,
                  "end_ms": 16960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "You may say it, write it or practise with a partner.",
                  "start_ms": 17260,
                  "end_ms": 21220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "What matters is explaining the role, making a clear request and verifying arrangements, rather than whether support is actually granted.",
                  "start_ms": 21520,
                  "end_ms": 29840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "The story is optional and is not required to complete the lesson.",
                  "start_ms": 30140,
                  "end_ms": 34260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Use the role, a clear request and verification to guide action.",
                  "start_ms": 34560,
                  "end_ms": 39680
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-barangay-partners/barangay-partners-application-check.fil.dcde98c2d1a2.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "dcde98c2d1a20fb96ff3277c063fbdd44639862cdb4b023100a499df9e9c44d2",
              "sha256": "26e49670b2588ebb673a56dafb4eba6a0e263d23e45f24823ce36a90436b69c4",
              "duration_seconds": 45.113,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ipaliwanag ang iyong pagpili",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Hindi pa kumpirmado ang lugar at sampung upuan para sa Sabado.",
                  "start_ms": 3020,
                  "end_ms": 7420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ano ang angkop na susunod na hakbang ni Malou?",
                  "start_ms": 7720,
                  "end_ms": 10920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Piliin at ipaliwanag ang sagot sa check.",
                  "start_ms": 11220,
                  "end_ms": 13980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Pagkatapos, bumuo ng isang tanong upang tiyakin ang lokal na contact at pahintulot.",
                  "start_ms": 14280,
                  "end_ms": 20200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Maaari itong sabihin, isulat o subukan kasama ang kapareha.",
                  "start_ms": 20500,
                  "end_ms": 25740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ang mahalaga ay ang paliwanag ng papel, malinaw na kahilingan at pagtitiyak, hindi kung talagang naibigay ang suporta.",
                  "start_ms": 26040,
                  "end_ms": 34520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Opsyonal ang kuwento at hindi kailangan upang matapos ang aralin.",
                  "start_ms": 34820,
                  "end_ms": 38980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Papel, malinaw na kahilingan at pagtitiyak ang batayan ng pagkilos.",
                  "start_ms": 39280,
                  "end_ms": 45040
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "barangay-support-request": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-barangay-partners/barangay-support-request.en.8435bb297a55.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "8435bb297a55e5bafd8263c235791903a645afa971f48399248bb512df9545a2",
              "sha256": "b364063ea00f90388c9433c3646e4a8cd79ee28868ded786e13d779e5368f75b",
              "duration_seconds": 39.001,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Make a specific request",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Malou explains: “We have an agreed activity on Saturday morning.",
                  "start_ms": 2380,
                  "end_ms": 7060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "We need a space and ten chairs.",
                  "start_ms": 7360,
                  "end_ms": 10200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Who should we contact, and what steps or approval are needed?”",
                  "start_ms": 10500,
                  "end_ms": 15300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "The purpose, time and requested support are clear.",
                  "start_ms": 15600,
                  "end_ms": 19560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "She separates known facts from what is unconfirmed: there is a request, but no approval or confirmed equipment yet.",
                  "start_ms": 19860,
                  "end_ms": 28060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "This request does not need a resident’s name or personal health information.",
                  "start_ms": 28360,
                  "end_ms": 33120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "State the purpose, time, support and a clarification question.",
                  "start_ms": 33420,
                  "end_ms": 38940
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-barangay-partners/barangay-support-request.fil.8854eb4d5e6e.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "8854eb4d5e6ecc271a048233363fd34a14a4d9cbbd4ec0be2fde217c3deacc4a",
              "sha256": "5deefe09ff603ef6c025526e74cee0d619a9cbe2ad23c759a487a99c6fb5adc6",
              "duration_seconds": 44.8,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Bumuo ng tiyak na kahilingan",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ipinapaliwanag ni Malou: “May napagkasunduang aktibidad sa Sabado ng umaga.",
                  "start_ms": 2980,
                  "end_ms": 8540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Kailangan namin ng lugar at sampung upuan.",
                  "start_ms": 8840,
                  "end_ms": 12160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Sino ang dapat lapitan, at anong hakbang o pahintulot ang kailangan?”",
                  "start_ms": 12460,
                  "end_ms": 17660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Malinaw ang layunin, oras at hinihinging suporta.",
                  "start_ms": 17960,
                  "end_ms": 22840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Hiwalay ang alam sa hindi pa kumpirmado: may kahilingan, ngunit wala pang pahintulot o kumpirmadong kagamitan.",
                  "start_ms": 23140,
                  "end_ms": 31420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Hindi niya kailangang magsama ng pangalan o personal na impormasyong pangkalusugan ng residente sa ganitong kahilingan.",
                  "start_ms": 31720,
                  "end_ms": 38720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Sabihin ang layunin, oras, suporta at tanong na maglilinaw.",
                  "start_ms": 39020,
                  "end_ms": 44740
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "confirm-and-follow-through": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-barangay-partners/confirm-and-follow-through.en.9086ef3cef45.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "9086ef3cef451a8f706cd944ad6764b8030ce276973574289a008733e4829e83",
              "sha256": "9a54dbfb72a523b6df0ea70ebedb808975942019b934b36968fa6c3c7c2c08a4",
              "duration_seconds": 38.478,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Confirm and report accurately",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Malou records the responsible contact, next step and when to ask again.",
                  "start_ms": 2940,
                  "end_ms": 8100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "If the space is unconfirmed, she tells the group.",
                  "start_ms": 8400,
                  "end_ms": 11440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "She listens to their preferences and discusses another appropriate plan if needed.",
                  "start_ms": 11740,
                  "end_ms": 16900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "She checks actual availability and approval before saying arrangements are ready.",
                  "start_ms": 17200,
                  "end_ms": 22280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "A personal health question goes separately to an authorized professional under local arrangements.",
                  "start_ms": 22580,
                  "end_ms": 28780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "A guess or personal acquaintance is not confirmation.",
                  "start_ms": 29080,
                  "end_ms": 33720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Report confirmed and unconfirmed arrangements separately.",
                  "start_ms": 34020,
                  "end_ms": 38420
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-barangay-partners/confirm-and-follow-through.fil.034aa92ae2d5.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "034aa92ae2d55e99d910c0ee69ff91b909691e69198971be6a4a1f1e15b97b5d",
              "sha256": "1de0da717d5eca18853f8f683cd496a84fcecd80a5ce7a77981139cbd3ea4d7d",
              "duration_seconds": 46.838,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tiyakin at magbalita nang tama",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Itinatala ni Malou ang responsableng contact, susunod na hakbang at kailan muling magtatanong.",
                  "start_ms": 3180,
                  "end_ms": 9500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Kung hindi pa kumpirmado ang lugar, sinasabi niya iyon sa grupo.",
                  "start_ms": 9800,
                  "end_ms": 14000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Nakikinig siya sa kanilang pagpili at nakikipag-usap tungkol sa ibang angkop na plano kung kailangan.",
                  "start_ms": 14300,
                  "end_ms": 21220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Tinitiyak niya ang aktuwal na pagkakaroon ng suporta at pahintulot bago sabihing handa na.",
                  "start_ms": 21520,
                  "end_ms": 27880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Ang personal na tanong pangkalusugan ay hiwalay na dinadala sa awtorisadong propesyonal ayon sa lokal na kaayusan.",
                  "start_ms": 28180,
                  "end_ms": 35900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Hindi niya itinuturing na kumpirmasyon ang hula o pagiging kakilala.",
                  "start_ms": 36200,
                  "end_ms": 41280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ibalita ang kumpirmado at hindi pa kumpirmado nang magkahiwalay.",
                  "start_ms": 41580,
                  "end_ms": 46780
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "council-health-role": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-barangay-partners/council-health-role.en.51dca0870194.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "51dca08701947822556a19fd6cd8331c3bf213f1a2f5f89d34dbd10d28222465",
              "sha256": "2705ce83716ad1f9077ff8bf9b4565bdce5adc6f2074afd1c2a74a49388fed7b",
              "duration_seconds": 38.06,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Coordinate within clear limits",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "For a proposed health policy or program support, the health kagawad may be a partner in advocating it in the council.",
                  "start_ms": 2940,
                  "end_ms": 10300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "That differs from simply asking who manages a space for an activity.",
                  "start_ms": 10600,
                  "end_ms": 15160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Malou does not promise that one official can provide funding, payment or equipment alone.",
                  "start_ms": 15460,
                  "end_ms": 22020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "She asks what decisions, approvals and local arrangements are needed.",
                  "start_ms": 22320,
                  "end_ms": 27600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "This lesson does not give legal rules about budget appropriation or honoraria.",
                  "start_ms": 27900,
                  "end_ms": 33260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Coordination and approval differ; do not promise funding.",
                  "start_ms": 33560,
                  "end_ms": 38000
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-barangay-partners/council-health-role.fil.908aed2331c4.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "908aed2331c47ce604ac2a585d6feedadf774fa6b66ad50ebfec3c5b132f90c8",
              "sha256": "0db75a1ed7b05f1451bbea7d50d872f9bf1fdf6cc2bd48ac118da724f62eac9f",
              "duration_seconds": 45.662,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pag-ugnayin nang may hangganan",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Kung ang usapin ay mungkahing polisiya o suporta sa programang pangkalusugan, ang kagawad sa kalusugan ay maaaring maging katuwang sa pagtataguyod nito sa konseho.",
                  "start_ms": 2740,
                  "end_ms": 13300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Iba ito sa simpleng pagtatanong kung sino ang namamahala sa lugar para sa isang aktibidad.",
                  "start_ms": 13600,
                  "end_ms": 19880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Hindi nangangako si Malou na isang opisyal lamang ang makapagbibigay ng pondo, bayad o kagamitan.",
                  "start_ms": 20180,
                  "end_ms": 26300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Itinatanong niya kung anong pagpapasya, pag-apruba at lokal na kaayusan ang kailangan.",
                  "start_ms": 26600,
                  "end_ms": 33200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Hindi nagbibigay ang araling ito ng tuntuning legal tungkol sa paglalaan ng pondo o honorarium.",
                  "start_ms": 33500,
                  "end_ms": 40540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Magkaiba ang pag-uugnay at pag-apruba; huwag mangako ng pondo.",
                  "start_ms": 40840,
                  "end_ms": 45600
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-4": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-barangay-partners/section-4.en.3ebe7ea2b83e.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "3ebe7ea2b83e716c61abf14f2b9da74ac05b8b68c637a679e16225ee5e040d29",
              "sha256": "d8b8fbda71c8ddc3c27dbd9d090a742141bd7851dc5ae81aa336ad70df09ed13",
              "duration_seconds": 33.437,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Start with a clear need",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "At a fictional meeting, Malou helps prepare an agreed community health activity.",
                  "start_ms": 2380,
                  "end_ms": 7860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "The group needs a space and ten chairs on Saturday morning.",
                  "start_ms": 8160,
                  "end_ms": 12080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "She first checks the number, time and participants’ preferences.",
                  "start_ms": 12380,
                  "end_ms": 16820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "The space and chairs are not yet confirmed.",
                  "start_ms": 17120,
                  "end_ms": 19920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "A clear need guides the choice of partner.",
                  "start_ms": 20220,
                  "end_ms": 23220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Knowing an official does not automatically give Malou equipment or permission.",
                  "start_ms": 23520,
                  "end_ms": 29800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Clarify the need before requesting support.",
                  "start_ms": 30100,
                  "end_ms": 33380
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-barangay-partners/section-4.fil.6efeecef2f08.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "6efeecef2f088d540b9adc224267346c445438125b49f05b79f32cea257e846f",
              "sha256": "ccb94419a195c13519f28eb23fccd81de48df4f507cb64a4205074b9d34f5a37",
              "duration_seconds": 39.367,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Unahin ang malinaw na pangangailangan",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Sa kathang-isip na pulong, tumutulong si Malou sa paghahanda ng napagkasunduang aktibidad pangkalusugan.",
                  "start_ms": 3220,
                  "end_ms": 10820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Kailangan ng grupo ng lugar at sampung upuan sa Sabado ng umaga.",
                  "start_ms": 11120,
                  "end_ms": 15680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Itinatanong muna niya kung tama ang bilang, oras at nais ng mga kalahok.",
                  "start_ms": 15980,
                  "end_ms": 21740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Hindi pa kumpirmado ang lugar o mga upuan.",
                  "start_ms": 22040,
                  "end_ms": 25800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Ang malinaw na pangangailangan ang batayan ng pagpili ng katuwang.",
                  "start_ms": 26100,
                  "end_ms": 30500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Hindi awtomatikong may kagamitan o pahintulot dahil may kakilalang opisyal si Malou.",
                  "start_ms": 30800,
                  "end_ms": 35960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Linawin ang kailangan bago humingi ng suporta.",
                  "start_ms": 36260,
                  "end_ms": 39300
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-5": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-barangay-partners/section-5.en.e80face1d65d.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "e80face1d65d1b34e66cd1037eb2038576608d5e4966e1a5fd89831358cce112",
              "sha256": "fbc99399ccd632f89714a1708097a340f9fa3958e501d57a297d8626ca4cf8c2",
              "duration_seconds": 45.113,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Know the partner’s role",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The DOH manual describes the punong barangay as a partner in health services, local leadership and administrative oversight.",
                  "start_ms": 2300,
                  "end_ms": 11140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "The health kagawad advocates health policies and resolutions in the council.",
                  "start_ms": 11440,
                  "end_ms": 16480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Some barangays assign additional health-activity responsibilities.",
                  "start_ms": 16780,
                  "end_ms": 21020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Malou can ask the responsible barangay contact about space and equipment.",
                  "start_ms": 21320,
                  "end_ms": 26360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "She confirms who handles the request and which local process applies.",
                  "start_ms": 26660,
                  "end_ms": 31420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Technical or personal health questions belong with the designated authorized health professional; an official’s position does not replace that role.",
                  "start_ms": 31720,
                  "end_ms": 40440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Match the need to the role; confirm local responsibility.",
                  "start_ms": 40740,
                  "end_ms": 45060
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-barangay-partners/section-5.fil.ed9443e31072.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "ed9443e3107209b006d58cbb44cb8c647a21c8060e07264c5f4d3d94f5584f5d",
              "sha256": "80c1950b2016e3baa54c20d400f5be9e496f962cf94d2fea9b55a7fc744b8f88",
              "duration_seconds": 53.734,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Kilalanin ang papel ng katuwang",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Inilalarawan ng DOH manual ang punong barangay bilang katuwang sa serbisyong pangkalusugan, lokal na pamumuno at administratibong pangangasiwa.",
                  "start_ms": 2940,
                  "end_ms": 13100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ang kagawad sa kalusugan ay nagtataguyod ng mga polisiya at resolusyong pangkalusugan sa konseho.",
                  "start_ms": 13400,
                  "end_ms": 20440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Sa ilang barangay, may itinalagang dagdag na tungkulin sa gawaing pangkalusugan.",
                  "start_ms": 20740,
                  "end_ms": 26140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Maaaring magtanong si Malou sa responsableng barangay contact tungkol sa lugar at kagamitan.",
                  "start_ms": 26440,
                  "end_ms": 32400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Tinitiyak niya kung sino ang may saklaw sa kahilingan at anong lokal na proseso ang kailangan.",
                  "start_ms": 32700,
                  "end_ms": 38180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ang teknikal o personal na tanong pangkalusugan ay sa itinalagang awtorisadong health professional; hindi ito napapalitan ng katungkulan ng opisyal.",
                  "start_ms": 38480,
                  "end_ms": 48880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Itugma ang kailangan sa papel; tiyakin ang lokal na saklaw.",
                  "start_ms": 49180,
                  "end_ms": 53660
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "bhw-local-partners": [
      {
        "module": "05-bhw-at-barangay",
        "sections": {
          "section-6": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-local-partners/section-6.en.ffda51e86c2a.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "ffda51e86c2a0f62cd347e756cd825215f80d2f639e16b928ec00b464ca024f6",
              "sha256": "6aa07ec4a6efefd948ccacc3c8c36ead49b90c36b439493d2706624755bb1a25",
              "duration_seconds": 89.835,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Additional contacts at the city or municipal level",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 4200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The barangay opens up into a wider network once you reach the city or municipal level.",
                  "start_ms": 4500,
                  "end_ms": 11420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "The **City or Municipal Health Officer (CHO/MHO)** is the overall manager of health for the whole city or town, and the general supervisor of health workers including BHWs.",
                  "start_ms": 11720,
                  "end_ms": 27360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "The **midwife**, assigned to the barangay health station, sets the BHW's tasks and is their technical supervisor.",
                  "start_ms": 27660,
                  "end_ms": 36140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "The **Public Health Nurse (PHN)** supervises the midwives, and is sometimes assigned as supervisor of all BHWs citywide.",
                  "start_ms": 36440,
                  "end_ms": 46880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "There is a new level to meet as well: the **city or municipal-level HEPO office** — not the same as a BHW's own HEPO designation (which you already learned in Module 1), but the office that plans health promotion for the whole locality and monitors BHWs' skill at it.",
                  "start_ms": 47180,
                  "end_ms": 66380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "And the **local health board**, which gives health recommendations to the LGU and manages the budget — the mayor chairs it, the CHO/MHO is vice-chair.",
                  "start_ms": 66680,
                  "end_ms": 80000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "As the level rises — barangay, city, municipality — the number of people connected to the health service you provide grows too.",
                  "start_ms": 80300,
                  "end_ms": 89780
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-local-partners/section-6.fil.a2ecb51c8408.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "a2ecb51c8408b1944fd477b1977af34da911770bb05b559194bbbbaf8fe5d5a2",
              "sha256": "3a1c3d8ccdad61373dd1abf708ab6265168f5b78c0eeb035665fbfc43a16dedc",
              "duration_seconds": 102.165,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Karagdagang kakilala sa lungsod o munisipyo",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Lumalabas ang barangay patungo sa mas malawak na network kapag umaabot na sa antas ng lungsod o munisipyo.",
                  "start_ms": 4020,
                  "end_ms": 11980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ang **City o Municipal Health Officer (CHO/MHO)** ang pangkalahatang namamahala sa kalusugan ng buong lungsod o bayan, at pangkalahatang supervisor ng mga health worker kasama ang mga BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 12280,
                  "end_ms": 29680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ang **midwife**, na naitatalaga sa barangay health station, ang nagtatakda ng mga gawain ng BHW at kanilang technical supervisor.",
                  "start_ms": 29980,
                  "end_ms": 40700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ang **Public Health Nurse (PHN)** naman ang nangangasiwa sa mga midwife, at kung minsan ay itinatalagang supervisor ng lahat ng BHW sa buong lungsod.",
                  "start_ms": 41000,
                  "end_ms": 52360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "May bagong antas ding kikilalanin: ang **HEPO sa antas ng lungsod o munisipyo** — hindi ito ang tungkuling HEPO ng BHW mismo (natutunan mo na ito sa Modyul 1), kundi ang opisinang namamahala sa pagpaplano ng health promotion sa buong lokalidad at nag-mo-monitor ng kasanayan ng mga BHW dito.",
                  "start_ms": 52660,
                  "end_ms": 75500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "At ang **local health board**, na nagbibigay ng rekomendasyong pangkalusugan sa local government at namamahala sa budget — ang mayor ang chairperson nito, ang CHO/MHO ang vice-chairperson.",
                  "start_ms": 75800,
                  "end_ms": 89720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Habang tumataas ang antas — barangay, lungsod, munisipyo — dumadami rin ang taong may kinalaman sa serbisyong pangkalusugan na iyong ibinibigay.",
                  "start_ms": 90020,
                  "end_ms": 102100
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-7": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-local-partners/section-7.en.73b7ff198455.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "73b7ff198455c44f7c588f2499e582ed90004ebf02c8e373e6348ff1c46d0235",
              "sha256": "207a9e097275fcb7d735e739026a47c26a5366846b7bdbf191a95e0aa5b602fe",
              "duration_seconds": 62.38,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Other partners",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Four more partners round out BHW Marites' network.",
                  "start_ms": 1780,
                  "end_ms": 6660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "The **mayor** is the overall chief executive of the city or municipality and the CHO/MHO's direct supervisor.",
                  "start_ms": 6960,
                  "end_ms": 16520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "The **BHW President** is the elected or appointed leader of all BHWs in a city or town — helping update the BHW registry and sharing opportunities with fellow BHWs.",
                  "start_ms": 16820,
                  "end_ms": 30820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "The **municipal social work and development officer** manages financial assistance for people needing medical help (AICS).",
                  "start_ms": 31120,
                  "end_ms": 40720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "And the **sanitary inspector** leads cleanliness promotion, and works with BHWs to find households needing environmental sanitation help.",
                  "start_ms": 41020,
                  "end_ms": 51060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Not every partner works directly in health — the barangay's leader, the one who provides financial aid, and the one who promotes cleanliness all matter too.",
                  "start_ms": 51360,
                  "end_ms": 62320
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-local-partners/section-7.fil.329db6b8f186.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "329db6b8f18639c2bc44bc0d097f27407904832ad92ff11c1f56dd16f69599c3",
              "sha256": "057edd509b88f351dabbd4a404fccc44a2d6817270583cd4c4fd8b5435129289",
              "duration_seconds": 71.576,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Iba pang kapartner",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Apat pang kapartner ang dapat kilalanin ni BHW Marites.",
                  "start_ms": 1980,
                  "end_ms": 6860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ang **mayor** ang pangkalahatang chief executive ng lungsod o munisipyo at direktang supervisor ng CHO/MHO.",
                  "start_ms": 7160,
                  "end_ms": 16560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ang **BHW President** ay ang nahalal o itinalagang lider ng lahat ng BHW sa isang lungsod o bayan — tumutulong siya sa pag-update ng BHW registry at nagbibigay ng impormasyon tungkol sa mga oportunidad para sa kapwa BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 16860,
                  "end_ms": 34980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ang **municipal social work and development officer** ang namamahala sa financial assistance para sa mga nangangailangan ng tulong medikal (AICS).",
                  "start_ms": 35280,
                  "end_ms": 46280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "At ang **sanitary inspector** ang nangunguna sa promosyon ng kalinisan, at kasama ng BHW sa paghahanap ng mga kabahayang nangangailangan ng environmental sanitation intervention.",
                  "start_ms": 46580,
                  "end_ms": 59220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Hindi lahat ng kapartner ay direktang nasa larangan ng kalusugan — may kinalaman din ang lider ng barangay, ang tagapagbigay ng tulong pinansyal, at ang tagapagsulong ng kalinisan.",
                  "start_ms": 59520,
                  "end_ms": 71520
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "module": "05-bhw-at-barangay",
        "sections": {
          "city-role-map": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-local-partners/city-role-map.en.c887c3bef423.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "c887c3bef423099096a70a0d14a81a9870fd54bd52ac2594195cbcc496af8207",
              "sha256": "102a0de7e2364e9b39c7cb156d04c9dc4e5d7a06d0ebe5596ff3a110d2281426",
              "duration_seconds": 48.327,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Health team roles",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "At the RHU, the city or municipal health officer, CHO or MHO, leads the local health service and its office staff.",
                  "start_ms": 2180,
                  "end_ms": 11620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "The midwife and public health nurse, PHN, may provide technical support to BHWs according to actual local assignments; Malou confirms who handles the question or referral there.",
                  "start_ms": 11920,
                  "end_ms": 25440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "The city or municipal HEPO supports health promotion, a different role from a BHW’s own HEPO designation.",
                  "start_ms": 25740,
                  "end_ms": 34140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "A decision about one person’s care belongs with an authorized health professional, not a board that discusses budgets.",
                  "start_ms": 34440,
                  "end_ms": 42680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Confirm actual assignments rather than assuming one hierarchy.",
                  "start_ms": 42980,
                  "end_ms": 48260
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-local-partners/city-role-map.fil.ea72a67086bb.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "ea72a67086bbb177c0cc9a316500b5966e09e2159c07a5c38c1442cecbaeffee",
              "sha256": "194e5494d1fe2370b8c65033d48ab4982cc5401d82f56254ae5003d0178a5cd4",
              "duration_seconds": 56.085,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Mga tungkulin ng health team",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Sa RHU, ang city o municipal health officer, CHO o MHO, ang namumuno sa lokal na serbisyong pangkalusugan at sa mga tauhan ng tanggapan.",
                  "start_ms": 2940,
                  "end_ms": 14980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ang midwife at public health nurse, PHN, ay maaaring maging teknikal na katuwang ng BHW ayon sa aktuwal na pagtatalaga sa kanilang lugar; kinukumpirma ni Malou kung sino ang responsable sa tanong o referral.",
                  "start_ms": 15280,
                  "end_ms": 31640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ang HEPO sa antas ng lungsod o munisipyo ay katuwang sa health promotion; iba ito sa HEPO na tungkulin ng BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 31940,
                  "end_ms": 40500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ang tanong sa pangangalaga ng isang tao ay dinadala sa awtorisadong health professional, hindi sa board na nagbabalangkas ng badyet.",
                  "start_ms": 40800,
                  "end_ms": 50120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Kumpirmahin ang aktuwal na pagtatalaga; huwag magpalagay ng iisang hierarchy.",
                  "start_ms": 50420,
                  "end_ms": 56020
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "close-loop": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-local-partners/close-loop.en.7ab039e9b03c.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "7ab039e9b03ccce89ae575a4680e102a16ff577f7d2a27acec559b8dc9ce6953",
              "sha256": "8f566fa90ff8da560e2c9d05e7e62d0cb3cfbdf8059d32bd12ce446f1884f0cb",
              "duration_seconds": 37.642,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Confirm and close the loop",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "After making contact, Malou records whom she reached, the agreed next step, and when to follow up under local rules.",
                  "start_ms": 2460,
                  "end_ms": 10780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "She tells the family the verified next step without guaranteeing an outcome.",
                  "start_ms": 11080,
                  "end_ms": 16440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "If clinical advice is needed, she returns the question to a health professional; for sanitation, she checks the designated sanitary contact.",
                  "start_ms": 16740,
                  "end_ms": 25900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "With a nonhealth partner, she shares only information the family has agreed to share and that is truly needed.",
                  "start_ms": 26200,
                  "end_ms": 33880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Return to the family with the verified next step.",
                  "start_ms": 34180,
                  "end_ms": 37580
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-local-partners/close-loop.fil.847c35dcde7b.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "847c35dcde7b3ca07110f3b1a9416d2c6cdd0422fbb45dc9fbd030c586cac0ce",
              "sha256": "027618724795b0b0c438455262343722fab57c84529a8e42753bdf7babf8f734",
              "duration_seconds": 45.714,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Kumpirmahin at balikan ang pamilya",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pagkatapos ng pag-ugnay, tinatandaan ni Malou kung sino ang nakausap, anong hakbang ang napagkasunduan, at kailan dapat bumalik para sa sagot, ayon sa lokal na patakaran.",
                  "start_ms": 3260,
                  "end_ms": 16180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ipinababatid niya sa pamilya ang na-verify na susunod na hakbang nang hindi ipinangangako ang resulta.",
                  "start_ms": 16480,
                  "end_ms": 22920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Kung kailangan ng klinikal na payo, ibinabalik niya ito sa health professional; kung usapin ng kalinisan, tinatanong niya ang itinalagang sanitary contact.",
                  "start_ms": 23220,
                  "end_ms": 33180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Sa kapartner na hindi health worker, ibinabahagi lamang niya ang impormasyong may pahintulot at talagang kailangan.",
                  "start_ms": 33480,
                  "end_ms": 41440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Balikan ang pamilya sa na-verify na susunod na hakbang.",
                  "start_ms": 41740,
                  "end_ms": 45660
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "local-partners-application-check": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-local-partners/local-partners-application-check.en.e86a04e25571.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "e86a04e25571d3dcd78003981594b4b232304cedd77576b7246896998d6b38e0",
              "sha256": "2e0ebc05955e0ee7e530d88443a3d52b94da043ff5b047c9d3387b0133eeadb4",
              "duration_seconds": 41.613,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Try it: choose the first step",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "On the next question about medicine support, Malou still does not know the current contact.",
                  "start_ms": 3140,
                  "end_ms": 9300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "She sees three possible actions: seek consent and verify the local process with the midwife or RHU before sharing only necessary information; send a full record to any official; or promise funding because a local health board exists.",
                  "start_ms": 9600,
                  "end_ms": 26960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Choose the action that checks consent and the process.",
                  "start_ms": 27260,
                  "end_ms": 31180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "The other two overshare information or promise a decision beyond a BHW’s role.",
                  "start_ms": 31480,
                  "end_ms": 37520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose an appropriate first step and explain why.",
                  "start_ms": 37820,
                  "end_ms": 41540
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-local-partners/local-partners-application-check.fil.577f3b0590a2.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "577f3b0590a2e86535dc1cf7a43818b3b58bebe26ff2ad895b2e08b0a2fdf9f4",
              "sha256": "543c43ff156440e0ded91708ec3e44b74ad85097527aa5d5bd521ada547f9eca",
              "duration_seconds": 45.558,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Subukan: piliin ang unang hakbang",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Sa susunod na tanong tungkol sa tulong sa gamot, hindi pa alam ni Malou ang kasalukuyang contact.",
                  "start_ms": 3740,
                  "end_ms": 9980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "May tatlong posibleng hakbang: tiyakin ang pahintulot at ang lokal na proseso sa midwife o RHU bago ibahagi ang kailangan lamang na impormasyon; ipadala ang buong tala sa sinumang kawani; o ipangako ang pondo dahil may local health board.",
                  "start_ms": 10280,
                  "end_ms": 27160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Piliin ang hakbang na may pahintulot at pagtiyak.",
                  "start_ms": 27460,
                  "end_ms": 31220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ang dalawang iba pa ay lumalampas sa kinakailangang pagbabahagi o nangangako ng desisyong hindi saklaw ng BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 31520,
                  "end_ms": 40680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang angkop na unang hakbang at ipaliwanag kung bakit.",
                  "start_ms": 40980,
                  "end_ms": 45500
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "local-request": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-local-partners/local-request.en.36ad7492280e.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "36ad7492280e7e8351068156f9813825724ad8de2a6350003edf49c380e1e7d8",
              "sha256": "82f600a1b5900067a44cab76e6ae2a861dedfbb4a7307e1f0b564c0a8bc7ddd1",
              "duration_seconds": 43.18,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Example: a locally verified request",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The family asks Malou whether medicine support is available.",
                  "start_ms": 3540,
                  "end_ms": 7540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "She explains that she can check the proper process but cannot promise an amount or approval.",
                  "start_ms": 7840,
                  "end_ms": 14280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "With the family’s consent, she asks the RHU midwife who the current contact is and what information is needed.",
                  "start_ms": 14580,
                  "end_ms": 22620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "She learns to ask the designated social welfare contact about possible support.",
                  "start_ms": 22920,
                  "end_ms": 27840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "The family or an authorized person provides requested documents through the proper office; Malou does not send the whole health record.",
                  "start_ms": 28140,
                  "end_ms": 37980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Use a locally verified contact and only necessary information.",
                  "start_ms": 38280,
                  "end_ms": 43120
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-local-partners/local-request.fil.48947e50c5e0.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "48947e50c5e0f65427bbdac5963b386ab664f439f4d882c056753f687bb9759b",
              "sha256": "f62c09a98770ded39d5fc707867a4f2e4a5771cbf6a654f99efa8072e3e9e141",
              "duration_seconds": 50.155,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Halimbawa: tiyaking lokal na hiling",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tinanong ng pamilya si Malou kung may tulong sa gamot.",
                  "start_ms": 3860,
                  "end_ms": 7460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ipinaliwanag niyang maaari niyang alamin ang wastong proseso ngunit hindi niya maipapangako ang halaga o pag-apruba.",
                  "start_ms": 7760,
                  "end_ms": 16320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Sa pahintulot ng pamilya, tinanong niya ang midwife sa RHU kung sino ang kasalukuyang contact at anong impormasyon ang kailangan.",
                  "start_ms": 16620,
                  "end_ms": 25540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Nalaman niyang dapat munang sa itinalagang social welfare contact itanong ang posibleng suporta.",
                  "start_ms": 25840,
                  "end_ms": 32440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Ang pamilya o awtorisadong kausap ang magbibigay ng hinihinging dokumento sa tamang tanggapan; hindi ipinadadala ni Malou ang buong health record.",
                  "start_ms": 32740,
                  "end_ms": 43540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Gumamit ng lokal na na-verify na contact at pinakamaliit na kailangang impormasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 43840,
                  "end_ms": 50080
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-6": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-local-partners/section-6.en.a465c2c6aa12.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "a465c2c6aa121e4c8f7f4a1843cfb6e176fad53f4092a5e5211015c635f3a4ae",
              "sha256": "1927000eb17739d2b3e425e3a1e63edcd1747ade3612c48fd6a8195ec60408b2",
              "duration_seconds": 38.792,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Clarify the need",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Malou hears a family ask about possible help with medicine.",
                  "start_ms": 2060,
                  "end_ms": 6420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Before contacting anyone, she clarifies whether the need is clinical, health promotion, social support, or environmental sanitation.",
                  "start_ms": 6720,
                  "end_ms": 16480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "For an urgent health concern, she follows the local emergency or referral protocol and seeks guidance from the health team.",
                  "start_ms": 16780,
                  "end_ms": 24700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "She does not turn a funding question into a promise.",
                  "start_ms": 25000,
                  "end_ms": 28200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "She records only what is needed and asks whether the family agrees to an appropriate referral.",
                  "start_ms": 28500,
                  "end_ms": 34980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Identify the need before choosing a contact.",
                  "start_ms": 35280,
                  "end_ms": 38720
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-local-partners/section-6.fil.a837f60e7947.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "a837f60e79479da84435e3c5cf69277d7b6c0bf67ff5b67287d6f2f9464bfd16",
              "sha256": "85e6fe98990481271c651e0e0337f36e4f798ed06818b55f8f56088dbcf61a9a",
              "duration_seconds": 47.256,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Linawin ang pangangailangan",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Si Malou ay may tanong mula sa isang pamilya tungkol sa posibleng tulong para sa gamot.",
                  "start_ms": 2780,
                  "end_ms": 8540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Bago tumawag sa kahit sino, nililinaw niya kung klinikal na tanong ba ito, tanong sa health promotion, pangangailangang panlipunan, o suliranin sa kalinisan.",
                  "start_ms": 8840,
                  "end_ms": 21200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Kung may agarang kondisyong pangkalusugan, sinusunod niya ang lokal na emergency o referral protocol at humihingi ng gabay sa health team.",
                  "start_ms": 21500,
                  "end_ms": 30380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ang tanong tungkol sa pondo ay hindi niya ginagawang pangako.",
                  "start_ms": 30680,
                  "end_ms": 34680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Itinatala niya lamang ang kinakailangang impormasyon at nagtatanong kung pumapayag ang pamilya sa angkop na referral.",
                  "start_ms": 34980,
                  "end_ms": 42860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Kilalanin ang pangangailangan bago piliin ang kausap.",
                  "start_ms": 43160,
                  "end_ms": 47200
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-7": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-local-partners/section-7.en.424c04856008.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "424c048560086746ea3d297d6d156e8503fb5801c1e6937d303f8e23cf72a33f",
              "sha256": "620769172244923e1192e1580b9d099eca2dca38a4cf851d1d1795138ccf83ca",
              "duration_seconds": 49.136,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Other partners and boundaries",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The mayor leads the local government and chairs the city or municipal local health board; the CHO or MHO is vice-chair.",
                  "start_ms": 2780,
                  "end_ms": 11100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "The board proposes health service funding and advises the sanggunian.",
                  "start_ms": 11400,
                  "end_ms": 16480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "It does not automatically approve a family’s request or make an individual clinical decision.",
                  "start_ms": 16780,
                  "end_ms": 22780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "A BHW president may help coordinate BHWs according to local arrangements.",
                  "start_ms": 23080,
                  "end_ms": 28800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "A social welfare or development officer can help identify suitable social assistance, while a sanitary inspector handles sanitation concerns.",
                  "start_ms": 29100,
                  "end_ms": 39420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Verify the right person and scope before approaching anyone.",
                  "start_ms": 39720,
                  "end_ms": 44040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Institutional planning differs from a decision for one person.",
                  "start_ms": 44340,
                  "end_ms": 49060
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-local-partners/section-7.fil.344bf64b4d9f.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "344bf64b4d9f0e02da7984f53d356bdf639e64def0a5ce8c3ad47b2b11f027af",
              "sha256": "691e2abcdac70240b13700d0b124360f8ad0865c59c521f28e6263c17b371363",
              "duration_seconds": 58.645,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Iba pang katuwang at hangganan",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang mayor ay namumuno sa lokal na pamahalaan at chair ng city o municipal local health board; ang CHO o MHO ang vice-chair.",
                  "start_ms": 2980,
                  "end_ms": 13780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ang board ay nagmumungkahi ng pondo para sa serbisyong pangkalusugan at nagpapayo sa sanggunian.",
                  "start_ms": 14080,
                  "end_ms": 21160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Hindi nito kusang inaprubahan ang hiling ng isang pamilya at hindi ito ang gumagawa ng indibidwal na klinikal na pasya.",
                  "start_ms": 21460,
                  "end_ms": 30220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ang BHW president ay makatutulong sa koordinasyon ng mga BHW ayon sa lokal na kaayusan.",
                  "start_ms": 30520,
                  "end_ms": 37880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Maaaring makatulong ang social welfare o development officer sa pag-alam sa angkop na social assistance, at ang sanitary inspector sa isyu ng kalinisan.",
                  "start_ms": 38180,
                  "end_ms": 49580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Tiyakin ang tamang tao at saklaw ng gawain bago lumapit.",
                  "start_ms": 49880,
                  "end_ms": 53760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Iba ang pagpaplano ng institusyon sa pasya para sa isang tao.",
                  "start_ms": 54060,
                  "end_ms": 58580
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "bhw-teamwork": [
      {
        "module": "05-bhw-at-barangay",
        "sections": {
          "section-8": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-teamwork/section-8.en.422876760efa.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "422876760efa46c44d9b78e38f1d9d3ff30be6d0796000814c47675d96721af1",
              "sha256": "1b118bb253e67978842c7bc10cc66fb9010eab10ea39d063210ea8aa9783ef8d",
              "duration_seconds": 58.593,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "What good teamwork looks like",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A barangay usually has more than one BHW, and they need to work as a team.",
                  "start_ms": 2940,
                  "end_ms": 9460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Five recommendations guide this.",
                  "start_ms": 9760,
                  "end_ms": 12840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "First, everyone should be clear on why they volunteered — to improve the community's health.",
                  "start_ms": 13140,
                  "end_ms": 19780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Second, each member's role should be clear — who's assigned to which purok, who leads which programme.",
                  "start_ms": 20080,
                  "end_ms": 27000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Third, be open about issues, even personal ones — talk about them right away before they deepen.",
                  "start_ms": 27300,
                  "end_ms": 35060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Fourth, be open to feedback and opinions from teammates or the community — treat it as help, not an attack.",
                  "start_ms": 35360,
                  "end_ms": 43400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Fifth, build relationships with teammates outside of work too — it helps team bonding.",
                  "start_ms": 43700,
                  "end_ms": 49700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A clear purpose and clear roles build the team; staying open to issues and feedback is what keeps it together.",
                  "start_ms": 50000,
                  "end_ms": 58520
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-teamwork/section-8.fil.b0e1abe61189.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "b0e1abe611893bd09587110ef4f66ed93f773f47ace1c31542f2ca3aab481b35",
              "sha256": "b93fb6dba8720204f1dd9e2e23db9e85db6c732a03d8e8fe99312330ded9f317",
              "duration_seconds": 70.139,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ano ang mabuting teamwork",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Kadalasan ay higit sa isang BHW ang isang barangay, at kailangan nilang magtrabaho bilang isang koponan.",
                  "start_ms": 2940,
                  "end_ms": 10500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Limang rekomendasyon ang gagabay dito.",
                  "start_ms": 10800,
                  "end_ms": 14240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Una, dapat malinaw sa lahat kung bakit sila nag-volunteer — upang mapabuti ang kalusugan sa komunidad.",
                  "start_ms": 14540,
                  "end_ms": 22380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Pangalawa, dapat malinaw ang tungkulin ng bawat miyembro — sino ang naka-assign sa aling purok, sino ang lead sa aling programa.",
                  "start_ms": 22680,
                  "end_ms": 33000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Pangatlo, maging bukas sa isyu, kahit personal — agad itong pag-usapan bago pa ito lumalim.",
                  "start_ms": 33300,
                  "end_ms": 41220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Pang-apat, maging bukas sa puna at opinyon mula sa kasamahan o sa komunidad — tingnan ito bilang tulong, hindi atake.",
                  "start_ms": 41520,
                  "end_ms": 51440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Panglima, bumuo ng ugnayan sa mga kasamahan kahit sa labas ng trabaho — nakakatulong ito sa bonding ng koponan.",
                  "start_ms": 51740,
                  "end_ms": 60500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang malinaw na layunin at tungkulin ang bumubuo ng koponan; ang pagiging bukas sa isyu at puna ang nagpapanatili nito.",
                  "start_ms": 60800,
                  "end_ms": 70080
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "module": "05-bhw-at-barangay",
        "sections": {
          "section-8": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-teamwork/section-8.en.b7f01452d6cc.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "b7f01452d6cc178b5ae80de21dc88f1a9c6ce08d41ebc3c1514c5d963f20cedc",
              "sha256": "51717c158bfcd8bce978c643cc1596c44bc53ae7849ea3a46396eee2f4352aa2",
              "duration_seconds": 49.528,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "One purpose, clear teamwork",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "In this fictional situation, Malou and two fellow BHWs are preparing invitations for an agreed outreach activity.",
                  "start_ms": 3580,
                  "end_ms": 12380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "The purok and time are assigned, but it is not yet clear who will prepare the invitations or who will report completion.",
                  "start_ms": 12680,
                  "end_ms": 20960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Saying everyone will help is not enough.",
                  "start_ms": 21260,
                  "end_ms": 24020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Good teamwork uses a shared purpose, clear roles, early communication, openness to feedback and respectful relationships.",
                  "start_ms": 24320,
                  "end_ms": 33800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "These help the team carry out its work for community health.",
                  "start_ms": 34100,
                  "end_ms": 37700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Cooperation does not grant authority to make clinical decisions or share confidential information.",
                  "start_ms": 38000,
                  "end_ms": 44920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Explain the purpose and clarify your contribution and limits.",
                  "start_ms": 45220,
                  "end_ms": 49460
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-teamwork/section-8.fil.e78cf986210f.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "e78cf986210ff569db32dd9cfa70c4f734b14ea71aac9677bef4bd9fd2615878",
              "sha256": "52b1ec341e9bbb1310b416d7d215ed0da2d5ea67baa698a5e3dbd3726fc0c605",
              "duration_seconds": 62.72,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Isang layunin, malinaw na pagtutulungan",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Sa kathang-isip na sitwasyon, naghahanda si Malou at dalawang kapwa BHW ng paanyaya para sa napagkasunduang outreach.",
                  "start_ms": 4020,
                  "end_ms": 14380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "May nakatalagang purok at oras, ngunit hindi pa malinaw kung sino ang maghahanda ng mga paanyaya at sino ang magbabalita kapag tapos na.",
                  "start_ms": 14680,
                  "end_ms": 25000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Hindi sapat ang sabihing tutulong ang lahat.",
                  "start_ms": 25300,
                  "end_ms": 28540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ang mabuting pagtutulungan ay may iisang layunin, malinaw na tungkulin, maagang pag-uusap, bukas na pagtanggap sa puna, at magalang na ugnayan.",
                  "start_ms": 28840,
                  "end_ms": 41040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Ginagamit ang mga ito upang maihatid nang maayos ang gawain para sa kalusugan ng komunidad.",
                  "start_ms": 41340,
                  "end_ms": 47380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ang pagtutulungan ay hindi nagbibigay ng karapatang gumawa ng pasyang klinikal o magbahagi ng kumpidensiyal na impormasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 47680,
                  "end_ms": 57240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ipaliwanag ang layunin at linawin ang sariling ambag at hangganan.",
                  "start_ms": 57540,
                  "end_ms": 62660
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "teamwork-application-check": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-teamwork/teamwork-application-check.en.eb41e9e270d8.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "eb41e9e270d8d06ca422da6cc67dac0f7f09e10f5e3ec555868a70ac5db7898b",
              "sha256": "158db088dfbbbecbe520effd398f910c0f115fbd2016132d1f27358feeff9780",
              "duration_seconds": 48.327,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Apply: a task will not be finished",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "At another fictional outreach activity, Malou’s colleague cannot finish the assigned preparation.",
                  "start_ms": 3700,
                  "end_ms": 10540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "There is no immediate danger, but an assignment needs to change.",
                  "start_ms": 10840,
                  "end_ms": 15600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "There is still time to contact the designated supervisor.",
                  "start_ms": 15900,
                  "end_ms": 19820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "The colleague does not want to share her personal reason.",
                  "start_ms": 20120,
                  "end_ms": 23720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Choose the best of the three responses.",
                  "start_ms": 24020,
                  "end_ms": 26700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Explain how it shows clear roles, early communication and respectful teamwork.",
                  "start_ms": 27000,
                  "end_ms": 33440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Then say who will accept the task, what permission must be checked and how completion will be confirmed.",
                  "start_ms": 33740,
                  "end_ms": 40540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "You do not need to watch the optional story to answer.",
                  "start_ms": 40840,
                  "end_ms": 44280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Show teamwork through a specific, safe agreement.",
                  "start_ms": 44580,
                  "end_ms": 48260
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-teamwork/teamwork-application-check.fil.abc2b01d061a.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "abc2b01d061afdbd0bc90d2baa0c11e41c9afbe7c73208bdaacd00570d0ef325",
              "sha256": "16fa590c37f2c2c29b6964edeec4f2439384a3a3ebff124f01f68cc9b936a29a",
              "duration_seconds": 57.13,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ilapat: may hindi matatapos",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Sa isa pang kathang-isip na outreach, hindi matatapos ng kasama ni Malou ang nakatalagang paghahanda.",
                  "start_ms": 3780,
                  "end_ms": 10740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Hindi ito agarang panganib, ngunit kailangan ng pagbabago sa assignment.",
                  "start_ms": 11040,
                  "end_ms": 16000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "May oras pa upang makipag-ugnayan sa itinalagang supervisor.",
                  "start_ms": 16300,
                  "end_ms": 20540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ayaw ibahagi ng kasama ang personal niyang dahilan.",
                  "start_ms": 20840,
                  "end_ms": 24240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Piliin ang pinakamainam na tugon sa tatlong pagpipilian.",
                  "start_ms": 24540,
                  "end_ms": 28660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ipaliwanag kung paano nito naipakikita ang malinaw na tungkulin, maagang pag-uusap at magalang na pagtutulungan.",
                  "start_ms": 28960,
                  "end_ms": 37360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Pagkatapos, sabihin kung sino ang tatanggap sa gawain, anong pahintulot ang titiyakin, at paano malalaman na tapos na.",
                  "start_ms": 37660,
                  "end_ms": 46780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Hindi kailangan ang panonood ng opsyonal na kuwento upang sagutin ito.",
                  "start_ms": 47080,
                  "end_ms": 51880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ipakita ang pagtutulungan sa tiyak at ligtas na kasunduan.",
                  "start_ms": 52180,
                  "end_ms": 57060
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "teamwork-early-handoff": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-teamwork/teamwork-early-handoff.en.6ea68bfdf1bf.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "6ea68bfdf1bf00a6b2e45f091546bd1512edc249b0d54c4bcba65f95d1abc23c",
              "sha256": "0c8d70881ab67b622db36cd6e3d8a3b1770ab1beae9b4748adc247907eb59c88",
              "duration_seconds": 64.496,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Raise issues early, hand over clearly",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Before the deadline, a colleague says, “I cannot finish checking the invitations.”",
                  "start_ms": 3940,
                  "end_ms": 9060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Malou responds, “Thank you for telling us early.",
                  "start_ms": 9360,
                  "end_ms": 12960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "What is done and what remains?”",
                  "start_ms": 13260,
                  "end_ms": 16540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "She does not demand private reasons or blame her colleague.",
                  "start_ms": 16840,
                  "end_ms": 21720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "A handoff identifies what is done, what remains, the deadline and any permission still needed.",
                  "start_ms": 22020,
                  "end_ms": 29260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Changes requiring permission are checked with the designated supervisor.",
                  "start_ms": 29560,
                  "end_ms": 34240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "The receiving person accepts and repeats the task; simply leaving a message is not enough.",
                  "start_ms": 34540,
                  "end_ms": 41460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Share only necessary information with an authorized recipient through an appropriate channel.",
                  "start_ms": 41760,
                  "end_ms": 48160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "An immediate danger or serious breach is raised promptly with the appropriate contact under the local process; a peer discussion must not delay it.",
                  "start_ms": 48460,
                  "end_ms": 58980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Speak early and confirm that someone accepts the bounded task.",
                  "start_ms": 59280,
                  "end_ms": 64440
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-teamwork/teamwork-early-handoff.fil.7b67fe858ac0.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "7b67fe858ac017c8fa6a966c541089928abe42b7220c1c7eabb8b919f58968c3",
              "sha256": "ba5af2cba3e1688316afb0f04d76f418188f7424f391720c41f22d81347e7499",
              "duration_seconds": 71.497,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Magsabi nang maaga, magpasa nang malinaw",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 4320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Bago ang takdang oras, sinabi ng kasama: “Hindi ko matatapos ang pagtingin sa mga paanyaya.”",
                  "start_ms": 4620,
                  "end_ms": 11060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sumagot si Malou: “Salamat sa maagang pagsabi.",
                  "start_ms": 11360,
                  "end_ms": 16000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ano na ang tapos at ano pa ang kailangan?”",
                  "start_ms": 16300,
                  "end_ms": 19940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Hindi niya hinihingi ang pribadong dahilan o sinisisi ang kasama.",
                  "start_ms": 20240,
                  "end_ms": 25560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Sa paglipat ng gawain, nililinaw ang tapos, natitira, takdang oras at kailangan pang pahintulot.",
                  "start_ms": 25860,
                  "end_ms": 34340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Tinitiyak sa itinalagang supervisor ang pagbabagong nangangailangan ng pahintulot.",
                  "start_ms": 34640,
                  "end_ms": 40520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Tinatanggap at inuulit ng sasalo ang gawain; hindi sapat ang mag-iwan lang ng mensahe.",
                  "start_ms": 40820,
                  "end_ms": 47540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Ibinabahagi lamang ang impormasyong kailangan sa awtorisadong tatanggap gamit ang angkop na paraan.",
                  "start_ms": 47840,
                  "end_ms": 54960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Ang agarang panganib o seryosong paglabag ay idinudulog kaagad sa angkop na contact ayon sa lokal na proseso; hindi kailangang hintayin ang usapang magkakasama.",
                  "start_ms": 55260,
                  "end_ms": 65980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Maagang magsabi at tiyaking may tumanggap sa saklaw na gawain.",
                  "start_ms": 66280,
                  "end_ms": 71440
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "teamwork-feedback-completion": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-teamwork/teamwork-feedback-completion.en.d44366c2f116.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "d44366c2f116cd4cdb1784176c94195a59587885ce2ccd5ebf2b7a11dc457901",
              "sha256": "8d55de8f4a5d2ee78da6cc06006ec57e097f0e0d8bf83dadcdf6314ea5d13d04",
              "duration_seconds": 60.134,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Give feedback and confirm completion",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "After the task, Malou says, “Telling us early helped.",
                  "start_ms": 3300,
                  "end_ms": 8260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Next time, let us write down who will report back.”",
                  "start_ms": 8560,
                  "end_ms": 11960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Her feedback names an action and a suggestion, not a personality trait.",
                  "start_ms": 12260,
                  "end_ms": 18300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "She listens to her colleague’s explanation and asks what change would help.",
                  "start_ms": 18600,
                  "end_ms": 23960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "The person who accepted the task reports, “The invitations were checked before ten o’clock.”",
                  "start_ms": 24260,
                  "end_ms": 30420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "The group confirms completeness against the agreement and informs the designated contact.",
                  "start_ms": 30720,
                  "end_ms": 37240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "If work remains, they record the next step, responsible person and follow-up time.",
                  "start_ms": 37540,
                  "end_ms": 43340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "A task is not complete merely because it was handed over.",
                  "start_ms": 43640,
                  "end_ms": 48760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "The group thanks one another and offers a voluntary chance to check in socially.",
                  "start_ms": 49060,
                  "end_ms": 54260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Confirm completion of the agreement; set a next step if anything remains.",
                  "start_ms": 54560,
                  "end_ms": 60080
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-teamwork/teamwork-feedback-completion.fil.a1ff1c2bc47c.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "a1ff1c2bc47c14db8a8fe82cd08a1b8afb868147347e372434504a150b96e6f4",
              "sha256": "fc6fcb8abb9472f092bf8b8c3659348815a53222384369d79b69305545636d44",
              "duration_seconds": 63.504,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Magbigay ng puna at tiyaking tapos",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Matapos ang gawain, sinabi ni Malou: “Nakatulong ang maagang pagsabi.",
                  "start_ms": 3340,
                  "end_ms": 8540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sa susunod, isulat natin kung sino ang magbabalita.”",
                  "start_ms": 8840,
                  "end_ms": 13120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Tiyak sa kilos at mungkahi ang puna, hindi sa pagkatao.",
                  "start_ms": 13420,
                  "end_ms": 18060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Nakikinig siya sa paliwanag ng kasama at nagtatanong kung anong pagbabago ang makatutulong.",
                  "start_ms": 18360,
                  "end_ms": 25080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Nagbalita ang tumanggap ng gawain: “Nasuri na ang mga paanyaya bago mag-alas-diyes.”",
                  "start_ms": 25380,
                  "end_ms": 31700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Tinitiyak ng grupo kung kumpleto ito ayon sa napagkasunduan at ipinapaalam sa itinakdang contact.",
                  "start_ms": 32000,
                  "end_ms": 38760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Kung may natitira, itinatala ang susunod na hakbang, responsable at oras ng pagbalik.",
                  "start_ms": 39060,
                  "end_ms": 45820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Hindi itinuturing na tapos ang gawain dahil lamang naipasa na ito.",
                  "start_ms": 46120,
                  "end_ms": 51200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Nagpapasalamat ang grupo at nag-aalok ng boluntaryong pagkakataong magkumustahan.",
                  "start_ms": 51500,
                  "end_ms": 57540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tiyaking natapos ang napagkasunduan; magtakda ng susunod na hakbang kung may kulang.",
                  "start_ms": 57840,
                  "end_ms": 63440
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "teamwork-five-practices": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-teamwork/teamwork-five-practices.en.c7fb911d43d6.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "c7fb911d43d683e06bef5ad8141d0b4e7f47f5fffcf91a4029eb863f34d3bb63",
              "sha256": "44bc9bfc13c5a486281be18e6ac21e6ab6c07005d6f6d2847bfbf54bbdb47b50",
              "duration_seconds": 56.163,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Five practices of a good team",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "First, clarify why you volunteered: to improve community health.",
                  "start_ms": 2740,
                  "end_ms": 7740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Second, clarify each member’s role and responsibility.",
                  "start_ms": 8040,
                  "end_ms": 12200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Third, discuss issues affecting the work early.",
                  "start_ms": 12500,
                  "end_ms": 15980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Describing the effect on the task is enough; private reasons do not have to be disclosed.",
                  "start_ms": 16280,
                  "end_ms": 22400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Fourth, listen to feedback from colleagues and the community and use specific suggestions to improve the work.",
                  "start_ms": 22700,
                  "end_ms": 30700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Fifth, build good relationships, including outside work, while respecting personal lives.",
                  "start_ms": 31000,
                  "end_ms": 38440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Such social activities are voluntary.",
                  "start_ms": 38740,
                  "end_ms": 41700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Nobody has to spend money, join a trip or take part in a close-contact physical game to prove they are a good teammate.",
                  "start_ms": 42000,
                  "end_ms": 50640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Keep all five practices while respecting privacy and choice.",
                  "start_ms": 50940,
                  "end_ms": 56100
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-teamwork/teamwork-five-practices.fil.829cb52a71c2.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "829cb52a71c2eb6b06d58d65f6043369d56b2ed63ccacc20193197786a1ccf8a",
              "sha256": "223a38c90819a82f386b758c7e83f2a11a1e17104e3a4f362c81c11d240ba8fd",
              "duration_seconds": 61.414,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Limang gawi ng mabuting koponan",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Una, linawin kung bakit nagboluntaryo: upang mapabuti ang kalusugan ng komunidad.",
                  "start_ms": 3460,
                  "end_ms": 10260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ikalawa, linawin ang tungkulin at pananagutan ng bawat miyembro.",
                  "start_ms": 10560,
                  "end_ms": 16160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ikatlo, pag-usapan nang maaga ang isyung nakaaapekto sa trabaho.",
                  "start_ms": 16460,
                  "end_ms": 21620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Sapat na sabihin ang epekto sa gawain; hindi kailangang ibunyag ang pribadong dahilan.",
                  "start_ms": 21920,
                  "end_ms": 27800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Ikaapat, pakinggan ang puna ng kasamahan at komunidad at gamitin ang tiyak na mungkahi upang mapabuti ang gawain.",
                  "start_ms": 28100,
                  "end_ms": 36500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ikalima, bumuo ng mabuting ugnayan, maging sa labas ng trabaho, nang may paggalang sa personal na buhay.",
                  "start_ms": 36800,
                  "end_ms": 45080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Boluntaryo ang ganitong pakikisalamuha.",
                  "start_ms": 45380,
                  "end_ms": 48220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Walang kailangang gumastos, sumama sa biyahe, o makipagdikit sa pisikal na laro upang patunayang mabuting kasamahan.",
                  "start_ms": 48520,
                  "end_ms": 56320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Panatilihin ang limang gawi at igalang ang pribasiya at pagpili.",
                  "start_ms": 56620,
                  "end_ms": 61340
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "teamwork-role-agreement": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-teamwork/teamwork-role-agreement.en.e4adf09b9e90.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "e4adf09b9e90b0a4dfbe17d93b6c5ac17bc84b43a603b61b959880bb1f4d255c",
              "sha256": "183274e141776fb13a1cbd9319c399ab1ffd87506d1546d7ff018a7ffd74e0e0",
              "duration_seconds": 55.745,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Agree on the task",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "At the table, the group clarifies the task: prepare the invitations before ten o’clock.",
                  "start_ms": 2860,
                  "end_ms": 8860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Malou prepares them, one colleague checks completeness and another reports to the designated contact.",
                  "start_ms": 9160,
                  "end_ms": 17200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Each person repeats the task and time they accepted.",
                  "start_ms": 17500,
                  "end_ms": 21300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "This is an example of sharing an already authorized task, not a universal rule for every barangay.",
                  "start_ms": 21600,
                  "end_ms": 29960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "A change to an official assignment must first be checked against the local process and permission from the designated supervisor.",
                  "start_ms": 30260,
                  "end_ms": 39100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "A peer BHW cannot assign work beyond a colleague’s training or authorization.",
                  "start_ms": 39400,
                  "end_ms": 45240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Also clarify whom to contact if there is a difficulty.",
                  "start_ms": 45540,
                  "end_ms": 49420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Task, recipient, time and contact: repeat and confirm the agreement.",
                  "start_ms": 49720,
                  "end_ms": 55680
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-teamwork/teamwork-role-agreement.fil.98a64229f11a.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "98a64229f11ada77c3b6c760acaacc571038eb3b6a0700d5a586adc195ae5491",
              "sha256": "a12e4a72505e2892e0ce7a9fb8559e48b06c9d40933c788967453011ca1357c9",
              "duration_seconds": 59.585,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pagkasunduan ang gawain",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Sa mesa, nililinaw ng grupo ang gawain: ihanda ang mga paanyaya bago mag-alas-diyes.",
                  "start_ms": 2500,
                  "end_ms": 9900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Si Malou ang naghahanda, isang kasama ang tumitingin sa pagkakakumpleto, at ang isa ang nagbabalita sa itinakdang contact.",
                  "start_ms": 10200,
                  "end_ms": 18480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Inuulit ng bawat isa ang tinanggap na gawain at oras.",
                  "start_ms": 18780,
                  "end_ms": 23780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ito ay halimbawa ng paghahati ng gawaing napahintulutan na, hindi pangkalahatang tuntunin sa lahat ng barangay.",
                  "start_ms": 24080,
                  "end_ms": 31560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Kung may pagbabago sa opisyal na assignment, tinitiyak muna ang lokal na proseso at pahintulot sa itinalagang supervisor.",
                  "start_ms": 31860,
                  "end_ms": 39660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Hindi maaaring magtalaga ang kapwa BHW ng gawaing lampas sa pagsasanay o awtorisasyon ng kasama.",
                  "start_ms": 39960,
                  "end_ms": 47560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Linawin din kung sino ang lalapitan kapag may hadlang.",
                  "start_ms": 47860,
                  "end_ms": 51500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Gawain, tatanggap, oras at contact: ulitin at tiyakin ang kasunduan.",
                  "start_ms": 51800,
                  "end_ms": 59520
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "bhw-right-contact": [
      {
        "module": "05-bhw-at-barangay",
        "sections": {
          "section-11": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-right-contact/section-11.en.fa2b8ac715f8.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "fa2b8ac715f8e620b8bb882d55eefca9354ee2b5992c7b2bb638803a803dbc12",
              "sha256": "0a77cead551b74be93fb2195687717b8da4b372b06d5edd07d90ce64917f05e7",
              "duration_seconds": 54.491,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Try it: one more situation",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Now try it yourself.",
                  "start_ms": 3220,
                  "end_ms": 5140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "A newly accredited BHW in your barangay is confused about how to file their first report.",
                  "start_ms": 5440,
                  "end_ms": 13600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Who is the most fitting person to approach — not the midwife, not barangay officials, but someone with the same experience as a BHW?",
                  "start_ms": 13900,
                  "end_ms": 25540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Think of the answer before moving on: a more experienced fellow BHW is the easiest person to go to for this — not because it's a lesser concern, but because that is exactly where the everyday, practical know-how of the work actually lives.",
                  "start_ms": 25840,
                  "end_ms": 43560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Not every question is for the midwife or barangay officials — some things a fellow BHW is simply the closest person to answer.",
                  "start_ms": 43860,
                  "end_ms": 54420
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-right-contact/section-11.fil.24e16c552912.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "24e16c55291269e8c3a6b9b2c519411f7bbb094bd047fce8551d2915f82da477",
              "sha256": "188440c43ba150f3f05b561449b5ed38576bdd823d7e2118d4fe82525d551034",
              "duration_seconds": 55.197,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Subukan mo: isa pang sitwasyon",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ngayon, subukan mo.",
                  "start_ms": 3260,
                  "end_ms": 5420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "May BHW na bagong-tanggap sa inyong barangay at nalilito kung paano mag-file ng kanyang unang ulat.",
                  "start_ms": 5720,
                  "end_ms": 13120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Sino kaya ang pinakaangkop na lapitan niya — hindi ang midwife, hindi rin ang barangay officials, kundi ang taong may parehong karanasan bilang BHW?",
                  "start_ms": 13420,
                  "end_ms": 25700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Isipin ang sagot bago magpatuloy: ang kapwa BHW na mas matagal na sa gawain ang pinakamadaling puntahan para dito — hindi dahil mas mababa ang usapin, kundi dahil doon talaga umiikot ang karanasan sa pang-araw-araw na mga detalye ng trabaho.",
                  "start_ms": 26000,
                  "end_ms": 43760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Hindi lahat ng katanungan ay para sa midwife o barangay officials — may mga bagay na ang kapwa BHW mismo ang may pinakamalapit na sagot.",
                  "start_ms": 44060,
                  "end_ms": 55140
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-12": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-right-contact/section-12.en.5a7ff8cd85bc.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "5a7ff8cd85bcd55b601326b65c058adcf2e28c8ebd0ab9722e46286b918a4ee7",
              "sha256": "bcf1032d30d0631681fc14f827e746b61d94e0d02a314eacdd5484179061c2dd",
              "duration_seconds": 47.83,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Wrong versus right: approaching the right person",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 4040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "**Wrong**: BHW Marites went straight to the barangay captain about Aling Nena's child's cough, because \"he's the one I usually talk to anyway.\"",
                  "start_ms": 4340,
                  "end_ms": 15460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "The barangay captain's time was wasted on a clinical matter outside his role, and the proper referral was delayed.",
                  "start_ms": 15760,
                  "end_ms": 23440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "**Right**: BHW Marites first recognized the clinical nature of the concern, approached the midwife/RHU, and only involved barangay officials once transport support to the facility was actually needed.",
                  "start_ms": 23740,
                  "end_ms": 40220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Approaching the wrong person doesn't just waste time — it also delays the service that should have been quick.",
                  "start_ms": 40520,
                  "end_ms": 47760
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-right-contact/section-12.fil.f4d5186d58c4.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "f4d5186d58c49e70eb6f9dcf89b0f41b2ad3345bbc75438d3dcd6969b5052c5d",
              "sha256": "4c3fb25ba674249a56cf50ad0fcfb350760a8cf4a22f514f4157324f043b50ff",
              "duration_seconds": 55.824,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Mali kumpara sa tama: paglapit sa tamang tao",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 4240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "**Mali**: Pinuntahan agad ni BHW Marites ang barangay captain para sa ubo ni anak ni Aling Nena, dahil \"siya naman ang laging kausap ko.\"",
                  "start_ms": 4540,
                  "end_ms": 17100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Nasayang ang oras ng barangay captain sa usaping klinikal na hindi naman niya saklaw, at naantala ang tamang pag-refer.",
                  "start_ms": 17400,
                  "end_ms": 26440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "**Tama**: Kinilala muna ni BHW Marites ang klinikal na katangian ng alalahanin, lumapit sa midwife/RHU, at kalaunan ay isinama ang barangay officials lamang kapag may kailangan nang suportang pantransportasyon papunta sa pasilidad.",
                  "start_ms": 26740,
                  "end_ms": 46220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang paglapit sa maling tao ay hindi lang nakakaubos ng oras — naaantala rin nito ang serbisyong dapat sana'y mabilis.",
                  "start_ms": 46520,
                  "end_ms": 55760
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "module": "05-bhw-at-barangay",
        "sections": {
          "contact-application": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-right-contact/contact-application.en.844783248522.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "844783248522f7a0e556a320d48fca9a9d92e9b945d8eea8f876bb5ba159cbef",
              "sha256": "44b804f61c033700e7becf2111ee60a2fe3a6c953d99d1134772460adf008052",
              "duration_seconds": 44.617,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose and explain",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A new BHW asks Malou how to file the first report.",
                  "start_ms": 2300,
                  "end_ms": 6740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "There is no immediate health concern in this situation.",
                  "start_ms": 7040,
                  "end_ms": 10960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Choose an appropriate first action and explain what to confirm with the supervisor.",
                  "start_ms": 11260,
                  "end_ms": 17020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Then summarize four relationships: the community for listening and participation; fellow BHWs for teamwork; the authorized health team for professional guidance; and local partners for administrative support.",
                  "start_ms": 17320,
                  "end_ms": 32400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "For each relationship, clarify the role, need and local process.",
                  "start_ms": 32700,
                  "end_ms": 39260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Match the need to the role, verify the process and follow up.",
                  "start_ms": 39560,
                  "end_ms": 44560
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-right-contact/contact-application.fil.b7d1a51d19f3.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "b7d1a51d19f30fab71f5af3e0da03525dab20e3f4270531915b95a21c277542c",
              "sha256": "3a36f65284c1da647747586df5034bcfbf181f7210f626ec7a3aa522268146dd",
              "duration_seconds": 52.637,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin at ipaliwanag",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "May bagong BHW na nagtatanong kay Malou kung paano mag-file ng unang ulat.",
                  "start_ms": 2780,
                  "end_ms": 9540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Walang agarang alalahaning pangkalusugan sa sitwasyong ito.",
                  "start_ms": 9840,
                  "end_ms": 14040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Piliin ang angkop na unang hakbang at ipaliwanag kung ano ang titiyakin sa supervisor.",
                  "start_ms": 14340,
                  "end_ms": 20580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Pagkatapos, ibuod ang apat na ugnayan: komunidad para sa pakikinig at partisipasyon; kapwa BHW para sa pagtutulungan; awtorisadong health team para sa propesyonal na gabay; at mga lokal na katuwang para sa administratibong suporta.",
                  "start_ms": 20880,
                  "end_ms": 40440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Sa bawat ugnayan, linawin ang papel, pangangailangan at lokal na proseso.",
                  "start_ms": 40740,
                  "end_ms": 46980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Itugma ang kailangan sa papel, tiyakin ang proseso at sundan.",
                  "start_ms": 47280,
                  "end_ms": 52560
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "contact-classify": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-right-contact/contact-classify.en.cb822501112c.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "cb822501112c1c076cac4b6c0277dbd163ace13b79ec77b2b83d3d7ade6f14ea",
              "sha256": "58d51600f17256e3d16bcc226f81dbeb7e70be850869b00ee46e23c6ef7df9a8",
              "duration_seconds": 33.489,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "What is needed?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "At a fictional coordination desk, Malou has two requests: help filing a report and a health concern.",
                  "start_ms": 1660,
                  "end_ms": 9060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Before choosing a contact, she clarifies the need, whether immediate help is needed, and the limits of her role.",
                  "start_ms": 9360,
                  "end_ms": 17520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Familiarity alone is not the basis.",
                  "start_ms": 17820,
                  "end_ms": 20980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "When immediate help is needed, follow the local referral or emergency process promptly; do not wait to find a perfect contact.",
                  "start_ms": 21280,
                  "end_ms": 30400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose by need and urgency.",
                  "start_ms": 30700,
                  "end_ms": 33420
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-right-contact/contact-classify.fil.be0e25a347df.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "be0e25a347dfac3edf3ba526a91288a451ea82795b06d0593024157ed7d27d0d",
              "sha256": "24db276de5129fc99885943ef25fa4ff4757908443b9a1fda6f819efc24047fb",
              "duration_seconds": 39.236,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ano ang kailangan?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Sa kathang-isip na coordination desk, may dalawang kahilingan si Malou: tulong sa pag-file ng ulat at alalahanin tungkol sa kalusugan.",
                  "start_ms": 1900,
                  "end_ms": 11460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Bago pumili ng lalapitan, nililinaw niya ang pangangailangan, kung may agarang tulong na kailangan, at ang saklaw ng kanyang tungkulin.",
                  "start_ms": 11760,
                  "end_ms": 21600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Hindi batayan ang pagiging kakilala lamang.",
                  "start_ms": 21900,
                  "end_ms": 25140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Kung agarang tulong ang kailangan, sundin agad ang lokal na referral o emergency process; huwag hintaying mahanap ang perpektong contact.",
                  "start_ms": 25440,
                  "end_ms": 34600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ayon sa pangangailangan at pagkaapurahan.",
                  "start_ms": 34900,
                  "end_ms": 39180
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "contact-professional": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-right-contact/contact-professional.en.c45fe077c345.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "c45fe077c3450d781fc097488eb29b432f089634514d773fdb63a998782de0c6",
              "sha256": "59167dd0796885e13378a22133e96d825298984ea64e150a254ea002960df1c7",
              "duration_seconds": 41.404,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A health concern",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "For a clinical, uncertain or urgent concern, contact the appropriate authorized health professional and follow the local referral or emergency process.",
                  "start_ms": 1980,
                  "end_ms": 12700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "The contact may be a midwife, nurse, doctor or RHU according to the assigned service and need; no single profession is sufficient for every case.",
                  "start_ms": 13000,
                  "end_ms": 24920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Malou does not diagnose or prescribe medicines.",
                  "start_ms": 25220,
                  "end_ms": 29860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "If immediate help is needed, act promptly under the local process while arranging coordination.",
                  "start_ms": 30160,
                  "end_ms": 36880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Clinical decisions belong to the appropriate authorized professional.",
                  "start_ms": 37180,
                  "end_ms": 41340
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-right-contact/contact-professional.fil.da2cb65c4805.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "da2cb65c4805cfc445087728a6e378bd10e6ccf0d5cee484e79dee07e6a0de20",
              "sha256": "616a4f7be81de9097381d35ad284a70e24c070f64515faa63d8afa03daa216b6",
              "duration_seconds": 44.173,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Alalahaning pangkalusugan",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Kapag klinikal, hindi tiyak o apurahan ang alalahanin, lumapit sa angkop na awtorisadong health professional at sundin ang lokal na referral o emergency process.",
                  "start_ms": 2820,
                  "end_ms": 14620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Maaaring contact ang midwife, nurse, doktor o RHU ayon sa nakatalagang serbisyo at pangangailangan; hindi sapat ang iisang propesyon para sa lahat ng kaso.",
                  "start_ms": 14920,
                  "end_ms": 26800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Hindi nagdi-diagnose o nagtatakda ng gamot si Malou.",
                  "start_ms": 27100,
                  "end_ms": 31020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Kung agarang tulong ang kailangan, kumilos agad ayon sa lokal na proseso habang inaayos ang koordinasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 31320,
                  "end_ms": 39000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang klinikal na pasya ay para sa angkop na awtorisadong propesyonal.",
                  "start_ms": 39300,
                  "end_ms": 44100
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "contact-verify": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-right-contact/contact-verify.en.218125211b1b.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "218125211b1b7b8746df340b6284a11a242fd55d0314268a076dc36630528017",
              "sha256": "782991b3230d7b0383dc012a16ed493fbdc390ae7fa14ec6448911b0541ed92f",
              "duration_seconds": 41.848,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Verify and follow up",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Malou verifies who is on duty, how to contact them safely, the next action and when to follow up on the outcome.",
                  "start_ms": 3020,
                  "end_ms": 11700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "If the first contact is unavailable, use the confirmed alternative under the local process; do not keep waiting when the need is urgent.",
                  "start_ms": 12000,
                  "end_ms": 20880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "With a nonhealth partner, share only the minimum information needed for coordination, consistent with consent and local policy.",
                  "start_ms": 21180,
                  "end_ms": 30540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Separate confirmed from unconfirmed arrangements and update the person who requested help.",
                  "start_ms": 30840,
                  "end_ms": 36680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Verify the contact, next action and outcome.",
                  "start_ms": 36980,
                  "end_ms": 41780
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-right-contact/contact-verify.fil.4e509cb330ab.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "4e509cb330abdb691577fdba43f97792c008b71de2cd2ea6c4ba3fb9cb678660",
              "sha256": "952fc4bc0d1d8e4cb6a3360de5089c19122cfdc95f759a064d8091982d92510d",
              "duration_seconds": 44.696,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tiyakin at sundan",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tinitiyak ni Malou kung sino ang naka-duty, paano ligtas na makikipag-ugnayan, ano ang susunod na hakbang at kailan susundan ang resulta.",
                  "start_ms": 2300,
                  "end_ms": 12540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Kung hindi makontak ang una, gamitin ang kumpirmadong alternatibo ayon sa lokal na proseso; huwag tumigil sa paghihintay kung apurahan.",
                  "start_ms": 12840,
                  "end_ms": 22320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Sa nonhealth partner, ibahagi lamang ang pinakamaliit na impormasyong kailangan sa koordinasyon, alinsunod sa pahintulot at lokal na patakaran.",
                  "start_ms": 22620,
                  "end_ms": 32980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ihiwalay ang kumpirmado sa hindi pa kumpirmado at magbalita sa taong humingi ng tulong.",
                  "start_ms": 33280,
                  "end_ms": 40120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tiyakin ang contact, susunod na hakbang at resulta.",
                  "start_ms": 40420,
                  "end_ms": 44620
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-11": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-right-contact/section-11.en.d8574faf408e.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "d8574faf408e3658d0d95d27e32bb53ab56148511c035d5fdd1ebae2a18251f2",
              "sha256": "e7be4dc259207841f0f799e0a5a31eb3a1b4ae4d5dfeb05b194e80e5d96b2174",
              "duration_seconds": 38.635,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Try it: the first report",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A new BHW is confused about filing the first report.",
                  "start_ms": 2380,
                  "end_ms": 6820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Malou can ask an experienced fellow BHW for routine steps that the peer knows and can support competently.",
                  "start_ms": 7120,
                  "end_ms": 15360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Confirm the official form, method, deadline and recipient with the designated supervisor.",
                  "start_ms": 15660,
                  "end_ms": 23260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "If the peer is unsure, ask the supervisor to clarify.",
                  "start_ms": 23560,
                  "end_ms": 28200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Use a blank example for practice, rather than an actual patient record.",
                  "start_ms": 28500,
                  "end_ms": 33420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Peer practical support; official confirmation with the supervisor.",
                  "start_ms": 33720,
                  "end_ms": 38560
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-right-contact/section-11.fil.e49cfc21f4d9.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "e49cfc21f4d96de24a663dca47d8575d396d3a27cb78064de54a40187e7a5d27",
              "sha256": "b1a43c8e3d775fd8dba6d444386114c8c3886fd2447ad5109a1e3056225cd473",
              "duration_seconds": 43.703,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Subukan mo: unang ulat",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Nalilito ang bagong BHW sa pag-file ng unang ulat.",
                  "start_ms": 2940,
                  "end_ms": 6940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Maaaring magpatulong si Malou sa kapwa BHW na may karanasan sa karaniwang hakbang na alam nito at saklaw ng kakayahan nito.",
                  "start_ms": 7240,
                  "end_ms": 15720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Tiyakin sa itinalagang supervisor ang opisyal na form, paraan, deadline at tumatanggap ng ulat.",
                  "start_ms": 16020,
                  "end_ms": 24300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Kung hindi tiyak ang sagot ng kapwa BHW, humingi ng paglilinaw sa supervisor.",
                  "start_ms": 24600,
                  "end_ms": 30920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Gumamit ng blangkong halimbawa sa pagsasanay, hindi totoong patient record.",
                  "start_ms": 31220,
                  "end_ms": 36860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Praktikal na tulong ng kapwa BHW; opisyal na pagtitiyak sa supervisor.",
                  "start_ms": 37160,
                  "end_ms": 43640
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-12": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-right-contact/section-12.en.fdd5bbcf42f1.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "fdd5bbcf42f112f88874c1e69a8d8c147ae1795a45bd95e415e0c1cfff8bd71c",
              "sha256": "bc4b5439aaa0b772560f5136561548ecd5628b565eb49991702fef30664df74d",
              "duration_seconds": 43.18,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Wrong and right choices",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "In a fictional example, Aling Nena asks about her child’s cough.",
                  "start_ms": 2740,
                  "end_ms": 8060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Malou should not choose the barangay captain for a clinical decision just because they often speak.",
                  "start_ms": 8360,
                  "end_ms": 14800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "The appropriate choice is guidance from the authorized health professional or RHU under the local process, without delaying immediate help when needed.",
                  "start_ms": 15100,
                  "end_ms": 26020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Transport support may be coordinated with the responsible local contact at the same time.",
                  "start_ms": 26320,
                  "end_ms": 32320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Support is separate from clinical decisions; Malou does not guarantee a vehicle or funding.",
                  "start_ms": 32620,
                  "end_ms": 39220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Coordinate support without delaying appropriate help.",
                  "start_ms": 39520,
                  "end_ms": 43120
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-right-contact/section-12.fil.b97a5c23c79a.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "b97a5c23c79a3b3b087d1d1414384aeda1f62ae689ac586241652e5b0d8624ee",
              "sha256": "4a6b28b825ad4ab93d28eeedb889b28af4094c6fe65541696f1e420aaf2f26a2",
              "duration_seconds": 48.353,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Mali at tamang pagpili",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Sa kathang-isip na halimbawa, may tanong si Aling Nena tungkol sa ubo ng kanyang anak.",
                  "start_ms": 2740,
                  "end_ms": 9140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Maling piliin ni Malou ang barangay captain para sa klinikal na pasya dahil lamang palagi niya itong kausap.",
                  "start_ms": 9440,
                  "end_ms": 16800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Tamang humingi ng gabay sa angkop na awtorisadong health professional o RHU ayon sa lokal na proseso, nang hindi inaantala ang agarang tulong kung kailangan.",
                  "start_ms": 17100,
                  "end_ms": 28860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Maaaring kasabay na iugnay sa responsableng lokal na contact ang suportang pantransportasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 29160,
                  "end_ms": 36320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Hiwalay ang suporta sa klinikal na pasya; hindi ginagarantiya ni Malou ang sasakyan o pondo.",
                  "start_ms": 36620,
                  "end_ms": 43420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Iugnay ang suporta nang hindi inaantala ang angkop na tulong.",
                  "start_ms": 43720,
                  "end_ms": 48280
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "bhw-self-management": [
      {
        "module": "05-bhw-at-barangay",
        "sections": {
          "section-10": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-self-management/section-10.en.adb3a1a45ded.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "adb3a1a45dedf1640de3b743fca238a610579c51260aa4d59f64e78c3107a96e",
              "sha256": "8e521a88bcd7f266210a4c636bdafc09b0b6d0cf65a28c7f5d036cab21401d0e",
              "duration_seconds": 62.668,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "How to improve self-management",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "These skills aren't natural to everyone — but there are specific ways to develop them.",
                  "start_ms": 3220,
                  "end_ms": 9260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Practice self-care, since stress lowers performance.",
                  "start_ms": 9560,
                  "end_ms": 13840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Train yourself to be patient, since everyone has their own timeline.",
                  "start_ms": 14140,
                  "end_ms": 19540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Finish one task at a time, since multitasking doesn't actually get more done.",
                  "start_ms": 19840,
                  "end_ms": 25960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Reflect on your own abilities — you improve faster once you know them.",
                  "start_ms": 26260,
                  "end_ms": 31380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Set specific, measurable, achievable, realistic, time-bound (SMART) goals.",
                  "start_ms": 31680,
                  "end_ms": 39840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Plan each week's work in writing.",
                  "start_ms": 40140,
                  "end_ms": 43180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Come to meetings prepared — ask for the agenda and read materials beforehand.",
                  "start_ms": 43480,
                  "end_ms": 49320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "And think before you speak.",
                  "start_ms": 49620,
                  "end_ms": 52420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Self-management isn't a natural skill — it's developed through specific habits: planning, reflection, and thinking before speaking.",
                  "start_ms": 52720,
                  "end_ms": 62600
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-self-management/section-10.fil.776f396f0dfb.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "776f396f0dfb75a105301b3db60bf737bc92c5336a5702df74a99995cd34480f",
              "sha256": "e73cf126c62b805c79310e2053a4329bf45c927f2ad49c95b7efc39ca00d5a99",
              "duration_seconds": 80.588,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Paano pagbutihin ang self-management",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Hindi likas sa lahat ang mga kasanayang ito — pero may mga tiyak na paraan para mapaunlad ito.",
                  "start_ms": 4020,
                  "end_ms": 11300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Mag-alaga sa sarili, dahil ang stress ay nagpapababa ng performance.",
                  "start_ms": 11600,
                  "end_ms": 17520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Sanayin ang sariling maging matiyaga, dahil may sariling timeline ang bawat tao.",
                  "start_ms": 17820,
                  "end_ms": 24500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Tapusin ang isang gawain sa isang pagkakataon, dahil hindi nagreresulta sa pagkumpleto ang multitasking.",
                  "start_ms": 24800,
                  "end_ms": 33440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Pagnilayan ang sariling kakayahan — mas mapapabuti mo ito kung kilala mo ito.",
                  "start_ms": 33740,
                  "end_ms": 39380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Magtakda ng mga target na tiyak, nasusukat, naaabot, makatotohanan, at may hangganan sa oras (SMART).",
                  "start_ms": 39680,
                  "end_ms": 51240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Magplano ng bawat linggo ng trabaho, nakasulat.",
                  "start_ms": 51540,
                  "end_ms": 56060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Dumalo sa mga pulong nang handa — hingin ang agenda at basahin ang mga materyales bago pumunta.",
                  "start_ms": 56360,
                  "end_ms": 63600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "At mag-isip muna bago magsalita.",
                  "start_ms": 63900,
                  "end_ms": 67100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang self-management ay hindi likas na kasanayan — ito ay pinapaunlad sa pamamagitan ng tiyak na ugali: pagpaplano, pagninilay, at pag-iisip bago magsalita.",
                  "start_ms": 67400,
                  "end_ms": 80520
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-9": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-self-management/section-9.en.a2e2a3434739.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "a2e2a343473909df39882c47e5c267486e019030bab4cbe0abc25695d63fedd0",
              "sha256": "e57b17b0e7a06d3f17057a6562ea613ba47a4aace8bcf5a6e1f8838b6e61f57b",
              "duration_seconds": 58.723,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Self-management skills",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Because each BHW is still just one person, they also need skills aimed inward — not only skills for relating to others.",
                  "start_ms": 2380,
                  "end_ms": 12660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Six skills matter: being **reliable** — delivering the good service expected of them; **stress management** — staying calm and focused under pressure; **time management** — prioritizing what matters so work finishes on time; being **trustworthy** — holding to principles and moral standards; **adaptability** — willing to accept and keep up with change; and being **honest and careful** — thoughtful in what is said and how others are treated.",
                  "start_ms": 12960,
                  "end_ms": 47240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Six self-management skills support a BHW — it isn't only the ability to relate to others that matters, but keeping yourself steady too.",
                  "start_ms": 47540,
                  "end_ms": 58660
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-self-management/section-9.fil.988f027b924a.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "988f027b924ae8e797a6df220dbd1efa5df9c22a6ddce5d57460506d50dd6140",
              "sha256": "0ed6867bde406660a9f36de2bf8334344ee49db53b7ac3378de7259491c7fdef",
              "duration_seconds": 66.273,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Mga kasanayan sa self-management",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Dahil isang tao lang ang bawat BHW, kailangan din niya ng mga kasanayang pang-sarili — hindi lang pang-ugnayan sa iba.",
                  "start_ms": 3180,
                  "end_ms": 12420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Anim na kasanayan ang dapat taglayin: **maasahan** — makapaghatid ng mabuting serbisyong inaasahan sa kanya; **stress management** — pagiging kalmado at tutok sa trabaho sa kabila ng tensyon; **time management** — kaya niyang unahin ang mas importanteng gawain upang matapos sa takdang oras; **mapagkakatiwalaan** — may prinsipyo at sumusunod sa pamantayang moral; **adaptability** — handang tumanggap at makisabay sa pagbabago; at **matapat at maingat** — maalalahanin sa sinasabi at sa pakikitungo sa ibang tao.",
                  "start_ms": 12720,
                  "end_ms": 53600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Anim na kasanayan sa self-management ang sumusuporta sa BHW — hindi lang ang kakayahang makipag-ugnayan sa iba ang kailangan, kundi ang pagpapanatili ng sarili.",
                  "start_ms": 53900,
                  "end_ms": 66220
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "communication-listen": [
      {
        "module": "06-komunikasyon",
        "sections": {
          "check": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/check.en.ccefa4e0a0db.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "ccefa4e0a0db870ecb52485834e1da746781b37f9c3c94e2b4b59b3a82dc77f0",
              "sha256": "7f968b5edd89be48908c2e1ff6c6ebc80437694ac1f4c5afd846f197453f28f4",
              "duration_seconds": 17.084,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose the next step",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose an answer and explain why before viewing the feedback.",
                  "start_ms": 2140,
                  "end_ms": 7020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Then compare it with your own practice attempt.",
                  "start_ms": 7320,
                  "end_ms": 10640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Permission, privacy and time help the person explain the concern.",
                  "start_ms": 10940,
                  "end_ms": 17020
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/check.fil.fd9cdff49383.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "fd9cdff493831d844e28bb987f08965c191139910a3e99e6ce12fe73ee418e0f",
              "sha256": "cdf9e86a55a5075ec5a5c43f4a1010f4f87197e3b04de860ada51f979b8dba63",
              "duration_seconds": 19.958,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang susunod na hakbang",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang sagot at ipaliwanag kung bakit bago tingnan ang feedback.",
                  "start_ms": 3100,
                  "end_ms": 8300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Pagkatapos, ihambing sa sarili mong ginawa sa pagsasanay.",
                  "start_ms": 8600,
                  "end_ms": 13240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Mas malinaw ang concern kapag may pahintulot, privacy at oras ang kausap.",
                  "start_ms": 13540,
                  "end_ms": 19900
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "listen": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/listen.en.499b72c712af.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "499b72c712af2fba53b7357070fe904c1a12638d34da5e7d131294e63e54ced0",
              "sha256": "4b80e33b71fd2991ad4ae5af5a975bd4543146969b4da374bced92e11f33c3df",
              "duration_seconds": 41.665,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Listen before giving advice",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Mila sits at Liza’s level and puts her phone away.",
                  "start_ms": 3020,
                  "end_ms": 6980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "She waits for the story to finish: Liza feels ashamed about missing several health-center visits.",
                  "start_ms": 7280,
                  "end_ms": 14040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Mila replies, “It sounds difficult to manage caregiving and getting there.”",
                  "start_ms": 14340,
                  "end_ms": 20060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "She does not call Liza lazy or promise to fix everything.",
                  "start_ms": 20360,
                  "end_ms": 24520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "A calm voice, appropriate eye contact and pauses leave space for a reply; do not force eye contact when it makes someone uncomfortable.",
                  "start_ms": 24820,
                  "end_ms": 35980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Respectful listening gives the person room to describe the real concern.",
                  "start_ms": 36280,
                  "end_ms": 41600
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/listen.fil.55836c6315a7.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "55836c6315a79440290272300ff2f2dbf1adf76bf8724e1af00b57acda30c9f8",
              "sha256": "8d12a977b7376ad2445eec5e6dbf1f3d278ef407aa2f95e09ae7cabb32344348",
              "duration_seconds": 49.11,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Makinig bago magpayo",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Umupo si Mila nang kapantay ni Liza at itinabi ang telepono.",
                  "start_ms": 3020,
                  "end_ms": 8380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Hinintay niyang matapos ang kuwento: nahihiya si Liza dahil ilang beses siyang hindi nakapunta sa health center.",
                  "start_ms": 8680,
                  "end_ms": 17040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "“Mukhang mahirap pagsabayin ang pag-aalaga at pagpunta roon,” tugon ni Mila.",
                  "start_ms": 17340,
                  "end_ms": 23300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Hindi niya sinabing tamad si Liza o nangakong maaayos ang lahat.",
                  "start_ms": 23600,
                  "end_ms": 29480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Ang mahinahong boses, angkop na tingin at sapat na paghinto ay nagpapakitang may puwang ang sagot; huwag pilitin ang eye contact kung hindi komportable ang kausap.",
                  "start_ms": 29780,
                  "end_ms": 42420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang pakikinig na may respeto ay nagbibigay ng pagkakataong mailahad ang tunay na concern.",
                  "start_ms": 42720,
                  "end_ms": 49040
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "liza": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/liza.en.6d78f843f323.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "6d78f843f3235d402f73a842e1bb33ec592838d41937b0fdc9c3976df8482b3a",
              "sha256": "168d82d442223c3f545808a02a4f5f0082eeee34dc25bbd2ecc7f36a58347aad",
              "duration_seconds": 39.732,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Why is Liza quiet?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Liza, 29, is speaking with BHW Mila for a household profile.",
                  "start_ms": 2740,
                  "end_ms": 9180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "A neighbor is beside her and she keeps looking at the door.",
                  "start_ms": 9480,
                  "end_ms": 13760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "She answers every question with “I’m fine.”",
                  "start_ms": 14060,
                  "end_ms": 18020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Instead of guessing the missing details, Mila asks whether they can move somewhere more private and which language Liza prefers.",
                  "start_ms": 18320,
                  "end_ms": 27400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "She explains that relevant information is for the health team and service planning.",
                  "start_ms": 27700,
                  "end_ms": 33500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Gathering information begins with a comfortable setting and a clear purpose.",
                  "start_ms": 33800,
                  "end_ms": 39680
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/liza.fil.c7896646b4f1.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "c7896646b4f1e3ec045be5d5477dbd8360cc19fc552ff7ac46d6abe3869b05f5",
              "sha256": "49426aadb003517f41f820edb094e64e148007de57b67a014da80a12a3410b17",
              "duration_seconds": 47.621,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Bakit tahimik si Liza?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Si Liza, 29 anyos, ay kinakausap ni BHW Mila para sa household profile.",
                  "start_ms": 2500,
                  "end_ms": 11220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Katabi niya ang kapitbahay at paulit-ulit siyang tumitingin sa pinto.",
                  "start_ms": 11520,
                  "end_ms": 16920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "“Okay lang po” ang sagot niya sa lahat.",
                  "start_ms": 17220,
                  "end_ms": 20260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Sa halip na punan ang mga patlang sa hula, tinanong ni Mila kung maaari silang lumipat sa mas pribadong lugar at kung anong wika ang komportable kay Liza.",
                  "start_ms": 20560,
                  "end_ms": 32400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Ipinaliwanag niyang ang kaugnay na impormasyon ay para sa health team at sa pagpaplano ng serbisyo.",
                  "start_ms": 32700,
                  "end_ms": 40020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang maayos na pangangalap ng impormasyon ay nagsisimula sa komportableng lugar at malinaw na layunin.",
                  "start_ms": 40320,
                  "end_ms": 47560
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "practice": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/practice.en.901867e76c4c.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "901867e76c4cd9c13fa1e3119782a9208f4379e2e639545e409cfc7889effd0b",
              "sha256": "3cfdb3cf8e4e2c42544d32d44d32a2fc4425717515203d6887d54b7b9bc40287",
              "duration_seconds": 37.695,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Try it, then repeat",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Play Liza and Mila.",
                  "start_ms": 2940,
                  "end_ms": 5300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Liza wants privacy and has a childcare barrier.",
                  "start_ms": 5600,
                  "end_ms": 9640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ask permission, agree on the place and language, listen, then summarize her concern.",
                  "start_ms": 9940,
                  "end_ms": 16380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ask a partner to identify one helpful phrase and repeat any rushed part.",
                  "start_ms": 16680,
                  "end_ms": 22840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Alone, speak both roles aloud.",
                  "start_ms": 23140,
                  "end_ms": 26940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Use the same opening at your next authorized visit.",
                  "start_ms": 27240,
                  "end_ms": 31000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Permission, privacy and time help the person explain the concern.",
                  "start_ms": 31300,
                  "end_ms": 37620
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/practice.fil.55a0092820dc.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "55a0092820dcd634aa06e67cd19646158fdf103487978478f8afcdca37420c97",
              "sha256": "91523b15fae5fb53e68658c05e873fcbe8c0f38fca3c724c1a62d0c9fb3fcfca",
              "duration_seconds": 44.643,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Subukan, saka ulitin",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Gumanap bilang Liza at Mila.",
                  "start_ms": 2860,
                  "end_ms": 6180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Nais ni Liza ng pribadong usapan at may problema sa magbabantay ng anak.",
                  "start_ms": 6480,
                  "end_ms": 12640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Humingi ng pahintulot, ayusin ang lugar at wika, makinig, saka ibuod ang concern.",
                  "start_ms": 12940,
                  "end_ms": 20940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ipaturo sa kapareha ang isang linyang nakatulong at ulitin ang bahaging minadali.",
                  "start_ms": 21240,
                  "end_ms": 27360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Kung mag-isa, sabihin nang malakas ang dalawang papel.",
                  "start_ms": 27660,
                  "end_ms": 32300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Sa susunod na awtorisadong pagbisita, gamitin ang parehong pambungad.",
                  "start_ms": 32600,
                  "end_ms": 38000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Mas malinaw ang concern kapag may pahintulot, privacy at oras ang kausap.",
                  "start_ms": 38300,
                  "end_ms": 44580
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "profile": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/profile.en.1c9f2f7e423c.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "1c9f2f7e423cebf48b3576fc665f1b2d3ecff74d6d4093dac5d7cc0a240a2a01",
              "sha256": "8a36a07c50b6d6633884ee1e413c38a97ad856257d3c7f546665dd66d2d02c20",
              "duration_seconds": 42.109,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Household profiling with a purpose",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Before profiling, explain the form’s purpose and who will use it.",
                  "start_ms": 3260,
                  "end_ms": 8420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ask one question at a time, respect a person’s wish not to answer yet, and never guess a blank field.",
                  "start_ms": 8720,
                  "end_ms": 17440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "If someone speaks for Liza, give her the opportunity to respond.",
                  "start_ms": 17740,
                  "end_ms": 22580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Summarize the record so she can correct errors.",
                  "start_ms": 22880,
                  "end_ms": 26400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "More personal information does not automatically make a better profile; collect what the authorized task requires.",
                  "start_ms": 26700,
                  "end_ms": 35220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A profile needs a clear purpose, accurate answers and respect for the person.",
                  "start_ms": 35520,
                  "end_ms": 42040
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/profile.fil.9f17836f7392.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "9f17836f7392cae560bc9d70828e68ef636ec8f21ca527f13cdf4c0609147155",
              "sha256": "9e46fd2c27a5b9f7d1b969770cd7541cedbebff5337a63c60975892730cbfd84",
              "duration_seconds": 45.584,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Household profile na may layunin",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Bago ang profile, sabihin kung para saan ang form at sino ang gagamit.",
                  "start_ms": 3580,
                  "end_ms": 9140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Isa-isahin ang tanong, igalang ang ayaw munang sagutin, at huwag hulaan ang bakanteng field.",
                  "start_ms": 9440,
                  "end_ms": 16720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Kung may ibang sumasagot para kay Liza, ibalik sa kanya ang pagkakataong magsalita.",
                  "start_ms": 17020,
                  "end_ms": 23180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ibuod ang naitala upang maitama niya ang maling detalye.",
                  "start_ms": 23480,
                  "end_ms": 28760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Ang mas maraming personal na impormasyon ay hindi awtomatikong mas mahusay na profile; kunin lamang ang kailangan ng awtorisadong gawain.",
                  "start_ms": 29060,
                  "end_ms": 38580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang profile ay may malinaw na gamit, tumpak na sagot at paggalang sa kausap.",
                  "start_ms": 38880,
                  "end_ms": 45520
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "module": "06-komunikasyon",
        "sections": {
          "check": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/check.en.fd1413c6512f.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "fd1413c6512fa9b89734c93a7aae3861836be9afb38b9f005b5059d07080841b",
              "sha256": "41b1d6e5d41358e93c6866535f74acde34d85b79f3324fa5f6ceb806310dfe5b",
              "duration_seconds": 28.264,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose the next step",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Return to the scene: the neighbor answers for Liza.",
                  "start_ms": 2060,
                  "end_ms": 5420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Gibs holds a closed clipboard.",
                  "start_ms": 5720,
                  "end_ms": 8120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "He has not yet checked where, in which language and with whom Liza feels comfortable talking.",
                  "start_ms": 8420,
                  "end_ms": 15340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Choose the first step and explain your reason before viewing feedback.",
                  "start_ms": 15640,
                  "end_ms": 19920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Then compare your decision with your practice attempt.",
                  "start_ms": 20220,
                  "end_ms": 23380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Give Liza a choice and a voice, then check understanding.",
                  "start_ms": 23680,
                  "end_ms": 28200
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/check.fil.82471a685a31.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "82471a685a31b00fca46d200e0743f1120fea99148da12f9010a4b84f6acba6f",
              "sha256": "afa4167237787598d6526b3dc4e77268b32f17bba567854857747c6b48db3b00",
              "duration_seconds": 31.112,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang susunod na hakbang",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Bumalik sa tagpo: ang kapitbahay ang sumasagot para kay Liza.",
                  "start_ms": 2660,
                  "end_ms": 7260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Hawak ni Gibs ang nakasarang clipboard.",
                  "start_ms": 7560,
                  "end_ms": 10280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Hindi pa niya alam kung saan, sa anong wika at kanino kasama komportable si Liza.",
                  "start_ms": 10580,
                  "end_ms": 16260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Piliin ang unang hakbang at ipaliwanag ang dahilan bago tingnan ang feedback.",
                  "start_ms": 16560,
                  "end_ms": 21520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Pagkatapos, ihambing ang pasya sa ginawa mo sa pagsasanay.",
                  "start_ms": 21820,
                  "end_ms": 26020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Bigyan ng pagpili at boses si Liza, saka tiyakin ang pagkaintindi.",
                  "start_ms": 26320,
                  "end_ms": 31040
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "listen": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/listen.en.28416bd7c4fe.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "28416bd7c4fe717272827a372cbb5f7c44538b823e93d48950fcfcd40a74dc33",
              "sha256": "de706675b5879474124a2f224635ee40a7ee239fac7ede4da066b889dfc8c94b",
              "duration_seconds": 45.349,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Listen before giving advice",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Gibs sits at Liza’s level and puts his phone away.",
                  "start_ms": 2940,
                  "end_ms": 6540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "“What would you like to tell me about getting to the health center?”",
                  "start_ms": 6840,
                  "end_ms": 10240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "he asks.",
                  "start_ms": 10540,
                  "end_ms": 11900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "He allows time and does not interrupt.",
                  "start_ms": 12200,
                  "end_ms": 15360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Liza says getting there is difficult when nobody can look after her child.",
                  "start_ms": 15660,
                  "end_ms": 20340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "“It sounds difficult to manage caregiving and getting there,” Gibs replies.",
                  "start_ms": 20640,
                  "end_ms": 25920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "He does not call Liza lazy or promise to fix everything.",
                  "start_ms": 26220,
                  "end_ms": 30740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "He uses a calm voice and allows pauses.",
                  "start_ms": 31040,
                  "end_ms": 34960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Do not force eye contact; comfortable listening is not measured by staring.",
                  "start_ms": 35260,
                  "end_ms": 40580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Allow time for the account and acknowledge difficulty without blame.",
                  "start_ms": 40880,
                  "end_ms": 45280
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/listen.fil.005b506abeea.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "005b506abeea99fdf038a05d31a71994bbb4228bfb6793f403e79062eccc9813",
              "sha256": "e34d6f17332104a45ab7ab2a59d725e16462426df49ee6cc5e395459e012b567",
              "duration_seconds": 49.894,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Makinig bago magpayo",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Umupo si Gibs nang kapantay ni Liza at itinabi ang telepono.",
                  "start_ms": 2580,
                  "end_ms": 7420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "“Ano po ang gusto ninyong ikuwento tungkol sa pagpunta sa health center?”",
                  "start_ms": 7720,
                  "end_ms": 12040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "tanong niya.",
                  "start_ms": 12340,
                  "end_ms": 13740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Nagbigay siya ng oras at hindi sumabat.",
                  "start_ms": 14040,
                  "end_ms": 17240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Sinabi ni Liza na mahirap pumunta kapag walang magbabantay sa anak.",
                  "start_ms": 17540,
                  "end_ms": 22300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "“Mukhang mahirap pagsabayin ang pag-aalaga at pagpunta roon,” tugon ni Gibs.",
                  "start_ms": 22600,
                  "end_ms": 27840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Hindi niya tinawag na tamad si Liza o nangakong maaayos ang lahat.",
                  "start_ms": 28140,
                  "end_ms": 33060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Gumamit siya ng mahinahong boses at sapat na paghinto.",
                  "start_ms": 33360,
                  "end_ms": 37680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Huwag pilitin ang eye contact; ang komportableng pakikinig ay hindi sinusukat sa pagtitig.",
                  "start_ms": 37980,
                  "end_ms": 44420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Magbigay ng oras sa kuwento at kilalanin ang hirap nang walang paratang.",
                  "start_ms": 44720,
                  "end_ms": 49840
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "liza": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/liza.en.5c85a132024b.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "5c85a132024b691ed4de33945065c3424d1d699309efd41890164725a6759ab4",
              "sha256": "ff3af0704b9b1edbc5492303388e0a0b91b53e6ccf1d42ffad02a008a8105bf1",
              "duration_seconds": 33.593,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Why is Liza quiet?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Gibs, a male BHW, visits Liza, 29, for a household profile.",
                  "start_ms": 2260,
                  "end_ms": 8420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "A neighbor sits beside Liza and answers for her.",
                  "start_ms": 8720,
                  "end_ms": 12280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Liza gives short replies and looks toward the door.",
                  "start_ms": 12580,
                  "end_ms": 16380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "These cues do not tell Gibs for certain how she feels.",
                  "start_ms": 16680,
                  "end_ms": 20360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "He pauses the questions.",
                  "start_ms": 20660,
                  "end_ms": 23260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Before continuing, what should he check about Liza’s comfort and choices?",
                  "start_ms": 23560,
                  "end_ms": 28040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pause and ask what the person prefers; do not guess the reason for silence.",
                  "start_ms": 28340,
                  "end_ms": 33540
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/liza.fil.530aa7c60245.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "530aa7c602458029fee7936011c9792c562dccdeea39bf06dae5333560f79a46",
              "sha256": "fc0586f8d234c2744ce8e750efc853926e23b57b85d4afba8918af564ab6d064",
              "duration_seconds": 37.799,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Bakit tahimik si Liza?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Si Gibs, isang lalaking BHW, ay bumisita kay Liza, 29 anyos, para sa household profile.",
                  "start_ms": 2460,
                  "end_ms": 9860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Katabi ni Liza ang kapitbahay na sumasagot para sa kanya.",
                  "start_ms": 10160,
                  "end_ms": 14320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Maikli ang sagot ni Liza at tumitingin siya sa pinto.",
                  "start_ms": 14620,
                  "end_ms": 18420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Hindi nito tiyak na sinasabi kung ano ang nararamdaman niya.",
                  "start_ms": 18720,
                  "end_ms": 22600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Huminto muna si Gibs sa pagtatanong.",
                  "start_ms": 22900,
                  "end_ms": 25460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Bago magpatuloy, ano ang dapat niyang alamin tungkol sa ginhawa at pagpili ni Liza?",
                  "start_ms": 25760,
                  "end_ms": 31360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Huminto at itanong ang gusto ng kausap; huwag hulaan ang dahilan ng katahimikan.",
                  "start_ms": 31660,
                  "end_ms": 37740
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "permission": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/permission.en.0f61a329df8e.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "0f61a329df8e2bb6b266c13277bcf5b19e47ec63202938cbb9d726ab8da455f3",
              "sha256": "d17eed27b3ea71df84e725569e65393d7375884e819fec88c3fb182ba9e0b77a",
              "duration_seconds": 51.618,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ask permission and offer choices",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Gibs explains: “This is for an authorized household profile and health-service planning.",
                  "start_ms": 3180,
                  "end_ms": 9180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Only relevant information will be used by the authorized health team under local policy.",
                  "start_ms": 9480,
                  "end_ms": 15120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "May we talk?”",
                  "start_ms": 15420,
                  "end_ms": 16740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "He asks about Liza’s preferred language, place and whether she wants a support person present.",
                  "start_ms": 17040,
                  "end_ms": 23040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "“Here in the quieter part, in Filipino, just us for now,” Liza replies.",
                  "start_ms": 23340,
                  "end_ms": 29460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "She may pause, leave a question unanswered for now or choose another time.",
                  "start_ms": 29760,
                  "end_ms": 35240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Gibs does not promise absolute secrecy.",
                  "start_ms": 35540,
                  "end_ms": 38940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "If immediate help is needed, do not delay it to complete a routine interview; follow the local process.",
                  "start_ms": 39240,
                  "end_ms": 46040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The person chooses a comfortable place, language and support person.",
                  "start_ms": 46340,
                  "end_ms": 51540
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/permission.fil.ddf51688b025.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "ddf51688b02569637670264084ca71f255c60eecee5f6eaab6b01bc136aa78bc",
              "sha256": "f79a71a3cadbec14d72549556c3c7405611e929671b8fccb2ef816a5c4b36356",
              "duration_seconds": 58.854,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Humingi ng pahintulot at mag-alok ng pagpili",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ipinaliwanag ni Gibs: “Para po ito sa awtorisadong household profile at pagpaplano ng serbisyong pangkalusugan.",
                  "start_ms": 4020,
                  "end_ms": 11740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Kaugnay na impormasyon lamang ang gagamitin ng awtorisadong health team ayon sa lokal na patakaran.",
                  "start_ms": 12040,
                  "end_ms": 19200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Maaari po ba tayong mag-usap?”",
                  "start_ms": 19500,
                  "end_ms": 21700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Tinanong niya ang gustong wika, lugar at kung nais ni Liza ng kasamang susuporta sa kanya.",
                  "start_ms": 22000,
                  "end_ms": 28920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "“Dito po sa mas tahimik na bahagi, sa Filipino, tayo muna,” sagot ni Liza.",
                  "start_ms": 29220,
                  "end_ms": 34660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Maaari siyang magpahinga, hindi muna sumagot o pumili ng ibang oras.",
                  "start_ms": 34960,
                  "end_ms": 40600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Hindi pangako ng ganap na lihim ang paliwanag ni Gibs.",
                  "start_ms": 40900,
                  "end_ms": 44620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Kung kailangan ng agarang tulong, huwag itong ipagpaliban para makumpleto ang karaniwang interview; sundin ang lokal na proseso.",
                  "start_ms": 44920,
                  "end_ms": 53280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang kausap ang pumipili ng komportableng lugar, wika at kasama.",
                  "start_ms": 53580,
                  "end_ms": 58780
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "practice": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/practice.en.b119957951d2.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "b119957951d291b6f186432cad582e9db5f5607c5def1ddcc4ee77930ed12c43",
              "sha256": "ea5e30917db40e7b01ca0605793aba565b5fae13fd21040f5b249d760aed6138",
              "duration_seconds": 48.274,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Try it, then repeat",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Use the fictional role cards: Gibs, Liza and observer.",
                  "start_ms": 2260,
                  "end_ms": 6940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Rehearse permission, choice of place and language, listening without interruption, and a summary with an accuracy check.",
                  "start_ms": 7240,
                  "end_ms": 15320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Liza chooses whether she wants a support person.",
                  "start_ms": 15620,
                  "end_ms": 18940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "The observer records the exact helpful phrase and any rushed step.",
                  "start_ms": 19240,
                  "end_ms": 24680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Repeat that part before rotating roles.",
                  "start_ms": 24980,
                  "end_ms": 28220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Everyone practices as the BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 28520,
                  "end_ms": 31640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Alone, say both roles aloud and check the listening aid.",
                  "start_ms": 31940,
                  "end_ms": 36180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "At the next authorized visit, rehearse the same opening.",
                  "start_ms": 36480,
                  "end_ms": 40360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Do not upload a resident’s private account.",
                  "start_ms": 40660,
                  "end_ms": 43540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Repeat the step needing work; peer feedback is practice.",
                  "start_ms": 43840,
                  "end_ms": 48200
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/practice.fil.47dd236d320d.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "47dd236d320d67702e215453f2ae2162f906a32412e03caf703e05633a69e073",
              "sha256": "f6c3d7d6cf678d2e7a817c9cf6572d5499a64b1e11b020c49a4e3eafe2d47b4e",
              "duration_seconds": 53.864,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Subukan, saka ulitin",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Gamitin ang kathang-isip na role cards: Gibs, Liza at tagamasid.",
                  "start_ms": 2540,
                  "end_ms": 8020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Magsanay ng pahintulot, pagpili ng lugar at wika, pakikinig nang hindi sumasabat, at buod na may pagtiyak.",
                  "start_ms": 8320,
                  "end_ms": 17040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Si Liza ang pipili kung may kasamang susuporta.",
                  "start_ms": 17340,
                  "end_ms": 20620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Itala ng tagamasid ang eksaktong linyang nakatulong at ang hakbang na minadali.",
                  "start_ms": 20920,
                  "end_ms": 26120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Ulitin ang bahaging iyon bago magpalit ng papel.",
                  "start_ms": 26420,
                  "end_ms": 29940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Lahat ay susubok bilang BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 30240,
                  "end_ms": 33400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Kung mag-isa, sabihin nang malakas ang dalawang papel at itsek ang listening aid.",
                  "start_ms": 33700,
                  "end_ms": 39180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Sa susunod na awtorisadong pagbisita, sanayin ang parehong pambungad.",
                  "start_ms": 39480,
                  "end_ms": 44360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Huwag mag-upload ng pribadong kuwento ng residente.",
                  "start_ms": 44660,
                  "end_ms": 48060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ulitin ang hindi pa malinaw na hakbang; feedback ng kapareha ay pagsasanay.",
                  "start_ms": 48360,
                  "end_ms": 53800
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "profile": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/profile.en.ef88bd11b327.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "ef88bd11b327ab58ae020a0219115e29690e2b3818ccfb921f7156b654318ef5",
              "sha256": "f23695b4882beb2361c7f16c7f7b686af070cd11e725aa31fa2f450df91b497a",
              "duration_seconds": 48.797,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Summarize and check accuracy",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "“Have I understood correctly: getting there is difficult when nobody can look after your child?”",
                  "start_ms": 3340,
                  "end_ms": 8980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Gibs asks.",
                  "start_ms": 9280,
                  "end_ms": 10800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "“Yes, when my sister is away,” Liza clarifies.",
                  "start_ms": 11100,
                  "end_ms": 15300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Gibs offers a more accurate summary: “When your sister is away, it is difficult to find childcare.",
                  "start_ms": 15600,
                  "end_ms": 22520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Is that right?”",
                  "start_ms": 22820,
                  "end_ms": 24220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Liza confirms it.",
                  "start_ms": 24520,
                  "end_ms": 26480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "This is a fictional accuracy check, not an actual record.",
                  "start_ms": 26780,
                  "end_ms": 31020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "In an authorized profile, collect only relevant information, do not guess missing answers and respect a wish not to answer yet.",
                  "start_ms": 31320,
                  "end_ms": 40240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "No childcare arrangement or appointment has been promised.",
                  "start_ms": 40540,
                  "end_ms": 44140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ask whether the summary is accurate and let the person correct it.",
                  "start_ms": 44440,
                  "end_ms": 48720
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/profile.fil.46ed74ba1db9.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "46ed74ba1db9f803a29b4e6fe0fc70590c23de98dae06df2aed0f0eac8dace10",
              "sha256": "6ea691c9028ba122860c8d8b0180d27171a2ad1963de505248fbe26ebf4a93d8",
              "duration_seconds": 50.495,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ibuod at tiyaking tama",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "“Tama po ba ang pagkaintindi ko: mahirap pumunta kapag walang magbabantay sa anak ninyo?”",
                  "start_ms": 2700,
                  "end_ms": 8740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "tanong ni Gibs.",
                  "start_ms": 9040,
                  "end_ms": 10560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "“Opo, kapag wala ang kapatid ko,” paglilinaw ni Liza.",
                  "start_ms": 10860,
                  "end_ms": 15460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ibinalik ni Gibs ang mas tumpak na buod: “Kapag wala ang kapatid ninyo, mahirap makahanap ng magbabantay.",
                  "start_ms": 15760,
                  "end_ms": 23440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Tama po ba?”",
                  "start_ms": 23740,
                  "end_ms": 24820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Kinumpirma ito ni Liza.",
                  "start_ms": 25120,
                  "end_ms": 27200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Kathang-isip na halimbawa ito ng pagtitiyak, hindi aktuwal na rekord.",
                  "start_ms": 27500,
                  "end_ms": 32660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Sa awtorisadong profile, kunin lamang ang kaugnay na impormasyon, huwag hulaan ang patlang at igalang ang ayaw munang sagutin.",
                  "start_ms": 32960,
                  "end_ms": 41720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Walang ipinangakong childcare o appointment.",
                  "start_ms": 42020,
                  "end_ms": 45020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tanungin kung tama ang buod at hayaan ang kausap na magwasto.",
                  "start_ms": 45320,
                  "end_ms": 50440
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "module": "06-komunikasyon",
        "sections": {
          "check": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/check.en.dcdaa412d29b.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "dcdaa412d29b3eb79cc71ba434fd0c72f581997b4f3e1e7fd39f750f795d4d71",
              "sha256": "6df064c60cb7e3b76421dbbd0b3bd48fe1c9267d38216e5727cf43244886e5f3",
              "duration_seconds": 27.533,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose the next step",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Return to the scene: the neighbor answers for Liza.",
                  "start_ms": 1860,
                  "end_ms": 5620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Gibs holds a closed clipboard.",
                  "start_ms": 5920,
                  "end_ms": 8360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "He has not yet checked where, in which language and with whom Liza feels comfortable talking.",
                  "start_ms": 8660,
                  "end_ms": 14900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Choose the first step and explain your reason before viewing feedback.",
                  "start_ms": 15200,
                  "end_ms": 19880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Then compare your decision with your practice attempt.",
                  "start_ms": 20180,
                  "end_ms": 23340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Give Liza a choice and a voice, then check understanding.",
                  "start_ms": 23640,
                  "end_ms": 27480
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/check.fil.47ed16057bab.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "47ed16057bab4852ff5f3e6dafc39e90ab8fb4cb7094bc2998886b0e34b4a3ed",
              "sha256": "7374c3df65795766c5e2040b5fed2733e406b49e1762bc54849c151996b96265",
              "duration_seconds": 31.216,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang susunod na hakbang",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Bumalik sa tagpo: ang kapitbahay ang sumasagot para kay Liza.",
                  "start_ms": 2660,
                  "end_ms": 7060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Hawak ni Gibs ang nakasarang clipboard.",
                  "start_ms": 7360,
                  "end_ms": 9960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Hindi pa niya alam kung saan, sa anong wika at kanino kasama komportable si Liza.",
                  "start_ms": 10260,
                  "end_ms": 16500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Piliin ang unang hakbang at ipaliwanag ang dahilan bago tingnan ang feedback.",
                  "start_ms": 16800,
                  "end_ms": 21840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Pagkatapos, ihambing ang pasya sa ginawa mo sa pagsasanay.",
                  "start_ms": 22140,
                  "end_ms": 26100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Bigyan ng pagpili at boses si Liza, saka tiyakin ang pagkaintindi.",
                  "start_ms": 26400,
                  "end_ms": 31160
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "listen": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/listen.en.d6c6e47f2ab2.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "d6c6e47f2ab2faf7c9b3f8ceee1c5a500c4516eed7e9d420078866a1864ddc7e",
              "sha256": "ad6fb29571fd5b498a4654f24bf22c9e75a49103004a2ed775a8a89116b10f8d",
              "duration_seconds": 43.494,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Listen before giving advice",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Gibs sits at Liza’s level and puts his phone away.",
                  "start_ms": 3220,
                  "end_ms": 6700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "“What would you like to tell me about getting to the health center?”",
                  "start_ms": 7000,
                  "end_ms": 10240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "he asks.",
                  "start_ms": 10540,
                  "end_ms": 11780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "He allows time and does not interrupt.",
                  "start_ms": 12080,
                  "end_ms": 15160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Liza says getting there is difficult when nobody can look after her child.",
                  "start_ms": 15460,
                  "end_ms": 19820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "“It sounds difficult to manage caregiving and getting there,” Gibs replies.",
                  "start_ms": 20120,
                  "end_ms": 25840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "He does not call Liza lazy or promise to fix everything.",
                  "start_ms": 26140,
                  "end_ms": 29940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "He uses a calm voice and allows pauses.",
                  "start_ms": 30240,
                  "end_ms": 33280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Do not force eye contact; comfortable listening is not measured by staring.",
                  "start_ms": 33580,
                  "end_ms": 39100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Allow time for the account and acknowledge difficulty without blame.",
                  "start_ms": 39400,
                  "end_ms": 43440
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/listen.fil.6d66945bc07f.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "6d66945bc07f01127fb74a27979b7745ccef3e6e77fc2d2b9d924dbcc76135be",
              "sha256": "7eb9a5a5454ca0c57b3c1fe474fb65a25c637f98bd2b525550299ad757a8ec7e",
              "duration_seconds": 47.935,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Makinig bago magpayo",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Umupo si Gibs nang kapantay ni Liza at itinabi ang telepono.",
                  "start_ms": 2380,
                  "end_ms": 6300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "“Ano po ang gusto ninyong ikuwento tungkol sa pagpunta sa health center?”",
                  "start_ms": 6600,
                  "end_ms": 10760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "tanong niya.",
                  "start_ms": 11060,
                  "end_ms": 12220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Nagbigay siya ng oras at hindi sumabat.",
                  "start_ms": 12520,
                  "end_ms": 15480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Sinabi ni Liza na mahirap pumunta kapag walang magbabantay sa anak.",
                  "start_ms": 15780,
                  "end_ms": 19820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "“Mukhang mahirap pagsabayin ang pag-aalaga at pagpunta roon,” tugon ni Gibs.",
                  "start_ms": 20120,
                  "end_ms": 25760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Hindi niya tinawag na tamad si Liza o nangakong maaayos ang lahat.",
                  "start_ms": 26060,
                  "end_ms": 30660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Gumamit siya ng mahinahong boses at sapat na paghinto.",
                  "start_ms": 30960,
                  "end_ms": 35360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Huwag pilitin ang eye contact; ang komportableng pakikinig ay hindi sinusukat sa pagtitig.",
                  "start_ms": 35660,
                  "end_ms": 42060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Magbigay ng oras sa kuwento at kilalanin ang hirap nang walang paratang.",
                  "start_ms": 42360,
                  "end_ms": 47880
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "liza": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/liza.en.7f6cb15e3b4b.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "7f6cb15e3b4bd04bde4793e650da6fcc6a2c6684d7065a174a4782c5b3cfe3e7",
              "sha256": "fba969a6b11bcf44d1f559028ca8e0f2d36b996b5d44aee8267adaaf171e6e4d",
              "duration_seconds": 31.922,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Why is Liza quiet?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Gibs, a male BHW, visits Liza, 29, for a household profile.",
                  "start_ms": 2140,
                  "end_ms": 7780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "A neighbor sits beside Liza and answers for her.",
                  "start_ms": 8080,
                  "end_ms": 11520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Liza gives short replies and looks toward the door.",
                  "start_ms": 11820,
                  "end_ms": 15260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "These cues do not tell Gibs for certain how she feels.",
                  "start_ms": 15560,
                  "end_ms": 19480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "He pauses the questions.",
                  "start_ms": 19780,
                  "end_ms": 21860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Before continuing, what should he check about Liza’s comfort and choices?",
                  "start_ms": 22160,
                  "end_ms": 26680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pause and ask what the person prefers; do not guess the reason for silence.",
                  "start_ms": 26980,
                  "end_ms": 31860
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/liza.fil.947df9854c6d.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "947df9854c6def3fd636436b493c24d001f8fc2b88abc1989bdd1637d1007c46",
              "sha256": "5062e66e7d4b44cee172dc7f1f741716802f014c53d0a0228da465c99ec4328e",
              "duration_seconds": 36.833,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Bakit tahimik si Liza?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Si Gibs, isang lalaking BHW, ay bumisita kay Liza, 29 anyos, para sa household profile.",
                  "start_ms": 2220,
                  "end_ms": 10060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Katabi ni Liza ang kapitbahay na sumasagot para sa kanya.",
                  "start_ms": 10360,
                  "end_ms": 13720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Maikli ang sagot ni Liza at tumitingin siya sa pinto.",
                  "start_ms": 14020,
                  "end_ms": 17700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Hindi nito tiyak na sinasabi kung ano ang nararamdaman niya.",
                  "start_ms": 18000,
                  "end_ms": 21800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Huminto muna si Gibs sa pagtatanong.",
                  "start_ms": 22100,
                  "end_ms": 24380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Bago magpatuloy, ano ang dapat niyang alamin tungkol sa ginhawa at pagpili ni Liza?",
                  "start_ms": 24680,
                  "end_ms": 31360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Huminto at itanong ang gusto ng kausap; huwag hulaan ang dahilan ng katahimikan.",
                  "start_ms": 31660,
                  "end_ms": 36780
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "permission": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/permission.en.4041e78d3059.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "4041e78d30591af91e441c7d740385141af0c3175b0f2e4d5220e799b1bbc2aa",
              "sha256": "32fedbb5914a2be2a68b76f45c264eea18a52a89d7a284bf194771166d44ab3a",
              "duration_seconds": 49.162,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ask permission and offer choices",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Gibs explains: “This is for an authorized household profile and health-service planning.",
                  "start_ms": 2900,
                  "end_ms": 8900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Only relevant information will be used by the authorized health team under local policy.",
                  "start_ms": 9200,
                  "end_ms": 14320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "May we talk?”",
                  "start_ms": 14620,
                  "end_ms": 16060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "He asks about Liza’s preferred language, place and whether she wants a support person present.",
                  "start_ms": 16360,
                  "end_ms": 22400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "“Here in the quieter part, in Filipino, just us for now,” Liza replies.",
                  "start_ms": 22700,
                  "end_ms": 28180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "She may pause, leave a question unanswered for now or choose another time.",
                  "start_ms": 28480,
                  "end_ms": 33360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Gibs does not promise absolute secrecy.",
                  "start_ms": 33660,
                  "end_ms": 36900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "If immediate help is needed, do not delay it to complete a routine interview; follow the local process.",
                  "start_ms": 37200,
                  "end_ms": 44040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The person chooses a comfortable place, language and support person.",
                  "start_ms": 44340,
                  "end_ms": 49100
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/permission.fil.e556f22af84c.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "e556f22af84c1c88af981481b3bcd4b293ea55a8ed57a70c3c81f8e42fa2a40f",
              "sha256": "60dce0934aad4d82fff1d38b0d031fdcd5327c869e668093215401d85b8df266",
              "duration_seconds": 56.033,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Humingi ng pahintulot at mag-alok ng pagpili",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 4080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ipinaliwanag ni Gibs: “Para po ito sa awtorisadong household profile at pagpaplano ng serbisyong pangkalusugan.",
                  "start_ms": 4380,
                  "end_ms": 11860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Kaugnay na impormasyon lamang ang gagamitin ng awtorisadong health team ayon sa lokal na patakaran.",
                  "start_ms": 12160,
                  "end_ms": 17880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Maaari po ba tayong mag-usap?”",
                  "start_ms": 18180,
                  "end_ms": 20180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Tinanong niya ang gustong wika, lugar at kung nais ni Liza ng kasamang susuporta sa kanya.",
                  "start_ms": 20480,
                  "end_ms": 27160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "“Dito po sa mas tahimik na bahagi, sa Filipino, tayo muna,” sagot ni Liza.",
                  "start_ms": 27460,
                  "end_ms": 32460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Maaari siyang magpahinga, hindi muna sumagot o pumili ng ibang oras.",
                  "start_ms": 32760,
                  "end_ms": 38360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Hindi pangako ng ganap na lihim ang paliwanag ni Gibs.",
                  "start_ms": 38660,
                  "end_ms": 42500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Kung kailangan ng agarang tulong, huwag itong ipagpaliban para makumpleto ang karaniwang interview; sundin ang lokal na proseso.",
                  "start_ms": 42800,
                  "end_ms": 50280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang kausap ang pumipili ng komportableng lugar, wika at kasama.",
                  "start_ms": 50580,
                  "end_ms": 55980
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "practice": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/practice.en.b6bcb21378c3.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "b6bcb21378c3ef7d8beb263a37529e181de08a4c527afd6c1359fbaf4b297210",
              "sha256": "153eccfd8a39675dc8c475bf7895aed3b22837791db378cd76afb9196779231c",
              "duration_seconds": 47.229,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Try it, then repeat",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Use the fictional role cards: Gibs, Liza and observer.",
                  "start_ms": 2180,
                  "end_ms": 7980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Rehearse permission, choice of place and language, listening without interruption, and a summary with an accuracy check.",
                  "start_ms": 8280,
                  "end_ms": 16720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Liza chooses whether she wants a support person.",
                  "start_ms": 17020,
                  "end_ms": 19940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "The observer records the exact helpful phrase and any rushed step.",
                  "start_ms": 20240,
                  "end_ms": 25080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Repeat that part before rotating roles.",
                  "start_ms": 25380,
                  "end_ms": 27980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Everyone practices as the BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 28280,
                  "end_ms": 31160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Alone, say both roles aloud and check the listening aid.",
                  "start_ms": 31460,
                  "end_ms": 35220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "At the next authorized visit, rehearse the same opening.",
                  "start_ms": 35520,
                  "end_ms": 39320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Do not upload a resident’s private account.",
                  "start_ms": 39620,
                  "end_ms": 42860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Repeat the step needing work; peer feedback is practice.",
                  "start_ms": 43160,
                  "end_ms": 47160
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/practice.fil.a42caab66ef8.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "a42caab66ef8227b2df736db57564850a2ae5124b75f767e4445eae376fa14c6",
              "sha256": "5455dffc6f9c0ea21c3b51cc85ebbd5291f586eba64fabedf481597fe08743c3",
              "duration_seconds": 52.637,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Subukan, saka ulitin",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Gamitin ang kathang-isip na role cards: Gibs, Liza at tagamasid.",
                  "start_ms": 2820,
                  "end_ms": 8260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Magsanay ng pahintulot, pagpili ng lugar at wika, pakikinig nang hindi sumasabat, at buod na may pagtiyak.",
                  "start_ms": 8560,
                  "end_ms": 16920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Si Liza ang pipili kung may kasamang susuporta.",
                  "start_ms": 17220,
                  "end_ms": 20380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Itala ng tagamasid ang eksaktong linyang nakatulong at ang hakbang na minadali.",
                  "start_ms": 20680,
                  "end_ms": 25960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Ulitin ang bahaging iyon bago magpalit ng papel.",
                  "start_ms": 26260,
                  "end_ms": 29420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Lahat ay susubok bilang BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 29720,
                  "end_ms": 33160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Kung mag-isa, sabihin nang malakas ang dalawang papel at itsek ang listening aid.",
                  "start_ms": 33460,
                  "end_ms": 38660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Sa susunod na awtorisadong pagbisita, sanayin ang parehong pambungad.",
                  "start_ms": 38960,
                  "end_ms": 43640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Huwag mag-upload ng pribadong kuwento ng residente.",
                  "start_ms": 43940,
                  "end_ms": 47020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ulitin ang hindi pa malinaw na hakbang; feedback ng kapareha ay pagsasanay.",
                  "start_ms": 47320,
                  "end_ms": 52560
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "profile": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/profile.en.c6066b54b53c.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "c6066b54b53ca7ee402ca763cb4c7cf29ce0db4c4c10cef8c450bdc408563a09",
              "sha256": "523b416e03635575fadba34dff49c40088ce38f988512a53fb35b18d740d49cf",
              "duration_seconds": 46.472,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Summarize and check accuracy",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "“Have I understood correctly: getting there is difficult when nobody can look after your child?”",
                  "start_ms": 2900,
                  "end_ms": 8660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Gibs asks.",
                  "start_ms": 8960,
                  "end_ms": 10560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "“Yes, when my sister is away,” Liza clarifies.",
                  "start_ms": 10860,
                  "end_ms": 14780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Gibs offers a more accurate summary: “When your sister is away, it is difficult to find childcare.",
                  "start_ms": 15080,
                  "end_ms": 21560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Is that right?”",
                  "start_ms": 21860,
                  "end_ms": 23260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Liza confirms it.",
                  "start_ms": 23560,
                  "end_ms": 25160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "This is a fictional accuracy check, not an actual record.",
                  "start_ms": 25460,
                  "end_ms": 29180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "In an authorized profile, collect only relevant information, do not guess missing answers and respect a wish not to answer yet.",
                  "start_ms": 29480,
                  "end_ms": 38120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "No childcare arrangement or appointment has been promised.",
                  "start_ms": 38420,
                  "end_ms": 42460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ask whether the summary is accurate and let the person correct it.",
                  "start_ms": 42760,
                  "end_ms": 46400
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/profile.fil.f4da1956f7e2.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "f4da1956f7e260198f9c3ccf769a3c7d39d23d7be865fc7109478dad1551b0d4",
              "sha256": "e1bfb1fd2db6672daa5c1c66f01c26a4780ebf8544eed29e065b79a6908a3fd5",
              "duration_seconds": 48.509,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ibuod at tiyaking tama",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "“Tama po ba ang pagkaintindi ko: mahirap pumunta kapag walang magbabantay sa anak ninyo?”",
                  "start_ms": 2820,
                  "end_ms": 9020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "tanong ni Gibs.",
                  "start_ms": 9320,
                  "end_ms": 10800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "“Opo, kapag wala ang kapatid ko,” paglilinaw ni Liza.",
                  "start_ms": 11100,
                  "end_ms": 15300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ibinalik ni Gibs ang mas tumpak na buod: “Kapag wala ang kapatid ninyo, mahirap makahanap ng magbabantay.",
                  "start_ms": 15600,
                  "end_ms": 22880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Tama po ba?”",
                  "start_ms": 23180,
                  "end_ms": 24580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Kinumpirma ito ni Liza.",
                  "start_ms": 24880,
                  "end_ms": 26920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Kathang-isip na halimbawa ito ng pagtitiyak, hindi aktuwal na rekord.",
                  "start_ms": 27220,
                  "end_ms": 31540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Sa awtorisadong profile, kunin lamang ang kaugnay na impormasyon, huwag hulaan ang patlang at igalang ang ayaw munang sagutin.",
                  "start_ms": 31840,
                  "end_ms": 40360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Walang ipinangakong childcare o appointment.",
                  "start_ms": 40660,
                  "end_ms": 44220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tanungin kung tama ang buod at hayaan ang kausap na magwasto.",
                  "start_ms": 44520,
                  "end_ms": 48440
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "module": "06-komunikasyon",
        "sections": {
          "check": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/check.en.dcdaa412d29b.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "dcdaa412d29b3eb79cc71ba434fd0c72f581997b4f3e1e7fd39f750f795d4d71",
              "sha256": "6df064c60cb7e3b76421dbbd0b3bd48fe1c9267d38216e5727cf43244886e5f3",
              "duration_seconds": 27.533,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose the next step",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Return to the scene: the neighbor answers for Liza.",
                  "start_ms": 1860,
                  "end_ms": 5620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Gibs holds a closed clipboard.",
                  "start_ms": 5920,
                  "end_ms": 8360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "He has not yet checked where, in which language and with whom Liza feels comfortable talking.",
                  "start_ms": 8660,
                  "end_ms": 14900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Choose the first step and explain your reason before viewing feedback.",
                  "start_ms": 15200,
                  "end_ms": 19880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Then compare your decision with your practice attempt.",
                  "start_ms": 20180,
                  "end_ms": 23340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Give Liza a choice and a voice, then check understanding.",
                  "start_ms": 23640,
                  "end_ms": 27480
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/check.fil.c3b213b32b6f.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "c3b213b32b6fe1f89781617fede646c260f4ad6b95f301516356fa13929ef7f4",
              "sha256": "346aefebef1e3eec9db0bb267d8d17327bf1942bfd492896e36c4f1e0090a89b",
              "duration_seconds": 33.228,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang susunod na hakbang",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Bumalik sa tagpo: ang kapitbahay ang sumasagot para kay Liza.",
                  "start_ms": 2500,
                  "end_ms": 7460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Hawak ni Gibs ang nakasarang clipboard.",
                  "start_ms": 7760,
                  "end_ms": 10480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Hindi pa niya alam kung saan, sa anong wika at kanino kasama komportable si Liza.",
                  "start_ms": 10780,
                  "end_ms": 17460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Piliin ang unang hakbang at ipaliwanag ang dahilan bago tingnan ang feedback.",
                  "start_ms": 17760,
                  "end_ms": 23080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Pagkatapos, ihambing ang pasya sa ginawa mo sa pagsasanay.",
                  "start_ms": 23380,
                  "end_ms": 27900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Bigyan ng pagpili at boses si Liza, saka tiyakin ang pagkaintindi.",
                  "start_ms": 28200,
                  "end_ms": 33160
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "listen": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/listen.en.d6c6e47f2ab2.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "d6c6e47f2ab2faf7c9b3f8ceee1c5a500c4516eed7e9d420078866a1864ddc7e",
              "sha256": "ad6fb29571fd5b498a4654f24bf22c9e75a49103004a2ed775a8a89116b10f8d",
              "duration_seconds": 43.494,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Listen before giving advice",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Gibs sits at Liza’s level and puts his phone away.",
                  "start_ms": 3220,
                  "end_ms": 6700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "“What would you like to tell me about getting to the health center?”",
                  "start_ms": 7000,
                  "end_ms": 10240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "he asks.",
                  "start_ms": 10540,
                  "end_ms": 11780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "He allows time and does not interrupt.",
                  "start_ms": 12080,
                  "end_ms": 15160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Liza says getting there is difficult when nobody can look after her child.",
                  "start_ms": 15460,
                  "end_ms": 19820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "“It sounds difficult to manage caregiving and getting there,” Gibs replies.",
                  "start_ms": 20120,
                  "end_ms": 25840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "He does not call Liza lazy or promise to fix everything.",
                  "start_ms": 26140,
                  "end_ms": 29940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "He uses a calm voice and allows pauses.",
                  "start_ms": 30240,
                  "end_ms": 33280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Do not force eye contact; comfortable listening is not measured by staring.",
                  "start_ms": 33580,
                  "end_ms": 39100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Allow time for the account and acknowledge difficulty without blame.",
                  "start_ms": 39400,
                  "end_ms": 43440
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/listen.fil.6d66945bc07f.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "6d66945bc07f01127fb74a27979b7745ccef3e6e77fc2d2b9d924dbcc76135be",
              "sha256": "7eb9a5a5454ca0c57b3c1fe474fb65a25c637f98bd2b525550299ad757a8ec7e",
              "duration_seconds": 47.935,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Makinig bago magpayo",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Umupo si Gibs nang kapantay ni Liza at itinabi ang telepono.",
                  "start_ms": 2380,
                  "end_ms": 6300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "“Ano po ang gusto ninyong ikuwento tungkol sa pagpunta sa health center?”",
                  "start_ms": 6600,
                  "end_ms": 10760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "tanong niya.",
                  "start_ms": 11060,
                  "end_ms": 12220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Nagbigay siya ng oras at hindi sumabat.",
                  "start_ms": 12520,
                  "end_ms": 15480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Sinabi ni Liza na mahirap pumunta kapag walang magbabantay sa anak.",
                  "start_ms": 15780,
                  "end_ms": 19820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "“Mukhang mahirap pagsabayin ang pag-aalaga at pagpunta roon,” tugon ni Gibs.",
                  "start_ms": 20120,
                  "end_ms": 25760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Hindi niya tinawag na tamad si Liza o nangakong maaayos ang lahat.",
                  "start_ms": 26060,
                  "end_ms": 30660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Gumamit siya ng mahinahong boses at sapat na paghinto.",
                  "start_ms": 30960,
                  "end_ms": 35360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Huwag pilitin ang eye contact; ang komportableng pakikinig ay hindi sinusukat sa pagtitig.",
                  "start_ms": 35660,
                  "end_ms": 42060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Magbigay ng oras sa kuwento at kilalanin ang hirap nang walang paratang.",
                  "start_ms": 42360,
                  "end_ms": 47880
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "liza": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/liza.en.f880278eea9b.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "f880278eea9b8a270f76a30fee49857200c5b29833ba74e61c15049969bc7810",
              "sha256": "07b7963bbb89ba72078653788cb2d90165c03f682fb532425a9cb493b1e8f929",
              "duration_seconds": 34.873,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Why is Liza quiet?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Gibs, a male BHW, visits Liza, 29, for a household profile.",
                  "start_ms": 2660,
                  "end_ms": 9220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "A neighbor sits beside Liza and answers for her.",
                  "start_ms": 9520,
                  "end_ms": 13720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Liza gives short replies and looks toward the door.",
                  "start_ms": 14020,
                  "end_ms": 17500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "These cues do not tell Gibs for certain how she feels.",
                  "start_ms": 17800,
                  "end_ms": 21840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "He pauses the questions.",
                  "start_ms": 22140,
                  "end_ms": 24220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Before continuing, what should he check about Liza’s comfort and choices?",
                  "start_ms": 24520,
                  "end_ms": 29280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pause and ask what the person prefers; do not guess the reason for silence.",
                  "start_ms": 29580,
                  "end_ms": 34820
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/liza.fil.947df9854c6d.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "947df9854c6def3fd636436b493c24d001f8fc2b88abc1989bdd1637d1007c46",
              "sha256": "5062e66e7d4b44cee172dc7f1f741716802f014c53d0a0228da465c99ec4328e",
              "duration_seconds": 36.833,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Bakit tahimik si Liza?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Si Gibs, isang lalaking BHW, ay bumisita kay Liza, 29 anyos, para sa household profile.",
                  "start_ms": 2220,
                  "end_ms": 10060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Katabi ni Liza ang kapitbahay na sumasagot para sa kanya.",
                  "start_ms": 10360,
                  "end_ms": 13720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Maikli ang sagot ni Liza at tumitingin siya sa pinto.",
                  "start_ms": 14020,
                  "end_ms": 17700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Hindi nito tiyak na sinasabi kung ano ang nararamdaman niya.",
                  "start_ms": 18000,
                  "end_ms": 21800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Huminto muna si Gibs sa pagtatanong.",
                  "start_ms": 22100,
                  "end_ms": 24380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Bago magpatuloy, ano ang dapat niyang alamin tungkol sa ginhawa at pagpili ni Liza?",
                  "start_ms": 24680,
                  "end_ms": 31360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Huminto at itanong ang gusto ng kausap; huwag hulaan ang dahilan ng katahimikan.",
                  "start_ms": 31660,
                  "end_ms": 36780
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "permission": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/permission.en.4041e78d3059.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "4041e78d30591af91e441c7d740385141af0c3175b0f2e4d5220e799b1bbc2aa",
              "sha256": "32fedbb5914a2be2a68b76f45c264eea18a52a89d7a284bf194771166d44ab3a",
              "duration_seconds": 49.162,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ask permission and offer choices",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Gibs explains: “This is for an authorized household profile and health-service planning.",
                  "start_ms": 2900,
                  "end_ms": 8900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Only relevant information will be used by the authorized health team under local policy.",
                  "start_ms": 9200,
                  "end_ms": 14320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "May we talk?”",
                  "start_ms": 14620,
                  "end_ms": 16060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "He asks about Liza’s preferred language, place and whether she wants a support person present.",
                  "start_ms": 16360,
                  "end_ms": 22400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "“Here in the quieter part, in Filipino, just us for now,” Liza replies.",
                  "start_ms": 22700,
                  "end_ms": 28180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "She may pause, leave a question unanswered for now or choose another time.",
                  "start_ms": 28480,
                  "end_ms": 33360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Gibs does not promise absolute secrecy.",
                  "start_ms": 33660,
                  "end_ms": 36900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "If immediate help is needed, do not delay it to complete a routine interview; follow the local process.",
                  "start_ms": 37200,
                  "end_ms": 44040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The person chooses a comfortable place, language and support person.",
                  "start_ms": 44340,
                  "end_ms": 49100
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/permission.fil.e556f22af84c.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "e556f22af84c1c88af981481b3bcd4b293ea55a8ed57a70c3c81f8e42fa2a40f",
              "sha256": "60dce0934aad4d82fff1d38b0d031fdcd5327c869e668093215401d85b8df266",
              "duration_seconds": 56.033,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Humingi ng pahintulot at mag-alok ng pagpili",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 4080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ipinaliwanag ni Gibs: “Para po ito sa awtorisadong household profile at pagpaplano ng serbisyong pangkalusugan.",
                  "start_ms": 4380,
                  "end_ms": 11860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Kaugnay na impormasyon lamang ang gagamitin ng awtorisadong health team ayon sa lokal na patakaran.",
                  "start_ms": 12160,
                  "end_ms": 17880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Maaari po ba tayong mag-usap?”",
                  "start_ms": 18180,
                  "end_ms": 20180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Tinanong niya ang gustong wika, lugar at kung nais ni Liza ng kasamang susuporta sa kanya.",
                  "start_ms": 20480,
                  "end_ms": 27160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "“Dito po sa mas tahimik na bahagi, sa Filipino, tayo muna,” sagot ni Liza.",
                  "start_ms": 27460,
                  "end_ms": 32460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Maaari siyang magpahinga, hindi muna sumagot o pumili ng ibang oras.",
                  "start_ms": 32760,
                  "end_ms": 38360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Hindi pangako ng ganap na lihim ang paliwanag ni Gibs.",
                  "start_ms": 38660,
                  "end_ms": 42500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Kung kailangan ng agarang tulong, huwag itong ipagpaliban para makumpleto ang karaniwang interview; sundin ang lokal na proseso.",
                  "start_ms": 42800,
                  "end_ms": 50280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang kausap ang pumipili ng komportableng lugar, wika at kasama.",
                  "start_ms": 50580,
                  "end_ms": 55980
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "practice": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/practice.en.12b535e84c65.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "12b535e84c65c2cbc3ddb4dfa73d14f1f590a9bc3287e59699a4a1b4a4cc5496",
              "sha256": "6901b00a0e3e63817e098a22b8e5d97ca5bc7fe0056d29e830531b6e0669640e",
              "duration_seconds": 48.797,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Try it, then repeat",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Use the fictional role cards: Gibs, Liza and observer.",
                  "start_ms": 2420,
                  "end_ms": 7460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Rehearse permission, choice of place and language, listening without interruption, and a summary with an accuracy check.",
                  "start_ms": 7760,
                  "end_ms": 17160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Liza chooses whether she wants a support person.",
                  "start_ms": 17460,
                  "end_ms": 20660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "The observer records the exact helpful phrase and any rushed step.",
                  "start_ms": 20960,
                  "end_ms": 26200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Repeat that part before rotating roles.",
                  "start_ms": 26500,
                  "end_ms": 29540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Everyone practices as the BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 29840,
                  "end_ms": 32640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Alone, say both roles aloud and check the listening aid.",
                  "start_ms": 32940,
                  "end_ms": 36940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "At the next authorized visit, rehearse the same opening.",
                  "start_ms": 37240,
                  "end_ms": 41000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Do not upload a resident’s private account.",
                  "start_ms": 41300,
                  "end_ms": 44660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Repeat the step needing work; peer feedback is practice.",
                  "start_ms": 44960,
                  "end_ms": 48720
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/practice.fil.a42caab66ef8.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "a42caab66ef8227b2df736db57564850a2ae5124b75f767e4445eae376fa14c6",
              "sha256": "5455dffc6f9c0ea21c3b51cc85ebbd5291f586eba64fabedf481597fe08743c3",
              "duration_seconds": 52.637,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Subukan, saka ulitin",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Gamitin ang kathang-isip na role cards: Gibs, Liza at tagamasid.",
                  "start_ms": 2820,
                  "end_ms": 8260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Magsanay ng pahintulot, pagpili ng lugar at wika, pakikinig nang hindi sumasabat, at buod na may pagtiyak.",
                  "start_ms": 8560,
                  "end_ms": 16920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Si Liza ang pipili kung may kasamang susuporta.",
                  "start_ms": 17220,
                  "end_ms": 20380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Itala ng tagamasid ang eksaktong linyang nakatulong at ang hakbang na minadali.",
                  "start_ms": 20680,
                  "end_ms": 25960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Ulitin ang bahaging iyon bago magpalit ng papel.",
                  "start_ms": 26260,
                  "end_ms": 29420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Lahat ay susubok bilang BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 29720,
                  "end_ms": 33160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Kung mag-isa, sabihin nang malakas ang dalawang papel at itsek ang listening aid.",
                  "start_ms": 33460,
                  "end_ms": 38660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Sa susunod na awtorisadong pagbisita, sanayin ang parehong pambungad.",
                  "start_ms": 38960,
                  "end_ms": 43640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Huwag mag-upload ng pribadong kuwento ng residente.",
                  "start_ms": 43940,
                  "end_ms": 47020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ulitin ang hindi pa malinaw na hakbang; feedback ng kapareha ay pagsasanay.",
                  "start_ms": 47320,
                  "end_ms": 52560
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "profile": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/profile.en.4fa60ff0f040.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "4fa60ff0f040bff559d28c774570dde26bcd5f4ef5cd7d867b780e6b7154178d",
              "sha256": "e45a11235ba24d664a4944e133956d9efee37f243ae09a04dbcec2c5154a6589",
              "duration_seconds": 49.972,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Summarize and check accuracy",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "“Have I understood correctly: getting there is difficult when nobody can look after your child?”",
                  "start_ms": 2900,
                  "end_ms": 9180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Gibs asks.",
                  "start_ms": 9480,
                  "end_ms": 11000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "“Yes, when my sister is away,” Liza clarifies.",
                  "start_ms": 11300,
                  "end_ms": 15460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Gibs offers a more accurate summary: “When your sister is away, it is difficult to find childcare.",
                  "start_ms": 15760,
                  "end_ms": 22520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Is that right?”",
                  "start_ms": 22820,
                  "end_ms": 24140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Liza confirms it.",
                  "start_ms": 24440,
                  "end_ms": 26400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "This is a fictional accuracy check, not an actual record.",
                  "start_ms": 26700,
                  "end_ms": 30980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "In an authorized profile, collect only relevant information, do not guess missing answers and respect a wish not to answer yet.",
                  "start_ms": 31280,
                  "end_ms": 41000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "No childcare arrangement or appointment has been promised.",
                  "start_ms": 41300,
                  "end_ms": 45500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ask whether the summary is accurate and let the person correct it.",
                  "start_ms": 45800,
                  "end_ms": 49920
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-listen/profile.fil.4ea13b5f19d0.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "4ea13b5f19d0b05282f420e6467142e777be6c9ff9398729a1d7900d6f0417f2",
              "sha256": "c6eea6b674c3b580fe319ae71509fa18dc318485cba896e69bf480cf8c532037",
              "duration_seconds": 50.233,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ibuod at tiyaking tama",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "“Tama po ba ang pagkaintindi ko: mahirap pumunta kapag walang magbabantay sa anak ninyo?”",
                  "start_ms": 2660,
                  "end_ms": 9100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "tanong ni Gibs.",
                  "start_ms": 9400,
                  "end_ms": 11000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "“Opo, kapag wala ang kapatid ko,” paglilinaw ni Liza.",
                  "start_ms": 11300,
                  "end_ms": 15740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ibinalik ni Gibs ang mas tumpak na buod: “Kapag wala ang kapatid ninyo, mahirap makahanap ng magbabantay.",
                  "start_ms": 16040,
                  "end_ms": 24280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Tama po ba?”",
                  "start_ms": 24580,
                  "end_ms": 25780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Kinumpirma ito ni Liza.",
                  "start_ms": 26080,
                  "end_ms": 28040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Kathang-isip na halimbawa ito ng pagtitiyak, hindi aktuwal na rekord.",
                  "start_ms": 28340,
                  "end_ms": 32900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Sa awtorisadong profile, kunin lamang ang kaugnay na impormasyon, huwag hulaan ang patlang at igalang ang ayaw munang sagutin.",
                  "start_ms": 33200,
                  "end_ms": 41920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Walang ipinangakong childcare o appointment.",
                  "start_ms": 42220,
                  "end_ms": 45540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tanungin kung tama ang buod at hayaan ang kausap na magwasto.",
                  "start_ms": 45840,
                  "end_ms": 50160
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "communication-clarify": [
      {
        "module": "06-komunikasyon",
        "sections": {
          "barriers": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-clarify/barriers.en.485918ef4bd5.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "485918ef4bd53afd43dd302462ac653f51bf70c2c6f2ff92ec25ed60a27df297",
              "sha256": "138bc79d22219fc6ea12f31911452438312809a280a23493d68f27a88a301e6f",
              "duration_seconds": 41.012,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "What was unheard in Rosario’s story",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "In the Rosario case studied in Module 7, poverty, service gaps and misinformation affect the family together.",
                  "start_ms": 3540,
                  "end_ms": 13180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "“Why didn’t you follow instructions?”",
                  "start_ms": 13480,
                  "end_ms": 16280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "is not enough.",
                  "start_ms": 16580,
                  "end_ms": 18180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "“What were you told, and what prevented you from getting help?”",
                  "start_ms": 18480,
                  "end_ms": 22800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "is more useful.",
                  "start_ms": 23100,
                  "end_ms": 24740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Communication brings barriers into view and clarifies them.",
                  "start_ms": 25040,
                  "end_ms": 30080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "The next module examines which partners can address them.",
                  "start_ms": 30380,
                  "end_ms": 34540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A barrier to services is important information, not a reason to judge a family.",
                  "start_ms": 34840,
                  "end_ms": 40960
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-clarify/barriers.fil.40a688e56fc6.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "40a688e56fc670def86c279d368a9c08798ec431f7151f3ebb64b2408bb9f384",
              "sha256": "a88ab90163d508ec69d1ad94f40bcb5a27165bc808a43690f4c31cd7e32d1a7a",
              "duration_seconds": 44.826,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang hindi narinig sa kuwento ni Rosario",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Sa kasong Rosario na pag-aaralan sa Modyul 7, sabay-sabay ang kahirapan, kakulangan sa serbisyo at maling impormasyong natanggap ng pamilya.",
                  "start_ms": 3700,
                  "end_ms": 14220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Hindi sapat ang tanong na “Bakit hindi kayo sumunod?”",
                  "start_ms": 14520,
                  "end_ms": 18600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Mas makabuluhan ang “Ano ang sinabi sa inyo, at ano ang pumigil sa pagkuha ng tulong?”",
                  "start_ms": 18900,
                  "end_ms": 25820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Sa komunikasyon, ang gawain ay ilabas at linawin ang hadlang.",
                  "start_ms": 26120,
                  "end_ms": 31480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Sa susunod na modyul, susuriin kung sino-sinong kasosyo ang makakatugon dito.",
                  "start_ms": 31780,
                  "end_ms": 37900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang hadlang sa serbisyo ay mahalagang impormasyon, hindi dahilan para husgahan ang pamilya.",
                  "start_ms": 38200,
                  "end_ms": 44760
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "check": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-clarify/check.en.d9b7b1ad1149.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "d9b7b1ad114977bcf5436c2cfeaad85ec42dee43184b49be59a5fbdcec5b6175",
              "sha256": "cb1aaa1d88eb0b3986d0fc9823fbd1f04eec507ed17c875d94b17ba7595fd855",
              "duration_seconds": 16.927,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose the next step",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose an answer and explain why before viewing the feedback.",
                  "start_ms": 2100,
                  "end_ms": 6940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Then compare it with your own practice attempt.",
                  "start_ms": 7240,
                  "end_ms": 10720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A clear question elicits information rather than the answer we expect.",
                  "start_ms": 11020,
                  "end_ms": 16860
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-clarify/check.fil.58fde8ae9c90.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "58fde8ae9c902e48aadc341cd2f027eb3116598d78f8cc9ec9b742d0dd923aab",
              "sha256": "41ab14aa55dc122efa8e837f9cbea14a243f65ee411e1bb353b26a581c591bee",
              "duration_seconds": 20.297,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang susunod na hakbang",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang sagot at ipaliwanag kung bakit bago tingnan ang feedback.",
                  "start_ms": 3220,
                  "end_ms": 8380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Pagkatapos, ihambing sa sarili mong ginawa sa pagsasanay.",
                  "start_ms": 8680,
                  "end_ms": 13480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang malinaw na tanong ay naglalabas ng impormasyon, hindi ng sagot na gusto nating marinig.",
                  "start_ms": 13780,
                  "end_ms": 20220
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "open-question": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-clarify/open-question.en.ea0d56053ceb.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "ea0d56053ceb4227823b5615c832a958042b7ae315d7ac9147588038400c84d7",
              "sha256": "534972015f841184d7e5011f454e395458fdbadb2f6cdc9aaf0a56ca4b2bee24",
              "duration_seconds": 48.823,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Open first, then clarify",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Liza, 29, missed a health-center visit because of childcare barriers.",
                  "start_ms": 3300,
                  "end_ms": 9300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "BHW Mila is finding out what happened.",
                  "start_ms": 9600,
                  "end_ms": 13120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "“Why don’t you follow instructions?”",
                  "start_ms": 13420,
                  "end_ms": 16220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "sounds like an accusation.",
                  "start_ms": 16520,
                  "end_ms": 19040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "“What makes it hard to attend?”",
                  "start_ms": 19340,
                  "end_ms": 21940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "invites an explanation.",
                  "start_ms": 22240,
                  "end_ms": 24440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Follow an open question with focused clarification: “When was your last visit?”",
                  "start_ms": 24740,
                  "end_ms": 30740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Yes-or-no questions are useful when confirming one detail.",
                  "start_ms": 31040,
                  "end_ms": 35280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Avoid asking three questions at once or putting the answer into the person’s mouth.",
                  "start_ms": 35580,
                  "end_ms": 41940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Use open questions for the story and focused questions to clarify information.",
                  "start_ms": 42240,
                  "end_ms": 48760
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-clarify/open-question.fil.1485d13e367e.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "1485d13e367e4afbe46fae5eca4c45923661d237d48b77245e7ec3c761db2b38",
              "sha256": "b698df8ad5d8d38143018271458149ac9133a9bd9d64ea9c3f5c2bf328837390",
              "duration_seconds": 55.719,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Bukas muna, saka linawin",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Si Liza, 29, ay hindi nakapunta sa health center dahil may hadlang sa pag-aalaga ng anak.",
                  "start_ms": 3780,
                  "end_ms": 11980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Inaalam ni BHW Mila kung ano ang nangyari.",
                  "start_ms": 12280,
                  "end_ms": 16000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "“Bakit hindi ka sumusunod?”",
                  "start_ms": 16300,
                  "end_ms": 18660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "ay paratang na tanong.",
                  "start_ms": 18960,
                  "end_ms": 21400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Mas makakatulong ang “Ano ang nagpapahirap sa pagpunta mo?”",
                  "start_ms": 21700,
                  "end_ms": 26500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Pagkatapos ng bukas na tanong, gumamit ng tiyak na paglilinaw: “Kailan ka huling nakapunta?”",
                  "start_ms": 26800,
                  "end_ms": 33560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Hindi masama ang tanong na oo o hindi kung isang detalye ang kailangang kumpirmahin.",
                  "start_ms": 33860,
                  "end_ms": 40500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Iwasan ang tatlong tanong na magkakasabay at ang sagot na isinusubo na sa kausap.",
                  "start_ms": 40800,
                  "end_ms": 48240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Bukas na tanong para sa kuwento; tiyak na tanong para sa paglilinaw ng impormasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 48540,
                  "end_ms": 55660
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "practice": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-clarify/practice.en.79c5e81faec8.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "79c5e81faec82b905e0c2de40abf469fe3794936f94b653fd7f5d6ec2555a984",
              "sha256": "cdd8b02831b3703c2b2550140f8110810437ac48b15d414f8ae2bd731550b538",
              "duration_seconds": 36.493,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Try it, then repeat",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Replace “Why don’t you follow instructions?”",
                  "start_ms": 2860,
                  "end_ms": 6500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "with an open question.",
                  "start_ms": 6800,
                  "end_ms": 9040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Your partner replies, “I have nobody with me.”",
                  "start_ms": 9340,
                  "end_ms": 12980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Clarify whether this means a travel companion or someone to watch the children, then check your summary.",
                  "start_ms": 13280,
                  "end_ms": 20440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Alone, write and read the three lines aloud.",
                  "start_ms": 20740,
                  "end_ms": 24740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "At the next visit, clarify one ambiguous answer before recording it.",
                  "start_ms": 25040,
                  "end_ms": 30840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A clear question elicits information rather than the answer we expect.",
                  "start_ms": 31140,
                  "end_ms": 36420
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-clarify/practice.fil.b1e4b5dc8e84.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "b1e4b5dc8e8448bade5131e5cd4e6ba80bc5d3c62480e28d6b72da9756688bbc",
              "sha256": "436bda070e7c7544f949bbc7f8c79e2d9108a057f526ff0d278d91c982c5f49f",
              "duration_seconds": 39.915,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Subukan, saka ulitin",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Palitan ang “Bakit hindi ka sumusunod?”",
                  "start_ms": 2940,
                  "end_ms": 6580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "ng isang bukas na tanong.",
                  "start_ms": 6880,
                  "end_ms": 9000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ang kapareha ay sasagot: “Wala akong kasama.”",
                  "start_ms": 9300,
                  "end_ms": 13420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Linawin kung kasama sa biyahe o magbabantay sa anak ang ibig sabihin, saka ipasuri ang iyong buod.",
                  "start_ms": 13720,
                  "end_ms": 21680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Kung mag-isa, isulat ang tatlong linya at basahin nang malakas.",
                  "start_ms": 21980,
                  "end_ms": 27020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Sa susunod na pagbisita, maglinaw ng isang malabong sagot bago magtala.",
                  "start_ms": 27320,
                  "end_ms": 33400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang malinaw na tanong ay naglalabas ng impormasyon, hindi ng sagot na gusto nating marinig.",
                  "start_ms": 33700,
                  "end_ms": 39860
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "module": "06-komunikasyon",
        "sections": {
          "barriers": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-clarify/barriers.en.485918ef4bd5.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "485918ef4bd53afd43dd302462ac653f51bf70c2c6f2ff92ec25ed60a27df297",
              "sha256": "138bc79d22219fc6ea12f31911452438312809a280a23493d68f27a88a301e6f",
              "duration_seconds": 41.012,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "What was unheard in Rosario’s story",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "In the Rosario case studied in Module 7, poverty, service gaps and misinformation affect the family together.",
                  "start_ms": 3540,
                  "end_ms": 13180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "“Why didn’t you follow instructions?”",
                  "start_ms": 13480,
                  "end_ms": 16280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "is not enough.",
                  "start_ms": 16580,
                  "end_ms": 18180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "“What were you told, and what prevented you from getting help?”",
                  "start_ms": 18480,
                  "end_ms": 22800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "is more useful.",
                  "start_ms": 23100,
                  "end_ms": 24740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Communication brings barriers into view and clarifies them.",
                  "start_ms": 25040,
                  "end_ms": 30080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "The next module examines which partners can address them.",
                  "start_ms": 30380,
                  "end_ms": 34540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A barrier to services is important information, not a reason to judge a family.",
                  "start_ms": 34840,
                  "end_ms": 40960
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-clarify/barriers.fil.40a688e56fc6.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "40a688e56fc670def86c279d368a9c08798ec431f7151f3ebb64b2408bb9f384",
              "sha256": "a88ab90163d508ec69d1ad94f40bcb5a27165bc808a43690f4c31cd7e32d1a7a",
              "duration_seconds": 44.826,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang hindi narinig sa kuwento ni Rosario",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Sa kasong Rosario na pag-aaralan sa Modyul 7, sabay-sabay ang kahirapan, kakulangan sa serbisyo at maling impormasyong natanggap ng pamilya.",
                  "start_ms": 3700,
                  "end_ms": 14220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Hindi sapat ang tanong na “Bakit hindi kayo sumunod?”",
                  "start_ms": 14520,
                  "end_ms": 18600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Mas makabuluhan ang “Ano ang sinabi sa inyo, at ano ang pumigil sa pagkuha ng tulong?”",
                  "start_ms": 18900,
                  "end_ms": 25820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Sa komunikasyon, ang gawain ay ilabas at linawin ang hadlang.",
                  "start_ms": 26120,
                  "end_ms": 31480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Sa susunod na modyul, susuriin kung sino-sinong kasosyo ang makakatugon dito.",
                  "start_ms": 31780,
                  "end_ms": 37900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang hadlang sa serbisyo ay mahalagang impormasyon, hindi dahilan para husgahan ang pamilya.",
                  "start_ms": 38200,
                  "end_ms": 44760
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "check": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-clarify/check.en.d9b7b1ad1149.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "d9b7b1ad114977bcf5436c2cfeaad85ec42dee43184b49be59a5fbdcec5b6175",
              "sha256": "cb1aaa1d88eb0b3986d0fc9823fbd1f04eec507ed17c875d94b17ba7595fd855",
              "duration_seconds": 16.927,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose the next step",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose an answer and explain why before viewing the feedback.",
                  "start_ms": 2100,
                  "end_ms": 6940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Then compare it with your own practice attempt.",
                  "start_ms": 7240,
