                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Try it, then repeat",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Replace “The family is difficult” with three sentences: Liza’s concern; confirmed and unconfirmed details; help requested from the midwife.",
                  "start_ms": 2820,
                  "end_ms": 14820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Add the authorized channel and how receipt will be confirmed.",
                  "start_ms": 15120,
                  "end_ms": 19960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ask a partner whether the next step is clear.",
                  "start_ms": 20260,
                  "end_ms": 23300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Alone, check the four elements.",
                  "start_ms": 23600,
                  "end_ms": 26680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "In the next handoff, confirm the recipient and follow-up owner.",
                  "start_ms": 26980,
                  "end_ms": 32020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A handoff gives the right person enough to act while protecting private details.",
                  "start_ms": 32320,
                  "end_ms": 38160
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/practice.fil.1100cbc1f0e8.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "1100cbc1f0e8c9fc135f92d6dbce026bcbbed2589a3b0e4b43efc8fa6c2e5dd1",
              "sha256": "f5b94b1d5de59336dbea973535c3e527987ff3c710248f36b09d528914091a3a",
              "duration_seconds": 45.427,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Subukan, saka ulitin",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Palitan ang “Mahirap kausap ang pamilya” ng tatlong pangungusap: concern ni Liza; natiyak at hindi pa tiyak; tulong na hinihingi sa midwife.",
                  "start_ms": 3420,
                  "end_ms": 15740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Idagdag ang awtorisadong channel at paano kukumpirmahin ang pagtanggap.",
                  "start_ms": 16040,
                  "end_ms": 21760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ipabasa sa kapareha: alam ba niya ang susunod na hakbang?",
                  "start_ms": 22060,
                  "end_ms": 27020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Kung mag-isa, suriin gamit ang apat na bahagi.",
                  "start_ms": 27320,
                  "end_ms": 31560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Sa susunod na ulat, kumpirmahin ang tumanggap at may-ari ng follow-up.",
                  "start_ms": 31860,
                  "end_ms": 37780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang ulat ay sapat para makakilos ang tamang tao, habang protektado ang pribadong detalye.",
                  "start_ms": 38080,
                  "end_ms": 45360
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "module": "06-komunikasyon",
        "sections": {
          "audience": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/audience.en.3834ec14d40b.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "3834ec14d40ba969ff7397e80fad6d9a126b4b15972f78553d6d5a708839c9d7",
              "sha256": "63317d31ba187fdeb7b1d06e4358036b20f3218c186dc72e6420b6e99e59b249",
              "duration_seconds": 83.278,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The right recipient and enough detail",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Before sending, verify who is authorized to receive an individual report and what they need for their role.",
                  "start_ms": 3220,
                  "end_ms": 10260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "In this example, the midwife is the designated recipient.",
                  "start_ms": 10560,
                  "end_ms": 15040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Every meeting participant is not automatically authorized to receive a private case.",
                  "start_ms": 15340,
                  "end_ms": 20740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Gibs asks: “Are you the authorized recipient for this report?",
                  "start_ms": 21040,
                  "end_ms": 25320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Which approved method should we use?”",
                  "start_ms": 25620,
                  "end_ms": 28140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Verify the actual recipient; do not rely only on an account name.",
                  "start_ms": 28440,
                  "end_ms": 33800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Follow the verified local procedure for a spoken, paper or electronic handoff.",
                  "start_ms": 34100,
                  "end_ms": 39700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "A personal phone is not automatically approved.",
                  "start_ms": 40000,
                  "end_ms": 43320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Keep names and personal forms out of public group chats.",
                  "start_ms": 43620,
                  "end_ms": 47660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "Explain the purpose, recipient and next step to Liza in plain language under local policy.",
                  "start_ms": 47960,
                  "end_ms": 54000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 10,
                  "text": "Give the midwife only relevant details.",
                  "start_ms": 54300,
                  "end_ms": 57540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 11,
                  "text": "At a meeting, use sufficient aggregated information that cannot identify a household.",
                  "start_ms": 57840,
                  "end_ms": 63920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 12,
                  "text": "Do not promise absolute secrecy in every situation.",
                  "start_ms": 64220,
                  "end_ms": 68620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 13,
                  "text": "If urgent assistance is needed, do not delay help to finish a routine report; follow the verified local process.",
                  "start_ms": 68920,
                  "end_ms": 77000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Verify the authorized recipient and locally approved method; share only what is needed.",
                  "start_ms": 77300,
                  "end_ms": 83220
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/audience.fil.11b0fa4f1192.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "11b0fa4f11927ea7c512d4f32759483b2a320d428199b827dbf616b5699d12f9",
              "sha256": "034bd35168dc104517f20b7af1dd97eb250d327352a43b21a37c5ed700b4a2e6",
              "duration_seconds": 93.048,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tamang tatanggap, sapat na detalye",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Bago magpadala, tiyakin kung sino ang awtorisadong tumanggap ng indibidwal na ulat at ano ang kailangan niya para sa kanyang tungkulin.",
                  "start_ms": 3540,
                  "end_ms": 12260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sa halimbawa, ang midwife ang itinalagang tatanggap.",
                  "start_ms": 12560,
                  "end_ms": 16160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Hindi nangangahulugang maaaring tumanggap ng pribadong kaso ang bawat kasama sa pulong.",
                  "start_ms": 16460,
                  "end_ms": 22060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Sinabi ni Gibs: “Kayo po ba ang awtorisadong tatanggap nito?",
                  "start_ms": 22360,
                  "end_ms": 26640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Aling aprubadong paraan ang gagamitin natin?”",
                  "start_ms": 26940,
                  "end_ms": 30020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Tiyakin ang aktuwal na tatanggap; huwag umasa sa pangalan lang sa isang account.",
                  "start_ms": 30320,
                  "end_ms": 35400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Sundin ang natiyak na lokal na paraan para sa pasalita, papel o elektronikong ulat.",
                  "start_ms": 35700,
                  "end_ms": 41940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Hindi awtomatikong aprubado ang personal na telepono.",
                  "start_ms": 42240,
                  "end_ms": 46160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Huwag ilagay ang pangalan o personal na form sa pampublikong group chat.",
                  "start_ms": 46460,
                  "end_ms": 51540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "Kay Liza, ipaliwanag sa payak na wika ang layunin, tatanggap at susunod na hakbang ayon sa lokal na patakaran.",
                  "start_ms": 51840,
                  "end_ms": 60520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 10,
                  "text": "Sa midwife, ibigay lamang ang kaugnay na detalye.",
                  "start_ms": 60820,
                  "end_ms": 64620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 11,
                  "text": "Sa pulong, gumamit ng sapat na pinagsama-samang impormasyon na hindi makakakilala sa isang pamilya.",
                  "start_ms": 64920,
                  "end_ms": 72800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 12,
                  "text": "Walang pangakong lubos na lihim sa lahat ng pagkakataon.",
                  "start_ms": 73100,
                  "end_ms": 76820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 13,
                  "text": "Kung may agarang pangangailangan, huwag ipagpaliban ang tulong para tapusin ang karaniwang ulat; sundin ang natiyak na lokal na proseso.",
                  "start_ms": 77120,
                  "end_ms": 85760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tiyakin ang awtorisadong tatanggap at lokal na aprubadong paraan; ibahagi lamang ang kailangan.",
                  "start_ms": 86060,
                  "end_ms": 92980
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "check": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/check.en.3eaa90eeebbe.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "3eaa90eeebbe4838d955e9483542f4a560ae691b8a7770e265d217e1a47ef020",
              "sha256": "a543aec4db0cf595946115a25eb88b989bd0291191c5e36c9a91418bc36bfdc4",
              "duration_seconds": 41.953,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "What is enough for the meeting?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The chair of a barangay planning meeting asks about missed visits.",
                  "start_ms": 2180,
                  "end_ms": 6980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Gibs has a private record from the fictional exercise, but not everyone present is authorized to receive individual cases.",
                  "start_ms": 7280,
                  "end_ms": 14800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "A schedule change has not been approved.",
                  "start_ms": 15100,
                  "end_ms": 17900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Look at the situation before choosing.",
                  "start_ms": 18200,
                  "end_ms": 20600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "What relevant information does the group need for planning?",
                  "start_ms": 20900,
                  "end_ms": 24300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Choose an answer and explain why.",
                  "start_ms": 24600,
                  "end_ms": 27400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "After selecting, read all three rationales and the ending, then compare them with your own report and confirmation.",
                  "start_ms": 27700,
                  "end_ms": 35460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Share what the right recipient needs; verify receipt and follow up on the agreement.",
                  "start_ms": 35760,
                  "end_ms": 41880
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/check.fil.f461a939520c.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "f461a939520ced75d2825a2c1025e4bf1472aca04818126aca51bf1e26103ec7",
              "sha256": "a3d04790c96cac7e819a580cb637a5338ed7fcac8023113943f9e9d7a118e56f",
              "duration_seconds": 50.181,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ano ang sapat para sa pulong?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Nagtanong ang chair ng barangay planning meeting tungkol sa mga hindi natuloy na pagpunta.",
                  "start_ms": 2620,
                  "end_ms": 7820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "May pribadong tala si Gibs mula sa kathang-isip na pagsasanay, ngunit hindi lahat ng nasa pulong ay awtorisadong tumanggap ng indibidwal na kaso.",
                  "start_ms": 8120,
                  "end_ms": 17960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Hindi pa aprubado ang pagbabago sa iskedyul.",
                  "start_ms": 18260,
                  "end_ms": 21260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Tingnan ang larawan ng sitwasyon bago pumili.",
                  "start_ms": 21560,
                  "end_ms": 24520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Ano ang kaugnay na impormasyong kailangan ng grupo para magplano?",
                  "start_ms": 24820,
                  "end_ms": 28900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Piliin ang sagot at ipaliwanag kung bakit.",
                  "start_ms": 29200,
                  "end_ms": 32720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Pagkatapos pumili, basahin ang paliwanag sa lahat ng pagpipilian at ang wakas; ihambing sa sariling ulat at kumpirmasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 33020,
                  "end_ms": 42500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ibahagi ang kailangan ng tamang tatanggap; tiyakin ang pagtanggap at sundan ang napagkasunduan.",
                  "start_ms": 42800,
                  "end_ms": 50120
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "confirm-next-step": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/confirm-next-step.en.36b3156f46c6.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "36b3156f46c62c7b2f31718772063dd4f505fbed2f5a76a31f5c8df231c75216",
              "sha256": "288623a6473ace62343280464ff8a64c6ec69ab66bdbda41f07e9e1fcbb6998a",
              "duration_seconds": 86.465,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Was it received, and what was agreed?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A sent message does not prove that it was read, understood or agreed to.",
                  "start_ms": 3460,
                  "end_ms": 9340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ask the recipient and listen to clarification.",
                  "start_ms": 9640,
                  "end_ms": 13440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "In this example, the midwife asks: “Is the last attendance date certain?”",
                  "start_ms": 13740,
                  "end_ms": 18940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Gibs replies: “Not yet.",
                  "start_ms": 19240,
                  "end_ms": 21720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "I will correct the report: Liza is the source of the barrier; the date still needs verification.”",
                  "start_ms": 22020,
                  "end_ms": 28620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "The midwife says: “I received your report.",
                  "start_ms": 28920,
                  "end_ms": 31760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "I will check scheduling options and talk with you tomorrow through our agreed private method.”",
                  "start_ms": 32060,
                  "end_ms": 37220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Gibs repeats: “You will check the schedule.",
                  "start_ms": 37520,
                  "end_ms": 40640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Tomorrow I will confirm your response with you, then explain the verified next step to Liza.",
                  "start_ms": 40940,
                  "end_ms": 46940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "Is that correct?”",
                  "start_ms": 47240,
                  "end_ms": 48400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 10,
                  "text": "The midwife agrees.",
                  "start_ms": 48700,
                  "end_ms": 50700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 11,
                  "text": "This is the agreement in the fictional exercise, not a universal local deadline.",
                  "start_ms": 51000,
                  "end_ms": 56400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 12,
                  "text": "Record acknowledgement, who will act, what they will do and when or how to confirm again.",
                  "start_ms": 56700,
                  "end_ms": 63580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 13,
                  "text": "Do not tell Liza that an appointment or childcare is arranged when it is not.",
                  "start_ms": 63880,
                  "end_ms": 69480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 14,
                  "text": "If the recipient cannot be reached, follow only the verified local backup process; do not invent a substitute recipient or an emergency rule.",
                  "start_ms": 69780,
                  "end_ms": 80140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Confirm receipt and the agreement: who, what, and when or how to follow up.",
                  "start_ms": 80440,
                  "end_ms": 86400
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/confirm-next-step.fil.ea4d10cda9e3.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "ea4d10cda9e3d3c9a3a98f7b12a41efe4c2924200498cf9468dbb6d196794f2c",
              "sha256": "6763f0d7d126f8924fbba54cd4ab646ee46f2d389a27814e1a3225c3d6097ab6",
              "duration_seconds": 99.265,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Natanggap ba, at ano ang napagkasunduan?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang naipadalang mensahe ay hindi patunay na nabasa, naunawaan o napagkasunduan ang hiling.",
                  "start_ms": 3540,
                  "end_ms": 10940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Tanungin ang tatanggap at pakinggan ang paglilinaw.",
                  "start_ms": 11240,
                  "end_ms": 14840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Sa halimbawa, nagtanong ang midwife: “Tiyak ba ang huling petsa?”",
                  "start_ms": 15140,
                  "end_ms": 20380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Sumagot si Gibs: “Hindi pa po.",
                  "start_ms": 20680,
                  "end_ms": 23600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Itatama ko ang ulat: ayon kay Liza ang hadlang; ang petsa ay kailangan pang beripikahin.”",
                  "start_ms": 23900,
                  "end_ms": 31100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Sinabi ng midwife: “Natanggap ko ang ulat.",
                  "start_ms": 31400,
                  "end_ms": 34600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Titingnan ko ang mga pagpipilian sa iskedyul at kakausapin kita bukas sa napagkasunduan nating pribadong paraan.”",
                  "start_ms": 34900,
                  "end_ms": 43020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Inulit ni Gibs: “Kayo po ang titingin sa iskedyul.",
                  "start_ms": 43320,
                  "end_ms": 47320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Bukas ko kukumpirmahin sa inyo ang sagot; pagkatapos ay ipapaliwanag ko kay Liza ang natiyak na hakbang.",
                  "start_ms": 47620,
                  "end_ms": 54780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "Tama po ba?”",
                  "start_ms": 55080,
                  "end_ms": 56360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 10,
                  "text": "Sumang-ayon ang midwife.",
                  "start_ms": 56660,
                  "end_ms": 58820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 11,
                  "text": "Ito ang napagkasunduan sa kathang-isip na pagsasanay, hindi pangkalahatang deadline sa lahat ng lugar.",
                  "start_ms": 59120,
                  "end_ms": 65360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 12,
                  "text": "Itala ang pagtanggap, sino ang gagawa, ano ang gagawin at kailan o paano muling kukumpirmahin.",
                  "start_ms": 65660,
                  "end_ms": 74860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 13,
                  "text": "Huwag sabihin kay Liza na may appointment o childcare na kung wala pa.",
                  "start_ms": 75160,
                  "end_ms": 80440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 14,
                  "text": "Kung hindi makontak ang tatanggap, sundin lamang ang natiyak na lokal na backup process; huwag gumawa ng sariling kapalit na tatanggap o emergency rule.",
                  "start_ms": 80740,
                  "end_ms": 90900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Kumpirmahin ang pagtanggap at ang napagkasunduan: sino, ano, at kailan o paano mag-follow-up.",
                  "start_ms": 91200,
                  "end_ms": 99200
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "handoff": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/handoff.en.1105573ee9e5.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "1105573ee9e526ca97f94ad1eff87249b65d8fac388cd5e42a9dd57550450389",
              "sha256": "e2b04a9f837684577465cbed5fc2a96c5d696deff9715f61de69007c7229fb50",
              "duration_seconds": 75.938,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A short report with honest sources",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Gibs is the fictional male BHW; Liza, 29, is the resident.",
                  "start_ms": 3180,
                  "end_ms": 9220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Her earlier attributed record says attending the health center is difficult because she has no one to watch her child.",
                  "start_ms": 9520,
                  "end_ms": 16640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Her last attendance date remains unverified.",
                  "start_ms": 16940,
                  "end_ms": 19740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "This is neither a diagnosis nor evidence that she refuses to attend.",
                  "start_ms": 20040,
                  "end_ms": 24800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "In a private conversation with the authorized midwife, Gibs says: “Liza reports difficulty finding childcare.",
                  "start_ms": 25100,
                  "end_ms": 32260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Her last attendance date is not yet verified.",
                  "start_ms": 32560,
                  "end_ms": 35680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "She requests a conversation about scheduling.",
                  "start_ms": 35980,
                  "end_ms": 39140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Could you check a possible way for her to talk with you?”",
                  "start_ms": 39440,
                  "end_ms": 42720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Use the locally approved form if available: date, relevant concern, source, uncertainty, action taken and requested action.",
                  "start_ms": 43020,
                  "end_ms": 53940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "Record the request separately from what was actually agreed.",
                  "start_ms": 54240,
                  "end_ms": 58520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 10,
                  "text": "Asking for help does not approve a visit, appointment or childcare.",
                  "start_ms": 58820,
                  "end_ms": 63620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 11,
                  "text": "This dialogue is an authored teaching example, not a DOH quotation.",
                  "start_ms": 63920,
                  "end_ms": 68840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Separate the concern, source and missing detail; a request is not yet an agreement.",
                  "start_ms": 69140,
                  "end_ms": 75860
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/handoff.fil.9eb9a5961c9f.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "9eb9a5961c9f78ea3b5f0d1def63c68120a250792fa5b9621aeadef0fb874bfe",
              "sha256": "771c71fe88e37a222c31bb7e64ca8c0e35b0155c5463112eca8f4e4576392eee",
              "duration_seconds": 85.682,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Maikling ulat, tapat na pinagmulan",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Si Gibs ang kathang-isip na lalaking BHW; si Liza, 29, ang residente.",
                  "start_ms": 3340,
                  "end_ms": 10940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sa naunang tala, sinabi ni Liza na mahirap pumunta sa health center dahil walang magbabantay sa anak.",
                  "start_ms": 11240,
                  "end_ms": 17960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Hindi pa natiyak ang petsa ng huling pagpunta.",
                  "start_ms": 18260,
                  "end_ms": 21540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Hindi ito diagnosis o patunay na ayaw niyang pumunta.",
                  "start_ms": 21840,
                  "end_ms": 26200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Sa pribadong usapan sa awtorisadong midwife, sinabi ni Gibs: “Ayon kay Liza, hirap siyang makahanap ng magbabantay sa anak.",
                  "start_ms": 26500,
                  "end_ms": 35580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Hindi pa natiyak ang huling pagpunta niya.",
                  "start_ms": 35880,
                  "end_ms": 38720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Humihingi siya ng pakikipag-usap tungkol sa iskedyul.",
                  "start_ms": 39020,
                  "end_ms": 42540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Maaari po ba ninyong tingnan ang posibleng paraan ng pakikipag-usap?”",
                  "start_ms": 42840,
                  "end_ms": 47600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Gamitin ang lokal na aprubadong form kung mayroon: petsa, kaugnay na concern, pinagmulan, hindi pa tiyak, ginawa at hinihinging aksyon.",
                  "start_ms": 47900,
                  "end_ms": 60140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "Itala nang magkahiwalay ang hiling at ang talagang napagkasunduan.",
                  "start_ms": 60440,
                  "end_ms": 65440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 10,
                  "text": "Ang paghingi ng tulong ay hindi pa pag-apruba ng pagbisita, appointment o childcare.",
                  "start_ms": 65740,
                  "end_ms": 72020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 11,
                  "text": "Ang usapang ito ay ginawang halimbawa para sa aralin, hindi sipi mula sa DOH.",
                  "start_ms": 72320,
                  "end_ms": 78000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ihiwalay ang concern, pinagmulan at kulang na detalye; ang hinihingi ay hindi pa napagkasunduan.",
                  "start_ms": 78300,
                  "end_ms": 85620
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "meeting": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/meeting.en.ccd59541d1e9.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "ccd59541d1e98777498dce74bd81df72875d68c51cbcbf8f953d278af29b51f0",
              "sha256": "d88f59cf1d1b8a509da8262dd2377197a0eee611a665084d3b8e4f0304cdc2f9",
              "duration_seconds": 79.595,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A pattern for the meeting, a case for the right person",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "In this practice exercise, three fictional households report childcare barriers.",
                  "start_ms": 4020,
                  "end_ms": 10140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "The barangay planning meeting aims to discuss scheduling, not expose their private stories.",
                  "start_ms": 10440,
                  "end_ms": 16000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Names, form photographs, exact addresses and details that point to a household are unnecessary.",
                  "start_ms": 16300,
                  "end_ms": 23020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Combined details can identify someone even without a name.",
                  "start_ms": 23320,
                  "end_ms": 27440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Gibs gives a brief report: “In three fictional reports, childcare was mentioned as a barrier.",
                  "start_ms": 27740,
                  "end_ms": 34220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Not all attendance dates have been verified.",
                  "start_ms": 34520,
                  "end_ms": 37520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Could we discuss how to explain scheduling options?”",
                  "start_ms": 37820,
                  "end_ms": 41260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "This is a coordination question, not a statement that a change is approved.",
                  "start_ms": 41560,
                  "end_ms": 46680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "The count belongs only to this example; it is not barangay data.",
                  "start_ms": 46980,
                  "end_ms": 51540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "Keep individual follow-up separate from the meeting.",
                  "start_ms": 51840,
                  "end_ms": 55360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 10,
                  "text": "In real work, use only authorized information for the approved purpose under local procedure.",
                  "start_ms": 55660,
                  "end_ms": 61740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 11,
                  "text": "If removing identifying details is insufficient, do not share the case with the group; ask the designated health team member for the appropriate method.",
                  "start_ms": 62040,
                  "end_ms": 71560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "At a meeting, give a sufficient pattern and a clear question; private cases go to the authorized recipient.",
                  "start_ms": 71860,
                  "end_ms": 79540
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/meeting.fil.e76bbd131450.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "e76bbd13145068ce63dc0508f6d3f9c8ebd9f972457c9058a85001816e61ad8b",
              "sha256": "e44f2dc09e50d09072b1258fa670bcf54fbb0651028d2887005e8b2c70606fe7",
              "duration_seconds": 89.496,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pattern sa pulong, kaso sa tamang tao",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Sa pagsasanay, tatlong kathang-isip na pamilya ang nagsabing hadlang ang magbabantay sa anak.",
                  "start_ms": 3420,
                  "end_ms": 10580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ang layunin ng barangay planning meeting ay pag-usapan ang iskedyul, hindi ilantad ang kanilang personal na kuwento.",
                  "start_ms": 10880,
                  "end_ms": 17720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Walang kailangang pangalan, larawan ng form, eksaktong tirahan o detalyeng madaling magturo sa isang pamilya.",
                  "start_ms": 18020,
                  "end_ms": 26180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Kahit walang pangalan, maaaring makilala ang tao mula sa pinagsamang detalye.",
                  "start_ms": 26480,
                  "end_ms": 32160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Maikling ulat ni Gibs: “Sa tatlong kathang-isip na ulat, nabanggit ang hadlang sa pagbabantay ng anak.",
                  "start_ms": 32460,
                  "end_ms": 40260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Hindi pa natiyak ang lahat ng petsa ng pagpunta.",
                  "start_ms": 40560,
                  "end_ms": 43840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Maaari bang pag-usapan kung paano ipapaliwanag ang mga pagpipilian sa iskedyul?”",
                  "start_ms": 44140,
                  "end_ms": 50060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Tanong ito para sa koordinasyon, hindi pahayag na aprubado na ang pagbabago.",
                  "start_ms": 50360,
                  "end_ms": 55720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Ang bilang ay mula lamang sa halimbawang ito, hindi datos ng barangay.",
                  "start_ms": 56020,
                  "end_ms": 60380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "Ihiwalay ang indibidwal na follow-up sa pulong.",
                  "start_ms": 60680,
                  "end_ms": 64200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 10,
                  "text": "Sa tunay na gawain, gamitin lamang ang awtorisadong impormasyon para sa aprubadong layunin at lokal na proseso.",
                  "start_ms": 64500,
                  "end_ms": 72100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 11,
                  "text": "Kung hindi sapat ang pagtatanggal ng pagkakakilanlan, huwag ibahagi ang kaso sa grupo; itanong ang tamang paraan sa itinalagang health team member.",
                  "start_ms": 72400,
                  "end_ms": 81640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Sa pulong, sapat na pattern at malinaw na tanong; ang pribadong kaso ay sa awtorisadong tatanggap.",
                  "start_ms": 81940,
                  "end_ms": 89420
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "practice": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/practice.en.5ad96ade2c2c.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "5ad96ade2c2c14f7418cfa1af175c5aa92199a6713fef236063bf0a3abbee235",
              "sha256": "5de4ae679dae24311cfbc3a55b3d7ee69bfcb97f63f3acb293a95b7e22024650",
              "duration_seconds": 91.794,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Report, clarify, confirm",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "In a triad, use fictional role cards.",
                  "start_ms": 3380,
                  "end_ms": 6580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "First, play Gibs and give the brief report: concern, source and uncertainty, request and secure method.",
                  "start_ms": 6880,
                  "end_ms": 15360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Second, play the authorized midwife: ask one clarification, acknowledge receipt and agree on an action within the role.",
                  "start_ms": 15660,
                  "end_ms": 24140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Third, observe with the checklist.",
                  "start_ms": 24440,
                  "end_ms": 27160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Rotate roles over three rounds so everyone practises giving the report.",
                  "start_ms": 27460,
                  "end_ms": 32780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Replace “The family is difficult” with Liza’s honestly attributed concern and the verified or unverified details.",
                  "start_ms": 33080,
                  "end_ms": 41760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "After clarification, repeat who will do what and when or how to follow up.",
                  "start_ms": 42060,
                  "end_ms": 47940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Include no diagnosis, promised service or real resident record.",
                  "start_ms": 48240,
                  "end_ms": 53120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Give specific feedback, then retry the missing part.",
                  "start_ms": 53420,
                  "end_ms": 57620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "Peer feedback is not a facilitator grade.",
                  "start_ms": 57920,
                  "end_ms": 61600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 10,
                  "text": "Alone or without internet, write or say the report using paper cards.",
                  "start_ms": 61900,
                  "end_ms": 67220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 11,
                  "text": "Read the midwife’s clarification and prepare the reply and confirmation.",
                  "start_ms": 67520,
                  "end_ms": 72360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 12,
                  "text": "Reading support or the preferred language may be used.",
                  "start_ms": 72660,
                  "end_ms": 76660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 13,
                  "text": "Keep the same standard; arrange later direct facilitator observation before claiming that the performance was observed.",
                  "start_ms": 76960,
                  "end_ms": 84680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Practise reporting, answering clarification and confirming; retry the missing part.",
                  "start_ms": 84980,
                  "end_ms": 91740
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/practice.fil.47588b675285.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "47588b675285644d1aaa168a1c618b456d4596934a4efa832b1f36ff993d8f76",
              "sha256": "e24d52f67141a3dd9b6bc0da98392fb07a5e71848dac43ade823037ce458f89e",
              "duration_seconds": 105.169,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ulat, paglilinaw, kumpirmasyon",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Sa grupo ng tatlo, gumamit ng kathang-isip na role cards.",
                  "start_ms": 3620,
                  "end_ms": 8060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Una, gumanap na Gibs at ibigay ang maikling ulat: concern, pinagmulan at hindi pa tiyak, hiling at ligtas na paraan.",
                  "start_ms": 8360,
                  "end_ms": 18440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ikalawa, gumanap na awtorisadong midwife: humingi ng isang paglilinaw, kilalanin ang pagtanggap at makipagkasundo sa kayang gawin.",
                  "start_ms": 18740,
                  "end_ms": 29660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ikatlo, magmasid gamit ang checklist.",
                  "start_ms": 29960,
                  "end_ms": 33480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Iikot ang mga tungkulin sa tatlong round upang lahat ay makapag-ulat.",
                  "start_ms": 33780,
                  "end_ms": 38980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Palitan ang “Mahirap kausap ang pamilya” ng tapat na concern ni Liza at kung alin ang natiyak o hindi pa natiyak.",
                  "start_ms": 39280,
                  "end_ms": 48560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Pagkatapos ng paglilinaw, ulitin kung sino ang gagawa ng ano at kailan o paano susundan.",
                  "start_ms": 48860,
                  "end_ms": 55860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Walang diagnosis, pangakong serbisyo o tunay na resident record.",
                  "start_ms": 56160,
                  "end_ms": 61560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Magbigay ng tiyak na puna, saka ulitin ang bahaging kulang.",
                  "start_ms": 61860,
                  "end_ms": 65980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "Ang puna ng kapareha ay hindi marka ng facilitator.",
                  "start_ms": 66280,
                  "end_ms": 70400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 10,
                  "text": "Kung mag-isa o walang internet, isulat o sabihin ang ulat gamit ang papel na cards.",
                  "start_ms": 70700,
                  "end_ms": 77180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 11,
                  "text": "Basahin ang paglilinaw ng midwife at buuin ang sagot at kumpirmasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 77480,
                  "end_ms": 82600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 12,
                  "text": "Maaaring may katuwang sa pagbasa o sariling wika.",
                  "start_ms": 82900,
                  "end_ms": 86220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 13,
