                "text": "Sa Lunes, magsanay ng maikling pulong gamit ang tatlong kathang-isip na papel.",
                "start_ms": 25860,
                "end_ms": 32180
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "scene": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/trust-and-core-group/scene.en.867a172cb27d.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "867a172cb27d4b0d51852a3f4f3068e74cef3cce0719d964e14df2b65bd7c35c",
            "sha256": "7f96ba018529fe012c72fd6b004dc501b4c9b9855f8800a7484003ae0d23022e",
            "duration_seconds": 25.051,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "The situation",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 1600
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Purok Maligaya already has a residents’ group.",
                "start_ms": 1900,
                "end_ms": 5500
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "At the meeting, its leader wants to control every update.",
                "start_ms": 5800,
                "end_ms": 10160
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Eva is quiet, and Sari has an idea for people without phones.",
                "start_ms": 10460,
                "end_ms": 16020
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Ina needs to open the discussion and clarify who is willing to help.",
                "start_ms": 16320,
                "end_ms": 21640
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "How can the discussion include them?",
                "start_ms": 21940,
                "end_ms": 24980
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/trust-and-core-group/scene.fil.665a30009080.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "665a300090806e55cceec285cc5d1b96319c0c29b5747c44e3ba4607209f1976",
            "sha256": "ff38aabde60a584d0ca1a3bc644ed1c12348e601fd0843665977d662262e404d",
            "duration_seconds": 25.522,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ang sitwasyon",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 1680
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "May umiiral nang samahan sa Purok Maligaya.",
                "start_ms": 1980,
                "end_ms": 5580
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Sa pulong, gustong kontrolin ng lider ang lahat ng pagpapabalita.",
                "start_ms": 5880,
                "end_ms": 10720
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Tahimik si Eva, at may mungkahi si Sari para sa walang cellphone.",
                "start_ms": 11020,
                "end_ms": 16140
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Kailangan ni Ina na buksan ang usapan at linawin kung sino ang handang tumulong.",
                "start_ms": 16440,
                "end_ms": 22840
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Paano bubuksan ang usapan?",
                "start_ms": 23140,
                "end_ms": 25460
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "scope": {
          "en": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/trust-and-core-group/scope.en.1c04f318ee8a.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "1c04f318ee8a9a6a40440bd4953b2d5373d253568d772244a0aa5268c7005683",
            "sha256": "041ea9f909d260c3cf09eb76ff228b22228dbfd2a0ffbe81686371ce83b5b015",
            "duration_seconds": 32,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Scope and support",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2280
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "The BHW supports the process rather than automatically owning decisions.",
                "start_ms": 2580,
                "end_ms": 9060
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Do not force agreement or appoint unwilling people.",
                "start_ms": 9360,
                "end_ms": 13880
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "When disagreement arises, summarize the points and return to the shared purpose.",
                "start_ms": 14180,
                "end_ms": 20380
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "If the group is not ready, record what needs another discussion.",
                "start_ms": 20680,
                "end_ms": 25320
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "The BHW supports the process; no forced agreement or appointed roles.",
                "start_ms": 25620,
                "end_ms": 31940
              }
            ]
          },
          "fil": {
            "src": "/training/audio/chapter2/06-community-mobilization/trust-and-core-group/scope.fil.b0dd3051d93e.mp3",
            "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
            "content_hash": "b0dd3051d93e8b967d1068c7ab4c5186106e76f82c4afecfff3bfdce1f59fa2f",
            "sha256": "68aa6696157c81ed04b2aff6a5086253e959c848c8b34abef78ecd4bdb60a552",
            "duration_seconds": 33.933,
            "timings": [
              {
                "zone": "heading",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Saklaw at paghingi ng tulong",
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 2960
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Ang BHW ay tumutulong sa proseso, hindi awtomatikong may-ari ng desisyon.",
                "start_ms": 3260,
                "end_ms": 9900
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "Huwag pilitin ang pagsang-ayon o humirang ng ayaw tumanggap.",
                "start_ms": 10200,
                "end_ms": 15080
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 2,
                "text": "Kung may hindi pagkakaunawaan, ibuod ang punto at balikan ang layunin.",
                "start_ms": 15380,
                "end_ms": 21060
              },
              {
                "zone": "body",
                "index": 3,
                "text": "Kung hindi pa handa ang grupo, itala ang tanong na kailangang pag-usapan muli.",
                "start_ms": 21360,
                "end_ms": 26680
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Tumutulong ang BHW sa proseso; walang sapilitang pagsang-ayon o paghirang.",
                "start_ms": 26980,
                "end_ms": 33860
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
