                "text": "Refer worsening pain to a health professional; do not copy a dose from the old table.",
                "start_ms": 20220,
                "end_ms": 26260
              },
              {
                "zone": "takeaway",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "Match two Tsaang gubat cards; choose Carmona retusa, leaves, use and safe next step.",
