  "history": {
    "bhs-decline": [
      {
        "module": "03-polisiya-bhs",
        "sections": {
          "section-4": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/section-4.en.cd89f2b3b65d.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "cd89f2b3b65d0710ea3e185b19425e68d58bd4c5b6004a331c4228a211e3275d",
              "sha256": "86ccf1e2b0e6509905e440e7fbd79e146539f116cf853383648ba8e54c17cb6c",
              "duration_seconds": 65.332,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "How to decline respectfully",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Back to BHW Corazon.",
                  "start_ms": 2860,
                  "end_ms": 5980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Now that she knows the basis, how should she tell the company representative, without it sounding like a personal attack?",
                  "start_ms": 6280,
                  "end_ms": 14280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "The right approach: first acknowledge the visitor's good intention, then explain the policy directly and clearly — not stalling, not pretending not to know.",
                  "start_ms": 14580,
                  "end_ms": 25460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "\"I understand you want to help, but we're not allowed to promote milk substitutes inside the BHS, under the Milk Code.",
                  "start_ms": 25760,
                  "end_ms": 33800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "We also can't take samples, gifts or other offers from milk companies.",
                  "start_ms": 34100,
                  "end_ms": 40180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "I'll let our midwife know you came by.\"",
                  "start_ms": 40480,
                  "end_ms": 43320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Corazon does not suggest any other way for the company to help, and she promises nothing in return.",
                  "start_ms": 43620,
                  "end_ms": 50780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "That same day she tells the midwife about the visit.",
                  "start_ms": 51080,
                  "end_ms": 54840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The strongest refusal isn't an angry one — it's clear, has a basis, makes no deal, and is reported to the midwife.",
                  "start_ms": 55140,
                  "end_ms": 65260
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/section-4.fil.73e34c01d32b.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "73e34c01d32bec82e4b3c7f7be62bd3af76cdebaa241a4381e7a7af6a825a32c",
              "sha256": "db9960d65a996f6948b57bc6127fa92ab6deda2c4ed55c686c6598a7935ba4c6",
              "duration_seconds": 75.233,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Paano tumanggi nang magalang",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Bumalik tayo kay BHW Corazon.",
                  "start_ms": 2740,
                  "end_ms": 5900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ngayong alam na niya ang batayan, paano niya sasabihin ito sa kinatawan ng kumpanya nang hindi nagmukhang personal na pag-atake?",
                  "start_ms": 6200,
                  "end_ms": 14560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ang tamang paraan: kilalanin muna ang mabuting intensyon ng bisita, saka ipaliwanag ang polisiya nang direkta at malinaw — hindi pagpapaliban, hindi pagpapanggap na hindi alam.",
                  "start_ms": 14860,
                  "end_ms": 29060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "\"Naiintindihan ko po ang gusto ninyong tumulong, pero bawal po sa amin ang mag-promote ng milk substitute sa loob ng BHS, ayon sa Milk Code.",
                  "start_ms": 29360,
                  "end_ms": 39280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Hindi rin po kami puwedeng tumanggap ng sample, regalo, o iba pang alok mula sa kumpanya ng gatas.",
                  "start_ms": 39580,
                  "end_ms": 47300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Sasabihin ko po sa aming midwife na dumaan kayo.\"",
                  "start_ms": 47600,
                  "end_ms": 51200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Hindi nagmumungkahi si Corazon ng ibang paraan para tumulong ang kumpanya, at wala siyang ipinapangakong kapalit.",
                  "start_ms": 51500,
                  "end_ms": 59180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Sa araw ding iyon, sinasabihan niya ang midwife tungkol sa pagbisita.",
                  "start_ms": 59480,
                  "end_ms": 64800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang pinakamalakas na pagtanggi ay hindi galit — ito ay malinaw, may batayan, walang kasunduan, at ipinaaalam sa midwife.",
                  "start_ms": 65100,
                  "end_ms": 75180
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-7": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/section-7.en.338717f48153.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "338717f481539201b1b6772f19b62217d66d73919b398011fcb8f29f512574b7",
              "sha256": "c2233cbcb0e809f6922a4a9c77205b4624d5d825125ab083573dba355f41e16b",
              "duration_seconds": 60.317,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Wrong versus right: the company's offer",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "**Wrong**: BHW Danilo accepted the samples and gifts from the medicine company's representative, because \"it's free anyway, and maybe it's rude to say no.\"",
                  "start_ms": 4020,
                  "end_ms": 15700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "He handed the samples out to patients with no explanation of why they were being recommended.",
                  "start_ms": 16000,
                  "end_ms": 22480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "**Right**: Corazon respectfully declined, explained the basis in the Milk Code, made no deal of any kind with the company, and told the midwife about the visit that same day.",
                  "start_ms": 22780,
                  "end_ms": 35420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "The difference isn't kindness or its absence — the difference is who gets to decide what's good for the patient: the BHS, guided by policy, or the company, guided by its own benefit.",
                  "start_ms": 35720,
                  "end_ms": 49760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "When an offer is accepted with no basis behind it, it is the company, not the BHS, that ends up deciding what's good for the patient.",
                  "start_ms": 50060,
                  "end_ms": 60260
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/section-7.fil.9df7b5551c65.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "9df7b5551c65a8161c538242830191ca57cf604db30ac362919f88d7251fceae",
              "sha256": "3427ddfef1a36b10ffe159d5997bb0ffca82dfca11c5d55ecdde882bd4e01f78",
              "duration_seconds": 68.676,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Mali kumpara sa tama: ang alok ng kumpanya",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 4480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "**Mali**: Tinanggap ni BHW Danilo ang mga sample at regalo mula sa kinatawan ng kumpanya ng gamot, dahil \"libre naman, at baka magkasala pa ako kung tatanggihan ko.\"",
                  "start_ms": 4780,
                  "end_ms": 18140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ipinamigay niya ang mga sample sa mga pasyente nang walang paliwanag kung bakit ito ang inirekomenda.",
                  "start_ms": 18440,
                  "end_ms": 25440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "**Tama**: Magalang na tumanggi si Corazon, ipinaliwanag ang batayan mula sa Milk Code, walang pinasok na anumang kasunduan sa kumpanya, at sinabihan ang midwife tungkol sa pagbisita sa araw ding iyon.",
                  "start_ms": 25740,
                  "end_ms": 40900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ang pagkakaiba ay hindi kabaitan o kawalan nito — ang pagkakaiba ay kung sino ang nagpapasya kung ano ang mabuti para sa pasyente: ang BHS batay sa polisiya, o ang kumpanya batay sa benepisyo nito.",
                  "start_ms": 41200,
                  "end_ms": 57360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Kapag tinanggap ang alok nang walang batayan, ang kumpanya na, hindi ang BHS, ang nagpapasya kung ano ang mabuti para sa pasyente.",
                  "start_ms": 57660,
                  "end_ms": 68620
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
