                  "start_ms": 2780,
                  "end_ms": 6100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ngayong alam na niya ang batayan, paano niya sasabihin ito sa kinatawan ng kumpanya nang hindi nagmukhang personal na pag-atake?",
                  "start_ms": 6400,
                  "end_ms": 15120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ang tamang paraan: kilalanin muna ang mabuting intensyon ng bisita, saka ipaliwanag ang polisiya nang direkta at malinaw — hindi pagpapaliban, hindi pagpapanggap na hindi alam.",
                  "start_ms": 15420,
                  "end_ms": 29340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "\"Naiintindihan ko po ang gusto ninyong tumulong, pero bawal po sa amin ang mag-promote ng milk substitute sa loob ng BHS, ayon sa Milk Code.",
                  "start_ms": 29640,
                  "end_ms": 39880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Hindi rin po kami puwedeng tumanggap ng sample, regalo, o iba pang alok mula sa kumpanya ng gatas.",
                  "start_ms": 40180,
                  "end_ms": 47380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Sasabihin ko po sa aming midwife na dumaan kayo.\"",
                  "start_ms": 47680,
                  "end_ms": 51200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Hindi nagmumungkahi si Mimi ng ibang paraan para tumulong ang kumpanya, at wala siyang ipinapangakong kapalit.",
                  "start_ms": 51500,
                  "end_ms": 59620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Sa araw ding iyon, sinasabihan niya ang midwife tungkol sa pagbisita.",
                  "start_ms": 59920,
                  "end_ms": 65320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang pinakamalakas na pagtanggi ay hindi galit — ito ay malinaw, may batayan, walang kasunduan, at ipinaaalam sa midwife.",
                  "start_ms": 65620,
                  "end_ms": 75860
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-7": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/section-7.en.fc81549bfd06.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "fc81549bfd06785ad6e601f4fb2e66fcdd7f9ac9c0162b85d6b2bad1a642d85a",
              "sha256": "419484cd5ea1d919a2bf9482ae4d211d0251a407d0e444c10072d5338be47aa0",
              "duration_seconds": 59.481,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Wrong versus right: the company's offer",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "**Wrong**: BHW Danilo accepted the samples and gifts from the medicine company's representative, because \"it's free anyway, and maybe it's rude to say no.\"",
                  "start_ms": 3740,
                  "end_ms": 15700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "He handed the samples out to patients with no explanation of why they were being recommended.",
                  "start_ms": 16000,
                  "end_ms": 22600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "**Right**: Mimi respectfully declined, explained the basis in the Milk Code, made no deal of any kind with the company, and told the midwife about the visit that same day.",
                  "start_ms": 22900,
                  "end_ms": 35620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "The difference isn't kindness or its absence — the difference is who gets to decide what's good for the patient: the BHS, guided by policy, or the company, guided by its own benefit.",
                  "start_ms": 35920,
                  "end_ms": 49800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "When an offer is accepted with no basis behind it, it is the company, not the BHS, that ends up deciding what's good for the patient.",
                  "start_ms": 50100,
                  "end_ms": 59420
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/section-7.fil.6d4dd5c93b52.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "6d4dd5c93b52e2ccf4b789c4e9d4d9b1343a94d87ca8a48fcff79266d98a4939",
              "sha256": "c038fd8f8c2408abc8b1a99d904b5517d855adb2b6423c774c578030870c6188",
              "duration_seconds": 65.698,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Mali kumpara sa tama: ang alok ng kumpanya",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 4120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "**Mali**: Tinanggap ni BHW Danilo ang mga sample at regalo mula sa kinatawan ng kumpanya ng gamot, dahil \"libre naman, at baka magkasala pa ako kung tatanggihan ko.\"",
                  "start_ms": 4420,
                  "end_ms": 17300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ipinamigay niya ang mga sample sa mga pasyente nang walang paliwanag kung bakit ito ang inirekomenda.",
                  "start_ms": 17600,
                  "end_ms": 24600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "**Tama**: Magalang na tumanggi si Mimi, ipinaliwanag ang batayan mula sa Milk Code, walang pinasok na anumang kasunduan sa kumpanya, at sinabihan ang midwife tungkol sa pagbisita sa araw ding iyon.",
                  "start_ms": 24900,
                  "end_ms": 39500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ang pagkakaiba ay hindi kabaitan o kawalan nito — ang pagkakaiba ay kung sino ang nagpapasya kung ano ang mabuti para sa pasyente: ang BHS batay sa polisiya, o ang kumpanya batay sa benepisyo nito.",
                  "start_ms": 39800,
                  "end_ms": 55720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Kapag tinanggap ang alok nang walang batayan, ang kumpanya na, hindi ang BHS, ang nagpapasya kung ano ang mabuti para sa pasyente.",
                  "start_ms": 56020,
                  "end_ms": 65620
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "module": "03-polisiya-bhs",
        "sections": {
          "hold-boundary": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/hold-boundary.en.480bf18c4b0e.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "480bf18c4b0e07757fd002f1cf51d995b06bfe2557e76f189a1580f3043c094e",
              "sha256": "614992dc0c88ac404297008d8cc92efe5ccc1e42ed51b08548d9a0e912ea2d5c",
              "duration_seconds": 60.839,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "When the visitor presses",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "“It is free.",
                  "start_ms": 2460,
                  "end_ms": 4260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "I will just leave it, and you can decide later,” the visitor says.",
                  "start_ms": 4560,
                  "end_ms": 9000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Mimi does not need to argue or invent an excuse.",
                  "start_ms": 9300,
                  "end_ms": 13620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "She calmly repeats the boundary: “I understand the offer, but I will not accept or distribute these items.",
                  "start_ms": 13920,
                  "end_ms": 21760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Please do not leave them with us.",
                  "start_ms": 22060,
                  "end_ms": 25860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "I will inform the supervisor about your visit.”",
                  "start_ms": 26160,
                  "end_ms": 29080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "She does not arrange distribution outside the facility, accept secretly, or display the poster while waiting for the midwife.",
                  "start_ms": 29380,
                  "end_ms": 38100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "She does not promise that another offer will be approved.",
                  "start_ms": 38400,
                  "end_ms": 42200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "If the conversation becomes difficult, she asks the supervisor for help through the local process.",
                  "start_ms": 42500,
                  "end_ms": 48980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "Respect is expressed in how she speaks; it does not require agreement.",
                  "start_ms": 49280,
                  "end_ms": 54760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Repeat the boundary calmly; make no arrangement to bypass policy.",
                  "start_ms": 55060,
                  "end_ms": 60780
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/hold-boundary.fil.9f7876a73dd4.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "9f7876a73dd47d2887ba4a228606c96a6f4e5b8f953012ce593570bc60bb2fd4",
              "sha256": "2cb03e03d190b6ba1654144920f14605c8bd6fd8bcccbf34c3ef80387ec76f32",
              "duration_seconds": 64.522,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Kapag nagpumilit ang bisita",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "“Libre naman.",
                  "start_ms": 2340,
                  "end_ms": 4260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Iwan ko na lang, tapos kayo na ang bahala,” sabi ng bisita.",
                  "start_ms": 4560,
                  "end_ms": 9080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Hindi kailangang makipagtalo o magbigay ng palusot si Mimi.",
                  "start_ms": 9380,
                  "end_ms": 13660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Inuulit niya ang hangganan sa mahinahong boses: “Nauunawaan ko po ang alok, pero hindi ko po tatanggapin o ipamimigay ang mga ito.",
                  "start_ms": 13960,
                  "end_ms": 23960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Mangyaring huwag po itong iwan sa amin.",
                  "start_ms": 24260,
                  "end_ms": 27820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ipapaalam ko ang pagbisita sa namamahala.”",
                  "start_ms": 28120,
                  "end_ms": 31480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Hindi siya nakikipagkasundo na sa labas na lang ipamigay, tanggapin nang lihim, o ipaskil muna habang hinihintay ang midwife.",
                  "start_ms": 31780,
                  "end_ms": 40660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Hindi rin niya sinasabing siguradong maaaprubahan ang ibang alok.",
                  "start_ms": 40960,
                  "end_ms": 45040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Kung hindi maayos ang usapan, humingi ng tulong sa namamahala ayon sa lokal na proseso.",
                  "start_ms": 45340,
                  "end_ms": 51540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "Ang paggalang ay nasa paraan ng pagsasalita; hindi ito nangangahulugang pagsang-ayon.",
                  "start_ms": 51840,
                  "end_ms": 58400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ulitin ang hangganan nang mahinahon; walang kasunduang umiikot sa polisiya.",
                  "start_ms": 58700,
                  "end_ms": 64460
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "match-policy": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/match-policy.en.b2387eba2587.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "b2387eba2587b15cde350bb5ed704946fe7d8a471435f8e0eec9e4bffd35d5df",
              "sha256": "2fe60009d0e44817da7d1f6f79420f9ce77519317c7aa972c6dc2f704d0cd242",
              "duration_seconds": 71.863,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Match the reason to the product",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Different products need different policy explanations.",
                  "start_ms": 3100,
                  "end_ms": 6780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "The first situation involves infant-formula samples for mothers, a BHS product poster, and a gift for promotion; the Milk Code is the relevant basis.",
                  "start_ms": 7080,
                  "end_ms": 18160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "If Mimi is asked to give prescription-medicine samples to families instead, she needs a different explanation: “I cannot distribute prescription samples to the public.",
                  "start_ms": 18460,
                  "end_ms": 28980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Under the pharmaceutical order, samples are for licensed physicians and dentists under its rules.",
                  "start_ms": 29280,
                  "end_ms": 36000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "I will refer the details to the supervisor.”",
                  "start_ms": 36300,
                  "end_ms": 39460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "That order covers prescription pharmaceutical products and medical devices.",
                  "start_ms": 39760,
                  "end_ms": 44960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Some educational items and scientific activities are permitted under conditions; this is not automatic permission for a BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 45260,
                  "end_ms": 54660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "If the product or conditions are uncertain, state what is unknown, pause acceptance while checking, and ask for guidance.",
                  "start_ms": 54960,
                  "end_ms": 63760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Referral cannot make prohibited promotion lawful.",
                  "start_ms": 64060,
                  "end_ms": 67780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Match the policy to the product; do not invent permission.",
                  "start_ms": 68080,
                  "end_ms": 71800
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/match-policy.fil.72b21d66f26a.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "72b21d66f26ad9c2721d7e2b21cb1559121a56008cff965b184143591fcddee8",
              "sha256": "3fd4c22da62913e5097ef22ba593da2d852f4d42b9a94200a2d520106d95d480",
              "duration_seconds": 81.502,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Itugma ang paliwanag sa produkto",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Hindi iisang polisiya ang ginagamit sa lahat ng produkto.",
                  "start_ms": 2940,
                  "end_ms": 7500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Para sa infant-formula samples para sa mga nanay, product poster sa BHS, at regalong kapalit ng promosyon sa unang sitwasyon, Milk Code ang batayan.",
                  "start_ms": 7800,
                  "end_ms": 21080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Kung prescription-medicine samples naman ang hinihiling na ipamigay ni Mimi sa mga pamilya, ibang paliwanag ang kailangan: “Hindi ko po maaaring ipamigay ang prescription samples sa publiko.",
                  "start_ms": 21380,
                  "end_ms": 34620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Sa pharmaceutical order, para sa licensed physicians at dentists ang mga sample sa ilalim ng mga tuntunin nito.",
                  "start_ms": 34920,
                  "end_ms": 43400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Idudulog ko ang detalye sa namamahala.”",
                  "start_ms": 43700,
                  "end_ms": 46700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Saklaw ng order ang prescription pharmaceutical products at medical devices.",
                  "start_ms": 47000,
                  "end_ms": 52200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "May kondisyong pinapayagang educational items at scientific activities; hindi ito awtomatikong pahintulot sa BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 52500,
                  "end_ms": 61980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Kung hindi tiyak ang produkto o kondisyon, sabihin ang hindi pa alam, huwag tumanggap habang tinitiyak, at humingi ng gabay.",
                  "start_ms": 62280,
                  "end_ms": 71400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Hindi ginagawang legal ng pagdulog ang ipinagbabawal na promosyon.",
                  "start_ms": 71700,
                  "end_ms": 76260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tamang produkto, tamang batayan; huwag mag-imbento ng pahintulot.",
                  "start_ms": 76560,
                  "end_ms": 81440
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "refusal-check": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/refusal-check.en.f819baed3bb5.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "f819baed3bb590b893448a0a7b5150f8bc1f515308a00a8ba32a2b9e6f052a42",
              "sha256": "d393173c23f9525f305cea56e773e0f867ba484e0539c376217919c1568b42bc",
              "duration_seconds": 33.593,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Practice a clear refusal",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A representative asks you to give prescription-medicine samples to families.",
                  "start_ms": 2900,
                  "end_ms": 8060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "There is a personal gift, and the visitor offers to leave the box while the midwife is away.",
                  "start_ms": 8360,
                  "end_ms": 14600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Choose a clear, respectful response within the BHW role.",
                  "start_ms": 14900,
                  "end_ms": 19940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Then practice it in your own words without taking the items.",
                  "start_ms": 20240,
                  "end_ms": 25240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "You do not need to memorize a law number.",
                  "start_ms": 25540,
                  "end_ms": 28340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Acknowledge, decline, explain the correct basis, and report.",
                  "start_ms": 28640,
                  "end_ms": 33520
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/refusal-check.fil.4284a76191b4.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "4284a76191b48587b0ca62f75ceca325980b9c1a19944a1425ce7c39dceb5530",
              "sha256": "910617b8e7661a4c8232a83d9dee1df0adf834e74028250e2222eea4f1814c8d",
              "duration_seconds": 40.986,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Isagawa ang malinaw na pagtanggi",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Isang kinatawan ang humihiling na ipamigay mo sa mga pamilya ang prescription-medicine samples.",
                  "start_ms": 2980,
                  "end_ms": 9540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "May personal na regalo at sinasabing puwedeng iwan ang box habang wala ang midwife.",
                  "start_ms": 9840,
                  "end_ms": 16160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Piliin ang tugong malinaw, magalang, at nasa tungkulin ng BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 16460,
                  "end_ms": 23020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Pagkatapos, sabihin ito sa sariling pananalita nang hindi kumukuha ng mga bagay.",
                  "start_ms": 23320,
                  "end_ms": 29120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Hindi kailangang kabisaduhin ang numero ng batas.",
                  "start_ms": 29420,
                  "end_ms": 33380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Magpasalamat, tumanggi, ipaliwanag ang tamang batayan, at mag-ulat.",
                  "start_ms": 33680,
                  "end_ms": 40920
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "report-facts": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/report-facts.en.42e26b87d29a.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "42e26b87d29abfcafe113c99801d3e8dc061dd1357fd46fe2c49ed2f61169212",
              "sha256": "388ffc198ebef44fe001e7f929cd9323daf21cffe2ba9bd8079b4a9c634b8477",
              "duration_seconds": 64.131,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Report what happened",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "After the conversation, Mimi informs the midwife or facility supervisor through the local process.",
                  "start_ms": 1900,
                  "end_ms": 9340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "In this fictional example, she reports that day.",
                  "start_ms": 9640,
                  "end_ms": 13080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "This is not a new legal deadline.",
                  "start_ms": 13380,
                  "end_ms": 16100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "She says: “A representative offered infant-formula samples for mothers, a BHS poster, and a gift for promotion.",
                  "start_ms": 16400,
                  "end_ms": 25760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "I declined and accepted, displayed, and distributed nothing.",
                  "start_ms": 26060,
                  "end_ms": 31220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "I said I would tell you the details.”",
                  "start_ms": 31520,
                  "end_ms": 34120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "If a record is required, include the time, place, product, offer, requested activity, and her response.",
                  "start_ms": 34420,
                  "end_ms": 42340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Follow local rules for handling records; omit patient data and guesses about motives.",
                  "start_ms": 42640,
                  "end_ms": 49000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Ask the supervisor to determine the next step.",
                  "start_ms": 49300,
                  "end_ms": 52500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "Do not blame families for feeding choices; a health professional handles feeding or clinical questions.",
                  "start_ms": 52800,
                  "end_ms": 59400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Report the facts and your response, without speculation.",
                  "start_ms": 59700,
                  "end_ms": 64060
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/report-facts.fil.f055f270b7a6.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "f055f270b7a6fbcc433d048a573af5d17e237d1e773abda15036ffa2aea1a86a",
              "sha256": "8240e63d2794378ee97c1e2243701c1bb75e0e6f1638a62441cc2dedc05ca73d",
              "duration_seconds": 72.777,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ipabatid ang nangyari",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pagkatapos ng usapan, ipinaalam ni Mimi sa midwife o namamahala ang pagbisita ayon sa lokal na proseso.",
                  "start_ms": 2220,
                  "end_ms": 9860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sa kathang-isip na halimbawang ito, nag-ulat siya sa araw ding iyon.",
                  "start_ms": 10160,
                  "end_ms": 14800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Hindi ito bagong legal na deadline.",
                  "start_ms": 15100,
                  "end_ms": 17580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Sinabi niya: “May kinatawang nag-alok ng infant-formula samples para sa mga nanay, poster sa BHS, at regalo kapalit ng promosyon.",
                  "start_ms": 17880,
                  "end_ms": 28600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Tumanggi ako at walang tinanggap, ipinaskil, o ipinamahagi.",
                  "start_ms": 28900,
                  "end_ms": 34260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Sinabi kong ipapaalam ko ang detalye sa inyo.”",
                  "start_ms": 34560,
                  "end_ms": 38160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Kung kailangan ng tala, ilagay ang oras, lugar, produkto, alok, hinihinging gawain, at sariling tugon.",
                  "start_ms": 38460,
                  "end_ms": 48340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Sundin ang lokal na patakaran sa paghawak ng tala; huwag isama ang datos ng pasyente o haka-haka sa motibo.",
                  "start_ms": 48640,
                  "end_ms": 56240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Ipatukoy ang susunod na hakbang sa namamahala.",
                  "start_ms": 56540,
                  "end_ms": 59540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "Huwag sisihin ang mga pamilya sa feeding choices; health professional ang sasagot sa feeding o clinical questions.",
                  "start_ms": 59840,
                  "end_ms": 66920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Mag-ulat ng katotohanan at sariling tugon, hindi haka-haka.",
                  "start_ms": 67220,
                  "end_ms": 72700
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-4": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/section-4.en.9df9a1639547.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "9df9a16395478fc69ad869ad0e6a17108211002c483d46442b1253fb25965f77",
              "sha256": "13042c87e399cc1333b1e12a0125fafe135087277ff7e75b444be3acd7cb1466",
              "duration_seconds": 60.5,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Clear and respectful",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The company representative returns to the BHS with infant-formula samples for mothers, a product poster, and a personal gift in return for promotion.",
                  "start_ms": 2220,
                  "end_ms": 13300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Mimi knows she will decline this offer.",
                  "start_ms": 13600,
                  "end_ms": 17680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "How can she say no respectfully?",
                  "start_ms": 17980,
                  "end_ms": 20820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Mimi says: “Thank you for coming.",
                  "start_ms": 21120,
                  "end_ms": 23640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "I will not accept the samples or gift, or display the product poster.",
                  "start_ms": 23940,
                  "end_ms": 29500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "This falls under the Milk Code: the facility cannot be used for this promotion, and an inducement for promotion cannot be accepted.",
                  "start_ms": 29800,
                  "end_ms": 38160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "I will tell our midwife or facility supervisor the details.”",
                  "start_ms": 38460,
                  "end_ms": 42540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "She does not take the items, assume the visitor’s motives, or promise permission later.",
                  "start_ms": 42840,
                  "end_ms": 48800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "The story is optional; you can complete Read or Slides without watching it.",
                  "start_ms": 49100,
                  "end_ms": 54260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Use a respectful tone, a clear refusal, and a specific reason.",
                  "start_ms": 54560,
                  "end_ms": 60440
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/section-4.fil.e70ad9d921eb.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "e70ad9d921ebf3a1ae02819f20c014844e558cc1aac70149252b964f35b638b4",
              "sha256": "18dff9133223cbf7fec3d1e899c65952418022acd450300e442f8553bce34d63",
              "duration_seconds": 70.296,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Malinaw at magalang",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Bumalik ang kinatawan ng kumpanya sa BHS.",
                  "start_ms": 2380,
                  "end_ms": 5460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "May infant-formula samples para sa mga nanay, product poster, at personal na regalong kapalit ng tulong sa promosyon.",
                  "start_ms": 5760,
                  "end_ms": 15840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Alam ni Mimi na hindi niya tatanggapin ang alok na ito.",
                  "start_ms": 16140,
                  "end_ms": 20100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Paano niya sasabihin ang hindi nang may paggalang?",
                  "start_ms": 20400,
                  "end_ms": 24640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Sinabi ni Mimi: “Salamat po sa pagpunta.",
                  "start_ms": 24940,
                  "end_ms": 28620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Hindi ko po tatanggapin ang mga sample at regalo o ipapaskil ang product poster.",
                  "start_ms": 28920,
                  "end_ms": 35080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Saklaw ito ng Milk Code: hindi ginagamit ang pasilidad para sa ganitong promosyon, at hindi tinatanggap ang insentibong kapalit ng pagpromote.",
                  "start_ms": 35380,
                  "end_ms": 45660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Ipapaalam ko ang detalye sa aming midwife o namamahala.”",
                  "start_ms": 45960,
                  "end_ms": 50120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Hindi niya kinukuha ang mga bagay, ipinapalagay ang motibo ng bisita, o nangangakong may pahintulot mamaya.",
                  "start_ms": 50420,
                  "end_ms": 57980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "Opsyonal ang kuwento; maaari mong tapusin ang Read o Slides nang hindi nanonood.",
                  "start_ms": 58280,
                  "end_ms": 64400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Magalang na tono, malinaw na hindi, at tiyak na dahilan.",
                  "start_ms": 64700,
                  "end_ms": 70220
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-7": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/section-7.en.a48b9265a2a8.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "a48b9265a2a827e7b2be3f5ba7c003e561542462dc9e367405152b93d9f4c130",
              "sha256": "5dc3c563139b7aef8ae3a9ece51de44d34d3dc0c0b5016733a8be3afaed24280",
              "duration_seconds": 62.616,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Compare two responses",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Both responses concern the same infant-formula offer.",
                  "start_ms": 2500,
                  "end_ms": 7260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Danilo accepts the samples for mothers and gift because “saying no might be rude.”",
                  "start_ms": 7560,
                  "end_ms": 13600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "He suggests distributing them outside instead.",
                  "start_ms": 13900,
                  "end_ms": 17700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Accepting and arranging an alternative cross the boundary; a polite tone does not correct that.",
                  "start_ms": 18000,
                  "end_ms": 25640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Mimi thanks the visitor, clearly declines the samples, gift, and poster, explains the Milk Code as it applies to the offer, and makes no alternative promotional arrangement.",
                  "start_ms": 25940,
                  "end_ms": 39180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "She informs the supervisor of the facts.",
                  "start_ms": 39480,
                  "end_ms": 42280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "In the medicine-sample situation, she would use the pharmaceutical explanation, not the Milk Code.",
                  "start_ms": 42580,
                  "end_ms": 49060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "A good response combines respect, an accurate reason, and actions consistent with the refusal.",
                  "start_ms": 49360,
                  "end_ms": 57400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Polite words are insufficient if the offer is still accepted.",
                  "start_ms": 57700,
                  "end_ms": 62540
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/section-7.fil.a01200b3dd32.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "a01200b3dd323ea1956bb3349064237622dd519b6da07e7bd47b439fc345ab94",
              "sha256": "196d5975a4d761c662c5540c2c479b666641d1f4da2fd40b470757c0d524cbaf",
              "duration_seconds": 62.328,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ihambing ang dalawang tugon",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Parehong infant-formula offer ang pinag-uusapan.",
                  "start_ms": 2460,
                  "end_ms": 6060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Tinanggap ni Danilo ang mga sample para sa mga nanay at regalo dahil “baka bastos ang tumanggi.”",
                  "start_ms": 6360,
                  "end_ms": 13320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Sinabi niyang puwedeng sa labas na lang ipamigay.",
                  "start_ms": 13620,
                  "end_ms": 17300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Nalampasan ang hangganan sa mismong pagtanggap at kasunduan; hindi ito naitatama ng magalang na tono.",
                  "start_ms": 17600,
                  "end_ms": 25720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Si Mimi ay nagpasalamat sa pagbisita, malinaw na tumanggi sa mga sample, regalo, at poster, ipinaliwanag ang Milk Code na naaangkop sa alok, at walang iminungkahing kapalit na promosyon.",
                  "start_ms": 26020,
                  "end_ms": 38540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ipinaalam niya ang katotohanan sa namamahala.",
                  "start_ms": 38840,
                  "end_ms": 42400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Sa medicine-sample situation, gagamit siya ng pharmaceutical explanation, hindi Milk Code.",
                  "start_ms": 42700,
                  "end_ms": 49580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Ang magandang tugon ay may paggalang, tamang dahilan, at kilos na tugma sa sinabi.",
                  "start_ms": 49880,
                  "end_ms": 56960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Hindi sapat ang magalang na salita kung tinatanggap pa rin ang alok.",
                  "start_ms": 57260,
                  "end_ms": 62260
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "module": "03-polisiya-bhs",
        "sections": {
          "hold-boundary": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/hold-boundary.en.97ec7a9d2b44.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "97ec7a9d2b44535ec85a7a24e563741585aabf325b05cb69a9ce17cb86cf9efb",
              "sha256": "edad1c6b97b874669900b2b8f4a9cde29bc531c3fc33acf023a4d35d90341c5b",
              "duration_seconds": 59.324,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "When the visitor presses",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "“It is free.",
                  "start_ms": 2340,
                  "end_ms": 3900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "I will just leave it, and you can decide later,” the visitor says.",
                  "start_ms": 4200,
                  "end_ms": 9240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Mimi does not need to argue or invent an excuse.",
                  "start_ms": 9540,
                  "end_ms": 13620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "She calmly repeats the boundary: “I understand the offer, but I will not accept or distribute these items.",
                  "start_ms": 13920,
                  "end_ms": 21920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Please do not leave them with us.",
                  "start_ms": 22220,
                  "end_ms": 24580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "I will inform the supervisor about your visit.”",
                  "start_ms": 24880,
                  "end_ms": 28160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "She does not arrange distribution outside the facility, accept secretly, or display the poster while waiting for the midwife.",
                  "start_ms": 28460,
                  "end_ms": 36980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "She does not promise that another offer will be approved.",
                  "start_ms": 37280,
                  "end_ms": 40920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "If the conversation becomes difficult, she asks the supervisor for help through the local process.",
                  "start_ms": 41220,
                  "end_ms": 47820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "Respect is expressed in how she speaks; it does not require agreement.",
                  "start_ms": 48120,
                  "end_ms": 53760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Repeat the boundary calmly; make no arrangement to bypass policy.",
                  "start_ms": 54060,
                  "end_ms": 59260
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/hold-boundary.fil.54fbfa1d34b6.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "54fbfa1d34b6d5f2a1c4fa685f23808acc254e12d50532a77ffa264ebe86890b",
              "sha256": "7f2f69bcb3f683178d2f0cc9178a5b565f6565f95bbb81a06e4b991a02a15653",
              "duration_seconds": 63.974,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Kapag nagpumilit ang bisita",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "“Libre naman.",
                  "start_ms": 2780,
                  "end_ms": 4420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Iwan ko na lang, tapos kayo na ang bahala,” sabi ng bisita.",
                  "start_ms": 4720,
                  "end_ms": 9280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Hindi kailangang makipagtalo o magbigay ng palusot si Mimi.",
                  "start_ms": 9580,
                  "end_ms": 13660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Inuulit niya ang hangganan sa mahinahong boses: “Nauunawaan ko po ang alok, pero hindi ko po tatanggapin o ipamimigay ang mga ito.",
                  "start_ms": 13960,
                  "end_ms": 23520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Mangyaring huwag po itong iwan sa amin.",
                  "start_ms": 23820,
                  "end_ms": 27020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ipapaalam ko ang pagbisita sa namamahala.”",
                  "start_ms": 27320,
                  "end_ms": 30640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Hindi siya nakikipagkasundo na sa labas na lang ipamigay, tanggapin nang lihim, o ipaskil muna habang hinihintay ang midwife.",
                  "start_ms": 30940,
                  "end_ms": 39700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Hindi rin niya sinasabing siguradong maaaprubahan ang ibang alok.",
                  "start_ms": 40000,
                  "end_ms": 44040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Kung hindi maayos ang usapan, humingi ng tulong sa namamahala ayon sa lokal na proseso.",
                  "start_ms": 44340,
                  "end_ms": 50540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "Ang paggalang ay nasa paraan ng pagsasalita; hindi ito nangangahulugang pagsang-ayon.",
                  "start_ms": 50840,
                  "end_ms": 57280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ulitin ang hangganan nang mahinahon; walang kasunduang umiikot sa polisiya.",
                  "start_ms": 57580,
                  "end_ms": 63900
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "match-policy": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/match-policy.en.cf0493403f5d.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "cf0493403f5dc4f30ac9660aa93518d0738644eccb12131f4ced5a0914ea9c5f",
              "sha256": "933ee842dc39c3f85cd496f789715edf306781f736b5e67190826b6b55f1829d",
              "duration_seconds": 75.624,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Match the reason to the product",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Different products need different policy explanations.",
                  "start_ms": 3700,
                  "end_ms": 7300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "The first situation involves infant-formula samples for mothers, a BHS product poster, and a gift for promotion; the Milk Code is the relevant basis.",
                  "start_ms": 7600,
                  "end_ms": 20520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "If Mimi is asked to give prescription-medicine samples to families instead, she needs a different explanation: “I cannot distribute prescription samples to the public.",
                  "start_ms": 20820,
                  "end_ms": 32100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Under the pharmaceutical order, samples are for licensed physicians and dentists under its rules.",
                  "start_ms": 32400,
                  "end_ms": 38680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "I will refer the details to the supervisor.”",
                  "start_ms": 38980,
                  "end_ms": 42060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "That order covers prescription pharmaceutical products and medical devices.",
                  "start_ms": 42360,
                  "end_ms": 48240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Some educational items and scientific activities are permitted under conditions; this is not automatic permission for a BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 48540,
                  "end_ms": 57300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "If the product or conditions are uncertain, state what is unknown, pause acceptance while checking, and ask for guidance.",
                  "start_ms": 57600,
                  "end_ms": 65960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Referral cannot make prohibited promotion lawful.",
                  "start_ms": 66260,
                  "end_ms": 70340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Match the policy to the product; do not invent permission.",
                  "start_ms": 70640,
                  "end_ms": 75560
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/match-policy.fil.2ded5507efc7.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "2ded5507efc780c92cf27ec0730bdadde08182582ddf2cb0915a5ea00bd3466a",
              "sha256": "f34e118f999698b87223e0e7c51579c4b86e7be7a894afd5bfdebc984357ab03",
              "duration_seconds": 80.744,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Itugma ang paliwanag sa produkto",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Hindi iisang polisiya ang ginagamit sa lahat ng produkto.",
                  "start_ms": 2780,
                  "end_ms": 7180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Para sa infant-formula samples para sa mga nanay, product poster sa BHS, at regalong kapalit ng promosyon sa unang sitwasyon, Milk Code ang batayan.",
                  "start_ms": 7480,
                  "end_ms": 20880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Kung prescription-medicine samples naman ang hinihiling na ipamigay ni Mimi sa mga pamilya, ibang paliwanag ang kailangan: “Hindi ko po maaaring ipamigay ang prescription samples sa publiko.",
                  "start_ms": 21180,
                  "end_ms": 33140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Sa pharmaceutical order, para sa licensed physicians at dentists ang mga sample sa ilalim ng mga tuntunin nito.",
                  "start_ms": 33440,
                  "end_ms": 41560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Idudulog ko ang detalye sa namamahala.”",
                  "start_ms": 41860,
                  "end_ms": 44860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Saklaw ng order ang prescription pharmaceutical products at medical devices.",
                  "start_ms": 45160,
                  "end_ms": 51000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "May kondisyong pinapayagang educational items at scientific activities; hindi ito awtomatikong pahintulot sa BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 51300,
                  "end_ms": 60020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Kung hindi tiyak ang produkto o kondisyon, sabihin ang hindi pa alam, huwag tumanggap habang tinitiyak, at humingi ng gabay.",
                  "start_ms": 60320,
                  "end_ms": 69600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Hindi ginagawang legal ng pagdulog ang ipinagbabawal na promosyon.",
                  "start_ms": 69900,
                  "end_ms": 74980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Tamang produkto, tamang batayan; huwag mag-imbento ng pahintulot.",
                  "start_ms": 75280,
                  "end_ms": 80680
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "refusal-check": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/refusal-check.en.5a4d0e0de768.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "5a4d0e0de768b3d23986e5902731af98baf9990f913217c4ab68c4cab5fa8add",
              "sha256": "1ee3a4b2e566e7ed31d3218c38c949880e247b833c2f39000cf273daf5e23c64",
              "duration_seconds": 33.254,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Practice a clear refusal",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A representative asks you to give prescription-medicine samples to families.",
                  "start_ms": 2740,
                  "end_ms": 7700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "There is a personal gift, and the visitor offers to leave the box while the midwife is away.",
                  "start_ms": 8000,
                  "end_ms": 14160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Choose a clear, respectful response within the BHW role.",
                  "start_ms": 14460,
                  "end_ms": 19300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Then practice it in your own words without taking the items.",
                  "start_ms": 19600,
                  "end_ms": 23920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "You do not need to memorize a law number.",
                  "start_ms": 24220,
                  "end_ms": 27180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Acknowledge, decline, explain the correct basis, and report.",
                  "start_ms": 27480,
                  "end_ms": 33200
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/refusal-check.fil.81dd6a33a4c6.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "81dd6a33a4c64428412d0d04d4835d2abc69a60086d49fa858f86dc97a678a12",
              "sha256": "03a45390826c864550d125894fedf6942678ebb7e2deb9096c244aaf7b084d8f",
              "duration_seconds": 40.229,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Isagawa ang malinaw na pagtanggi",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Isang kinatawan ang humihiling na ipamigay mo sa mga pamilya ang prescription-medicine samples.",
                  "start_ms": 2860,
                  "end_ms": 9500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "May personal na regalo at sinasabing puwedeng iwan ang box habang wala ang midwife.",
                  "start_ms": 9800,
                  "end_ms": 16760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Piliin ang tugong malinaw, magalang, at nasa tungkulin ng BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 17060,
                  "end_ms": 23340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Pagkatapos, sabihin ito sa sariling pananalita nang hindi kumukuha ng mga bagay.",
                  "start_ms": 23640,
                  "end_ms": 29680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Hindi kailangang kabisaduhin ang numero ng batas.",
                  "start_ms": 29980,
                  "end_ms": 33700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Magpasalamat, tumanggi, ipaliwanag ang tamang batayan, at mag-ulat.",
                  "start_ms": 34000,
                  "end_ms": 40160
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "report-facts": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/report-facts.en.fabcb91ce467.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "fabcb91ce467cf9560bc6becc5c7f13b48febb542740c7f5d26a28e41209e892",
              "sha256": "6391b8a46f548bf68ff118e4361bd0f3d0cb3d3a0447bf6bf3660e934bba1fea",
              "duration_seconds": 64.679,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Report what happened",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "After the conversation, Mimi informs the midwife or facility supervisor through the local process.",
                  "start_ms": 2180,
                  "end_ms": 8820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "In this fictional example, she reports that day.",
                  "start_ms": 9120,
                  "end_ms": 12640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "This is not a new legal deadline.",
                  "start_ms": 12940,
                  "end_ms": 15900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "She says: “A representative offered infant-formula samples for mothers, a BHS poster, and a gift for promotion.",
                  "start_ms": 16200,
                  "end_ms": 25080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "I declined and accepted, displayed, and distributed nothing.",
                  "start_ms": 25380,
                  "end_ms": 31100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "I said I would tell you the details.”",
                  "start_ms": 31400,
                  "end_ms": 34080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "If a record is required, include the time, place, product, offer, requested activity, and her response.",
                  "start_ms": 34380,
                  "end_ms": 42940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Follow local rules for handling records; omit patient data and guesses about motives.",
                  "start_ms": 43240,
                  "end_ms": 49240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Ask the supervisor to determine the next step.",
                  "start_ms": 49540,
                  "end_ms": 52580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "Do not blame families for feeding choices; a health professional handles feeding or clinical questions.",
                  "start_ms": 52880,
                  "end_ms": 60280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Report the facts and your response, without speculation.",
                  "start_ms": 60580,
                  "end_ms": 64620
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/report-facts.fil.5fffc6a0fd04.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "5fffc6a0fd045452365f7e3d6fbf0ce6f30c3daddd610951fe388292c113ff54",
              "sha256": "57c28e65eeef075a09d6aa8ccb106ec04cb212cedb1759426b674e8f136d6eb5",
              "duration_seconds": 75.128,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ipabatid ang nangyari",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pagkatapos ng usapan, ipinaalam ni Mimi sa midwife o namamahala ang pagbisita ayon sa lokal na proseso.",
                  "start_ms": 2140,
                  "end_ms": 9860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sa kathang-isip na halimbawang ito, nag-ulat siya sa araw ding iyon.",
                  "start_ms": 10160,
                  "end_ms": 16120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Hindi ito bagong legal na deadline.",
                  "start_ms": 16420,
                  "end_ms": 19580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Sinabi niya: “May kinatawang nag-alok ng infant-formula samples para sa mga nanay, poster sa BHS, at regalo kapalit ng promosyon.",
                  "start_ms": 19880,
                  "end_ms": 30720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Tumanggi ako at walang tinanggap, ipinaskil, o ipinamahagi.",
                  "start_ms": 31020,
                  "end_ms": 36860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Sinabi kong ipapaalam ko ang detalye sa inyo.”",
                  "start_ms": 37160,
                  "end_ms": 40760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Kung kailangan ng tala, ilagay ang oras, lugar, produkto, alok, hinihinging gawain, at sariling tugon.",
                  "start_ms": 41060,
                  "end_ms": 50100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Sundin ang lokal na patakaran sa paghawak ng tala; huwag isama ang datos ng pasyente o haka-haka sa motibo.",
                  "start_ms": 50400,
                  "end_ms": 58080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Ipatukoy ang susunod na hakbang sa namamahala.",
                  "start_ms": 58380,
                  "end_ms": 61780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "Huwag sisihin ang mga pamilya sa feeding choices; health professional ang sasagot sa feeding o clinical questions.",
                  "start_ms": 62080,
                  "end_ms": 69680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Mag-ulat ng katotohanan at sariling tugon, hindi haka-haka.",
                  "start_ms": 69980,
                  "end_ms": 75060
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-4": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/section-4.en.d072d01cdd2c.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "d072d01cdd2caa5995e9f2fcc98d76d642f6587a8c7492996cceb66a579f68c0",
              "sha256": "2623ce414c7e32f986d6a0bf3bc46912ed15492259704e3ae1c20625a156d7ab",
              "duration_seconds": 60.813,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Clear and respectful",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The company representative returns to the BHS with infant-formula samples for mothers, a product poster, and a personal gift in return for promotion.",
                  "start_ms": 2540,
                  "end_ms": 14420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Mimi knows she will decline this offer.",
                  "start_ms": 14720,
                  "end_ms": 17880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "How can she say no respectfully?",
                  "start_ms": 18180,
                  "end_ms": 21060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Mimi says: “Thank you for coming.",
                  "start_ms": 21360,
                  "end_ms": 24320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "I will not accept the samples or gift, or display the product poster.",
                  "start_ms": 24620,
                  "end_ms": 30100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "This falls under the Milk Code: the facility cannot be used for this promotion, and an inducement for promotion cannot be accepted.",
                  "start_ms": 30400,
                  "end_ms": 39440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "I will tell our midwife or facility supervisor the details.”",
                  "start_ms": 39740,
                  "end_ms": 43780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "She does not take the items, assume the visitor’s motives, or promise permission later.",
                  "start_ms": 44080,
                  "end_ms": 49960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "The story is optional; you can complete Read or Slides without watching it.",
                  "start_ms": 50260,
                  "end_ms": 54660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Use a respectful tone, a clear refusal, and a specific reason.",
                  "start_ms": 54960,
                  "end_ms": 60760
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/section-4.fil.dda983cbd882.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "dda983cbd882820af3ec8d6815f25d8ae41f3480def3853348d694786cb660b6",
              "sha256": "66fe9d0663ac5ad622ca2ed91b3412ad70af9a0fd970cb359ea571580359f6ff",
              "duration_seconds": 68.728,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Malinaw at magalang",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Bumalik ang kinatawan ng kumpanya sa BHS.",
                  "start_ms": 2500,
                  "end_ms": 6140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "May infant-formula samples para sa mga nanay, product poster, at personal na regalong kapalit ng tulong sa promosyon.",
                  "start_ms": 6440,
                  "end_ms": 16040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Alam ni Mimi na hindi niya tatanggapin ang alok na ito.",
                  "start_ms": 16340,
                  "end_ms": 20100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Paano niya sasabihin ang hindi nang may paggalang?",
                  "start_ms": 20400,
                  "end_ms": 24400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Sinabi ni Mimi: “Salamat po sa pagpunta.",
                  "start_ms": 24700,
                  "end_ms": 28460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Hindi ko po tatanggapin ang mga sample at regalo o ipapaskil ang product poster.",
                  "start_ms": 28760,
                  "end_ms": 33880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Saklaw ito ng Milk Code: hindi ginagamit ang pasilidad para sa ganitong promosyon, at hindi tinatanggap ang insentibong kapalit ng pagpromote.",
                  "start_ms": 34180,
                  "end_ms": 43660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Ipapaalam ko ang detalye sa aming midwife o namamahala.”",
                  "start_ms": 43960,
                  "end_ms": 48560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Hindi niya kinukuha ang mga bagay, ipinapalagay ang motibo ng bisita, o nangangakong may pahintulot mamaya.",
                  "start_ms": 48860,
                  "end_ms": 57300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "Opsyonal ang kuwento; maaari mong tapusin ang Read o Slides nang hindi nanonood.",
                  "start_ms": 57600,
                  "end_ms": 63120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Magalang na tono, malinaw na hindi, at tiyak na dahilan.",
                  "start_ms": 63420,
                  "end_ms": 68660
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "section-7": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/section-7.en.611351ff6c6b.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "611351ff6c6b8860ed38caac4f51f7152b16ec739769fba143d24feba3f3166f",
              "sha256": "7c73b0730e338c0ae98710b8b04ca142c380618086dac261ac3095afbf919949",
              "duration_seconds": 58.802,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Compare two responses",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Both responses concern the same infant-formula offer.",
                  "start_ms": 2260,
                  "end_ms": 6700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Danilo accepts the samples for mothers and gift because “saying no might be rude.”",
                  "start_ms": 7000,
                  "end_ms": 12080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "He suggests distributing them outside instead.",
                  "start_ms": 12380,
                  "end_ms": 16780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Accepting and arranging an alternative cross the boundary; a polite tone does not correct that.",
                  "start_ms": 17080,
                  "end_ms": 22920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Mimi thanks the visitor, clearly declines the samples, gift, and poster, explains the Milk Code as it applies to the offer, and makes no alternative promotional arrangement.",
                  "start_ms": 23220,
                  "end_ms": 35940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "She informs the supervisor of the facts.",
                  "start_ms": 36240,
                  "end_ms": 39200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "In the medicine-sample situation, she would use the pharmaceutical explanation, not the Milk Code.",
                  "start_ms": 39500,
                  "end_ms": 46460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "A good response combines respect, an accurate reason, and actions consistent with the refusal.",
                  "start_ms": 46760,
                  "end_ms": 54160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Polite words are insufficient if the offer is still accepted.",
                  "start_ms": 54460,
                  "end_ms": 58740
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-decline/section-7.fil.c32dbc7a35d1.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "c32dbc7a35d11e882ba653e3f0e8d8fa39ca1e457e5e34240f0f818f662d19bc",
              "sha256": "23e7775ab4d3b2cd2e8c0e6bb9b0bd682a337f6b266b876e83944d2195525036",
              "duration_seconds": 62.433,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ihambing ang dalawang tugon",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Parehong infant-formula offer ang pinag-uusapan.",
                  "start_ms": 2540,
                  "end_ms": 5940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Tinanggap ni Danilo ang mga sample para sa mga nanay at regalo dahil “baka bastos ang tumanggi.”",
                  "start_ms": 6240,
                  "end_ms": 13080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Sinabi niyang puwedeng sa labas na lang ipamigay.",
                  "start_ms": 13380,
                  "end_ms": 16740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Nalampasan ang hangganan sa mismong pagtanggap at kasunduan; hindi ito naitatama ng magalang na tono.",
                  "start_ms": 17040,
                  "end_ms": 25000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Si Mimi ay nagpasalamat sa pagbisita, malinaw na tumanggi sa mga sample, regalo, at poster, ipinaliwanag ang Milk Code na naaangkop sa alok, at walang iminungkahing kapalit na promosyon.",
                  "start_ms": 25300,
                  "end_ms": 38860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ipinaalam niya ang katotohanan sa namamahala.",
                  "start_ms": 39160,
                  "end_ms": 42520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Sa medicine-sample situation, gagamit siya ng pharmaceutical explanation, hindi Milk Code.",
                  "start_ms": 42820,
                  "end_ms": 50020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Ang magandang tugon ay may paggalang, tamang dahilan, at kilos na tugma sa sinabi.",
                  "start_ms": 50320,
                  "end_ms": 57440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Hindi sapat ang magalang na salita kung tinatanggap pa rin ang alok.",
                  "start_ms": 57740,
                  "end_ms": 62380
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "bhs-resources": [
      {
        "module": "03-polisiya-bhs",
        "sections": {
          "section-5": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-resources/section-5.en.cf26520623c3.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "cf26520623c3eacbd4f28bbd1c316d13afe7f8454624c2c7bf9329f7b8746aab",
              "sha256": "4b61d896181dd12a7ffd2257a28e480a7d04285ba1d16b61c4bbc77b1c896391",
              "duration_seconds": 59.063,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Other policies and using resources efficiently",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 4000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Beyond the four policies you just learned, this competency — *practice entrepreneurial skills in the workplace* — also covers a broader skill: knowing the workplace's policies and structure, finding ways to make electricity, water, and supplies use more efficient, and being resourceful in the face of limited resources.",
                  "start_ms": 4300,
                  "end_ms": 26580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "This isn't separate from the four policies — it's the same skill: the ability to look at a situation, spot a better way, and explain it clearly to others.",
                  "start_ms": 26880,
                  "end_ms": 38240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Declining the offer to Corazon is one way of using it; proposing a more efficient way to use resources is another.",
                  "start_ms": 38540,
                  "end_ms": 47740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The same skill — spotting a better way and explaining it clearly — is what's used both to decline an offer and to propose a change at the workplace.",
                  "start_ms": 48040,
                  "end_ms": 59000
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-resources/section-5.fil.23a79bbf85e6.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "23a79bbf85e6c92ab30a638373183802f70251b11b75c76cad598b4d401c1dfe",
              "sha256": "99d8ede6efbb6228877160cabe4fdeb4fc0bef3d031ac068b3ba060e7c307cbf",
              "duration_seconds": 70.583,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Iba pang polisiya at episyenteng paggamit ng resources",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 4680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Bukod sa apat na polisiyang natutunan mo, saklaw din ng kakayahang ito — *practice entrepreneurial skills in the workplace* — ang mas malawak na kasanayan: alamin ang mga polisiya at istruktura ng lugar ng trabaho, tumukoy ng paraan para gawing mas episyente ang paggamit ng kuryente, tubig, at gamit, at maging mapamaraan sa harap ng limitadong rekurso.",
                  "start_ms": 4980,
                  "end_ms": 30900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Hindi ito hiwalay sa apat na polisiya — kaparehong kasanayan ito: ang kakayahang tumingin sa isang sitwasyon, tumukoy ng mas mahusay na paraan, at maipaliwanag ito nang malinaw sa iba.",
                  "start_ms": 31200,
                  "end_ms": 45160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ang pagtanggi kay Corazon ay isang paraan ng paggamit nito; ang pagmungkahi ng mas episyenteng paraan ng paggamit ng resources ay isa pang paraan.",
                  "start_ms": 45460,
                  "end_ms": 56060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang parehong kasanayan — pagtukoy ng mas mahusay na paraan at pagpapaliwanag nito nang malinaw — ang gamit sa pagtanggi sa isang alok at sa pagmumungkahi ng pagbabago sa lugar ng trabaho.",
                  "start_ms": 56360,
                  "end_ms": 70520
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
