                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose the next step",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose an answer and explain why before viewing the feedback.",
                  "start_ms": 2100,
                  "end_ms": 6940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Then compare it with your own practice attempt.",
                  "start_ms": 7240,
                  "end_ms": 10720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A clear question elicits information rather than the answer we expect.",
                  "start_ms": 11020,
                  "end_ms": 16860
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-clarify/check.fil.58fde8ae9c90.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "58fde8ae9c902e48aadc341cd2f027eb3116598d78f8cc9ec9b742d0dd923aab",
              "sha256": "41ab14aa55dc122efa8e837f9cbea14a243f65ee411e1bb353b26a581c591bee",
              "duration_seconds": 20.297,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang susunod na hakbang",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang sagot at ipaliwanag kung bakit bago tingnan ang feedback.",
                  "start_ms": 3220,
                  "end_ms": 8380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Pagkatapos, ihambing sa sarili mong ginawa sa pagsasanay.",
                  "start_ms": 8680,
                  "end_ms": 13480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang malinaw na tanong ay naglalabas ng impormasyon, hindi ng sagot na gusto nating marinig.",
                  "start_ms": 13780,
                  "end_ms": 20220
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "open-question": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-clarify/open-question.en.2204e0aa0cc7.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "2204e0aa0cc7b7a59d5e73070b387b9f990a6a68313afbf18bd33804bba10acf",
              "sha256": "e3f8dca1e664d27661bf1db3d4b6274a14ba7d978311561825acb34fbbc39b8c",
              "duration_seconds": 48.98,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Open first, then clarify",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Liza, 29, missed a health-center visit because of childcare barriers.",
                  "start_ms": 3060,
                  "end_ms": 9060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "BHW Gibs is finding out what happened.",
                  "start_ms": 9360,
                  "end_ms": 13320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "“Why don’t you follow instructions?”",
                  "start_ms": 13620,
                  "end_ms": 16340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "sounds like an accusation.",
                  "start_ms": 16640,
                  "end_ms": 19000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "“What makes it hard to attend?”",
                  "start_ms": 19300,
                  "end_ms": 21780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "invites an explanation.",
                  "start_ms": 22080,
                  "end_ms": 24320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Follow an open question with focused clarification: “When was your last visit?”",
                  "start_ms": 24620,
                  "end_ms": 30700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Yes-or-no questions are useful when confirming one detail.",
                  "start_ms": 31000,
                  "end_ms": 35520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Avoid asking three questions at once or putting the answer into the person’s mouth.",
                  "start_ms": 35820,
                  "end_ms": 42140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Use open questions for the story and focused questions to clarify information.",
                  "start_ms": 42440,
                  "end_ms": 48920
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-clarify/open-question.fil.993ca87f7911.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "993ca87f791195f00348b7580ba754b4109a8d73547cabc31a2503a010814f3a",
              "sha256": "be238d1220d6fc4a507486a4211e12b2b8fc93e133f63950781aecc4b759ab2b",
              "duration_seconds": 55.719,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Bukas muna, saka linawin",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Si Liza, 29, ay hindi nakapunta sa health center dahil may hadlang sa pag-aalaga ng anak.",
                  "start_ms": 3300,
                  "end_ms": 11380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Inaalam ni BHW Gibs kung ano ang nangyari.",
                  "start_ms": 11680,
                  "end_ms": 16320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "“Bakit hindi ka sumusunod?”",
                  "start_ms": 16620,
                  "end_ms": 19180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "ay paratang na tanong.",
                  "start_ms": 19480,
                  "end_ms": 21920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Mas makakatulong ang “Ano ang nagpapahirap sa pagpunta mo?”",
                  "start_ms": 22220,
                  "end_ms": 27460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Pagkatapos ng bukas na tanong, gumamit ng tiyak na paglilinaw: “Kailan ka huling nakapunta?”",
                  "start_ms": 27760,
                  "end_ms": 35240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Hindi masama ang tanong na oo o hindi kung isang detalye ang kailangang kumpirmahin.",
                  "start_ms": 35540,
                  "end_ms": 41900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Iwasan ang tatlong tanong na magkakasabay at ang sagot na isinusubo na sa kausap.",
                  "start_ms": 42200,
                  "end_ms": 48800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Bukas na tanong para sa kuwento; tiyak na tanong para sa paglilinaw ng impormasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 49100,
                  "end_ms": 55660
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "practice": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-clarify/practice.en.79c5e81faec8.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "79c5e81faec82b905e0c2de40abf469fe3794936f94b653fd7f5d6ec2555a984",
              "sha256": "cdd8b02831b3703c2b2550140f8110810437ac48b15d414f8ae2bd731550b538",
              "duration_seconds": 36.493,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Try it, then repeat",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Replace “Why don’t you follow instructions?”",
                  "start_ms": 2860,
                  "end_ms": 6500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "with an open question.",
                  "start_ms": 6800,
                  "end_ms": 9040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Your partner replies, “I have nobody with me.”",
                  "start_ms": 9340,
                  "end_ms": 12980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Clarify whether this means a travel companion or someone to watch the children, then check your summary.",
                  "start_ms": 13280,
                  "end_ms": 20440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Alone, write and read the three lines aloud.",
                  "start_ms": 20740,
                  "end_ms": 24740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "At the next visit, clarify one ambiguous answer before recording it.",
                  "start_ms": 25040,
                  "end_ms": 30840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A clear question elicits information rather than the answer we expect.",
                  "start_ms": 31140,
                  "end_ms": 36420
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-clarify/practice.fil.b1e4b5dc8e84.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "b1e4b5dc8e8448bade5131e5cd4e6ba80bc5d3c62480e28d6b72da9756688bbc",
              "sha256": "436bda070e7c7544f949bbc7f8c79e2d9108a057f526ff0d278d91c982c5f49f",
              "duration_seconds": 39.915,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Subukan, saka ulitin",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Palitan ang “Bakit hindi ka sumusunod?”",
                  "start_ms": 2940,
                  "end_ms": 6580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "ng isang bukas na tanong.",
                  "start_ms": 6880,
                  "end_ms": 9000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ang kapareha ay sasagot: “Wala akong kasama.”",
                  "start_ms": 9300,
                  "end_ms": 13420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Linawin kung kasama sa biyahe o magbabantay sa anak ang ibig sabihin, saka ipasuri ang iyong buod.",
                  "start_ms": 13720,
                  "end_ms": 21680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Kung mag-isa, isulat ang tatlong linya at basahin nang malakas.",
                  "start_ms": 21980,
                  "end_ms": 27020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Sa susunod na pagbisita, maglinaw ng isang malabong sagot bago magtala.",
                  "start_ms": 27320,
                  "end_ms": 33400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang malinaw na tanong ay naglalabas ng impormasyon, hindi ng sagot na gusto nating marinig.",
                  "start_ms": 33700,
                  "end_ms": 39860
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "module": "06-komunikasyon",
        "sections": {
          "barriers": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-clarify/barriers.en.176efec8fc44.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "176efec8fc44ebccbbb7931d3e5e6eb038d7f08cee5e7fc37678ec41aa4a527a",
              "sha256": "46bfc1623289d87f35d9ea453890a2f68dd74cfcb8d27d64871c2416982b2826",
              "duration_seconds": 69.773,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Clarify barriers without judging the person",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "In Liza’s own account, nobody could watch her child that day.",
                  "start_ms": 3580,
                  "end_ms": 7580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "This differs from the neighbor’s claim, “She just does not want to go.”",
                  "start_ms": 7880,
                  "end_ms": 12560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "That is the neighbor’s statement, not Liza’s confirmed explanation.",
                  "start_ms": 12860,
                  "end_ms": 17420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "“Which part of getting there was difficult?”",
                  "start_ms": 17720,
                  "end_ms": 20480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Gibs asks.",
                  "start_ms": 20780,
                  "end_ms": 22180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Timing, childcare, language or access may be barriers; let the person explain.",
                  "start_ms": 22480,
                  "end_ms": 29520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Do not turn possibilities into a list of expected answers.",
                  "start_ms": 29820,
                  "end_ms": 34380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "The Rosario case in Module 7 connects poverty, service gaps and misinformation.",
                  "start_ms": 34680,
                  "end_ms": 41120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "First clarify what the family was told, then separately ask what prevented them from getting help.",
                  "start_ms": 41420,
                  "end_ms": 47860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "A barrier does not prove laziness or disobedience.",
                  "start_ms": 48160,
                  "end_ms": 52480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 10,
                  "text": "Ask only for details relevant to the agreed task.",
                  "start_ms": 52780,
                  "end_ms": 56660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 11,
                  "text": "Do not promise childcare, transport or an appointment that has not been confirmed.",
                  "start_ms": 56960,
                  "end_ms": 63320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A service barrier is information; distinguish the person’s account from what others say.",
                  "start_ms": 63620,
                  "end_ms": 69700
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-clarify/barriers.fil.94792199bf7d.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "94792199bf7d58b91f43625dd5d3f4db2cb463e9036f4bb13a629c47803f5899",
              "sha256": "afae05b0c888278966fe2d0607a36d0554bc14af8b8be89b02da1db5ae13e270",
              "duration_seconds": 77.479,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Hadlang ang linawin, hindi pagkatao ang husgahan",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 4240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Sa sariling kuwento ni Liza, walang magbabantay sa anak noong araw na iyon.",
                  "start_ms": 4540,
                  "end_ms": 9500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Iba ito sa sabi ng kapitbahay na “Ayaw lang niyang pumunta.”",
                  "start_ms": 9800,
                  "end_ms": 14200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Sabi iyon ng kapitbahay, hindi kinumpirmang paliwanag ni Liza.",
                  "start_ms": 14500,
                  "end_ms": 19500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "“Aling bahagi po ng pagpunta ang naging mahirap?”",
                  "start_ms": 19800,
                  "end_ms": 23280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "tanong ni Gibs.",
                  "start_ms": 23580,
                  "end_ms": 25220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Maaaring oras, pag-aalaga, wika o pag-abot sa serbisyo ang hadlang; hayaang ang kausap ang magsabi.",
                  "start_ms": 25520,
                  "end_ms": 34440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Huwag gawing listahan ng inaasahang sagot ang mga posibilidad.",
                  "start_ms": 34740,
                  "end_ms": 39100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Sa kasong Rosario sa Modyul 7, magkakaugnay ang kahirapan, kakulangan sa serbisyo at maling impormasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 39400,
                  "end_ms": 47880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Linawin muna kung ano ang sinabi sa pamilya, saka hiwalay na itanong kung ano ang pumigil sa pagkuha ng tulong.",
                  "start_ms": 48180,
                  "end_ms": 55540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "Hindi patunay ng katamaran o pagsuway ang hadlang.",
                  "start_ms": 55840,
                  "end_ms": 59920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 10,
                  "text": "Kunin lamang ang kaugnay na detalye para sa napagkasunduang gawain.",
                  "start_ms": 60220,
                  "end_ms": 64900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 11,
                  "text": "Huwag mangako ng childcare, sasakyan o appointment na hindi pa nakumpirma.",
                  "start_ms": 65200,
                  "end_ms": 71000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang hadlang sa serbisyo ay impormasyon; ihiwalay ang sariling kuwento sa sabi ng iba.",
                  "start_ms": 71300,
                  "end_ms": 77420
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "check": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-clarify/check.en.af6c718b883d.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "af6c718b883d3da106b18e1f99649633515177997d5ff593aea5f9bde2ad79be",
              "sha256": "9ccd1b665e76642be503d08edb9bd72de201c059f9b4effc21781e0f06d469a2",
              "duration_seconds": 29.675,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose the next step",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Liza says, “That day did not work.”",
                  "start_ms": 1980,
                  "end_ms": 5300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Gibs listens with his clipboard closed.",
                  "start_ms": 5600,
                  "end_ms": 8920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "He does not yet know what happened; no solution has been promised.",
                  "start_ms": 9220,
                  "end_ms": 13860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Look at the scene, choose the next question and explain your reason before viewing feedback.",
                  "start_ms": 14160,
                  "end_ms": 19880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Then compare your decision with your own practice attempt.",
                  "start_ms": 20180,
                  "end_ms": 23700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A clear question elicits information rather than the answer we expect.",
                  "start_ms": 24000,
                  "end_ms": 29600
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-clarify/check.fil.2bf3d8e7f9e8.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "2bf3d8e7f9e85a5f1be4939cb05a8ef8e1fe44db1e2616d022178346315d9428",
              "sha256": "7fb3129644195466a10d389e3c5aafedc3c87eb2dfbb0866067d4ee261fbfbcc",
              "duration_seconds": 33.332,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang susunod na hakbang",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Sinabi ni Liza, “Hindi puwede noong araw na iyon.”",
                  "start_ms": 2740,
                  "end_ms": 6300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Nakikinig si Gibs at nakasara ang clipboard niya.",
                  "start_ms": 6600,
                  "end_ms": 9840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Hindi pa alam ni Gibs kung ano ang nangyari; wala pang ipinangakong solusyon.",
                  "start_ms": 10140,
                  "end_ms": 15340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Tingnan ang tagpo, piliin ang susunod na tanong at ipaliwanag ang dahilan bago tingnan ang feedback.",
                  "start_ms": 15640,
                  "end_ms": 21920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Pagkatapos, ihambing ang pasya sa sarili mong ginawa sa pagsasanay.",
                  "start_ms": 22220,
                  "end_ms": 26940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang malinaw na tanong ay naglalabas ng impormasyon, hindi ng sagot na gusto nating marinig.",
                  "start_ms": 27240,
                  "end_ms": 33280
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "clarify-detail": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-clarify/clarify-detail.en.f86356902ad6.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "f86356902ad6814c04e63f511a767b154d894f2eb3933057aafd5c022583d954",
              "sha256": "64c2cf8e94f453d755eaf4570b4e4e9a81d0f9ca567d7fb1a97fb5e80b597dea",
              "duration_seconds": 60.761,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "What does “with me” mean?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "“I had nobody with me” is still unclear to Gibs.",
                  "start_ms": 3380,
                  "end_ms": 7300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "“Do you mean someone to travel with you?”",
                  "start_ms": 7600,
                  "end_ms": 10480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "he asks.",
                  "start_ms": 10780,
                  "end_ms": 12140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "“No.",
                  "start_ms": 12440,
                  "end_ms": 13520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Someone to watch my child,” Liza corrects him.",
                  "start_ms": 13820,
                  "end_ms": 17380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "“Thank you for clarifying,” Gibs replies.",
                  "start_ms": 17680,
                  "end_ms": 20680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "He does not insist on his first interpretation.",
                  "start_ms": 20980,
                  "end_ms": 24380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "“What do you mean by with me?”",
                  "start_ms": 24680,
                  "end_ms": 27320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "is another useful question when the meaning is uncertain.",
                  "start_ms": 27620,
                  "end_ms": 31860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "Ask one question at a time; do not request the date, time and reason all at once.",
                  "start_ms": 32160,
                  "end_ms": 38760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 10,
                  "text": "If relevant to the agreed task, follow with “When was that?”",
                  "start_ms": 39060,
                  "end_ms": 43740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 11,
                  "text": "or “When was your last visit?”",
                  "start_ms": 44040,
                  "end_ms": 46560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 12,
                  "text": "Do not guess a date the person cannot remember.",
                  "start_ms": 46860,
                  "end_ms": 50060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 13,
                  "text": "In this story, first clarify who was unavailable and what their role was.",
                  "start_ms": 50360,
                  "end_ms": 56040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The person can correct your understanding; accept the correction.",
                  "start_ms": 56340,
                  "end_ms": 60700
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-clarify/clarify-detail.fil.094f4dd6667e.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "094f4dd6667e29f418333a6319d2912916d014a55af573547c21c741ebc4d93a",
              "sha256": "365a172a49c2f0da259c4c3f6098a18fa388271a368a592daeaaf8f7c4f96117",
              "duration_seconds": 63.295,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ano ang ibig sabihin ng “kasama”?",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Hindi pa malinaw kay Gibs ang “Wala akong kasama.”",
                  "start_ms": 3100,
                  "end_ms": 6940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "“Kasama po ba sa biyahe ang ibig ninyo?”",
                  "start_ms": 7240,
                  "end_ms": 9720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "tanong niya.",
                  "start_ms": 10020,
                  "end_ms": 11260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "“Hindi po.",
                  "start_ms": 11560,
                  "end_ms": 13000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Magbabantay sa anak ko,” pagwawasto ni Liza.",
                  "start_ms": 13300,
                  "end_ms": 17300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "“Salamat po sa paglilinaw,” tugon ni Gibs.",
                  "start_ms": 17600,
                  "end_ms": 20840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Hindi niya ipinilit ang unang pagkaintindi.",
                  "start_ms": 21140,
                  "end_ms": 24180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Maaari ring itanong ang “Ano po ang ibig ninyong sabihin sa kasama?”",
                  "start_ms": 24480,
                  "end_ms": 29400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "kung hindi pa tiyak ang kahulugan.",
                  "start_ms": 29700,
                  "end_ms": 31860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "Isa-isahin ang tanong; huwag sabay na hingin ang petsa, oras at dahilan.",
                  "start_ms": 32160,
                  "end_ms": 38200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 10,
                  "text": "Kung kailangan sa napagkasunduang gawain, saka itanong ang “Kailan po iyon?”",
                  "start_ms": 38500,
                  "end_ms": 44340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 11,
                  "text": "o “Kailan po kayo huling nakapunta?”",
                  "start_ms": 44640,
                  "end_ms": 47800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 12,
                  "text": "Huwag hulaan ang petsang hindi maalala.",
                  "start_ms": 48100,
                  "end_ms": 51100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 13,
                  "text": "Sa kuwentong ito, ang kailangang linawin muna ay kung sino ang wala at ano ang papel niya.",
                  "start_ms": 51400,
                  "end_ms": 57720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Puwedeng iwasto ng kausap ang pagkaintindi mo; tanggapin ang pagwawasto.",
                  "start_ms": 58020,
                  "end_ms": 63220
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "confirm-summary": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-clarify/confirm-summary.en.67bd44b15079.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "67bd44b150795a9a52f05c008dd54d3b67724e7c76ec394182c85bef635c6afb",
              "sha256": "634628decdd9b5cd62ed5f619cc6fba17f8480007064e5a6d5f2f257376e5da8",
              "duration_seconds": 71.706,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Offer the summary as a question",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "“Have I understood correctly: getting there is always difficult because nobody can watch your child?”",
                  "start_ms": 2340,
                  "end_ms": 9420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Gibs asks.",
                  "start_ms": 9720,
                  "end_ms": 11200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "“Not always.",
                  "start_ms": 11500,
                  "end_ms": 12980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Only when my sister is away,” Liza corrects him.",
                  "start_ms": 13280,
                  "end_ms": 17360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "“When your sister is away, it is difficult to find someone to watch your child.",
                  "start_ms": 17660,
                  "end_ms": 22900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Is that right?”",
                  "start_ms": 23200,
                  "end_ms": 24360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "“Yes,” she confirms.",
                  "start_ms": 24660,
                  "end_ms": 27020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Gibs removes always from his summary.",
                  "start_ms": 27320,
                  "end_ms": 30640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "“Would you like us to check the current service hours?”",
                  "start_ms": 30940,
                  "end_ms": 34060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "he offers.",
                  "start_ms": 34360,
                  "end_ms": 35680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 10,
                  "text": "Liza agrees to check the hours first; she does not yet know when she can attend.",
                  "start_ms": 35980,
                  "end_ms": 40940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 11,
                  "text": "This is a confirmed next step, not a promise of an appointment or childcare.",
                  "start_ms": 41240,
                  "end_ms": 46960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 12,
                  "text": "Return a brief relevant summary, not every private detail.",
                  "start_ms": 47260,
                  "end_ms": 52140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 13,
                  "text": "Use information for the authorized purpose under local policy.",
                  "start_ms": 52440,
                  "end_ms": 57480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 14,
                  "text": "If immediate help is needed, follow the local process; do not delay it to finish a routine conversation.",
                  "start_ms": 57780,
                  "end_ms": 65140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Summarize, invite correction, check the corrected summary and confirm the next step.",
                  "start_ms": 65440,
                  "end_ms": 71640
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-clarify/confirm-summary.fil.8a2f04493d0d.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "8a2f04493d0ddd13c08a788fb6d834262dbcd4a7e780bda451b73f8748e9a9af",
              "sha256": "319731e4567fa5e1213cc44771e55129fdef9b9f12c0bf3a9ac762d85bce8b87",
              "duration_seconds": 74.658,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ibalik ang buod bilang tanong",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "“Tama po ba: palaging mahirap pumunta dahil walang magbabantay?”",
                  "start_ms": 3020,
                  "end_ms": 8420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "tanong ni Gibs.",
                  "start_ms": 8720,
                  "end_ms": 10120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "“Hindi palagi.",
                  "start_ms": 10420,
                  "end_ms": 12100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Kapag wala lang ang kapatid ko,” pagwawasto ni Liza.",
                  "start_ms": 12400,
                  "end_ms": 16400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "“Kapag wala ang kapatid ninyo, mahirap makahanap ng magbabantay sa anak.",
                  "start_ms": 16700,
                  "end_ms": 22020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Tama po ba?”",
                  "start_ms": 22320,
                  "end_ms": 23560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "“Opo,” kinumpirma niya.",
                  "start_ms": 23860,
                  "end_ms": 25860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Tinanggal ni Gibs ang salitang palagi sa buod.",
                  "start_ms": 26160,
                  "end_ms": 29920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "“Gusto po ba ninyong alamin natin ang kasalukuyang oras ng serbisyo?”",
                  "start_ms": 30220,
                  "end_ms": 34500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "alok niya.",
                  "start_ms": 34800,
                  "end_ms": 35960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 10,
                  "text": "Pumayag si Liza na alamin muna ang oras; hindi pa tiyak kung kailan siya makakapunta.",
                  "start_ms": 36260,
                  "end_ms": 42540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 11,
                  "text": "Ito ang nakumpirmang susunod na hakbang, hindi pangako ng appointment o childcare.",
                  "start_ms": 42840,
                  "end_ms": 47720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 12,
                  "text": "Maikling kaugnay na buod lamang ang ibalik, hindi lahat ng pribadong detalye.",
                  "start_ms": 48020,
                  "end_ms": 53260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 13,
                  "text": "Gamitin ang impormasyon ayon sa awtorisadong layunin at lokal na patakaran.",
                  "start_ms": 53560,
                  "end_ms": 58880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 14,
                  "text": "Kung kailangan ng agarang tulong, sundin ang lokal na proseso; huwag ipagpaliban ito para tapusin ang karaniwang usapan.",
                  "start_ms": 59180,
                  "end_ms": 66660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ibuod, humingi ng pagwawasto, ibalik ang inayos na buod at kumpirmahin ang susunod na hakbang.",
                  "start_ms": 66960,
                  "end_ms": 74600
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "open-question": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-clarify/open-question.en.40bdea720436.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "40bdea720436aaf095d2cc7398db5b2ab081fe99d3e28bcfa436d9ef521dc321",
              "sha256": "57ba729e06d92768ccc8238d2f61be5a47a07c7ae39539bdeb458aeaad8811e5",
              "duration_seconds": 55.562,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Open first, then clarify",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Gibs, a male BHW, talks with Liza, 29, about her missed health-center visit.",
                  "start_ms": 3140,
                  "end_ms": 10220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "This story is fictional.",
                  "start_ms": 10520,
                  "end_ms": 12480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "They have already agreed on the purpose, language and a comfortable place.",
                  "start_ms": 12780,
                  "end_ms": 18140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "“What happened when you could not attend?”",
                  "start_ms": 18440,
                  "end_ms": 21000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Gibs asks.",
                  "start_ms": 21300,
                  "end_ms": 22940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "“I had nobody with me,” Liza replies.",
                  "start_ms": 23240,
                  "end_ms": 26120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "He gives her time to finish the story.",
                  "start_ms": 26420,
                  "end_ms": 28740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "“You mean you did not want to go?”",
                  "start_ms": 29040,
                  "end_ms": 31360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "already assumes a motive.",
                  "start_ms": 31660,
                  "end_ms": 34180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "An open invitation lets Liza describe events in her own words.",
                  "start_ms": 34480,
                  "end_ms": 39160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 10,
                  "text": "Then clarify one needed detail.",
                  "start_ms": 39460,
                  "end_ms": 42260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 11,
                  "text": "A yes-or-no answer can confirm a specific detail; it does not replace listening to the story.",
                  "start_ms": 42560,
                  "end_ms": 49400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Start with an open invitation, then ask one focused question without blame.",
                  "start_ms": 49700,
                  "end_ms": 55500
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-clarify/open-question.fil.7b38f9594d83.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "7b38f9594d83b96b6dc03b0efa4a3d74b1d77620772e17ca6f7d265cc1a746d9",
              "sha256": "87a88d0d0afbc9bdba3f84fae73d8d480fa385e6d89197d7dbf42e905a95155d",
              "duration_seconds": 65.332,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Bukas muna, saka linawin",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Si Gibs, lalaking BHW, ay nakikipag-usap kay Liza, 29 anyos, tungkol sa hindi niya pagpunta sa health center.",
                  "start_ms": 3100,
                  "end_ms": 12980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Kathang-isip ang kuwentong ito.",
                  "start_ms": 13280,
                  "end_ms": 15480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Napag-usapan na nila ang layunin, wika at komportableng lugar.",
                  "start_ms": 15780,
                  "end_ms": 20980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "“Ano po ang nangyari noong hindi kayo nakapunta?”",
                  "start_ms": 21280,
                  "end_ms": 24560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "tanong ni Gibs.",
                  "start_ms": 24860,
                  "end_ms": 26180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "“Wala akong kasama,” sagot ni Liza.",
                  "start_ms": 26480,
                  "end_ms": 30040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Nagbigay siya ng oras para matapos ang kuwento.",
                  "start_ms": 30340,
                  "end_ms": 33700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Ang “Ibig ninyong sabihin, ayaw ninyong pumunta?”",
                  "start_ms": 34000,
                  "end_ms": 38320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "ay may ipinapalagay nang motibo.",
                  "start_ms": 38620,
                  "end_ms": 41140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "Ang bukas na paanyaya ay nagbibigay kay Liza ng pagkakataong magsabi sa sarili niyang salita.",
                  "start_ms": 41440,
                  "end_ms": 47520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 10,
                  "text": "Saka lamang maglinaw ng isang kailangang detalye.",
                  "start_ms": 47820,
                  "end_ms": 51500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 11,
                  "text": "Maaaring oo o hindi ang sagot kung isang tiyak na detalye ang kinukumpirma; hindi ito kapalit ng pakikinig sa kuwento.",
                  "start_ms": 51800,
                  "end_ms": 59800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Bukas na paanyaya muna; saka isang tiyak at walang paratang na tanong.",
                  "start_ms": 60100,
                  "end_ms": 65260
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "practice": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-clarify/practice.en.b91dca7f0db7.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "b91dca7f0db71ce8d01a9f383a4b18f319669f17655d284e391e1c7d32feaa56",
              "sha256": "32a7b45f242c70afd01efbe98c109bd5bc5a55fcc0e5e5682c4d1a9a87d4ca87",
              "duration_seconds": 76.408,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Try it, then repeat",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Use fictional BHW, Liza and observer cards.",
                  "start_ms": 2420,
                  "end_ms": 7620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "In the first round, start with an open invitation.",
                  "start_ms": 7920,
                  "end_ms": 11360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Liza replies, “I have nobody with me.”",
                  "start_ms": 11660,
                  "end_ms": 15140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Clarify whether this means a travel companion or someone to watch her child, then ask her to check your summary.",
                  "start_ms": 15440,
                  "end_ms": 22840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "The observer records the exact question, answer and correction; do not guess a motive.",
                  "start_ms": 23140,
                  "end_ms": 29820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Repeat a step that needs support before rotating roles.",
                  "start_ms": 30120,
                  "end_ms": 34400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Across three rounds, everyone practices as the BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 34700,
                  "end_ms": 38860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "In the next round, clarify an ambiguous time; in the third, distinguish the neighbor’s claim from Liza’s own answer.",
                  "start_ms": 39160,
                  "end_ms": 47720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Alone, write and say the invitation, clarification and summary aloud, then use the question aid.",
                  "start_ms": 48020,
                  "end_ms": 55140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "Peer feedback is not a facilitator grade.",
                  "start_ms": 55440,
                  "end_ms": 58680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 10,
                  "text": "At the next authorized visit, clarify one ambiguous answer before recording it.",
                  "start_ms": 58980,
                  "end_ms": 65620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 11,
                  "text": "No real resident record or private account is uploaded for practice.",
                  "start_ms": 65920,
                  "end_ms": 70920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A clear question elicits information rather than the answer we expect.",
                  "start_ms": 71220,
                  "end_ms": 76340
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-clarify/practice.fil.a5ae164090dd.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "a5ae164090ddbce4d164be89f0b0eae1836bfabdac12c36e7b0922a15bb880f0",
              "sha256": "a7cb780164cda4febcc39db31a8102b288a53c1b774e64b3d2502742b38691c7",
              "duration_seconds": 81.894,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Subukan, saka ulitin",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Gamitin ang kathang-isip na cards para sa BHW, Liza at tagamasid.",
                  "start_ms": 2900,
                  "end_ms": 9420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sa unang round, magsimula sa bukas na paanyaya.",
                  "start_ms": 9720,
                  "end_ms": 13560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Sasagot si Liza ng “Wala akong kasama.”",
                  "start_ms": 13860,
                  "end_ms": 16900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Linawin kung kasama sa biyahe o magbabantay sa anak ang ibig sabihin, saka ipasuri ang iyong buod.",
                  "start_ms": 17200,
                  "end_ms": 25080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Itala ng tagamasid ang eksaktong tanong, sagot at pagwawasto; huwag hulaan ang motibo.",
                  "start_ms": 25380,
                  "end_ms": 32620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ulitin ang hakbang na nangangailangan ng tulong bago magpalit ng papel.",
                  "start_ms": 32920,
                  "end_ms": 37320
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Sa tatlong round, lahat ay susubok bilang BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 37620,
                  "end_ms": 42140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Sa susunod na round, linawin ang malabong oras; sa ikatlo, ihiwalay ang sabi ng kapitbahay sa sariling sagot ni Liza.",
                  "start_ms": 42440,
                  "end_ms": 51000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 8,
                  "text": "Kung mag-isa, isulat at sabihin nang malakas ang paanyaya, paglilinaw at buod, saka gamitin ang question aid.",
                  "start_ms": 51300,
                  "end_ms": 59260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 9,
                  "text": "Hindi grado ng facilitator ang peer feedback.",
                  "start_ms": 59560,
                  "end_ms": 62640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 10,
                  "text": "Sa susunod na awtorisadong pagbisita, maglinaw ng isang malabong sagot bago magtala.",
                  "start_ms": 62940,
                  "end_ms": 69420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 11,
                  "text": "Walang tunay na resident record o pribadong kuwentong ia-upload sa pagsasanay.",
                  "start_ms": 69720,
                  "end_ms": 75280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang malinaw na tanong ay naglalabas ng impormasyon, hindi ng sagot na gusto nating marinig.",
                  "start_ms": 75580,
                  "end_ms": 81820
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "communication-explain": [
      {
        "module": "06-komunikasyon",
        "sections": {
          "check": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/check.en.f68caa9602d5.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "f68caa9602d5d11cb16bce1ac16129f35a290b22d561f4abd4858b5e0aaea48a",
              "sha256": "acf3dc9e641d85697a5d607d353ae64453154034616143d5f720b29ba371cd95",
              "duration_seconds": 18.834,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose the next step",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose an answer and explain why before viewing the feedback.",
                  "start_ms": 2300,
                  "end_ms": 7260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Then compare it with your own practice attempt.",
                  "start_ms": 7560,
                  "end_ms": 11160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Hear the concern and check the clarity of your explanation while staying within the BHW role.",
                  "start_ms": 11460,
                  "end_ms": 18780
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/check.fil.c165e162ab54.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "c165e162ab54ee3da2e4b813b878f30bdccbfdcac1d5d9647f565812462498de",
              "sha256": "6b3f70e80dc2028fd969d968b4aa59a81ed6c6d4bf02dfe1e9b3a4b51b040a5c",
              "duration_seconds": 22.883,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang susunod na hakbang",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang sagot at ipaliwanag kung bakit bago tingnan ang feedback.",
                  "start_ms": 3180,
                  "end_ms": 8420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Pagkatapos, ihambing sa sarili mong ginawa sa pagsasanay.",
                  "start_ms": 8720,
                  "end_ms": 13520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pakinggan ang concern at suriin ang linaw ng sariling paliwanag, habang nananatili sa saklaw ng BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 13820,
                  "end_ms": 22820
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "distress": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/distress.en.303e4c2052ec.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "303e4c2052ecee09bbe21cd7290f73e7811e842680a83a01624bdfe82bc65340",
              "sha256": "33decf957af7d130623ce483a0efe043a41740dada8daa27e30f049de4d9d92a",
              "duration_seconds": 44.278,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "When someone feels overwhelmed",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ben, 37, says he has felt low for several weeks.",
                  "start_ms": 3020,
                  "end_ms": 7700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "A possible opening is, “Thank you for telling me.",
                  "start_ms": 8000,
                  "end_ms": 11880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "What feels hardest right now?”",
                  "start_ms": 12180,
                  "end_ms": 14580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Listen privately and help him reach a health professional; avoid saying “just think happy thoughts” or assigning a diagnosis.",
                  "start_ms": 14880,
                  "end_ms": 24600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "If there is immediate danger to safety, follow the local emergency referral protocol at once.",
                  "start_ms": 24900,
                  "end_ms": 31940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Do not promise to conceal danger from people who need to help.",
                  "start_ms": 32240,
                  "end_ms": 36560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Listening offers support; diagnosis and clinical care belong with a qualified health professional.",
                  "start_ms": 36860,
                  "end_ms": 44220
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/distress.fil.ead03843859b.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "ead03843859b8fbb6836d4ef005c7af6ce9d1b7a0313eaa3f5a77719e9e90926",
              "sha256": "325c0e940b094315594cebee76ca805dbc4041a7bac46cc5e3266233048db545",
              "duration_seconds": 50.991,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Kapag mabigat ang nararamdaman",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Si Ben, 37 anyos, ay nagsasabing ilang linggo na siyang malungkot.",
                  "start_ms": 2860,
                  "end_ms": 8820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "“Salamat sa pagsabi.",
                  "start_ms": 9120,
                  "end_ms": 10920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ano ang pinakamabigat para sa iyo ngayon?”",
                  "start_ms": 11220,
                  "end_ms": 14780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "ang maaaring simula.",
                  "start_ms": 15080,
                  "end_ms": 17160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Makinig sa pribadong lugar at tumulong makaugnay sa health professional; huwag sabihing “isipin mo lang ang masasaya” o magbigay ng diagnosis.",
                  "start_ms": 17460,
                  "end_ms": 28340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Kung may agarang panganib sa kaligtasan, sundin kaagad ang lokal na emergency referral protocol.",
                  "start_ms": 28640,
                  "end_ms": 35960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Huwag mangakong ililihim ang panganib sa mga taong kailangang tumulong.",
                  "start_ms": 36260,
                  "end_ms": 42060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang pakikinig ay suporta; ang diagnosis at pangangalagang klinikal ay para sa kwalipikadong health professional.",
                  "start_ms": 42360,
                  "end_ms": 50920
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "family-planning": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/family-planning.en.6316d05fd10e.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "6316d05fd10e956333a9e1743ac8bdac31e73efba77e02e2cf363c67b8afb5cc",
              "sha256": "5ee60929982ac2db85225afc434c460e5ee52ede1853a5083bd06a230a8288cf",
              "duration_seconds": 38.113,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A family-planning question",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Jo, 24, is worried about something she heard about family planning.",
                  "start_ms": 2580,
                  "end_ms": 7740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ask what specifically concerns her and listen without mocking the belief.",
                  "start_ms": 8040,
                  "end_ms": 13600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "A BHW can explain general information from approved materials, while choosing an appropriate method requires discussion with Jo and a midwife or qualified provider.",
                  "start_ms": 13900,
                  "end_ms": 26140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Identify where she can get private counseling; do not decide for her.",
                  "start_ms": 26440,
                  "end_ms": 31440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Family-planning communication supports the person’s choice and appropriate counseling.",
                  "start_ms": 31740,
                  "end_ms": 38060
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/family-planning.fil.0ad47f94e318.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "0ad47f94e318de05ef270be2a98772c08f7a403bb85efaf996f880f54a062f1c",
              "sha256": "3a71aad4aba9cf563789704bc766117e9097aa9789bf469e16bcb64bba3ef5f3",
              "duration_seconds": 48.64,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "May tanong tungkol sa family planning",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Si Jo, 24 anyos, ay takot sa kuwentong narinig tungkol sa family planning.",
                  "start_ms": 3180,
                  "end_ms": 9940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Tanungin kung ano ang partikular na ikinababahala niya at makinig nang hindi pinagtatawanan ang paniniwala.",
                  "start_ms": 10240,
                  "end_ms": 18000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Maaaring ipaliwanag ng BHW ang pangkalahatang impormasyon mula sa aprubadong materyal, ngunit ang pagpili ng angkop na paraan ay kailangang talakayin kay Jo at sa midwife o kwalipikadong provider.",
                  "start_ms": 18300,
                  "end_ms": 34220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Tiyakin kung saan siya makakakuha ng pribadong counseling; huwag pumili para sa kanya.",
                  "start_ms": 34520,
                  "end_ms": 40880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang pakikipag-usap tungkol sa family planning ay nagbibigay ng puwang sa pagpili at tamang counseling.",
                  "start_ms": 41180,
                  "end_ms": 48580
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "practice": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/practice.en.cedb52ab8871.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "cedb52ab88710212fb480224912a41a925bb02c97c1a44da227300278ca2fcbb",
              "sha256": "867262ff1be50d7ef0bd2eff247bbdac196322fe6c3f734f232de43f2f90c7ae",
              "duration_seconds": 41.561,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Try it, then repeat",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose Jo, Ben or Ramon.",
                  "start_ms": 2900,
                  "end_ms": 6260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "In triads, play BHW, resident and observer.",
                  "start_ms": 6560,
                  "end_ms": 11800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Acknowledge the concern, give one safe next step and invite an explanation in the resident’s own words.",
                  "start_ms": 12100,
                  "end_ms": 20660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "The observer identifies one phrase to change; repeat.",
                  "start_ms": 20960,
                  "end_ms": 25720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Alone, write both sides.",
                  "start_ms": 26020,
                  "end_ms": 28660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "At the next visit, use teach-back with one approved message.",
                  "start_ms": 28960,
                  "end_ms": 34200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Hear the concern and check the clarity of your explanation while staying within the BHW role.",
                  "start_ms": 34500,
                  "end_ms": 41500
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/practice.fil.a3480f6e0452.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "a3480f6e04522e4bf480b2bcd707861829cab63ce6064017c84a5af22b8c33e4",
              "sha256": "419b860e1947bf844637026034ad5bcd1b0d9fccb12f112efad19fa53893c3b6",
              "duration_seconds": 49.633,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Subukan, saka ulitin",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pumili ng Jo, Ben o Ramon na sitwasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 3460,
                  "end_ms": 7780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sa tatluhan, gumanap na BHW, residente at tagamasid.",
                  "start_ms": 8080,
                  "end_ms": 14840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Kilalanin ang concern, sabihin ang isang ligtas na susunod na hakbang, at ipasabi ito sa sariling salita.",
                  "start_ms": 15140,
                  "end_ms": 23580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Magbigay ang tagamasid ng isang linyang babaguhin; ulitin.",
                  "start_ms": 23880,
                  "end_ms": 28800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Kung mag-isa, i-record sa papel ang dalawang panig.",
                  "start_ms": 29100,
                  "end_ms": 33700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Sa susunod na pagbisita, gamitin ang teach-back sa isang aprubadong mensahe.",
                  "start_ms": 34000,
                  "end_ms": 39720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pakinggan ang concern at suriin ang linaw ng sariling paliwanag, habang nananatili sa saklaw ng BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 40020,
                  "end_ms": 49580
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "smoking": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/smoking.en.b1fe9b935295.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "b1fe9b935295b1467df5c4e5254a70b1299cae7341389ed3460e9b987d0d8e01",
              "sha256": "442f86cbf6541c1337c65aa893a2f412f156bf2cbc6b643a4db822f062009ad2",
              "duration_seconds": 38.687,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Discuss smoking without blame",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ramon, 45, feels attacked when called “undisciplined.”",
                  "start_ms": 2740,
                  "end_ms": 7980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "First ask permission to discuss smoking.",
                  "start_ms": 8280,
                  "end_ms": 11480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Explore what he would like to change and what barriers he anticipates.",
                  "start_ms": 11780,
                  "end_ms": 16860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Summarize his response and offer a connection to health-center support.",
                  "start_ms": 17160,
                  "end_ms": 22080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "One agreed step is more useful than a long lecture he has stopped hearing.",
                  "start_ms": 22380,
                  "end_ms": 28140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Medication and suitable treatment should be discussed with the provider.",
                  "start_ms": 28440,
                  "end_ms": 33400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Planning improves when the person’s own goal and barriers are heard.",
                  "start_ms": 33700,
                  "end_ms": 38620
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/smoking.fil.fc493c01a1bd.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "fc493c01a1bded2a437aee19067e03ae9fc5807760d6b26b7a1eced27cafdea2",
              "sha256": "8a9294bc20a986dbeea17058da81be23fa567e6e57375e25c2cbda3168d86af2",
              "duration_seconds": 47.726,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pag-usapan ang paninigarilyo nang walang paninisi",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Si Ramon, 45 anyos, ay napipikon kapag pinagsasabihang “walang disiplina.”",
                  "start_ms": 4140,
                  "end_ms": 11980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Humingi muna ng pahintulot na pag-usapan ang paninigarilyo.",
                  "start_ms": 12280,
                  "end_ms": 16760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Itanong kung ano ang gusto niyang mabago at kung anong hadlang ang nakikita niya.",
                  "start_ms": 17060,
                  "end_ms": 22540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ibuod ang sagot at mag-alok na ikonekta siya sa health-center support.",
                  "start_ms": 22840,
                  "end_ms": 27880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Isang napagkasunduang hakbang ang mas kapaki-pakinabang kaysa mahabang sermon na hindi niya pinakinggan.",
                  "start_ms": 28180,
                  "end_ms": 36620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ang gamot at angkop na paggamot ay talakayin sa provider.",
                  "start_ms": 36920,
                  "end_ms": 41440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Mas madaling magplano kapag narinig ang layunin at hadlang ng mismong tao.",
                  "start_ms": 41740,
                  "end_ms": 47660
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "teach-back": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/teach-back.en.02bc41949dfa.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "02bc41949dfa6592d15d368e66b2ba4864e07e47be3e8cf5707a54549d6159f8",
              "sha256": "c3f3bf9f70cf3d1ef0018fd96a96ad2ca1090eb9205cb24735e5c9ff6bac6c61",
              "duration_seconds": 50.704,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "One message, then hear it back",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "BHW Mila has heard Liza, 29, explain her difficulty attending the health center.",
                  "start_ms": 3180,
                  "end_ms": 10780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "They agree to contact the midwife about scheduling.",
                  "start_ms": 11080,
                  "end_ms": 14960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Mila explains the agreed next step in plain language.",
                  "start_ms": 15260,
                  "end_ms": 19340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "“To check that I explained it clearly, how would you describe the plan when you get home?”",
                  "start_ms": 19640,
                  "end_ms": 25120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "If Liza’s response differs, Mila explains it another way and checks again.",
                  "start_ms": 25420,
                  "end_ms": 31060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Teach-back checks the clarity of the explanation, not the person’s intelligence.",
                  "start_ms": 31360,
                  "end_ms": 36600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Use a suitable picture if helpful; keep advice within training and the health team’s instructions.",
                  "start_ms": 36900,
                  "end_ms": 44060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Check a clear message through the person’s own explanation, not a nod alone.",
                  "start_ms": 44360,
                  "end_ms": 50640
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/teach-back.fil.11b8b53270ec.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "11b8b53270ec33f63c2ce85a88c62f3ed99f65fc519ef8913b266b598e26019c",
              "sha256": "dd58c24daff924328aa51cfe9c5757d7a928ff55d17af30060cb9b84f2d84b62",
              "duration_seconds": 62.459,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Isang mensahe, saka pakinggan ang balik",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 4080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Si BHW Mila ay nakipag-usap kay Liza, 29, tungkol sa hadlang sa pagpunta sa health center.",
                  "start_ms": 4380,
                  "end_ms": 13340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Magkasundo silang makikipag-ugnayan sa midwife tungkol sa iskedyul.",
                  "start_ms": 13640,
                  "end_ms": 18680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ipinaliwanag ni Mila ang napagkasunduang susunod na hakbang sa payak na salita.",
                  "start_ms": 18980,
                  "end_ms": 25540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "“Para malaman kong malinaw ang paliwanag ko, paano mo ikukuwento ang plano pag-uwi?”",
                  "start_ms": 25840,
                  "end_ms": 32080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Kapag iba ang sagot ni Liza, uulitin ni Mila sa ibang paraan at muling magtatanong.",
                  "start_ms": 32380,
                  "end_ms": 38380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ang teach-back ay pagsusuri sa linaw ng paliwanag, hindi pagsusulit sa talino ng kausap.",
                  "start_ms": 38680,
                  "end_ms": 45520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Gumamit ng angkop na larawan kung makakatulong; huwag magbigay ng payong lampas sa pagsasanay at tagubilin ng health team.",
                  "start_ms": 45820,
                  "end_ms": 54620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang malinaw na mensahe ay nasusuri sa sariling paliwanag ng kausap, hindi sa pagtango lamang.",
                  "start_ms": 54920,
                  "end_ms": 62400
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "module": "06-komunikasyon",
        "sections": {
          "check": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/check.en.f68caa9602d5.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "f68caa9602d5d11cb16bce1ac16129f35a290b22d561f4abd4858b5e0aaea48a",
              "sha256": "acf3dc9e641d85697a5d607d353ae64453154034616143d5f720b29ba371cd95",
              "duration_seconds": 18.834,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose the next step",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose an answer and explain why before viewing the feedback.",
                  "start_ms": 2300,
                  "end_ms": 7260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Then compare it with your own practice attempt.",
                  "start_ms": 7560,
                  "end_ms": 11160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Hear the concern and check the clarity of your explanation while staying within the BHW role.",
                  "start_ms": 11460,
                  "end_ms": 18780
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/check.fil.c165e162ab54.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "c165e162ab54ee3da2e4b813b878f30bdccbfdcac1d5d9647f565812462498de",
              "sha256": "6b3f70e80dc2028fd969d968b4aa59a81ed6c6d4bf02dfe1e9b3a4b51b040a5c",
              "duration_seconds": 22.883,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang susunod na hakbang",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang sagot at ipaliwanag kung bakit bago tingnan ang feedback.",
                  "start_ms": 3180,
                  "end_ms": 8420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Pagkatapos, ihambing sa sarili mong ginawa sa pagsasanay.",
                  "start_ms": 8720,
                  "end_ms": 13520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pakinggan ang concern at suriin ang linaw ng sariling paliwanag, habang nananatili sa saklaw ng BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 13820,
                  "end_ms": 22820
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "distress": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/distress.en.303e4c2052ec.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "303e4c2052ecee09bbe21cd7290f73e7811e842680a83a01624bdfe82bc65340",
              "sha256": "33decf957af7d130623ce483a0efe043a41740dada8daa27e30f049de4d9d92a",
              "duration_seconds": 44.278,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "When someone feels overwhelmed",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ben, 37, says he has felt low for several weeks.",
                  "start_ms": 3020,
                  "end_ms": 7700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "A possible opening is, “Thank you for telling me.",
                  "start_ms": 8000,
                  "end_ms": 11880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "What feels hardest right now?”",
                  "start_ms": 12180,
                  "end_ms": 14580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Listen privately and help him reach a health professional; avoid saying “just think happy thoughts” or assigning a diagnosis.",
                  "start_ms": 14880,
                  "end_ms": 24600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "If there is immediate danger to safety, follow the local emergency referral protocol at once.",
                  "start_ms": 24900,
                  "end_ms": 31940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Do not promise to conceal danger from people who need to help.",
                  "start_ms": 32240,
                  "end_ms": 36560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Listening offers support; diagnosis and clinical care belong with a qualified health professional.",
                  "start_ms": 36860,
                  "end_ms": 44220
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/distress.fil.ead03843859b.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "ead03843859b8fbb6836d4ef005c7af6ce9d1b7a0313eaa3f5a77719e9e90926",
              "sha256": "325c0e940b094315594cebee76ca805dbc4041a7bac46cc5e3266233048db545",
              "duration_seconds": 50.991,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Kapag mabigat ang nararamdaman",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Si Ben, 37 anyos, ay nagsasabing ilang linggo na siyang malungkot.",
                  "start_ms": 2860,
                  "end_ms": 8820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "“Salamat sa pagsabi.",
                  "start_ms": 9120,
                  "end_ms": 10920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ano ang pinakamabigat para sa iyo ngayon?”",
                  "start_ms": 11220,
                  "end_ms": 14780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "ang maaaring simula.",
                  "start_ms": 15080,
                  "end_ms": 17160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Makinig sa pribadong lugar at tumulong makaugnay sa health professional; huwag sabihing “isipin mo lang ang masasaya” o magbigay ng diagnosis.",
                  "start_ms": 17460,
                  "end_ms": 28340
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Kung may agarang panganib sa kaligtasan, sundin kaagad ang lokal na emergency referral protocol.",
                  "start_ms": 28640,
                  "end_ms": 35960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Huwag mangakong ililihim ang panganib sa mga taong kailangang tumulong.",
                  "start_ms": 36260,
                  "end_ms": 42060
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang pakikinig ay suporta; ang diagnosis at pangangalagang klinikal ay para sa kwalipikadong health professional.",
                  "start_ms": 42360,
                  "end_ms": 50920
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "family-planning": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/family-planning.en.6316d05fd10e.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "6316d05fd10e956333a9e1743ac8bdac31e73efba77e02e2cf363c67b8afb5cc",
              "sha256": "5ee60929982ac2db85225afc434c460e5ee52ede1853a5083bd06a230a8288cf",
              "duration_seconds": 38.113,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A family-planning question",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Jo, 24, is worried about something she heard about family planning.",
                  "start_ms": 2580,
                  "end_ms": 7740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ask what specifically concerns her and listen without mocking the belief.",
                  "start_ms": 8040,
                  "end_ms": 13600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "A BHW can explain general information from approved materials, while choosing an appropriate method requires discussion with Jo and a midwife or qualified provider.",
                  "start_ms": 13900,
                  "end_ms": 26140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Identify where she can get private counseling; do not decide for her.",
                  "start_ms": 26440,
                  "end_ms": 31440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Family-planning communication supports the person’s choice and appropriate counseling.",
                  "start_ms": 31740,
                  "end_ms": 38060
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/family-planning.fil.0ad47f94e318.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "0ad47f94e318de05ef270be2a98772c08f7a403bb85efaf996f880f54a062f1c",
              "sha256": "3a71aad4aba9cf563789704bc766117e9097aa9789bf469e16bcb64bba3ef5f3",
              "duration_seconds": 48.64,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "May tanong tungkol sa family planning",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Si Jo, 24 anyos, ay takot sa kuwentong narinig tungkol sa family planning.",
                  "start_ms": 3180,
                  "end_ms": 9940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Tanungin kung ano ang partikular na ikinababahala niya at makinig nang hindi pinagtatawanan ang paniniwala.",
                  "start_ms": 10240,
                  "end_ms": 18000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Maaaring ipaliwanag ng BHW ang pangkalahatang impormasyon mula sa aprubadong materyal, ngunit ang pagpili ng angkop na paraan ay kailangang talakayin kay Jo at sa midwife o kwalipikadong provider.",
                  "start_ms": 18300,
                  "end_ms": 34220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Tiyakin kung saan siya makakakuha ng pribadong counseling; huwag pumili para sa kanya.",
                  "start_ms": 34520,
                  "end_ms": 40880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang pakikipag-usap tungkol sa family planning ay nagbibigay ng puwang sa pagpili at tamang counseling.",
                  "start_ms": 41180,
                  "end_ms": 48580
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "practice": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/practice.en.cedb52ab8871.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "cedb52ab88710212fb480224912a41a925bb02c97c1a44da227300278ca2fcbb",
              "sha256": "867262ff1be50d7ef0bd2eff247bbdac196322fe6c3f734f232de43f2f90c7ae",
              "duration_seconds": 41.561,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Try it, then repeat",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose Jo, Ben or Ramon.",
                  "start_ms": 2900,
                  "end_ms": 6260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "In triads, play BHW, resident and observer.",
                  "start_ms": 6560,
                  "end_ms": 11800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Acknowledge the concern, give one safe next step and invite an explanation in the resident’s own words.",
                  "start_ms": 12100,
                  "end_ms": 20660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "The observer identifies one phrase to change; repeat.",
                  "start_ms": 20960,
                  "end_ms": 25720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Alone, write both sides.",
                  "start_ms": 26020,
                  "end_ms": 28660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "At the next visit, use teach-back with one approved message.",
                  "start_ms": 28960,
                  "end_ms": 34200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Hear the concern and check the clarity of your explanation while staying within the BHW role.",
                  "start_ms": 34500,
                  "end_ms": 41500
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/practice.fil.a3480f6e0452.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "a3480f6e04522e4bf480b2bcd707861829cab63ce6064017c84a5af22b8c33e4",
              "sha256": "419b860e1947bf844637026034ad5bcd1b0d9fccb12f112efad19fa53893c3b6",
              "duration_seconds": 49.633,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Subukan, saka ulitin",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pumili ng Jo, Ben o Ramon na sitwasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 3460,
                  "end_ms": 7780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sa tatluhan, gumanap na BHW, residente at tagamasid.",
                  "start_ms": 8080,
                  "end_ms": 14840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Kilalanin ang concern, sabihin ang isang ligtas na susunod na hakbang, at ipasabi ito sa sariling salita.",
                  "start_ms": 15140,
                  "end_ms": 23580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Magbigay ang tagamasid ng isang linyang babaguhin; ulitin.",
                  "start_ms": 23880,
                  "end_ms": 28800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Kung mag-isa, i-record sa papel ang dalawang panig.",
                  "start_ms": 29100,
                  "end_ms": 33700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Sa susunod na pagbisita, gamitin ang teach-back sa isang aprubadong mensahe.",
                  "start_ms": 34000,
                  "end_ms": 39720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pakinggan ang concern at suriin ang linaw ng sariling paliwanag, habang nananatili sa saklaw ng BHW.",
                  "start_ms": 40020,
                  "end_ms": 49580
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "smoking": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/smoking.en.b1fe9b935295.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "b1fe9b935295b1467df5c4e5254a70b1299cae7341389ed3460e9b987d0d8e01",
              "sha256": "442f86cbf6541c1337c65aa893a2f412f156bf2cbc6b643a4db822f062009ad2",
              "duration_seconds": 38.687,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Discuss smoking without blame",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ramon, 45, feels attacked when called “undisciplined.”",
                  "start_ms": 2740,
                  "end_ms": 7980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "First ask permission to discuss smoking.",
                  "start_ms": 8280,
                  "end_ms": 11480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Explore what he would like to change and what barriers he anticipates.",
                  "start_ms": 11780,
                  "end_ms": 16860
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Summarize his response and offer a connection to health-center support.",
                  "start_ms": 17160,
                  "end_ms": 22080
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "One agreed step is more useful than a long lecture he has stopped hearing.",
                  "start_ms": 22380,
                  "end_ms": 28140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Medication and suitable treatment should be discussed with the provider.",
                  "start_ms": 28440,
                  "end_ms": 33400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Planning improves when the person’s own goal and barriers are heard.",
                  "start_ms": 33700,
                  "end_ms": 38620
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/smoking.fil.fc493c01a1bd.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "fc493c01a1bded2a437aee19067e03ae9fc5807760d6b26b7a1eced27cafdea2",
              "sha256": "8a9294bc20a986dbeea17058da81be23fa567e6e57375e25c2cbda3168d86af2",
              "duration_seconds": 47.726,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Pag-usapan ang paninigarilyo nang walang paninisi",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Si Ramon, 45 anyos, ay napipikon kapag pinagsasabihang “walang disiplina.”",
                  "start_ms": 4140,
                  "end_ms": 11980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Humingi muna ng pahintulot na pag-usapan ang paninigarilyo.",
                  "start_ms": 12280,
                  "end_ms": 16760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Itanong kung ano ang gusto niyang mabago at kung anong hadlang ang nakikita niya.",
                  "start_ms": 17060,
                  "end_ms": 22540
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ibuod ang sagot at mag-alok na ikonekta siya sa health-center support.",
                  "start_ms": 22840,
                  "end_ms": 27880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Isang napagkasunduang hakbang ang mas kapaki-pakinabang kaysa mahabang sermon na hindi niya pinakinggan.",
                  "start_ms": 28180,
                  "end_ms": 36620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ang gamot at angkop na paggamot ay talakayin sa provider.",
                  "start_ms": 36920,
                  "end_ms": 41440
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Mas madaling magplano kapag narinig ang layunin at hadlang ng mismong tao.",
                  "start_ms": 41740,
                  "end_ms": 47660
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "teach-back": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/teach-back.en.b0249869511b.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "b0249869511b1a42926072767ee52ef625e7a2cbbdc6d7bea0cca53be496466d",
              "sha256": "5010abb1588d4da47554c856c79a25b739f15a72a4f86d705b52ddbfb0f2924f",
              "duration_seconds": 50.469,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "One message, then hear it back",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "BHW Gibs has heard Liza, 29, explain her difficulty attending the health center.",
                  "start_ms": 3260,
                  "end_ms": 10180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "They agree to contact the midwife about scheduling.",
                  "start_ms": 10480,
                  "end_ms": 14160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Gibs explains the agreed next step in plain language.",
                  "start_ms": 14460,
                  "end_ms": 18820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "“To check that I explained it clearly, how would you describe the plan when you get home?”",
                  "start_ms": 19120,
                  "end_ms": 24640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "If Liza’s response differs, Gibs explains it another way and checks again.",
                  "start_ms": 24940,
                  "end_ms": 30700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Teach-back checks the clarity of the explanation, not the person’s intelligence.",
                  "start_ms": 31000,
                  "end_ms": 36680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Use a suitable picture if helpful; keep advice within training and the health team’s instructions.",
                  "start_ms": 36980,
                  "end_ms": 44180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Check a clear message through the person’s own explanation, not a nod alone.",
                  "start_ms": 44480,
                  "end_ms": 50400
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-explain/teach-back.fil.9d64b6344c06.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "9d64b6344c068984370020c0c8fbeeeca07f02192ac2b8918c2a75b56c4c7646",
              "sha256": "c0eba863ee6ce9cf7d72fc2f32180ece137ef2bc604d55655f795b9e29bd2766",
              "duration_seconds": 61.701,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Isang mensahe, saka pakinggan ang balik",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Si BHW Gibs ay nakipag-usap kay Liza, 29, tungkol sa hadlang sa pagpunta sa health center.",
                  "start_ms": 3940,
                  "end_ms": 11940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Magkasundo silang makikipag-ugnayan sa midwife tungkol sa iskedyul.",
                  "start_ms": 12240,
                  "end_ms": 17560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ipinaliwanag ni Gibs ang napagkasunduang susunod na hakbang sa payak na salita.",
                  "start_ms": 17860,
                  "end_ms": 23900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "“Para malaman kong malinaw ang paliwanag ko, paano mo ikukuwento ang plano pag-uwi?”",
                  "start_ms": 24200,
                  "end_ms": 30560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Kapag iba ang sagot ni Liza, uulitin ni Gibs sa ibang paraan at muling magtatanong.",
                  "start_ms": 30860,
                  "end_ms": 37220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ang teach-back ay pagsusuri sa linaw ng paliwanag, hindi pagsusulit sa talino ng kausap.",
                  "start_ms": 37520,
                  "end_ms": 44120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Gumamit ng angkop na larawan kung makakatulong; huwag magbigay ng payong lampas sa pagsasanay at tagubilin ng health team.",
                  "start_ms": 44420,
                  "end_ms": 53380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang malinaw na mensahe ay nasusuri sa sariling paliwanag ng kausap, hindi sa pagtango lamang.",
                  "start_ms": 53680,
                  "end_ms": 61640
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "communication-record": [
      {
        "module": "06-komunikasyon",
        "sections": {
          "check": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-record/check.en.2e5217dea0f9.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "2e5217dea0f9e4c099484159e51d223605050f499bbc52a84cbeb37cd6b4eb41",
              "sha256": "970eeba4294e2492068cf81cc040ff76a1b597b0f02e02b9a09fdbdf4db14308",
              "duration_seconds": 17.293,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose the next step",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose an answer and explain why before viewing the feedback.",
                  "start_ms": 2300,
                  "end_ms": 6780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Then compare it with your own practice attempt.",
                  "start_ms": 7080,
                  "end_ms": 10600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Clear sources and explicit gaps prevent a guess becoming an official record.",
                  "start_ms": 10900,
                  "end_ms": 17220
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-record/check.fil.37d60632cbde.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "37d60632cbde57f1a93aaa44b3c99b4a1f80a6a87f2a7d259bef862cf79f2d5f",
              "sha256": "da80ca02c98d69d74a845ae91f3ab4936a660f6e187b921fd0d60425c370bf80",
              "duration_seconds": 21.525,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang susunod na hakbang",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang sagot at ipaliwanag kung bakit bago tingnan ang feedback.",
                  "start_ms": 3420,
                  "end_ms": 8620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Pagkatapos, ihambing sa sarili mong ginawa sa pagsasanay.",
                  "start_ms": 8920,
                  "end_ms": 13480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Malinaw na pinagmulan at tapat na pagmarka sa kulang ang pumipigil sa hula na maging opisyal na tala.",
                  "start_ms": 13780,
                  "end_ms": 21460
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "conflicting-accounts": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-record/conflicting-accounts.en.d0ca72e8d0a2.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "d0ca72e8d0a20adaecc3dfd9ca5adcbf88b1ebaaa63c41dfd7d2e4bb428f92a6",
              "sha256": "85787805b374c6ff2ce8e7a23c541b5a2a185438dcbdc81918fd841b91b323c4",
              "duration_seconds": 34.873,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "When accounts differ",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Liza says the appointment was canceled; a neighbor says she was not interested.",
                  "start_ms": 2260,
                  "end_ms": 8260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Do not choose a story because one voice is louder.",
                  "start_ms": 8560,
                  "end_ms": 12920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ask Liza, check the authorized record and identify the source of each detail.",
                  "start_ms": 13220,
                  "end_ms": 19460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "If uncertainty remains, tell the health team.",
                  "start_ms": 19760,
                  "end_ms": 23360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Respecting a person and being careful with evidence can happen together.",
                  "start_ms": 23660,
                  "end_ms": 29100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "When accounts differ, clarify and verify before deciding.",
                  "start_ms": 29400,
                  "end_ms": 34800
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-record/conflicting-accounts.fil.d377496d80c4.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "d377496d80c4e8c7fdae9637a4e0afedb318156c8a0f36017c2bf4cb3fda3459",
              "sha256": "a3e9c5036553934a1bf7109fa9efc4bf448d6bcf97df912188a735d921766163",
              "duration_seconds": 41.273,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Kapag may magkaibang kuwento",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Sabi ni Liza, kinansela ang schedule; sabi ng kapitbahay, hindi siya interesado.",
                  "start_ms": 3100,
                  "end_ms": 10580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Huwag pumili ng kuwento dahil mas malakas ang boses.",
                  "start_ms": 10880,
                  "end_ms": 15000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Tanungin si Liza, suriin ang awtorisadong tala at itala ang pinagmulan ng bawat detalye.",
                  "start_ms": 15300,
                  "end_ms": 23660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Kung hindi pa malinaw, sabihin iyon sa health team.",
                  "start_ms": 23960,
                  "end_ms": 28040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Ang tiwala sa kausap at pagiging maingat sa ebidensya ay maaaring sabay na gawin.",
                  "start_ms": 28340,
                  "end_ms": 34620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Kapag magkaiba ang kuwento, maglinaw at magberipika bago magpasya.",
                  "start_ms": 34920,
                  "end_ms": 41200
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "practice": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-record/practice.en.137d49670c1a.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "137d49670c1a44e357f26ca8a2bdf65052f27f9083c9e0296340c5cb65c5540d",
              "sha256": "e888f29933b9ec48b41a75e4462591afaff436a05dd0ae442edbd00d324f41dc",
              "duration_seconds": 37.695,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Try it, then repeat",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Draw three boxes: “Reported,” “Observed,” and “Unconfirmed.”",
                  "start_ms": 2860,
                  "end_ms": 9180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sort Liza’s details.",
                  "start_ms": 9480,
                  "end_ms": 11760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Add: “Verify the date against the authorized record with the midwife.”",
                  "start_ms": 12060,
                  "end_ms": 18020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ask a partner to check for guesses or diagnoses.",
                  "start_ms": 18320,
                  "end_ms": 22480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Alone, underline each detail’s source.",
                  "start_ms": 22780,
                  "end_ms": 26620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "In your next record, mark what remains unconfirmed.",
                  "start_ms": 26920,
                  "end_ms": 31040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Clear sources and explicit gaps prevent a guess becoming an official record.",
                  "start_ms": 31340,
                  "end_ms": 37620
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-record/practice.fil.7e71c8321ea6.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "7e71c8321ea60888b40122d73270c08ea2029306d9390c7950646761dd5ad6e0",
              "sha256": "60a1771fabe65c195cdb2cab9e92c0a8aba67ed78f7d265a61ecef9c07c11c86",
              "duration_seconds": 44.617,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Subukan, saka ulitin",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Gumawa ng tatlong kahon: “Sinabi,” “Nakita,” at “Hindi pa tiyak.”",
                  "start_ms": 3180,
                  "end_ms": 9660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ilagay ang detalye ni Liza sa tamang kahon.",
                  "start_ms": 9960,
                  "end_ms": 13840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Idagdag: “Beripikahin ang petsa sa awtorisadong tala kasama ang midwife.”",
                  "start_ms": 14140,
                  "end_ms": 20780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ipasuri sa kapareha kung may hula o diagnosis.",
                  "start_ms": 21080,
                  "end_ms": 25920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Kung mag-isa, salungguhitan ang pinagmulan ng bawat detalye.",
                  "start_ms": 26220,
                  "end_ms": 31500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Sa susunod na pagtala, markahan ang hindi pa natiyak.",
                  "start_ms": 31800,
                  "end_ms": 36480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Malinaw na pinagmulan at tapat na pagmarka sa kulang ang pumipigil sa hula na maging opisyal na tala.",
                  "start_ms": 36780,
                  "end_ms": 44540
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "sources": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-record/sources.en.5bdcde9f5240.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "5bdcde9f52409834d281cccf833366fd274de4bb5a0740d29aa3ac3495db3dba",
              "sha256": "5cb0ba65c0b6fe38bcd774ef890bf3ea796c340dcdaea203e2caf608e881d9ac",
              "duration_seconds": 58.984,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Reported, observed, and unconfirmed",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 4480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "BHW Mila is asking Liza, 29, about a missed health-center visit.",
                  "start_ms": 4780,
                  "end_ms": 11700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Mila has not yet checked the authorized attendance record.",
                  "start_ms": 12000,
                  "end_ms": 16640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Liza says no one can stay with her two children.",
                  "start_ms": 16940,
                  "end_ms": 20620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Mila notices the appointment card is unavailable, but that does not prove there was no appointment.",
                  "start_ms": 20920,
                  "end_ms": 28280
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "In the notes, separate “Liza reports” from direct observations.",
                  "start_ms": 28580,
                  "end_ms": 33980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Clarify an uncertain date; mark information “not yet confirmed” when a record still needs checking.",
                  "start_ms": 34280,
                  "end_ms": 41640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Assessing information means checking its source and relevance, without assigning a diagnosis or judging the person.",
                  "start_ms": 41940,
                  "end_ms": 50620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "When assessing information, distinguish reports, observations and details still requiring verification.",
                  "start_ms": 50920,
                  "end_ms": 58920
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-record/sources.fil.037a293f0a6e.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "037a293f0a6ede880b77932f0cb9a2aaf8f7b385282bbd36a0c9e5c3cdcd2e22",
              "sha256": "f4f004da0eda26e4aefdce5c79090dad8969809fd7a2c5cdd9ac5c03f654c5ab",
              "duration_seconds": 62.511,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Sinabi, nakita, at hindi pa tiyak",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 4840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Si Liza, 29, ay kinakausap ni BHW Mila tungkol sa hindi pagpunta sa health center.",
                  "start_ms": 5140,
                  "end_ms": 13700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Hindi pa nakita ni Mila ang awtorisadong attendance record.",
                  "start_ms": 14000,
                  "end_ms": 18520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Sinabi ni Liza na walang maiiwan sa dalawang anak.",
                  "start_ms": 18820,
                  "end_ms": 22980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Nakita ni Mila na wala ang appointment card, ngunit hindi ito patunay na walang appointment.",
                  "start_ms": 23280,
                  "end_ms": 29840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Sa tala, ihiwalay ang “ayon kay Liza” sa sariling obserbasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 30140,
                  "end_ms": 35940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Itanong ang petsang hindi malinaw; markahang “hindi pa nakumpirma” kung kailangan pang tingnan ang rekord.",
                  "start_ms": 36240,
                  "end_ms": 44360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Ang pagsusuri ng impormasyon ay pagtiyak sa pinagmulan at kaugnayan nito, hindi paglalagay ng diagnosis o husga sa tao.",
                  "start_ms": 44660,
                  "end_ms": 54220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Sa pagsusuri ng impormasyon, ihiwalay ang sinabi, nakita at kailangan pang beripikahin.",
                  "start_ms": 54520,
                  "end_ms": 62440
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "module": "06-komunikasyon",
        "sections": {
          "check": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-record/check.en.2e5217dea0f9.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "2e5217dea0f9e4c099484159e51d223605050f499bbc52a84cbeb37cd6b4eb41",
              "sha256": "970eeba4294e2492068cf81cc040ff76a1b597b0f02e02b9a09fdbdf4db14308",
              "duration_seconds": 17.293,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose the next step",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose an answer and explain why before viewing the feedback.",
                  "start_ms": 2300,
                  "end_ms": 6780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Then compare it with your own practice attempt.",
                  "start_ms": 7080,
                  "end_ms": 10600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Clear sources and explicit gaps prevent a guess becoming an official record.",
                  "start_ms": 10900,
                  "end_ms": 17220
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-record/check.fil.37d60632cbde.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "37d60632cbde57f1a93aaa44b3c99b4a1f80a6a87f2a7d259bef862cf79f2d5f",
              "sha256": "da80ca02c98d69d74a845ae91f3ab4936a660f6e187b921fd0d60425c370bf80",
              "duration_seconds": 21.525,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang susunod na hakbang",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang sagot at ipaliwanag kung bakit bago tingnan ang feedback.",
                  "start_ms": 3420,
                  "end_ms": 8620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Pagkatapos, ihambing sa sarili mong ginawa sa pagsasanay.",
                  "start_ms": 8920,
                  "end_ms": 13480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Malinaw na pinagmulan at tapat na pagmarka sa kulang ang pumipigil sa hula na maging opisyal na tala.",
                  "start_ms": 13780,
                  "end_ms": 21460
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "conflicting-accounts": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-record/conflicting-accounts.en.d0ca72e8d0a2.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "d0ca72e8d0a20adaecc3dfd9ca5adcbf88b1ebaaa63c41dfd7d2e4bb428f92a6",
              "sha256": "85787805b374c6ff2ce8e7a23c541b5a2a185438dcbdc81918fd841b91b323c4",
              "duration_seconds": 34.873,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "When accounts differ",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Liza says the appointment was canceled; a neighbor says she was not interested.",
                  "start_ms": 2260,
                  "end_ms": 8260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Do not choose a story because one voice is louder.",
                  "start_ms": 8560,
                  "end_ms": 12920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ask Liza, check the authorized record and identify the source of each detail.",
                  "start_ms": 13220,
                  "end_ms": 19460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "If uncertainty remains, tell the health team.",
                  "start_ms": 19760,
                  "end_ms": 23360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Respecting a person and being careful with evidence can happen together.",
                  "start_ms": 23660,
                  "end_ms": 29100
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "When accounts differ, clarify and verify before deciding.",
                  "start_ms": 29400,
                  "end_ms": 34800
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-record/conflicting-accounts.fil.d377496d80c4.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "d377496d80c4e8c7fdae9637a4e0afedb318156c8a0f36017c2bf4cb3fda3459",
              "sha256": "a3e9c5036553934a1bf7109fa9efc4bf448d6bcf97df912188a735d921766163",
              "duration_seconds": 41.273,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Kapag may magkaibang kuwento",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Sabi ni Liza, kinansela ang schedule; sabi ng kapitbahay, hindi siya interesado.",
                  "start_ms": 3100,
                  "end_ms": 10580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Huwag pumili ng kuwento dahil mas malakas ang boses.",
                  "start_ms": 10880,
                  "end_ms": 15000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Tanungin si Liza, suriin ang awtorisadong tala at itala ang pinagmulan ng bawat detalye.",
                  "start_ms": 15300,
                  "end_ms": 23660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Kung hindi pa malinaw, sabihin iyon sa health team.",
                  "start_ms": 23960,
                  "end_ms": 28040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Ang tiwala sa kausap at pagiging maingat sa ebidensya ay maaaring sabay na gawin.",
                  "start_ms": 28340,
                  "end_ms": 34620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Kapag magkaiba ang kuwento, maglinaw at magberipika bago magpasya.",
                  "start_ms": 34920,
                  "end_ms": 41200
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "practice": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-record/practice.en.137d49670c1a.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "137d49670c1a44e357f26ca8a2bdf65052f27f9083c9e0296340c5cb65c5540d",
              "sha256": "e888f29933b9ec48b41a75e4462591afaff436a05dd0ae442edbd00d324f41dc",
              "duration_seconds": 37.695,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Try it, then repeat",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Draw three boxes: “Reported,” “Observed,” and “Unconfirmed.”",
                  "start_ms": 2860,
                  "end_ms": 9180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sort Liza’s details.",
                  "start_ms": 9480,
                  "end_ms": 11760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Add: “Verify the date against the authorized record with the midwife.”",
                  "start_ms": 12060,
                  "end_ms": 18020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ask a partner to check for guesses or diagnoses.",
                  "start_ms": 18320,
                  "end_ms": 22480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Alone, underline each detail’s source.",
                  "start_ms": 22780,
                  "end_ms": 26620
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "In your next record, mark what remains unconfirmed.",
                  "start_ms": 26920,
                  "end_ms": 31040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Clear sources and explicit gaps prevent a guess becoming an official record.",
                  "start_ms": 31340,
                  "end_ms": 37620
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-record/practice.fil.7e71c8321ea6.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "7e71c8321ea60888b40122d73270c08ea2029306d9390c7950646761dd5ad6e0",
              "sha256": "60a1771fabe65c195cdb2cab9e92c0a8aba67ed78f7d265a61ecef9c07c11c86",
              "duration_seconds": 44.617,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Subukan, saka ulitin",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Gumawa ng tatlong kahon: “Sinabi,” “Nakita,” at “Hindi pa tiyak.”",
                  "start_ms": 3180,
                  "end_ms": 9660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ilagay ang detalye ni Liza sa tamang kahon.",
                  "start_ms": 9960,
                  "end_ms": 13840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Idagdag: “Beripikahin ang petsa sa awtorisadong tala kasama ang midwife.”",
                  "start_ms": 14140,
                  "end_ms": 20780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Ipasuri sa kapareha kung may hula o diagnosis.",
                  "start_ms": 21080,
                  "end_ms": 25920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Kung mag-isa, salungguhitan ang pinagmulan ng bawat detalye.",
                  "start_ms": 26220,
                  "end_ms": 31500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Sa susunod na pagtala, markahan ang hindi pa natiyak.",
                  "start_ms": 31800,
                  "end_ms": 36480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Malinaw na pinagmulan at tapat na pagmarka sa kulang ang pumipigil sa hula na maging opisyal na tala.",
                  "start_ms": 36780,
                  "end_ms": 44540
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "sources": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-record/sources.en.fa812da9b7ef.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "fa812da9b7ef762cd81e14761382d7683a8f442b527c75ea88fbdebaa6847674",
              "sha256": "14756778b2b532fe302096323ba60e9b689cc49bb7d871f668d9641cd447900c",
              "duration_seconds": 58.854,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Reported, observed, and unconfirmed",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 4880
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "BHW Gibs is asking Liza, 29, about a missed health-center visit.",
                  "start_ms": 5180,
                  "end_ms": 11700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Gibs has not yet checked the authorized attendance record.",
                  "start_ms": 12000,
                  "end_ms": 16560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Liza says no one can stay with her two children.",
                  "start_ms": 16860,
                  "end_ms": 20380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Gibs notices the appointment card is unavailable, but that does not prove there was no appointment.",
                  "start_ms": 20680,
                  "end_ms": 27600
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "In the notes, separate “Liza reports” from direct observations.",
                  "start_ms": 27900,
                  "end_ms": 33420
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Clarify an uncertain date; mark information “not yet confirmed” when a record still needs checking.",
                  "start_ms": 33720,
                  "end_ms": 40920
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Assessing information means checking its source and relevance, without assigning a diagnosis or judging the person.",
                  "start_ms": 41220,
                  "end_ms": 49740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "When assessing information, distinguish reports, observations and details still requiring verification.",
                  "start_ms": 50040,
                  "end_ms": 58800
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-record/sources.fil.ba6a0324f348.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "ba6a0324f348f02c4109826f8af5517f02f8ea0e26507fbc287d51fa1b945dc5",
              "sha256": "2ea923ef0c9e026fe2dbc91324fb70a61d1141ec4a8660865e4c6aa7427aa5e9",
              "duration_seconds": 63.634,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Sinabi, nakita, at hindi pa tiyak",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 4800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Si Liza, 29, ay kinakausap ni BHW Gibs tungkol sa hindi pagpunta sa health center.",
                  "start_ms": 5100,
                  "end_ms": 13140
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Hindi pa nakita ni Gibs ang awtorisadong attendance record.",
                  "start_ms": 13440,
                  "end_ms": 18160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Sinabi ni Liza na walang maiiwan sa dalawang anak.",
                  "start_ms": 18460,
                  "end_ms": 22900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Nakita ni Gibs na wala ang appointment card, ngunit hindi ito patunay na walang appointment.",
                  "start_ms": 23200,
                  "end_ms": 29960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Sa tala, ihiwalay ang “ayon kay Liza” sa sariling obserbasyon.",
                  "start_ms": 30260,
                  "end_ms": 36580
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Itanong ang petsang hindi malinaw; markahang “hindi pa nakumpirma” kung kailangan pang tingnan ang rekord.",
                  "start_ms": 36880,
                  "end_ms": 45240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Ang pagsusuri ng impormasyon ay pagtiyak sa pinagmulan at kaugnayan nito, hindi paglalagay ng diagnosis o husga sa tao.",
                  "start_ms": 45540,
                  "end_ms": 55260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Sa pagsusuri ng impormasyon, ihiwalay ang sinabi, nakita at kailangan pang beripikahin.",
                  "start_ms": 55560,
                  "end_ms": 63560
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "communication-handoff": [
      {
        "module": "06-komunikasyon",
        "sections": {
          "audience": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/audience.en.f35c41ddca17.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "f35c41ddca1773261f19887efaf75f4a928886257f49b01f9b8ca4c5cedb006c",
              "sha256": "c4aa71a6fc66386b73e0002e27c680c7d47eb304da895b3f0d2c39cfa0a40cf5",
              "duration_seconds": 42.58,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Adapt the message to the audience",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Liza and the midwife need different information.",
                  "start_ms": 3140,
                  "end_ms": 6460
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Liza needs a plain next step and a contact.",
                  "start_ms": 6760,
                  "end_ms": 11200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "The midwife needs the concern, verified details and requested help.",
                  "start_ms": 11500,
                  "end_ms": 17500
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "A barangay planning meeting needs aggregated barriers without identifying people.",
                  "start_ms": 17800,
                  "end_ms": 23760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Choose a picture, spoken explanation or secure written report to fit the audience and purpose; do not turn a private case into a public story.",
                  "start_ms": 24060,
                  "end_ms": 35940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "The same concern can be presented differently for the purpose and appropriate recipient.",
                  "start_ms": 36240,
                  "end_ms": 42520
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/audience.fil.21c78bffb05a.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "21c78bffb05a3d3075eab26647b952025607a4d3bdd882ff416065b095e23b81",
              "sha256": "1bd2b7080b509badaa29af4c8c3f23cee9b45d05bfa24eaa14b420c2882c7995",
              "duration_seconds": 48.588,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Iangkop ang mensahe sa tatanggap",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Magkaiba ang kailangan ni Liza at ng midwife.",
                  "start_ms": 3540,
                  "end_ms": 7820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Kay Liza: payak na susunod na hakbang at kung sino ang lalapitan.",
                  "start_ms": 8120,
                  "end_ms": 14160
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Sa midwife: maikling concern, natiyak na detalye at hinihinging tulong.",
                  "start_ms": 14460,
                  "end_ms": 20940
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Sa barangay planning meeting: pinagsama-samang hadlang na walang pagkakakilanlan.",
                  "start_ms": 21240,
                  "end_ms": 26720
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Pumili ng larawan, pasalitang paliwanag o ligtas na nakasulat na ulat ayon sa layunin at kakayahan ng tatanggap; huwag gawing pampublikong kuwento ang pribadong kaso.",
                  "start_ms": 27020,
                  "end_ms": 41260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang parehong concern ay maaaring ilahad nang magkaiba ayon sa layunin at tamang tatanggap.",
                  "start_ms": 41560,
                  "end_ms": 48520
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "check": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/check.en.1fb16926b5ea.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "1fb16926b5ea206145cd23cea71a8bbef604c0760256c10ae4c3a5215beb48f1",
              "sha256": "e21b12cab8a83070b07935899167a0e54c1230c5c05230b6d28ac4ba7eaf8dd3",
              "duration_seconds": 16.614,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose the next step",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 1800
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Choose an answer and explain why before viewing the feedback.",
                  "start_ms": 2100,
                  "end_ms": 6740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Then compare it with your own practice attempt.",
                  "start_ms": 7040,
                  "end_ms": 10400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A handoff gives the right person enough to act while protecting private details.",
                  "start_ms": 10700,
                  "end_ms": 16540
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/check.fil.53da54e424ec.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "53da54e424ec57cae61c912f5830f89728704b530a25ae86a493bd4ef574ca5a",
              "sha256": "37673bce16239678290f9f25373b2a882dcca12b7d713edfcf0d398e6fc30c45",
              "duration_seconds": 20.715,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang susunod na hakbang",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Piliin ang sagot at ipaliwanag kung bakit bago tingnan ang feedback.",
                  "start_ms": 3140,
                  "end_ms": 8300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Pagkatapos, ihambing sa sarili mong ginawa sa pagsasanay.",
                  "start_ms": 8600,
                  "end_ms": 13040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang ulat ay sapat para makakilos ang tamang tao, habang protektado ang pribadong detalye.",
                  "start_ms": 13340,
                  "end_ms": 20660
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "handoff": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/handoff.en.f704dd3a68e7.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "f704dd3a68e7cb88d12864df647cc63fe13f278c72ef4d869e501a580be18d58",
              "sha256": "95c5087af4393433ccf3ba1cc4196de73a8853d45e1df7a3b647adbf4ccf434a",
              "duration_seconds": 60.369,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Report enough for action",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2200
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "BHW Mila has heard Liza, 29, describe a childcare barrier to attending the health center.",
                  "start_ms": 2500,
                  "end_ms": 10380
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "The last attendance date remains unconfirmed.",
                  "start_ms": 10680,
                  "end_ms": 14040
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Mila uses the approved form: date, relevant concern, information source, action taken and needed follow-up.",
                  "start_ms": 14340,
                  "end_ms": 24220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "For example: “Liza reports difficulty finding childcare; last attendance date needs verification.",
                  "start_ms": 24520,
                  "end_ms": 32560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Requests a conversation with the midwife about scheduling.”",
                  "start_ms": 32860,
                  "end_ms": 36980
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Send this to the appropriate health team member through an authorized channel.",
                  "start_ms": 37280,
                  "end_ms": 42000
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Keep names and private details out of public group chats.",
                  "start_ms": 42300,
                  "end_ms": 46900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Confirm receipt and identify who will act next.",
                  "start_ms": 47200,
                  "end_ms": 51560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Recording and presenting information requires clarity, a next step and the appropriate recipient.",
                  "start_ms": 51860,
                  "end_ms": 60300
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/handoff.fil.3879abe26cc4.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "3879abe26cc4642f58dd15ae6b85d77fbf99890edeacf884159c766f14e780ad",
              "sha256": "16560f171c800f8c4c9f1d15c473306aa20484b3cf1d9653779c328a0b82ac0d",
              "duration_seconds": 69.538,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Iulat ang kailangan para makakilos",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Si BHW Mila ay nakinig kay Liza, 29.",
                  "start_ms": 3940,
                  "end_ms": 9180
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Sinabi ni Liza na walang magbabantay sa anak kaya mahirap pumunta sa health center; hindi pa nakumpirma ang huling attendance.",
                  "start_ms": 9480,
                  "end_ms": 18680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ginagamit ni Mila ang aprubadong form: petsa, kaugnay na concern, pinagmulan ng impormasyon, ginawa at kailangang follow-up.",
                  "start_ms": 18980,
                  "end_ms": 30020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Halimbawa: “Ayon kay Liza, problema ang magbabantay sa anak; petsa ng huling pagpunta ay ibeberipika.",
                  "start_ms": 30320,
                  "end_ms": 39240
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Humihingi ng pakikipag-usap sa midwife tungkol sa iskedyul.”",
                  "start_ms": 39540,
                  "end_ms": 43660
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 5,
                  "text": "Ibigay ito sa tamang health team member sa awtorisadong paraan.",
                  "start_ms": 43960,
                  "end_ms": 48360
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 6,
                  "text": "Huwag ilagay ang pangalan at pribadong detalye sa pampublikong group chat.",
                  "start_ms": 48660,
                  "end_ms": 54220
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 7,
                  "text": "Tanungin kung natanggap ang ulat at kung sino ang susunod na kikilos.",
                  "start_ms": 54520,
                  "end_ms": 59680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang pagtatala at paglalahad ng impormasyon ay dapat malinaw, may susunod na hakbang at para lamang sa tamang tatanggap.",
                  "start_ms": 59980,
                  "end_ms": 69460
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "meeting": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/meeting.en.849d0bfe8ed8.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "849d0bfe8ed85cfa9a75b6cdbfd47cf93e825ed557a6735c384bd9f7de8499ed",
              "sha256": "e4340df13e54b2566c83cc2a601be2bcb74dae90443eee9dc8ce06c1cc1372ca",
              "duration_seconds": 37.721,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Present at a meeting without names",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "In this exercise, three fictional households share a childcare barrier.",
                  "start_ms": 3420,
                  "end_ms": 8900
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Prepare a one-minute report without names or identifying details: what is the pattern, what information is missing, and what small service change could be discussed?",
                  "start_ms": 9200,
                  "end_ms": 21640
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "End with a clear question for the group.",
                  "start_ms": 21940,
                  "end_ms": 24700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Do not promise that a proposal is approved before the responsible people decide.",
                  "start_ms": 25000,
                  "end_ms": 30840
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A meeting presentation asks for a concrete decision while protecting private stories.",
                  "start_ms": 31140,
                  "end_ms": 37660
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/meeting.fil.f69c7cf8f31a.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "f69c7cf8f31a2f4908194e3f7a18a971e0597a75e1597b7d9fa1dac2a9cc0f45",
              "sha256": "3433c06066b00e67a391f9e87424d0637935b3599fcc75e4da5cf21ff36d3c41",
              "duration_seconds": 41.77,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ipaliwanag sa pulong nang walang pangalan",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Sa pagsasanay, tatlong kathang-isip na pamilya ang may parehong hadlang sa childcare.",
                  "start_ms": 3780,
                  "end_ms": 10260
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Maghanda ng isang minutong ulat na walang pangalan o detalyeng makakakilala sa kanila: ano ang pattern, anong impormasyon ang kulang, at anong maliit na pagbabago sa serbisyo ang maaaring pag-usapan?",
                  "start_ms": 10560,
                  "end_ms": 24400
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Tapusin sa malinaw na tanong sa grupo.",
                  "start_ms": 24700,
                  "end_ms": 27700
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Huwag ipangakong aprubado na ang mungkahi bago magpasya ang may tungkulin.",
                  "start_ms": 28000,
                  "end_ms": 33480
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang paglalahad sa pulong ay humihingi ng konkretong desisyon habang pinangangalagaan ang pribadong kuwento.",
                  "start_ms": 33780,
                  "end_ms": 41700
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "practice": {
            "en": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/practice.en.e987d77bd1f5.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "e987d77bd1f5d58dbeffa3ecdfbb4a835298db2bc95fc6c0f194fbdd33c4a58f",
              "sha256": "167d0f5bfba9a5c7a9a1568cca060e6df1bda0e3c4e006ee1dc2698294613a6f",
              "duration_seconds": 38.217,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Try it, then repeat",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 2520
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Replace “The family is difficult” with three sentences: Liza’s concern; confirmed and unconfirmed details; help requested from the midwife.",
                  "start_ms": 2820,
                  "end_ms": 14820
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Add the authorized channel and how receipt will be confirmed.",
                  "start_ms": 15120,
                  "end_ms": 19960
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ask a partner whether the next step is clear.",
                  "start_ms": 20260,
                  "end_ms": 23300
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Alone, check the four elements.",
                  "start_ms": 23600,
                  "end_ms": 26680
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "In the next handoff, confirm the recipient and follow-up owner.",
                  "start_ms": 26980,
                  "end_ms": 32020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "A handoff gives the right person enough to act while protecting private details.",
                  "start_ms": 32320,
                  "end_ms": 38160
                }
              ]
            },
            "fil": {
              "src": "/training/audio/06-komunikasyon/communication-handoff/practice.fil.1100cbc1f0e8.mp3",
              "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
              "content_hash": "1100cbc1f0e8c9fc135f92d6dbce026bcbbed2589a3b0e4b43efc8fa6c2e5dd1",
              "sha256": "f5b94b1d5de59336dbea973535c3e527987ff3c710248f36b09d528914091a3a",
              "duration_seconds": 45.427,
              "timings": [
                {
                  "zone": "heading",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Subukan, saka ulitin",
                  "start_ms": 0,
                  "end_ms": 3120
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Palitan ang “Mahirap kausap ang pamilya” ng tatlong pangungusap: concern ni Liza; natiyak at hindi pa tiyak; tulong na hinihingi sa midwife.",
                  "start_ms": 3420,
                  "end_ms": 15740
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Idagdag ang awtorisadong channel at paano kukumpirmahin ang pagtanggap.",
                  "start_ms": 16040,
                  "end_ms": 21760
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "Ipabasa sa kapareha: alam ba niya ang susunod na hakbang?",
                  "start_ms": 22060,
                  "end_ms": 27020
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 3,
                  "text": "Kung mag-isa, suriin gamit ang apat na bahagi.",
                  "start_ms": 27320,
                  "end_ms": 31560
                },
                {
                  "zone": "body",
                  "index": 4,
                  "text": "Sa susunod na ulat, kumpirmahin ang tumanggap at may-ari ng follow-up.",
                  "start_ms": 31860,
                  "end_ms": 37780
                },
                {
                  "zone": "takeaway",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Ang ulat ay sapat para makakilos ang tamang tao, habang protektado ang pribadong detalye.",
                  "start_ms": 38080,
                  "end_ms": 45360
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
